ood, but the war made him a helpless orphan. A child without parents can even bully yellow dogs and crows. In times of crisis, he was rescued by a kind-hearted old fisherman and experienced a long-lost but short-lived happiness. The good times didn\'t last long, the bullies stole the fruits of their labor, and the bandit soldiers brutally shot the old man to death.  What will be waiting for him... The film is adapted from the comic book of the same name by the famous cartoonist Zhang Leping.\n\n(Source: v.qq)'),(43255,'San Mao Qiyu Ji',1320,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1358/130407.jpg','tv','2010-11-08','finished_airing',''),(43256,'San Mao Lixian Ji',1320,0,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1005/130408.jpg','tv','2010-11-15','finished_airing',''),(43257,'San Mao Luxing Ji',1320,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1392/130409.jpg','tv','2013-10-28','finished_airing',''),(43258,'Luo Bo Hui Lai Le',1020,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1191/118050.webp','movie','1959','finished_airing',''),(43259,'Mi Feng Yu Qiu Yin',1080,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1228/118051.webp','movie','1959','finished_airing',''),(43260,'Senlin Zhi Wang',1024,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1631/118052.webp','movie','1959','finished_airing',''),(43261,'Kan Chai Gu Niang',964,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1094/118053.webp','movie','1959','finished_airing',''),(43262,'Longxia',949,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1862/118084.webp','movie','1959','finished_airing',''),(43263,'Yi Zhi Xie',2145,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1539/118054.webp','movie','1959','finished_airing',''),(43264,'Bu Gu Niao Jiao Chi Le',615,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1053/118055.webp','movie','1959','finished_airing',''),(43265,'Yi Fu Tong Jin',2896,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1239/118056.webp','movie','1959','finished_airing','Once upon a time the Chuang family 