 from 3 years worth of abstract pencil drawings with the goal of being a catalyst for unveiling a new mental landscape in viewers.'),(43429,'Matierica',1800,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1171/113745.webp','movie','2017','finished_airing','A daring film that pierces through the hearts of viewers by discarding the charming characters, interesting stories, beautiful drawings, fluid movement and pleasing music associated with anime, while remaining firmly in the medium of animation.'),(43430,'Yamakawa Keiko-san wa Furimukanai',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1651/109757.webp','movie','2017','finished_airing','Man often yearns of a past more innocent and pure. This film disregards that sentimentality and depicts a constant, permanent transformation of the landscape of mountains and rivers. A beautiful and intense image poem made from thousands of pencil drawings.'),(43431,'Henkei Sakuhin Dai 5-ban: Rembrandt no Shudai ni yoru Henkei Kaitai to Saikousei',1661,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1131/109759.jpg','movie','1986','finished_airing','The fifth entry in Kurosaka\'s Henkei Sakuhin experimental short film series.'),(43432,'Umi no Uta',1800,54.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1128/113746.webp','movie','1988','finished_airing','In a fishing village, a scrapped boat is cremated. Old fishing boats on the verge of death dream of deep-sea fish running through alleys, fishermen pulling their nets, the crying specter of a young girl... Various imagery appear and retreat like waves on a shore, inviting viewers into a daydream.\n\nThis poetic film garnered critical acclaim at an international scale, starting at the Oberhausen international short film festival.'),(43434,'Shuo Feng: Po Zhen Zi',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1577/109768.webp','ona','','not_yet_aired',''),(43439,'Shadows House',1432,78,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1424/113342.webp','tv','2021-04-11','finished_airing','The Shadows, characterized by their pitch-black appearance and tendency to emit soot when agitated, are a family of nobles who reside in a colossal manor deep within the mountains far from other humans. When a Shadow child is nearly of-age, they are assigned a Living Doll who acts not only as their attendant but also as their second half—the faces they could have had if not for their complexion.\n\nEmilico is a cheerful, newly created Doll who serves a rather soft-spoken master named Kate. Despite their difference in personalities, Emilico does what she can to carry out the needs of her master. As she learns more about her role and duty, Emilico begins to meet her fellow Dolls and their respective masters and comes to know more about the purpose of her existence.\n\n\"Do not fret over trivial matters,\" says one of the rules by which all Dolls must abide. But how could the ever-curious Emilico do so in the face of the deep secrets that the Shadows House holds?\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(43447,'Effendi De Gushi',1268,0,14,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1409/118194.jpg','movie','1979','finished_airing',''),(43448,'Lao Xiao Effendi',720,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1519/118195.webp','tv','2012','finished_airing',''),(43449,'Effendi Xin Chuan: Bu Ting Hua De Gou',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1706/118196.webp','movie','2012','finished_airing',''),(43450,'Shao Nian Effendi',720,0,104,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1248/118197.webp','tv','2012','finished_airing',''),(43454,'Effendi Xin Chuan: Zhong Jin Ji',5100,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1855/118198.webp','movie','2018','finished_airing',''),(43455,'Wo de Peng You Xiao Hai Tun',1092,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1612/118199.webp','movie','1980','finished_airing',''),(43456,'Ba Bai Bian Zi',1140,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1949/118201.webp','movie','1980','finished_airing',''),(43458,'Ding Ding Zhan Hou Wang',1