Shinomiya and Chika Fujiwara take to the showers to wash themselves off. When Chika accidentally drops a bar of soap, the two find themselves in a rather slippery mishap. \n\nMeanwhile, Miyuki Shirogane and Yuu Ishigami examine a discarded pornographic magazine—its content bearing an uncanny resemblance to the other student council members. Later on, an intense fried rice cook-off commences as Chika and Miko Iino seek to crown a master chef amongst the council. \n\nThese eccentric activities reveal a side of the student council that has never been seen before!\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(43610,'Qi Ren You Tian',720,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1438/118453.webp','movie','1986','finished_airing',''),(43611,'Xin Hulu Xiongdi',660,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1974/118454.webp','tv','2016-07-06','finished_airing',''),(43612,'Hulu Xiongdi (Movie)',4980,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1684/118455.jpg','movie','2008-05-27','finished_airing','Summary movie of the original Hulu Xiongdi with remastered visuals and sound.'),(43613,'Lata Dawang Qiyu Ji',600,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1623/118456.webp','tv','1987','finished_airing',''),(43614,'Lata Dawang Qiyu Ji (Movie)',4956,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1893/118457.webp','movie','2012-08-17','finished_airing','Movie version of Lata Dawang Qiyu Ji.'),(43615,'Qiao Zai Qi Zhong',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1466/118506.webp','movie','1987','finished_airing',''),(43616,'Mayi He Da Xiang',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1463/118507.webp','movie','1987','finished_airing',' '),(43617,'You Qiu Bi Ying',1073,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1156/118505.webp','movie','1987','finished_airing',''),(43619,'Xue Shizi',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1377/118577.webp','movie','1987','finished_airing',''),(43620,'Feixiang De Gezi',561,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1783/118508.webp','movie','1987','finished_airing',''),(43622,'Mama Qing Xiuxi',1133,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1321/118509.jpg','movie','1987','finished_airing',''),(43623,'Laohu Zhuang Ya',1062,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1187/118511.jpg','movie','1987','finished_airing',''),(43624,'Xuanmei Ji',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1735/118512.webp','movie','1987','finished_airing',''),(43625,'Yue Dayue Xiang',300,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1244/118513.webp','movie','1987','finished_airing',''),(43626,'Jue Shi Wu Hun',710,68.4,440,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1183/110438.jpg','ona','2020-10-25','finished_airing','In the continent of Longmai, thousands of clans stand tall, countless sects exist, and cultivation is the way of life. The strong can do anything they want while the weaklings live like ants. Youngster Chen Feng has an incomplete dan region, causing him to be unable to cultivate, he withstood countless sneers directed at him. Until he obtained a mysterious dragon bloodline, breaking out of his cocoon and opening a new chapter to his life! Coquettish demonic fox spirits, cold female emperors, demon girls or princesses from a prestigious clan, all of them jump into my embrace. With the unparalleled inheritance, I will manifest the strongest martial spirit, obtain all the beauties and look down from the heavens.\n\n(Source: AC.QQ, translated)'),(43629,'Tokyo Babylon 2021',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1301/113833.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Subaru Sumeragi is the thirteenth head of his powerful onmyouji clan. Until the time comes when he must succeed his grandmother fully, Subaru is allowed to live in Tokyo with his fraternal twin Hokuto. While Subaru is kind and shy, Hokuto has exuberance to spare, and her favorite pastime is designing bold matching outfits for the two of them to wear. Her next favorite thing to do is try to set up Subaru with their veterinarian friend Seishirou Sakurazuka who, oddly enough, is always readily available to accompany the Sumeragis throughout the city.\n\nSubaru has to resolve a variety of spiritual conflicts in Tokyo: some are cases formally brought to him by clients, and others are matters in which he decides to involve himself. A selfless teenager, he empathizes with others to the point that their pain may as well be his own. This leaves him vulnerable in a city where nearly everyone makes decisions that only benefit themselves as individuals. Hokuto hopes that if Subaru develops feelings for Seishirou, their relationship will be the one thing that he never gives up for the sake of anyone else. However, is Seishirou the best candidate for her brother\'s love, or is he hiding sinister secrets?\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(43632,'Houzi Dian Bianpao',405,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1774/118578.webp','movie','1987','finished_airing',''),(43633,'Xiang Hu',1080,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1717/118502.webp','movie','1986','finished_airing',''),(43634,'Ying',1020,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1979/118501.webp','movie','1988','finished_airing',''),(43636,'Poshui Jie De Chuanshuo',1154,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1648/118518.webp','movie','1988','finished_airing',''),(43637,'Yu',289,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1744/118579.webp','movie','1988','finished_airing',''),(43638,'Qiangzhe Shanggou',195,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1537/118580.webp','movie','1988','finished_airing',''),(43639,'Zhui Shu',68,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1473/118581.webp','movie','1988','finished_airing',''),(43640,'Douji',169,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1266/118582.webp','movie','1988','finished_airing',''),(43642,'Pi Pi De Gushi',288,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1833/118583.jpg','tv','1988','finished_airing',''),(43643,'Lan Gu',1098,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/