e told that they are \"erased from the family register, involved in an experiment, and gained certain powers.\"\n\nAkira is determined to win the game with his newfound powers and destroy the organization. Armed with a power no one expects and his \"brain\" skills, the new period of intelligence battle begins! \n\n(Source: MU, edited)'),(43816,'Yeban Guai Sheng',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1373/118685.webp','movie','1991','finished_airing',''),(43817,'Zhi Dou Wuya',575,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1861/118686.webp','movie','1991','finished_airing',''),(43818,'Zi Zuo Zi Shou',346,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1940/118687.webp','movie','1991','finished_airing',''),(43819,'Zuiba, Erduo He Yanjing',588,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1681/118688.webp','movie','1991','finished_airing',''),(43820,'Dong Dong He Gua Gua',623,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1581/122425.jpg','movie','1991','finished_airing',''),(43821,'Lianhua Gongzhu',607,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1146/122426.jpg','movie','1992','finished_airing',''),(43822,'Xiao Huangyou De Gushi',1000,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1551/122427.jpg','movie','1992','finished_airing',''),(43823,'Da Qiqiu',1140,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1476/122428.jpg','movie','1992','finished_airing',''),(43824,'Chuntian Li De Xiaotian Shu',1400,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1968/122429.jpg','movie','1992','finished_airing',''),(43825,'Jingquan Jiuhu Dui',1200,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1363/122430.jpg','tv','1993','finished_airing',''),(43826,'Kaixin Guo',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1331/122431.jpg','movie','1993','finished_airing',''),(43827,'Xiao Heshang: You Fang Seng',630,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1407/122432.jpg','movie','1993','finished_airing',''),(43828,'Lu Nu',1680,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1770/12243