 girl named Nagisa Minase suddenly confesses to Naoya following months of preparation. Even though he politely rejects her, Nagisa\'s irresistible charm and determination continue to attract Naoya. Wanting to fulfill both Saki and Nagisa\'s desires, Naoya ends up proposing a crazy idea—to date the two of them simultaneously, with both girls fully aware. This unprecedented state of affairs ultimately causes wacky and hilarious situations in whatever they do to keep their unusual relationship going. \n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(43970,'Xiao Bing Zhang Ga',4740,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1002/122858.jpg','movie','2005','finished_airing',''),(43975,'Sai Er Hao: Xunzhao Fenghuang Shenshou',4738,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1607/123722.jpg','movie','2011-07-28','finished_airing',''),(43976,'Qi Jiguang Yingxiong Chuan',5400,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1831/122859.jpg','movie','2012-06-01','finished_airing',''),(43977,'Kaixin Chaoren',5355,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1911/140145.jpg','movie','2013-06-28','finished_airing',''),(43979,'Kaixin Chaoren 2: Qi Yuan Xing Zhi Zhan',5100,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1285/122860.jpg','movie','2014-07-18','finished_airing',''),(43982,'Xi Yangyang Yu Hui Tailang: Yangyang Yundonghui',900,0,60,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1261/115268.jpg','tv','2008-10-23','finished_airing',''),(43983,'Xi Yangyang Yu Hui Tailang: Yangyang Kuaile De Yi Nian',900,0,100,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1617/115269.jpg','tv','2010-05-01','finished_airing',''),(43984,'Xi Yangyang Yu Hui Tai Lang: Qi Si Miao Xiang Xi Yangyang',900,0,60,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1495/115270.jpg','tv','2011-07-06','finished_airing',''),(43985,'Xi Yangyang Yu Hui Tailang: Gei Kuaile Jiayou',900,0,100,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1550/115271.jpg','tv','2011-10-15','finished_airing',''),(43986,'Xi Yangyang Yu Hui Tailang: Jingji Da Lianmeng'