eath, crushing all hope of him ever achieving happiness.\n\nRemarkably, an old contract allows Pochita to merge with the deceased Denji and bestow devil powers on him, changing him into a hybrid able to transform his body parts into chainsaws. Because Denji\'s new abilities pose a significant risk to society, the Public Safety Bureau\'s elite devil hunter Makima takes him in, letting him live as long as he obeys her command. Guided by the promise of a content life alongside an attractive woman, Denji devotes everything and fights with all his might to make his naive dreams a reality.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(44513,'Wo Shi Da Shenxian',1179,68.60000000000001,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1255/110963.webp','ona','2020-11-12','finished_airing','At the age of seven, the very short-lived child prodigy, who was growing too fast, returned to the immortal world to prevent his abnormal growing. From then on, with his gifted brain and wisdom he obtained from earth, he walked in path immortality to became the legendary god to return his normal life...\n\n(Source: MU)'),(44516,'Koroshi Ai',1420,69,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1485/119329.webp','tv','2022-01-13','finished_airing','Novice bounty hunter Chateau Dankworth never expected to encounter someone capable of overpowering her in combat. Even less so that the mysterious man would take an immediate interest in her—to the point of aiding her missions. However, Chateau makes it clear that she has no plans of entertaining any personal involvement with him.\n\nChateau\'s company is soon tasked with eliminating Song Ryang-ha—an expert assassin and a former member of a powerful Asian organization. Coincidentally, Ryang-ha is the man that has been pursuing her. Despite his background, Chateau reluctantly agrees to meet with Ryang-ha as part of a deal: in exchange for going out with him, he will provide her with the locations of current targets, dead or alive.\n\nBut when the past begins to haunt both killers, their arrangement may need to come to an end, as their entanglement puts their lives at grave risk.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(44517,'Da, da Ge da Xigua',960,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1557/122933.jpg','movie','2008-12-31','finished_airing','The king of spades and the king of clubs argue for ownership of a small island when dividing territories, and break up at the negotiating table. So both kingdoms involve each other into a war of land, sea and air.\n\n(Source: IMDB)'),(44518,'Wo Jiao MT',600,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1926/122892.jpg','ona','2009-01-01','finished_airing',''),(44520,'Wo Jiao MT 2nd Season',600,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1352/131268.jpg','ona','2010-01-10','finished_airing',''),(44521,'Wo Jiao MT 3rd Season',1800,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1774/131303.jpg','ona','2010','finished_airing',''),(44522,'Wo Jiao MT 4th Season',1800,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1552/131304.jpg','ona','2011','finished_airing',''),(44523,'Wo Jiao MT 5th Season',1800,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1277/131305.jpg','ona','2012','finished_airing',''),(44524,'Isekai Meikyuu de Harem wo',1440,65.4,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1490/126919.webp','tv','2022-07-06','finished_airing','One day, high school student Michio Kaga attempts to start a strange online game he found while browsing the internet. Instead, he gets transported to a rural village in the game\'s world, equipped with special skills and an overpowered sword. After collecting his thoughts, he finds himself battling against bandits and soon realizes that he cannot log out. Resigning himself to fate and accepting this reality, Michio sets out on a journey—enjoying his new life, conquering dungeons to earn money, and building a harem to satisfy all his manly desires.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(44525,'Wo Jiao MT 6th Season',1800,0,21,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anim