,'movie','2015-06-27','finished_airing',''),(44931,'Tonikaku Kawaii: SNS',1425,80.19999999999999,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1765/122768.jpg','ova','2021-08-18','finished_airing','When Tsukasa Yuzaki receives a brand new smartphone as a surprise gift from her husband Nasa, she is delighted, quickly adding in contacts and mastering the arts of LINE and sticker-sending. However, her joy is short-lived: a former coworker calls in Nasa for a difficult job, and Tsukasa is dismayed to learn that her beloved might have to work through the night.\n\nFaced with her first night alone since her marriage to Nasa, will Tsukasa and her new phone be able to overcome the distance that separates the young couple and defeat the loneliness that threatens to pull her under?\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]\n\n'),(44935,'Ni Hao Ji Zhi',300,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1912/127634.jpg','ona','2015-09-01','finished_airing',''),(44936,'Baixue Gongzhu: Shenmi Baba',4690,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1030/127538.jpg','movie','2015-08-14','finished_airing',''),(44940,'World Trigger 3rd Season',1380,82.5,14,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1617/117474.webp','tv','2021-10-10','finished_airing','At the Border Defense Agency\'s headquarters, the B-Rank Wars are underway as each team fights intensely to secure a spot in the upcoming Away Mission. Though Osamu Mikumo and the rest of Tamakoma-2 have pulled through thus far, the final rounds will require them to push far beyond the limits of their current abilities. Taking in a talented new member, the squad begins to train and develop new strategies, but, amid these efforts, the team is shaken by a heated dispute—one that could jeopardize their ticket to the Neighbor\'s dimension.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]\n'),(44942,'Shuumatsu no Walküre',1480,68.1,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1456/115123.webp','ona','2021-06-17','finished_airing','The gods of the world—from Greek to Norse to Hindu mythology—gather every one thousand years to make one important decision: whether or not to wipe out mankind. Repulsed by humanity\'s selfishness, the council unanimously votes to destroy all humans. But before the decree is enacted, Brunhilde, one of the 13 Valkyries of Valhalla, interrupts the meeting to give mankind a chance at survival. \n\nBrunhilde proposes the idea of enacting Ragnarök, an event in which the strongest 13 mortal warriors fight against 13 gods in one-on-one matches. Although the trial is ridiculed by the gods, the demigod takes advantage of their pride and forces them into an agreement. However, Brunhilde herself must recruit the mightiest heroes throughout humanity\'s thousand-year history and guide them to victory before they meet their untimely demise.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(44943,'Alibaba 2: Solomon Fengyin',4860,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1091/127939.jpg','movie','2016-04-30','finished_airing',''),(44946,'Chouxiaoya Lixian Ji',4800,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1828/128419.jpg','movie','2016-07-02','finished_airing',''),(44947,'Chaoji Youeryuan',4500,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1675/127635.jpg','movie','2016-12-31','finished_airing',''),(44948,'Teddy Xiong: Wanju Dazhan',4680,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1324/128327.jpg','movie','2016-06-09','finished_airing',''),(44949,'Si Du Chishui',5100,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1307/128329.jpg','movie','2016-10-14','finished_airing',''),(44950,'Qingwa Zongdongyuan',4322,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1231/128330.jpg','movie','2016-04-30','finished_airing',''),(44951,'Xin Mu Ou Qiyu Ji',4624,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1415/128331.jpg','movie','2016-09-30','finished_airing',''),(44952,'Rexue Lei Feng Xia: Jiqing Yingjiu',5071,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1806/128333.jpg','movie','2016-10-21','finished_airing',''),(44953,'Ciwei Xiao Zi: Tiansheng Wo Ci',