'2023-04-20','finished_airing','Located at the end of the world, the Kingdom of Ozmargo is inhabited by beasts of all shapes and forms, ruled by a fearsome nameless king. After a hundred-year war between Ozmargo and the neighboring human kingdom ended, a peace treaty was signed: every year, a sacrifice must be sent to be devoured by the king on the night of revelation.\n\nSariphi is the 99th and latest human sacrifice. Although frail-looking, she neither fears the king nor has a family or home to return to should she manage to escape from her impending demise. Intrigued by the audacious girl, the king lets Sariphi roam around the palace despite the disapproval of his advisor, Anubis.\n\nLittle by little, the king and Sariphi begin to warm up to each other, but the night of revelation is fast approaching. Unbeknownst to them, the fateful day unleashes a series of events that will change the course of destiny of not only Sariphi and the king but also of their respective worlds.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(46423,'Qi Qu Shijie',600,0,50,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1516/129837.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46424,'Qi E Buluo',910,0,115,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1833/129838.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46425,'Duan Wei Gou: Pangxie Zhanzhu',800,0,60,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1522/129839.jpg','tv','2011','finished_airing',''),(46426,'Shenqi De Baoshi',320,0,300,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1514/127555.jpg','tv','2011','finished_airing',''),(46427,'Hanzi Da Zuozhan',726,0,104,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1678/129840.jpg','tv','2011','finished_airing',''),(46429,'Jia You Huobao',380,0,84,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1171/130897.jpg','ona','','finished_airing',''),(46430,'Chaoji Da Lotto',620,0,325,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1513/130898.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46431,'Yahari Ore no Seishun Love Comedy wa Machigatteiru. Kan: Dakara, Shishunki wa Owarazu 