s://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1308/130005.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46469,'Xiaoyao You Shijie',800,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1300/130004.jpg','tv','2011-11','finished_airing',''),(46471,'Tantei wa Mou, Shindeiru.',1545,64.1,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1843/115815.webp','tv','2021-07-04','finished_airing','Kimihiko Kimizuka has found himself inadvertently entangled in various crimes more times than he can remember, referring to himself as a magnet for trouble. One day, as if it was nothing out of the ordinary, a group of unknown men kidnaps him, forcing him to board a flight—where he also encounters a hijacking. Amid the resulting chaos, however, Kimizuka meets a stunning silver-haired beauty, going by the codename Siesta, who then saves the day.\n\nClaiming to be a legendary detective, Siesta enlists Kimizuka to be her sidekick. Though Kimizuka refuses at first, with Siesta\'s insistence, he eventually joins her—marking the start of a grand adventure spanning the entire world, preventing multiple threats that could spell doom for humanity along the way.\n\nUnfortunately, after three years of their unpredictable yet enjoyable time together, Siesta abruptly passes away. Distraught, Kimizuka tries to leave all memories of her behind, but as he begins to meet more people, it seems that Siesta\'s influence will never truly die.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(46472,'Gushi Zhentou',619,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1871/130003.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46474,'Budai Heshang Yun Youji: Kanghong Fengyun',670,0,36,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1983/130262.jpg','tv','2012','finished_airing',''),(46475,'Jiangziya Zhi Shang Hu Chuanshuo',720,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1868/130260.jpg','tv','2012','finished_airing',''),(46478,'Jisu Shaonian',1200,0,50,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1490/141444.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46479,'Xuanfeng Sudu',0,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1930/130259.jpg','tv','2012-11','finished_airing',''),(46485,'Huanle Zhi Cheng',1340,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1097/130258.jpg','tv','2012','finished_airing',''),(46488,'Tai-Ari deshita.: Ojousama wa Kakutou Game nante Shinai',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1834/148271.webp','tv','2025','not_yet_aired','A hot fighting game played at the girls\' school!!\n\nAya transferred into Kuromi Girls Academy a month ago with the goal of changing herself into a proper lady. After meeting the breathtaking Shirayuri, Aya is blown away by her elegance and posterity. Imagine her surprise when she finds Shirayuri after school playing... a fighting game?! And if that wasn\'t perplexing enough, she is challenged to a duel by the unladylike Shirayuri! \n\n(Source: MU)'),(46491,'Santa Company: Manatsu no Merry Christmas',1590,52.400000000000006,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1661/111242.webp','movie','2021-01-28','finished_airing','Santa Company is a worldwide organization dedicated to delivering presents to children. Santa Company\'s elves—known as \"tonttus\"—aid several Santas every year by wrapping presents, raising reindeer, and helping with deliveries. Mint Rondo is one of the many new tonttus arriving at Santa Company\'s tropical island office. Following in her older brother\'s footsteps, Mint begins training alongside her friend, Thomas Dou, and rival, Noah, to eventually become a Santa herself. Unfortunately, her clumsiness causes her to fall far behind her peers and into her brother\'s shadow.\n\nOne day, while sitting on the beach, Mint, Thomas, and Noah discover the biggest threat that Santa Company has faced yet: ocean pollution! With the accumulation of litter going unnoticed, the growing hazard will soon endanger the surrounding ocean wildlife and the members of the Santa Company. As trouble looms over the horizon, Mint might just be able to clean up her act and save everyone on the island in time for Christmas Eve.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(46494,'Yun Qi Feixing Riji',620,0,78,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1540/130255.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46495,'Yun Qi Feixing Riji 2',620,0,78,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1378/130256.jpg','tv','2014','finished_airing',''),(46496,'Yun Qi Feixing Riji 3',620,0,78,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1198/130257.jpg','tv','2020','finished_airing',''),(46499,'Hong Hai Er Yu Daxueyuan',740,0,208,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1121/130252.jpg','tv','2012','finished_airing',''),(46500,'Hong Hai Er: Papa Wa Xun Shi Ji',740,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1587/130253.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46501,'Cangshu Leyuan',740,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1171/130251.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46502,'Jin Tong Wang Shijie',920,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1879/130248.jpg','tv','2012-02-16','finished_airing',''),(46503,'Shengri Meng Jingling',780,0,104,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1740/130247.jpg','tv','2012','finished_airing',''),(46504,'Tao Donghua Pian',920,0,102,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1403/130246.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46505,'Gaotie Xia',1325,0,50,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1517/130245.webp','tv','2011-08','finished_airing',''),(46506,'Guaiwu Shan',740,0,104,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1873/130903.jpg','tv','2013','finished_airing',''),(46507,'Chaohu Chuanshuo',620,0,11,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1195/130904.jpg','ona','2012-09','finished_airing',''),(46509,'Bang Bang Quwei Yingyu',320,0,150,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1991/130905.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46511,'Congming Lun Wen Xu',900,0,78,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1044/130907.jpg','tv','2009','finished_airing',''),(46512,'Kuaile Xiao Fang Lian',360,0,260,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1398/130908.jpg',