d obtain the Elixir of Life—which supposedly grants immortality—and bring it back for the shogun, then his freedom will be assured.\n\nBut of the many who have traveled to Shinsekyo in search of the mythical Elixir, not a single person has returned sound of mind, if at all. Though unaware of the numerous dangers ahead, Gabimaru decides to accept the offer—alongside ten other death row convicts—in hope that he and his wife may finally live in peace.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(46570,'Kuaile Baobei: Bai Bian Zimu',491,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1666/131038.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46571,'Kuaile Baobei: Huoli Jiating',500,0,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1154/131039.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46572,'Kuaile Baobei: Xingqu Mofang',490,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1789/131040.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46573,'Kuaile Baobei: Duocai Shenghuo',500,0,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1044/131041.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46574,'Kuaile Baobei: Huanle Jiaqi',488,0,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1843/131042.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46575,'Kuaile Baobei: Cheng Chang Riji',489,0,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1528/131043.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46576,'Kuaile Baobei: Duo Mi Chengzhang Ji',500,0,80,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1149/131044.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46577,'Qi Qu Gong Fang: Jianzhi Baodian',720,0,42,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1220/131045.webp','tv','2012','finished_airing',''),(46578,'Qi Qu Gong Fang: Shougong Baodian',720,0,42,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1847/131046.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46579,'Qi Qu Gong Fang: Buyi Shougong Baodian',720,0,42,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1086/131047.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46580,'Qi Qu Gong Fang: Keji Shougong Baodian',720,0,42,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1160/131048.jpg','tv','