e \"Team Anti-Rain\" searches for highly confidential information in an abandoned warehouse, but they are shortly ambushed. Hoping to safeguard their findings, the group temporarily disbands and each Doll goes into hiding. Meanwhile, the lazy but gifted Gentiane is hired by Griffin as a rookie commander and given her critical first mission—track down Team Anti-Rain and recover the classified data before Sangvis Ferri can.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(46615,'Hao Haizi Xiao Ketang',140,0,98,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1540/131069.jpg','ona','','finished_airing',''),(46616,'Qin Qin Xiao Ke',740,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1999/131070.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46619,'Xingfu Zai Shenbian: Dangdai Leifeng Guomingyi De Gushi',1325,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1353/131071.jpg','tv','2012','finished_airing',''),(46620,'Tiexue Yang Jia Jiang',730,0,50,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1364/131072.jpg','tv','2012','finished_airing',''),(46621,'Gang Zi Tegong Dui',578,0,100,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1889/131073.jpg','tv','2012','finished_airing',''),(46623,'Long Gui: Long Xing Tianxia',900,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1535/131074.jpg','tv','2012','finished_airing',''),(46625,'Qingqing Qi E Leyuan',860,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1932/131075.jpg','tv','','finished_airing',''),(46626,'Da Erduo Yeye Lixian Ji',1040,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1451/131076.jpg','tv','2012','finished_airing',''),(46627,'Feiyue Wuqian Nian',500,0,50,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1487/131077.jpg','tv','2012','finished_airing',''),(46630,'Jue Ding',300,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1947/111276.jpg','ona','2021-02-06','finished_airing','Jia Fugui is the fierce gang leader of the Muye Gang. After going bald one day, he feels like he lost the respect of his fellow gang members. He leaves the temple on a search to find a hair growth tonic