9435.jpg','ona','2018-03-02','finished_airing',''),(47394,'Wangzhe? Bie Nao! 2nd Season',346,0,33,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1792/129436.jpg','ona','2019-05-02','finished_airing',''),(47398,'Chuukou Ikkan!! Kimetsu Gakuen Monogatari: Valentine-hen',154,66.8,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1722/120098.webp','ona','2021-02-14','finished_airing','Zenitsu Agatsuma is determined to be the subject of adoration by receiving chocolates on Valentine’s Day—and this year, he is taking no chances. Enlisting the help of his friend Tanjirou Kamado, the two are prepared to learn from some of Kimetsu Academy\'s most popular figures. Together, they ask Kyoujurou Rengoku, the history teacher; Giyuu Tomioka, the PE teacher; and Tengen Uzui, the art teacher, about the secrets to their popularity. However, only time will tell if following their advice will bring the same success for Zenitsu.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]\n'),(47403,'Kuiba Zhi Shu Tu',1360,62.1,7,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1558/111667.jpg','ona','2021-01-17','finished_airing','The story takes place in Lingshan, where a group of \"hopeless\" people are gathered on the earth. Most of them are poor, vicious, or extremely evil, abandoned by the society in Lingshan. This is where the fourth generation of Kuiba Mi Lin was born. \n\nThe Heavens struggled to find Kuiba to no avail. In order to eliminate Kuiba, the Heavens determined to blast Lingshan into the ground. Mi Lin rose from the predicament, and his spirit gradually awakened souls with flesh and blood in Lingshan. Mi Lin led the Lingshan Army to sweep across the world, against the Heavens, and became the overlord of the world.\n\n(Source: Tencent, translated)'),(47405,'Wanmei Shijie',1170,78.7,234,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1619/137928.jpg','ona','2021-04-23','currently_airing','Born into a unique world where villages fight to gain power and control, the main character, Shi Hao, is a genius blessed by the heavens born under the poorest of conditions.\n\nHis clan, however, has a mysterious past. To rise up and become the genius he is meant to be, the clan goes through every effort to aid his cultivation as they battle through fanatical monsters and engage in power struggles with other clans.\n\nHis journey will bring him through unknown lands until he is able to become a person that can truly shake the world.\n\n(Source: Novels Xianxia&Xuanhuan Wiki)'),(47409,'Gekijou Tanpen Macross Frontier: Toki no Meikyuu',840,70.8,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1419/111593.webp','movie','2021-10-08','finished_airing','Short screened with Macross Δ Movie 2: Zettai Live!!!.'),(47410,'Initial D Battle Stage 3',5581,75.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1236/113306.webp','ova','2021-03-05','finished_airing','Initial D: Battle Stage 3 is the eleventh and final installment of the Initial D series. It features every race from Fifth Stage and Final Stage. Unlike the previous two battle stages, it does not feature any new battles, and doesn\'t feature any character dialogue.\n\n(Source: Initial D Wiki)'),(47413,'Meitantei Conan: Hiiro no Fuzai Shoumei',5548,74.1,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1234/117118.jpg','movie','2021-02-11','finished_airing','Compilation film combining footage from various television anime episodes that center on the Akai family.\n\n(Source: ANN)'),(47425,'Bessatsu Kamen Rider Saber: Tanpen Katsudou Manga Shuu',586,0,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1345/115576.webp','ona','2021-02-01','finished_airing','Kamen Rider Saber shorts released on the Toei Tokusatsu Fanclub (TTFC) app.'),(47426,'23-ji no Saga Meshi Anime',19,57.699999999999996,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1384/111726.jpg','ona','2021-02-15','finished_airing','A series of short animations to promote the food of the Saga Prefecture. '),(47428,'Xin Chenglong Lixian Ji: Mengjing Shouhu Zhe',740,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1414/129437.jpg',