cter, \"Cayna,\" she notices that the world of Leadale is different from what she remembers playing.\n\nAs she comes to learn, two hundred years have passed since she last interacted with the world. However, this does not sadden Cayna—as it means that a new journey awaits her, filled with exciting prospects and unfamiliar faces all waiting to be discovered.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(48240,'Pororo Movie: Keompyuteo Wang-gug Daemoheom',5400,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1930/130304.jpg','movie','2015-12-10','finished_airing',''),(48241,'Pororo Movie: Gonglyongseom Daemoheom',4716,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1881/130305.jpg','movie','2017-12-07','finished_airing',''),(48242,'Pororo Movie: Bomulseom Daemoheom',4762,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1843/130343.webp','movie','2019-04-25','finished_airing',''),(48245,'Porong Porong Pororo 7',660,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1029/130303.jpg','tv','2020-11-23','finished_airing',''),(48250,'Pororo Donghwanala',560,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1465/114524.webp','tv','2020-08-24','finished_airing',''),(48251,'Ppyojogppyojog Pokeugajog',200,0,260,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1374/130302.jpg','ona','2016-04-16','finished_airing','The Forks with Spiky Hands is a comedic and a gothic styled animated series, starring an unusual family that is sure to leave a lasting impression.\nThe Fork family has pointy forks as hands, and their sharp hair make them unique in their appearances.\nThe main character, Tilly, is a very mature girl that dreams of becoming the main character of a horror story.\n\nMr. Fork, the father, doesn\'t wear a tie to work, but instead wears a noose. Unlike his looks, he is a warmhearted and a loving father.\nMrs. Fork makes cupcakes out of the most unusual ingredients that leaves you questioning whether it\'s edible, even for animals.\nChabby, the little brother, interacts very closely with animals and befriends them more than people.\n\nThe series depicts the daily lives of Tilly and her spooky family in a satirical tone that the viewers are sure to fall in love with.\n\n(Source: WelCon)'),(48252,'Ore, Tsushima',90,69.4,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1916/112514.jpg','tv','2021-07-02','finished_airing','One morning, an old lady meets a stray cat searching for food in garbage cans and decides to take him back home to give him a proper meal. Despite being surprised to learn that the cat named Tsushima has the ability to speak, she nevertheless chooses to adopt him and entertains all of his whims. Ore, Tsushima details the hilarious adventures of the gluttonous and lazy Tsushima leopard cat in his new foster family.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(48253,'Saeng-il-wang-gug-ui Princess Pring',800,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1497/130301.jpg','tv','2015-12-19','finished_airing',''),(48254,'Shadow Fighter',0,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1153/115552.jpg','tv','2005-07-07','finished_airing',''),(48255,'Seonmulgonglyong Dibo',680,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1550/130300.jpg','tv','2004','finished_airing','Dibo the Gift Dragon is a South Korean-British animated series created by OCON Studios in 2004.'),(48256,'SofyRuby',740,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1811/115553.webp','tv','2016-08-30','finished_airing',''),(48257,'Sup Sog Chingu Seutonijeu',0,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1762/115556.jpg','tv','2019-11-20','finished_airing',''),(48258,'Noonnoppi English Super Talk Talk',440,0,36,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1934/114523.jpg','ova','2000-08-11','finished_airing',''),(48259,'Super Hams Band',680,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1955/130299.jpg','tv','2009-09-03','finished_airing',''),(48260,'Taikong Xiha Zu',1471,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1985/114521.jpg','tv','2002-12-04','finished_airing',''),(48262,'Sigan Yeohaengja Luke',660,0,52,'ht