Hito',1469,71.2,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1026/143505.jpg','tv','2024-07-06','finished_airing','For the last three years, Clay has undergone rigorous training in order to find her father, who was last seen exploring a dungeon. While dungeon exploring is difficult for any regular adventurer, Clay knows her father, a thief who doesn\'t purely rely on raw power or magic, managed to progress farther than anyone else. Clay sets off after him, following in his footsteps until she encounters a furnished room behind a dungeon wall.\n\nClay is shocked to find the room is filled with monsters that can talk and a girl who claims to be the dungeons administrator. However, the room is meant to be kept hidden from explorers. Now that she knows the secret behind the dungeon, Clay is hired to be part of their staff. While she never expected to find a job in her adventure, doing so may just help Clay unravel the mystery behind her father\'s disappearance.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56351,'Mahoutsukai Sally: Astraea Palace no Party',1800,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1445/137883.jpg','ova','1990','finished_airing',''),(56352,'Loop 7-kaime no Akuyaku Reijou wa, Moto Tekikoku de Jiyuu Kimama na Hanayome Seikatsu wo Mankitsu suru',1430,75.1,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1533/140617.webp','tv','2024-01-07','finished_airing','Rishe Irmgard Weitzner finds herself in a familiar situation: her fiancé is publicly breaking off their engagement, and her ducal family is about to disown her in shame. However, Rishe is not distraught; she has already had six chances to rebuild her life and chase a different passion each time. But she would always get swept up in a war and die, so now she wishes for her seventh reincarnation to be easygoing and uneventful.\n\nWhat Rishe does not take into account is the presence of Arnold Hein, the crown prince of the Galkhein Kingdom. He is destined to usurp the throne and become a tyrant who starts a large-scale invasion of neighboring countries. To make their encounter worse, Arnold is the one who killed Rishe in her previous life. That is why it is all the more shocking when he proposes to Rishe on the spot. In pursuit of her desired life, Rishe must consider accepting Arnold\'s proposal and discover the reasons behind his brutal actions to stop the war from ever happening.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56354,'Code Name X',660,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1397/137900.jpg','tv','2023-04-08','finished_airing',''),(56356,'Hero Circle',660,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1515/137901.jpg','tv','2020-06-29','finished_airing','There is PawPaw School, where various clubs gather. Among them, \'Hero Circle\' has special kids with superpowers. Teo, a naughty head of the club, has telekinesis. Vincent, a timid vampire, can transform into a bat. Sena, who is cynical and competitive, has a speed of light. Lucky is an angel who is always bright. Dino is a scientist who transforms into a dinosaur when he\'s angry.\nThese five kids claim to be the problem solvers at school, but they often ruin things even more because they are impatient and clumsy. However, in order to become a hero who fights against real villains someday, Hero Circle continues to search for accidents in school, today as well.\n\n(Source: Official Website, translated)'),(56357,'Hero Circle 2',660,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1706/137902.jpg','tv','2022-06-29','finished_airing',''),(56358,'Kkomimanyeo Lara',660,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1505/137903.jpg','tv','2023-03-13','finished_airing','Tells the main character, Lara, who enters a magical world called Loia, where the magicians and Komipet live, and receives a magic education that goes against her wishes at the end of the twists and turns. When the peaceful village of lo gradually gained strange energy, the COMI Pelhiaraan Animal became damaged and a strange commotion appeared. Lara, who sympathizes with komipets with unique activeness and intelligence, heals them and breaks the commotion, gradually growing into a small witch.\n\n(Source: Mahou Shoujo, Magical Girl Wiki)'),(56359,'Nae Chingu Baninbaneo',720,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1381/137904.jpg','tv','2022-12-28','finished_airing',''),(56360,'Poten Dogs',540,0,18,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1915/137905.jpg','tv','2021-03-29','finished_airing',''),(56361,'Poten Dogs Season 2',540,0,18,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1885/137906.jpg','tv','2021-05-27','finished_airing',''),(56362,'Robocar Poli 5',840,0,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1181/137907.jpg','tv','2022-03-04','finished_airing',''),(56363,'Poli wa Hamkkehaneun Gyotonganjeon Iyagi',300,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1358/137909.jpg','tv','2011-11-14','finished_airing',''),(56365,'Roy wa Hamkkehaneun Sobanganjeon Iyagi',360,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1729/137911.jpg','tv','2017-08-29','finished_airing',''),(56366,'Amber wa Hamkkehaneun Saenghwalanjeon Iyagi',360,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1677/137912.jpg','tv','2018-08-31','finished_airing',''),(56368,'Robocar Poli: Song Song Museum',420,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1398/137914.jpg','tv','2020-07-02','finished_airing',''),(56369,'Samyang Ramen Original Musical',198,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1918/139466.webp','cm','2021-09-29','finished_airing','Samyang Ramen\'s 60th Anniversary music video by Kyuhyun.'),(56370,'Sesangui Gijuneul Bultaewola! Buldalgbokkeummyeon',128,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1487/137916.jpg','cm','2021-12-17','finished_airing','A music video by Soyeon (of (G)I-DLE) promoting Hot Chicken Flavor Ramen.'),(56371,'Koko',1008,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1539/137921.jpg','ona','2023-08-15','finished_airing',''),(56372,'Xue Yu Shaonian',6600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1731/137922.jpg','movie','2023-08-19','finished_airing',''),(56373,'Wangpai Erha',5580,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1305/137923.webp','movie','2023-08-19','finished_airing',''),(56374,'Carrie & Superkola',4740,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1537/137924.jpg','movie','2023-01-18','finished_airing',''),(56375,'Eommaui Ttang: Geulisyawa Supui Juin',4130,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1817/137925.jpg','movie','2023-01-25','finished_airing',''),(56376,'Uchi no Kaisha no Chiisai Senpai no Hanashi Mini Anime',60,56.8,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1862/137936.jpg','ona','2023-07-08','finished_airing',''),(56378,'Tarou no Tomodachi',780,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1472/137956.jpg','ova','2005-10-28','finished_airing',''),(56379,'Mameushi-kun',480,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1509/137933.jpg','ova','2006-08-25','finished_airing',''),(56380,'Mugen ∞ 15-byou Animation',906,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1563/137934.webp','movie','2023','finished_airing','An anthology work produced by the Japan Animation Association for their Into Animation 8 festival held at The National Art Center, Tokyo.'),(56381,'Kaze',220,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1420/137935.jpg','movie','1992','finished_airing',''),(56383,'Byeoleul Dameun Sonyeon',1020,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1817/137938.jpg','movie','2022-03-14','finished_airing',''),(56384,'Big Fish',494,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1432/137939.jpg','movie','2017','finished_airing','Mother Yona jumps into Big Fish to find her daughter Mika.'),(56385,'Snail Man',1314,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1576/137940.jpg','movie','2019','finished_airing','An old man named Lot is crossing a desert with a snail-shaped wagon with Aram, his grandson, to collect the body of his son who died in a war.\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(56386,'Jihyeloun Bangguseog Saenghwal',420,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1753/138053.jpg','movie','2020','finished_airing',''),(56387,'Dummy: No Way Out',408,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1537/138064.webp','movie','2015','finished_airing',''),(56400,'Maou-sama, Retry! R',1430,59.2,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1667/145393.jpg','tv','2024-10-05','finished_airing','With Rabbi Village greatly expanding under the management of his subordinates Isami Tahara and Yuu Kirino, Hakuto Kunai can now resume his adventures while looking for items to counteract magic. He begins his search at the Prison Labyrinth in Rookie Town, where a secret laboratory deep within the dungeon gives him insight into technology that is far more advanced and dangerous than anything in the rest of the world.\n\nMeanwhile, Rabbi Village has gained unwanted international attention from the newly formed Queendom of Xenobia, which wishes to drive a wedge between the Holy Kingdom of Light and the State of Right. But with Kunai\'s newly summoned aide, Akane Fujisaki, at his disposal, things may not go as the Queendom plans.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56402,'Gwahoheub Special',295,72.1,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1799/137965.webp','special','2018-10-05','finished_airing','Lee Myeongyi has lived his whole life with pneumothorax—a collapsed lung. He despises the attention he draws at school with his bouts of loud hyperventilating, extended coughing fits, and exemption from physical education as well as military service. Whether suffering through the curiosity or ire of his classmates, Myeongyi is left feeling like a complete outcast. However, the class president Han Seonho often shows Myeongyi kindness and understanding. With his friendly gestures and handsome looks, he becomes Myeongyi\'s first crush.\n\nNine years later, Myeongyi attends his high school reunion for only one reason: to see Han Seonho once again. He holds a tiny glimmer of hope about the other man\'s feelings for him—but after seeing the bright gold ring on Seonho\'s left hand and listening to their classmates\' prying questions, that hope is quickly dashed. Excusing himself to go take a smoke, regardless of the state of his lungs, Myeongyi is followed outside by Seonho. Unexpectedly, that marks the beginning of their illicit love affair.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56405,'7Fates: Chakho with BTS Official Trailer',74,59.900000000000006,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1868/137984.jpg','pv','2022-09-02','finished_airing','Official trailer for 7Fates: Chakho manhwa with the song Stay Alive by Jung Kook of BTS (Produced by SUGA of BTS).'),(56407,'Yatta ze! Nattou Boy',1200,0,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1923/137990.jpg','ova','2007','finished_airing',''),(56409,'Ppungppungppangppang Bubumaen',660,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1449/137993.jpg','tv','2023-02-27','finished_airing',''),(56410,'Maca and Roni',0,0,18,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1782/137994.jpg','tv','2021-03-11','finished_airing',''),(56411,'Maca and Roni 2',0,0,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1542/137995.jpg','tv','2022-09-07','finished_airing',''),(56412,'Papa Dog',1440,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1620/137996.jpg','tv','2016-02-12','finished_airing',''),(56413,'Papa Dog Season 2',840,0,19,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1784/137997.jpg','tv','2018-08-08','finished_airing',''),(56414,'Papa Dog Season 2 Part 2',1440,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1246/137998.jpg','tv','2019-04-17','finished_airing',''),(56419,'Monk Seishin',173,58.7,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1617/138235.jpg','ona','2023-05-17','finished_airing','In the 19th century, a rice merchant encounters a mother who tries to buy rice in exchange for her own child\'s clothes. The merchant becomes Monk Seishin and relieves the islanders of Miyajima from poverty by digging wells and starting the wooden ladle industry.\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(56420,'Haigakura',1420,56,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1214/142185.jpg','tv','2024-10-07','currently_airing','The balance of the world is deeply shaken when malevolent gods known as the Four Perils break their seals and disappear together with eight million minor deities. In the absence of gods, lands become barren and famine looms in the country of the Eight Immortals. In order to restore the fragile harmony, kashi—gifted dancers and singers—must hunt the missing gods in other realms, use their performance skills to charm the deities, and seal them using the power of their rosaries.\n\nAlthough a master dancer, Ichiyou is ridiculed by his peers for his lack of singing talent. Nonetheless, the young kashi is tasked by the Eight Immortals to bring back the Four Perils before the world plunges into complete chaos. Helped by his familiars Tenkou and Kaka, Ichiyou embarks on the perilous mission given to him, with his search leading him to modern-day Japan. If he hopes to save the world, Ichiyou must also uncover the truth behind the Four Perils\' disappearance—but this event seems to be disturbingly intertwined with his own past.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56421,'Recycle Zoo',660,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1339/138009.jpg','movie','2019-04-26','finished_airing',''),(56422,'Recycle Zoo: Mamore! Mokuyoubi wa Shigengomi no Hi',540,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1679/138011.jpg','movie','2020-08-14','finished_airing',''),(56423,'Kann-chan Tsuki no Ishi wo Morau',497,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1575/138012.webp','movie','2020-11','finished_airing',''),(56424,'Oh! My Friends',182,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1727/138013.webp','ona','2008','finished_airing',''),(56425,'Houkago Shounen Hanako-kun',600,70.9,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1530/138031.webp','tv','2023-10-13','finished_airing','There are rumors that one of Kamome Academy\'s Seven Mysteries, Hanako-kun, has gained an assistant: first-year high school student Nene Yashiro. Together, Hanako and Yashiro investigate the school\'s many mysteries, keeping the balance between humans and the supernatural. But in their free time, the two can often be found goofing off, engaging in various antics involving Yashiro\'s schoolmates and the lurking spectral entities that normal people cannot see.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56426,'Oh! Loose Boys Boogie',202,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1233/138015.webp','ona','2008-12-31','finished_airing',''),(56430,'Spicy Boy',360,0,42,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1340/138026.jpg','ona','2012','finished_airing',''),(56431,'Spicy Boy Mini',30,0,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1812/138027.jpg','ona','2013-09-14','finished_airing',''),(56432,'Spicy Boy Z',66,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1753/138028.jpg','ona','2016-11-01','finished_airing',''),(56438,'Pony Tail',180,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1759/138047.jpg','ona','2012-03-07','finished_airing',''),(56439,'Wu Ying Sanqian Dao 2nd Season',727,70.7,50,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1233/138050.webp','ona','2023-08-26','finished_airing',''),(56440,'Koala no Bocchi',105,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1561/138051.webp','ona','2014-04-10','finished_airing',''),(56441,'Kate Arrow x !EXC: Pony Tail',98,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1597/138052.jpg','ona','2013-03-24','finished_airing','A collaboration between Kate Arrow\'s Pony Tail and !EXC, a fashion building in Asahikawa.'),(56442,'Bleach: Sennen Kessen-hen - Ketsubetsu-tan Recap',1440,74.80000000000001,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1364/138054.webp','tv_special','2023-09-02','finished_airing','Recap of the first 8 episodes of Bleach: Sennen Kessen-hen - Ketsubetsu-tan.'),(56445,'UPO',177,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1624/138065.jpg','ona','2017-03-18','finished_airing','Group of aliens crash their UFO.'),(56446,'Nuiguru Papa',240,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1004/138066.jpg','ona','2017-11-03','finished_airing','Dad becomes a stuffed animal.'),(56448,'Fresh Peach',150,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1233/138070.jpg','tv_special','2022-11-22','finished_airing','Short directed by Takahide Hori for NHK\'s Buzz Creators.'),(56449,'Madougushi Dahliya wa Utsumukanai',1419,68,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1572/144060.webp','tv','2024-07-06','finished_airing','Tragically perishing from overwork, a young Japanese woman is reborn as Dahliya Rossetti, daughter of a newly entitled baron. Her father, Carlo, is a beloved magic artificer, a maker of magical tools. Inspired by him, Dahliya uses her memories from her previous life to create practical inventions and become a magic artificer like Carlo.\n\nA few years later, the now adult Dahliya has made a name for herself and has gotten engaged to her father\'s apprentice. However, her life takes a turn for the worse when Carlo suddenly passes away and her fiancé leaves her for another woman not long after. Although having to fend for herself, Dahliya is not quite ready to give up on her dream of becoming a master artificer yet. She may be a single woman but, with the help from old and new allies, she is prepared to overcome any obstacle in her way.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56452,'Yappari Umi ga Suki',3240,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1273/139099.jpg','ova','2015','finished_airing',''),(56455,'Kakumei Inu Decapoo Tanjou',312,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1841/138082.webp','ona','2023-03-17','finished_airing',''),(56458,'Umi no Jiken Jiko wa 118-ban',35,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1903/138090.jpg','ona','2021-07-28','finished_airing','An axolotl is fishing on the sea when a shark suddenly comes near him, then his cat friend tries to save him by jumping at the sea.'),(56461,'Hamidashi Creative',270,56.4,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1773/150096.webp','tv','2024-10-04','finished_airing','It\'s the end of June, and the summer seems to be locked in place. Tomohiro Izumi, recognized by himself and those around him as an introvert, is spending another quiet day in his little corner of his classroom... or so he thought.\n\n\"Congratulations! You\'ve been selected as our next student council president!\"\n\nThe student council president lottery, held on the spur of the moment by the academy. Tomohiro manages to be the one randomly selected thanks to his ridiculous luck! Now the spotlight is suddenly upon him, and as a result, rumors about him begin to circulate. With no way out, Tomohiro relies on his advisor to start gathering allies he can rely on.\n\nBut none of the candidates his advisor suggests, from his classmate Kano to his underclassman Asumi, and even his little sister Hiyori, are even coming to the campus!? Amidst all of this chaos, even the former president that no one could ever get ahold of, Shio, shows up...!\n\nIs it fate, or is it a foregone conclusion? The unheard of and unprecedented battles of the \"Random Lottery Student Council President\" are about to begin! \n\n(Source: Sekai Project, edited)'),(56462,'Umeyon Ekisu',240,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1043/138092.jpg','tv','2003-05-02','finished_airing',''),(56463,'Mahou Shokudou Chara Pontan',300,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1505/138096.jpg','tv','2006-11-01','finished_airing',''),(56468,'Oni Sara',300,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1170/138108.jpg','tv','2019-08-12','finished_airing',''),(56469,'Usopp Monogatari',300,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1797/138110.jpg','ona','2017-07-27','finished_airing',''),(56471,'Benghuai: Xing Qiong Tiedao - Xuanhuang',342,75.1,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1783/138114.jpg','ona','2023-08-29','finished_airing','In the Year 4800 of the Star Calendar, the five lineages of the Vidyadhara made alliance on the Yuque, putting their sacred vow into writing. \"This oath shall remain unbroken, standing stronger than even earth and steel.\" — History of the Xianzhou: Exodus of the Five Dragons\n\nIn the Year 7379 of the Star Calendar, the Imbibitor Lunae Dan Feng caused turmoil that threatened the sacred wood. The Cloud Knights joined forces with the Vidyadhara Preceptors to assault him. — History of the Xianzhou: Cloud Knights War Records\n\n\"Noble successor of the Azure Dragon, bearer of divine blessings from the heavens. Traversing clouds and bestowing rain, shaping forms as the world\'s essence beckons.\"\n\nHe dreamed of shouldering his responsibilities, performing the ritual dance gracefully, and sealing the Ambrosial Arbor. He dreamed of stepping into a battlefield where sharp blades and arrows fell like rain, and meted out punishment from the sky. He dreamed of being chained between jade pillars, pierced by long nails, sealed in darkness. He dreamed of wandering aimlessly in the darkness, chased by lurking shadows.\n\nIn all the dreams, he was a dragon, a hero, a sinner, but never a person with love, hatred, sorrow, or joy like everyone else in this world.\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(56475,'Nabiui Moheom',900,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1572/138124.jpg','tv','2023-05-06','finished_airing',''),(56476,'Pantie Hero',660,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1994/138125.jpg','tv','2023-04-25','finished_airing',''),(56477,'Nae Maeumeun Muji',300,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1142/138126.jpg','tv','2023-04-01','finished_airing',''),(56478,'Cricket Pang',660,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1087/138128.jpg','tv','2021-06-08','finished_airing',''),(56479,'Cricket Pang Season 2',0,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1430/138129.jpg','tv','2023-01-13','finished_airing',''),(56480,'Dino Powers',660,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1816/138130.jpg','tv','2022-06-02','finished_airing',''),(56481,'Dino Powers 2',660,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1304/150135.jpg','tv','2023-07-20','finished_airing',''),(56482,'Lindaui Singihan Yeohaeng',840,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1619/138132.jpg','tv','2020-12-03','finished_airing',''),(56483,'Lindaui Singihan Yeohaeng 2',840,0,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1873/138134.jpg','tv','2022-12-25','finished_airing',''),(56484,'Cabeon',840,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1864/150163.jpg','tv','2023-09-02','finished_airing',''),(56485,'Shasha and Milo',1320,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1635/149971.jpg','tv','2023-11-03','finished_airing','Shasha and Milo are the newly activated Crescent Moon Guardians. Imbued with the power to transform between human, cat and a formidable hybrid form, Shasha and Milo are tasked with protecting Crescent Island from the dark forces that lurk beneath it... whilst navigating the daily complexities of preteen life.\n\n(Source: Pingo)'),(56486,'Xue Wang Jiadao',540,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1635/138281.jpg','ona','2023-08-25','finished_airing','The ice cream scepter was mysteriously stolen. In order to regain the scepter and save the ice continent, Snow King chased the scepter thief all the way to Hunting Valley, and accidentally met the bounty hunter \"Boss Rabbit\" whose dream is to make money to revitalize the restaurant. In this way, with their own goals, the two started a fun adventure to find the scepter together.\n\n(Source: iqiyi.com, translated)'),(56487,'Matsuinu',160,58.5,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1792/140446.webp','tv','2023-10-07','finished_airing',''),(56488,'Zegapain: STA',5444,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1513/144978.jpg','movie','2024-08-16','finished_airing','Sequel to Zegapain.'),(56494,'Wakuwaku Oboeru DVD',1500,0,5,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1163/138160.jpg','ova','','finished_airing',''),(56497,'Secret Mission: Sennyuu Sousakan wa Zettai ni Makenai!',410,65.8,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1350/138334.jpg','ona','2023-10-02','finished_airing','Undercover agent Riko Ikazuchi and her partner Noma infiltrate an apartment that is also the hideout of a criminal organization. They pretend to be newlyweds. However, when the perpetrators don\'t hear any sounds coming from them at night, they become suspicious.\n\nTo convince the perpetrators that they are a married couple in love, they start touching each other and making noise...\n\n(Source: TMDB)'),(56498,'Obetomo Gakuen',150,0,200,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1384/138163.jpg','tv','2008-04','finished_airing','A series by Japanese illustrator Obetomo which aired on NHK\'s Shakin! program.'),(56499,'Mikocchaken.',90,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1053/138164.jpg','tv','2018-01-15','finished_airing','An animated series to promote the film Mikocchaken.'),(56500,'La Nuit des Illusions: Meisou no Yoru',402,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1271/138166.webp','movie','2023','finished_airing',''),(56501,'Raise Unicorn no Kubisuji Ushiro no Hokuro ni Naritai',586,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1078/138167.jpg','movie','2023','finished_airing','It\'s the day before the last performance by THE PARADISE. Three fans who have never met get trapped in an elevator. They talk about their favorite band member, Unicorn, while they wait to be rescued. For some reason, the air is tense. Then, a notification goes off on their phones.\n\n(Source: Geidai Animation)'),(56502,'Izumi no Koe',420,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1942/138168.jpg','movie','2023','finished_airing','A girl troubled by the threats in her home and the chaos of the outside world sits on a boat on a quiet lake. Her trauma, though suffocating at first, subsides as she finds refuge through her breathing.\n\n(Source: Geidai Animation)'),(56503,'Atomic War Daichou-hen',360,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1054/138169.jpg','movie','2023','finished_airing',''),(56504,'Chickip Dancers 3rd Season',300,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1833/138170.jpg','tv','2023-09-25','finished_airing','The third season of Chickip Dancers.'),(56505,'Shinobanai! Crypto Ninja Sakuya',210,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1367/140445.webp','tv','2023-10-04','finished_airing','The Crypto Scroll enshrined in the ninja city of Kouka has been stolen, leading to a battle royal among ninja. Sakuya, Nemu, and Xiaolan were living their daily lives until they must unite their forces.\n\n(Source: ANN)'),(56506,'Buchou Hashibiro Kousaku',300,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1131/138173.jpg','ona','2006','finished_airing',''),(56507,'Ikimono-san Pilot',114,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1683/138174.jpg','movie','2022','finished_airing','A pilot film for Ikimono-san that is not included in TV series.'),(56511,'Hatsukoi Jikan',965,78,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1163/138201.webp','ova','2023-11-24','finished_airing',''),(56512,'Ane Jiyoku Tsukushi: Neesan no Shitagi',1200,65,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1847/150009.jpg','ova','2023-11-24','currently_airing','Ema, the student council president, is a quiet, beautiful, and perfect girl. Her younger sister, Ruka, enjoys popularity comparable to that of an idol and is always the center of attention. Despite this, their younger brother Mizuki is rather ordinary.\n\nSince childhood, Mizuki has been the target of teasing from Ema and treated demanding by Ruka. However, his life takes a turn when he enters a romantic relationship.'),(56515,'Shogakkou Kouza Natsuyasumi no Daibouken',1800,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1642/138206.jpg','ova','','finished_airing',''),(56518,'Ojarumaru: Heianchou Onigami Kessen',1800,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1399/138213.jpg','special','2022-03-28','finished_airing','A special to commemorate the 25th anniversary of Ojarumaru.'),(56523,'Tunshi Xingkong 3rd Season',1260,83.69999999999999,33,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1250/138217.webp','ona','2022-09-14','finished_airing','Third season of Tunshi Xingkong.'),(56524,'Tunshi Xingkong 4th Season',1260,83.9,123,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1212/138218.jpg','ona','2023-10-03','currently_airing','Fourth season of Tunshi Xingkong.'),(56525,'Zero Sugar Saero CM',102,60.8,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1769/138220.webp','cm','2023-03-24','finished_airing','Lotte Chilsung\'s Soju Saero commercial featuring Dohyun Lee.'),(56526,'Liver Specialist Saegumi',307,58.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1663/138221.jpg','ona','2022-10-14','finished_airing','Soju Saero commercial by Lotte Chilsung featuring Eunji Jung.'),(56527,'Binggrae CM',180,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1319/138222.webp','cm','2020-08-24','finished_airing','Promotional video for the Binggrae confectionery company.'),(56528,'Binggrae Christmas',97,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1995/138223.webp','ona','2020-12-14','finished_airing','Musical Christmas video featuring Binggrae confectionery company characters.'),(56529,'Dead or Arrive',711,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1884/138224.jpg','ona','2022-05-27','finished_airing','Promotional video for Hyundai Mobis.'),(56533,'Otenki Pokojiro',88,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1792/138229.webp','ona','2013-05-31','finished_airing',''),(56538,'Kimi ni Todoke 3rd Season',3983,84.80000000000001,5,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1617/142448.webp','ona','2024-08-01','finished_airing','Summer is in full swing, and so is the love between Sawako Kuronuma and Shouta Kazehaya. From attending summer school together to meeting each other\'s parents, the two enjoy quality time together while tackling the feelings of self-doubt and emotional strain that come with their newfound love.\n\nMeanwhile, Sawako\'s close friends, Chizuru Yoshida and Ayane Yano, struggle through their own romantic dilemmas as their past experiences with relationships clash with their present feelings. Full of inner turmoil, the youngsters\' desire for intimacy persists through their second year of high school as they weave through the labyrinth of indecision and insecurity that is love. \n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56544,'Gintama on Theater 2D: Baragaki-hen',4648,70.1,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1579/150207.webp','movie','2023-11-10','finished_airing','A compilation film of the Thorny Arc, episodes 43–46 in the second season, featuring additional footage. The movie is a part of the \"Gintama 20th Anniversary Project.\"'),(56550,'Nejikure Ojisan',280,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1631/138263.webp','movie','2010','finished_airing','Graduate work 2010 by Maho Yoshida, Tokyo University of the Arts, Faculty of Fine Arts, Department of Design.'),(56551,'Honnou da Zou',176,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1559/138264.webp','ona','2013-04-17','finished_airing',''),(56552,'Watashi no Oshi wa Akuyaku Reijou. Mini Anime',120,58.4,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1908/138294.webp','ona','2023-08-25','finished_airing',''),(56553,'Kurayukaba',3824,64.6,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1885/141679.jpg','movie','2024-04-12','finished_airing','Business is slow for the Ootsuji Detective Agency. Soutarou and his juvenile sidekick Saki will take any job that comes along, even one that sounds like a lot more risk than it’s worth. It’s festival season in the city but away from the public eye, a wave of mysterious disappearances has occurred. A newspaperman hires Soutarou to investigate, suggesting that answers might lie somewhere in the Dark, the notorious, anarchic maze that is the city’s physical, social, and moral underground. Soutarou subcontracts the gig to Saki, but soon enough regrets it when the kid also goes missing. Now Soutarou is obligated to venture into the Dark himself, and confront its dubious subterranean denizens, including the malicious Laughing Masks gang and the renegade police squad piloting the fearsome Demon 463 armored train!\n\n(Source: Fantasia, edited)'),(56558,'Eldraine no Mori: Twin Fates',195,61.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1337/138286.webp','ona','2023-09-06','finished_airing','Animated promotion for new expansion set of Magic: The Gathering trading card game.\n\nA Wicked Slumber creeps through the land of Eldraine, home plane of Will and Rowan, turning Magic’s beloved fairy tale world into something more…twisted. \n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(56559,'Longzhu Xun Youji',4800,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1908/138292.jpg','movie','2023-09-04','finished_airing',''),(56560,'Shenqi Tushu Guan',740,0,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1967/138293.jpg','ona','2023-08-25','finished_airing',''),(56561,'Idol Land PriPara Episode 0',1440,66.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1224/138315.webp','ona','2021-09-01','finished_airing','PriPara is undergoing a new system update, and everyone is gathered at PriPara to watch as it updates. However, an unexpected error occurs, and all PriPara store locations have disappeared as well as the PriPara memories of any idol who was outside of PriPara during this time.'),(56562,'Daikaijuu Gamenya Shuurai',60,64.7,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1631/138470.webp','ona','2023-09-06','finished_airing','Special episode of Yoru wa Neko to Issho promoting Gamera: Rebirth.'),(56566,'Beyblade X',1465,68.2,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1394/145458.jpg','tv','2023-10-06','currently_airing','At the heart of X City stands the impressive X Tower, an interconnected twin-skyscraper structure that symbolizes the pinnacle of every Beyblade player\'s dream. The building serves as the official headquarters for professional Beybattles, where competitors strive to ascend all one hundred floors; at its summit, the reigning champions, Team Pendragon, await contenders worthy of challenging their title.\n\nBird Kazami, an amateur Blader, arrives in the city eager to turn professional. However, he and his teammates are crushed in their first qualifying match, prompting his companions to give up and disband their team. Fortunately, Bird is soon approached by the easygoing Ekusu Kurosu. In disguise as \"Kamen X\" to hide his identity as a former member of the undefeated Team Pendragon, Ekusu wants to climb the tower all over again. To complete their new group, they recruit skilled Beyblade expert and savvy social media influencer Multi Nanairo.\n\nDriven by their individual goals, the trio wins their preliminary rounds, launching their careers as Team Persona. Bird and his new friends must navigate the world of corporate sponsorships, earn the fickle public\'s support, and defeat many formidable opponents—all in their quest to reach X Tower\'s peak.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56572,'Supertrons',780,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1708/150126.jpg','tv','2023-08-10','finished_airing',''),(56573,'Space Donguibogam',1500,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1644/138311.jpg','tv','2021-11-03','finished_airing',''),(56574,'Space Donguibogam 2',1500,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1637/138312.jpg','tv','2023-08-09','finished_airing',''),(56575,'Metal Cardbot',780,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1864/138313.jpg','tv','2023-03-30','finished_airing','A long time ago, there was a planet named Machina where a race of sentient machines, or Metal Cardbots, resided. One day, the planet suddenly explodes, forcing its inhabitants to live on Earth. To not attract attention, the Cardbots disguise themselves as everyday vehicles. In the present day, Jun, an elementary school kid who loves BMX, accidentally discovers the Metal Breath, a wrist gadget that allows him to capture and power up the Cardbots with different abilities.\n\n(Source: IMDb)'),(56576,'Ruguo Lishi Shi Yiqun Miao 10th Season',576,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1713/138324.jpg','ona','2023-09-10','finished_airing',''),(56577,'Colossus: Child of the Wind',5587,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1759/138325.jpg','movie','2023-05-18','finished_airing',''),(56578,'Honghuang Ling Zun',617,0,60,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1098/138327.jpg','ona','2023-09-10','finished_airing','Above mortals, Xian Dao Changlong, in this world of practicing fairy tunnels, the first place is money. Poor Tianfeng College students Chu Tian inherited a huge amount of property in Chu Tian, thus opening a section of “ gold-swolling Journey ”. In accordance with the principle of “ that social resources cannot be wasted ”, Chutian set up a top-level mansion, equipped to reach the peak, monopolized the high-level fine-tanned drugs and symbols of Tianfeng City, and lived a gold-slurging day, truly reaching the view of money as dung. Superhuman realm. At this time, the dark tide surged under the calm surface of Tianfeng City. The wolf ambitions of the dark forces in the city were all over the world. Soon, Chu Tian was stared at by the dark forces and thus burst into hatred, and was chased by the dark forces.'),(56579,'Jinyi Shen Jiang',1299,63.9,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1204/138328.jpg','ona','2023-09-11','finished_airing',''),(56584,'Sseulegiui Seom',1080,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1655/138333.webp','movie','2021-04','finished_airing','After 50 years of floating in the ocean, plastic rubbishes formed a huge garbage patch. The background of <The Isle of Trashes> is set in the \"Great Pacific Garbage Patch\". On the Trash Island, various characters stumble across each other regardless of their will. They each face a tragic ending in this hopeless island.\n\n(Source: Yeoleum)'),(56585,'Wanmei Zhi Cheng: Mama',720,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1897/138335.jpg','movie','2022-07-07','finished_airing','A wood monster conceives a child covered in roots, ugly and out of control. The monster finds a liquid named Perfect, feeds it, and sculpts the child into a human form, gradually transforming it into the perfect being. This grotesque stop-motion animation depicts the subtexts of social ideology, childbirth and parenting.\n\n(Source: IMDB)'),(56586,'Wanmei Zhi Cheng: Zui Yonggan de Xiaohai',360,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1301/138336.jpg','movie','2023-04-01','finished_airing','A paper boy who is dreaming a big iron knife hand chasing him all the way realizes that his parents he depends on most are actually that knife hand.\n\n(Source: IMDB)'),(56587,'Balamui Moyang',720,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1543/138337.jpg','movie','2022','finished_airing','Somewhere in the vast, cold expanse of northern Asia, a boy awakes to find his prized lamb stolen by a wolf. With his rifle, he sets out on horseback to seek revenge, as a storm sweeps ever closer across the steppe.\n\n(Source: Fantasiafestival)'),(56588,'Ochibi-san',300,63.5,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1476/138339.jpg','tv','2023-10-08','finished_airing','\"I can help you laugh, but I can\'t take away the tears you\'ve shed.\" In Mametsubu-cho, a town somewhere in the ancient Japanese city of Kamakura, Ochibi-san lives a relaxed, easy life. With his friend Nazeni the dog, Jack the naughty kitten, and Pankui the hungry dog, Ochibi-san\'s year in Mametsubu-cho is filled with encounters and new discoveries! Flower-viewing in spring, swimming in summer, collecting leaves in fall, and eating yummy food in winter.\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)'),(56589,'Youan Xiao Jing de Gui',1200,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1502/138341.jpg','movie','2023-08-01','finished_airing','During the White Terror era, Shi Shuifang, a woman who advocated ideas bravely in the underground political organization, seemed to be a light that illuminated the times. The agent of the surveillance organization was influenced by Shi Shuifang and thus fell in love with her. However, under all kinds of unfavorable circumstances, he could only watch her hopelessly suffer through various injuries.\n\n(Source: IMDB)'),(56590,'Hong Weiba',1200,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1812/138342.jpg','movie','2022-09','finished_airing',''),(56591,'Dueogsiniga',2100,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1866/138343.jpg','movie','2022','finished_airing','In Devil, from South Korea, Lord Choi is expecting his second child. However, a fall from his horse brings him to the verge of death the exact moment the new baby is born. That night, he prays to a goblin, hoping to save his life, and his wish comes true. In return, the goblin vows to claim his daughter’s life on her sixteenth birthday. Lord Choi is willing to do whatever it takes to protect her from this dangerous curse, facing this evil monster who threatens them.\n\n(Source: Fantasiafestival)'),(56592,'Chuju',580,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1922/138345.jpg','movie','2018-03-18','finished_airing','The search for loved ones never ends, even when they are no longer there.\n\n(Source: Vimeo)'),(56593,'Laoying Zhua Xiao Ji',5640,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1897/138348.jpg','movie','2021-10-01','finished_airing',''),(56594,'Liqiu',540,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1040/138349.webp','movie','2020','finished_airing',''),(56595,'Qiushi',300,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1612/138350.jpg','movie','2019-06-20','finished_airing',''),(56596,'Hanlu',360,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1113/138351.jpg','movie','2018-06-12','finished_airing','In a restaurant in China, waiters try to swat flies while a number of diners eat their food.\n\n(Source: Vimeo)'),(56601,'Geu Yeoreum Movie',3660,70,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1331/138356.jpg','movie','2023-06-07','finished_airing','The 61-minute long movie follows the life of 18-year-old Yi-gyeong (Yoon Ah-Young), a quiet, ordinary student who meets Suyi (Song Harim), an athletic girl who stirs up new romantic feelings in her, causing her to realize her identity. Over the next two years, their relationship helps both women grow, but ironically, because of this development, Yi-gyeong realizes her thoughts about Suyi have begun to change.\n\n(Source: THE HOLY MOTHER OF YURI)'),(56605,'Zom 100: Zombie ni Naru made ni Shitai 100 no Koto Recap',1440,66.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1481/138371.webp','tv_special','2023-09-10','finished_airing','Recap of the first seven episodes of Zom 100: Zombie ni Naru made ni Shitai 100 no Koto.'),(56609,'Kizumonogatari: Koyomi Vamp',8640,79.2,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1279/140233.jpg','movie','2024-01-12','finished_airing','After befriending his classmate Tsubasa Hanekawa, Koyomi Araragi, a cynical and lonely high school student, begins to develop a more positive outlook on life. One night while walking home, however, he encounters an ethereal woman with severed limbs, barely clinging to life. Although reluctant at first to help her, Koyomi ultimately agrees to trade his life for hers, and lets her feast on his blood.\n\nUpon waking in an abandoned building, he is horrified to find that he was turned into a nigh-immortal being by the vampire he saved, Kiss-Shot Acerola-Orion Heart-Under-Blade. Thankfully for the desperate young man, there is a way for him to regain his mortality. Assisted by Meme Oshino, an expert in oddities, Koyomi must defeat the three vampire hunters who stole his new master\'s limbs to restore Kiss-shot\'s powers. Determined to return to his old life, Koyomi will stop at nothing to accomplish his goal. However, his largest challenge may not lie in overcoming his adversaries—but in preserving his own humanity. \n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56612,'Kusohamu-chan Happy Birthday!',65,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1206/138385.webp','ona','2021-03-17','finished_airing','A special video to commemorate the 5th anniversary of Kusohamu-chan.'),(56613,'Azur Lane: Bisoku Zenshin! Ni!!',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1720/149372.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Azur Lane: Bisoku Zenshin!.'),(56622,'Yankee Hamster Season 4',135,0,50,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1581/138432.jpg','ona','2023-10-06','finished_airing','The fourth season of Yankee Hamster.'),(56623,'Nui Story',120,0,50,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1432/149975.jpg','ona','2023-10-07','finished_airing',''),(56624,'Araburu Kisetsu no Otome-domo yo.  Mini Anime',35,56,42,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1850/138437.jpg','ona','2019-05-20','finished_airing','Mini anime released on the official Twitter account of main series.'),(56629,'Dead or Arrive 2: Dance of Auto',417,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1705/138442.jpg','ona','2023-07-07','finished_airing',''),(56638,'Shin Shinka no Mi Gekijou Special',117,53.7,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1117/138447.webp','special','2023-05-26','finished_airing','A special episode of Shin Shinka no Mi Gekijou included with the BD/DVD release of the series.'),(56640,'Junk World',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1800/150104.jpg','movie','2025-06-13','not_yet_aired','A sequel film to Junk Head.'),(56643,'Season of Change',240,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1213/138460.jpg','ona','2022-11-26','finished_airing','Trying new things is never easy.\nOhran Lim is an ex-boxer who never managed to go pro. Now, she spends her days working at the local convenience store, wondering where it all went wrong. But after she meets young couple Woon and Baram, she slowly begins to change her outlook on life. \"I need to find what makes me happy.\"\n\n(Source: Manta)'),(56646,'Hokuto no Ken: Fist of the North Star',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1271/138463.jpg','unknown','','not_yet_aired','In 199x, the world was engulfed in the blaze of nuclear war.\n\nWith the Ocean drying up and Earth torn asunder, all life seems to be lost but humans survived stubbornly. However, what dominated the post-apocalyptic world was sheer violence. The remaining humanity was split into two groups: those who kill and take whatever they can and those who are exploited.\n\nWhen all hope seems lost for the weak, a man in ragged cloth appears. He is Kenshiro, the rightful successor of the Hokuto Shinken martial arts with seven studs-like scars in the shape of the Big Dipper. His journey to becoming a legendary savior begins! \n\n(Source: Warner Bros. Japan, edited)'),(56647,'Ao no Miburo',1430,66.7,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1079/147334.jpg','tv','2024-10-19','finished_airing','Though he grew up as an orphan, Nio Chirinu finds a place to belong: being a waiter at his adoptive grandmother\'s restaurant. But this peace does not last long; Nio and his sister Iroha are used as bait to arrest child abductors by Toshizou Hijikata and Souji Okita—two members of an infamous ronin group called Miburo. After the ordeal, Toshizou proposes that Nio join the ranks of Miburo and protect the people of Kyoto.\n\nFrustrated by his own weakness, Nio trains to match the swordsmanship of his new comrades. Even so, he struggles to be accepted by Tarou Tanaka and Hajime Saitou, the other Miburo members of his age. Determined to befriend them, Nio must discover his own sense of justice and become strong enough to prevail against all his enemies.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56653,'BanG Dream! Ave Mujica',1420,80.8,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1181/148235.jpg','tv','2025-01-02','finished_airing','The day Sakiko Togawa\'s privileged life crumbled, she painfully broke her vow to CRYCHIC and left the band behind—an act that tore her heart in two. As days fade into nights, she struggles to make ends meet until a certain cherished memory is tainted, pushing her to the edge.\n\nDriven by a fractured sense of purpose and the need to reclaim what she lost, Sakiko forms Ave Mujica, a masked symphonic metal band. Its members are bound not by a shared goal but by the fragile threads of their divergent desires. Together, they weave a haunting masquerade of loss and rebirth, captivating audiences with a gothic musical stage play. But as the girls\' ideals collide, the scars of their pasts rear their ugly heads. The brittle facade the girls have built threatens to collapse beneath them, bringing Sakiko to the verge of falling apart.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56654,'Sweet and Hot',1200,61.5,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1757/138489.webp','ova','2023-11-10','finished_airing',''),(56662,'Trillion Game',1450,75.6,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1081/147379.webp','tv','2024-10-04','finished_airing','After socially awkward technology specialist Manabu \"Gaku\" Taira is saved from thugs by the outgoing Haru Tennouji, the two men find that they get along with each other well. Years later, Gaku, who is having a tough time getting a job due to his timidness, is convinced by Haru to apply for a position alongside him at Dragon Bank, one of Japan\'s largest IT companies.\n\nDuring their interviews, the company\'s board director, Kirika Kokuryuu, takes an interest in Haru and Gaku\'s contrasting personalities. However, Gaku does not get hired by the company, leading Haru to quit the job on his first day in protest. Nevertheless, they decide to embark on an ambitious plan of making a trillion dollars.\n\nIn order for their scheme to come to fruition, Haru and Gaku start looking for potential investors, but everyone rejects their extravagant idea. In spite of that, the two soon find themselves getting an offer from Kirika—and with her investment, they might just be able to reach their goal.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56669,'Justice Runners',266,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1193/140065.jpg','movie','2002','finished_airing','Tomioka does not fail to deliver in his wild and unique take on the world. His multi-coloured animation talents take us on a whirlwind trip of old school trams with weird and wonderful characters.\n\n(Source: 25FPS Festival)'),(56671,'Burn the Witch #0.8',1727,74.4,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1522/139282.webp','tv_special','2023-12-29','finished_airing','Prequel to Burn the Witch.'),(56674,'Balala Xiao Mo Xian: Xing Yuan Die Qi 1',780,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1950/138554.jpg','tv','2023-08-11','finished_airing','The Fairies Xia Letong, Yan Keke and Bai Yinyue, along with their Transfer Elf partners Buding, Milu and Lubi awaken the Garden of Spirit Spring, Island of Fantastical Summer and Park of Warm Autumn which contains the energy of the four seasons.\n\nTaking up the role of guardians, they must maintain the balance of the four seasons.\n\nHowever, Siqi, the guardian of the Cliffs of Frigid Winter was deceived, and now intends to freeze over the other three seasons, to restore the order of Frigid Winter.\n\nWhile the fairies guard the four season, they experience all kinds of trouble. In the process, they must learn to accept themselves, tolerate others and look at problems more comprehensively. At the same time, they will deepen their bonds with one another. In the end, their courage and understanding will turn defeat into victory and resolve the winter crisis!\n\n(Source: Balala The Fairies Wiki)'),(56677,'Saekomdalkom Catch! Tiniping',702,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1673/141592.jpg','tv','2023-09-27','finished_airing','Puffping stole the Magic Sugar Ball! This has created a strange magical phenomenon where all the Dessert Teeniepings get sucked into a mirror which releases them on Earth for Romi to catch! Along with the Royal Dessert Teeniepings, Jellyping, Shashaping, and Fluffyping, Romi will have to accomplish her mission as fast as possible, otherwise, the Cake Castle will inevitably collapse!\n\n(Source: Catch Teenieping Wiki)'),(56685,'Boku no Hero Academia: UA Heroes Battle',1400,67.4,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1094/138734.jpg','movie','2023-10-20','finished_airing','The stage this time is the UA dormitory, taking place just before the Endeavor Internship arc.\n\nThird-year Mirio Togata appears suddenly as the first-year students in Class A are bored during their ban from going outside. He brings with him the card game \"Yuuei Heroes Battle,\" created by the support class. As each student picks cards and joins the fierce battle, there seems to be more to the game than meets the eye. At the end, who will emerge victorious?\n\n(Source: ANN)'),(56690,'Re:Monster',1419,65.5,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1523/141680.jpg','tv','2024-04-05','finished_airing','Tomokui Kanata has been re-incarnated in the weakest goblin, named Goburou, after having undergone an unfortunate death. However Goburou has retained his previous life\'s memories, an unusual evolution, as well as becoming strong enough to gain status boosts from eating.\n\nIn this alternate world of survival of the fittest, events unfold with competent subordinates and comrades, delightful case of the tail-wagging dog...'),(56691,'Gekkan Mousou Kagaku',1420,54.1,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1789/139296.webp','tv','2024-01-11','finished_airing','Gekkan Mousou Kagaku is set in Most City in an unknown country in a small publishing house that prints a monthly magazine about the most outlandish of things. Everything changes when the staff of the magazine, editor-in-chief Tarou, his assistant Jirou and dog Saburou, meet with scientist Gorou Satou...\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)'),(56693,'Watari-kun no xx ga Houkai Sunzen',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1251/148434.jpg','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Two years ago, the death of Naoto Watari\'s parents left him as the sole caretaker for his younger sister Suzushiro \"Suzu\" Watari and forced him to move in with their aunt. So devoted is he to Suzu that he refuses to join clubs or even hang out with anyone, earning him snide comments and the title of \"siscon\" at his new school. But as long as Suzu is safe and happy, Naoto doesn\'t care what everyone else says.\n\nHowever, his sneering classmates may turn out to be the least of his worries. The sudden transfer of a girl named Satsuki Tachibana brings back traumatic memories from his past—a past she had a hand in making so unpleasant. Nasty secrets, unknown to Naoto, begin to surface with her arrival, threatening his new life. \n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56695,'Xiao Lu He Xiao Lan 3rd Season',480,66.7,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1713/140369.jpg','ona','2023-09-27','finished_airing','Third season of Xiao Lu He Xiao Lan.'),(56700,'Jidou Hanbaiki ni Umarekawatta Ore wa Meikyuu wo Samayou 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1209/149408.webp','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','The second season of Jidou Hanbaiki ni Umarekawatta Ore wa Meikyuu wo Samayou. '),(56701,'Watashi no Shiawase na Kekkon 2nd Season',1420,74.4,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1946/146770.jpg','tv','2025-01-06','finished_airing','Following the awakening of her Dream-Sight ability, Miyo Saimori reunites with her fiancé, Kiyoka Kudou, the captain of the special forces protecting the country against ill-intended individuals gifted with exceptional powers. However, the couple\'s blissful life is suddenly interrupted when Takaihito, the top contender for the imperial throne, sends Kiyoka on a dangerous mission.\n\nTraveling with Miyo to the remote household of his parents, Kiyoka must investigate unusual reports of demons in the region. Meanwhile, Miyo tries to gain the approbation of her callous mother-in-law, Fuyu, who refuses to recognize her as a family member.\n\nAfter Kiyoka repels an attack by the Gifted Communion, a subversive sect of special abilities wielders, he returns to the capital alongside his fiancée. As the looming threat against the imperial authority intensifies, Kiyoka must thwart the Gifted Communion\'s plans to protect Miyo and everyone he holds dear.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56702,'Gamera VS Kozamera',60,62.699999999999996,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1769/138604.webp','ona','2023-09-20','finished_airing','Special episode of Odekake Kozame promoting Gamera: Rebirth.\n\n'),(56703,'MARO17: Utakata feat. TETSU',129,63.2,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1539/138607.webp','cm','2023-07-20','finished_airing',''),(56704,'Kengan Ashura Season 2 Part 2',1460,78.3,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1086/144400.webp','ona','2024-08-15','finished_airing','Part two of Kengan Ashura Season 2.'),(56716,'Dubu Wangu',660,70.8,40,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1720/138642.jpg','ona','2023-09-29','finished_airing','The protagonist genius, Ye Feng, was betrayed and attacked by his senior, and other evildoers, after he refines the Divine Realm pill that would lead him towards Supreme Realm. He managed to fend off and consume the pill, yet finds himself inhabiting the body of his descendant, who bears his name after 500 years later. He pledge to save his current lineage and seeks vengeance, Yefeng embarked on the path of cultivation again, practicing hard and improving while exploring the mystery of the way of heaven. '),(56717,'Xian Wu Chuan 2nd Season',1200,74.7,156,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1269/150045.jpg','ona','2023-09-24','currently_airing','Ye Chen, the outcast disciple, is banished from the sect and becomes homeless. Through a series of coincidences, he receives a True Flame and once again steps on the path of cultivation. This is a world where demons and deities co-exist and an era where all realms in the world are overrun by chaos. Ye Chen\'s journey to defying heaven begins, and after going through all kinds of trials and tribulations, he finally reaches the pinnacle of cultivation.\n\n(Source: Youku)'),(56728,'Qing Chi Hong Xiaodou Ba! Season 0.5',150,0,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1219/138673.jpg','ona','2022-05-05','finished_airing','A prequel series to Qing Chi Hong Xiaodou Ba!'),(56729,'Qing Chi Hong Xiaodou Ba! Hong Yu Lu',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1182/138674.jpg','movie','','not_yet_aired',''),(56730,'Qing Chi Hong Xiaodou Ba! Season 0.5 Fanwai',193,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1064/138675.jpg','ona','2023-05-31','finished_airing','An extra episode of Qing Chi Hong Xiaodou Ba! Season 0.5 to celebrate Children\'s Day.'),(56731,'Synduality: Noir Part 2',1444,71,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1189/140511.webp','tv','2024-01-09','finished_airing','Despite returning victorious from a dangerous struggle, Kanata and his friends have, in a sense, lost a key ally, the amnesiac magus Noir. Having partially recovered her memory, Noir reverted back to her former personality: that of Mystere, who acts in a patronizing manner toward her master Kanata. However, Mystere remembers detecting a signal from Histoire, a mystical city, during her former life as an artificially intelligent magus.\n\nMeanwhile, Tokio disappears from Rock Town while hunting down the ghosts of his past; however, shocking revelations await the deeper his search goes. As Kanata, his childhood friend Ellie, and the magus diva Ciel set out for Histoire, a hostile organization named Ideal sends assassins after them. If Kanata wants to stand a chance at accomplishing his dream, he must uncover the unpleasant truth about Ideal—and some of his closest allies.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56732,'Sekai Saikou no Ansatsusha, Isekai Kizoku ni Tensei suru 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1208/138680.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','Season two of Sekai Saikou no Ansatsusha, Isekai Kizoku ni Tensei suru'),(56733,'Magical★Explorer',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1062/138681.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Reincarnated as a character in the legendary erotic game, “Magical Explorer,” it doesn’t take long for our hero to discover that he’s been designated the unlucky side-character rather than the game’s lady-killer protagonist. Not to worry, though! Armed with his vast knowledge of the game (and a few cheats) he’ll do whatever it takes to win the hearts of the game’s heroines and emerge as the most accomplished student at the Sorcerer\'s Academy!\n\n(Source: Yen Press)'),(56734,'Class de 2-banme ni Kawaii Onnanoko to Tomodachi ni Natta',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1348/149451.webp','tv','2026','not_yet_aired','I, Maehara Maki, struggled to connect with anyone during my high school years, finding it hard to make friends. Then, a turning point arrived. A girl named Asanagi entered my life. Despite being clandestinely referred to as the \"second cutest girl in class\" by the boys, she chose to spend her Fridays with me instead of her best friend Amami, who held the \"cutest girl in class\" title. In the comfort of my home, we delved into the realm of games, watched movies, immersed ourselves in manga, indulged in junk food—pizza, hamburgers—and guzzled cola, carefree and content. To the outside world, we might have seemed a bit messy, but to both Asanagi and me, it was a cherished, hidden time together.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(56735,'Tenkou-saki no Seiso Karen na Bishoujo ga, Mukashi Danshi to Omotte Issho ni Asonda Osananajimi Datta Ken',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1671/138683.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','I met my childhood friend again, and she had become a beautiful and innocent girl.\n\n\"It\'s been a while, Hayato.\"\n\"Haruki, is it?\"\n\nIn the past, I used to play in the mud with my childhood friend in the countryside, and when I saw him again, there was no trace of the bratty young man I thought he was back then. Only in front of Hayato, she threw away the coat she was wearing and reacted in the same crass way she did back then. The distance between you and me has not changed.\n\n(Source: Shousetsuka ni Narou, translated)'),(56736,'Saikyou Degarashi Ouji no Anyaku Teii Arasoi: Munou wo Enjiru SS Rank Ouji wa Koui Keishousen wo Kage kara Shihai suru',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1768/138684.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','The Adrasia empire on the Vogel continent. There is a battle over the throne of such an empire that possesses powerful military and vast territory. With the successor undecided, the children of the emperor are vying to expand their power. However, there was one prince that everyone says will definitely not become the emperor: the seventh prince, Arnold Lakes Adler. The young man who was inferior to his younger twin brother in every way, the dull prince. Incompetent and lethargic, Arnold wastes everyday just playing around. However, behind the scenes, he is one of the only five SS-Class adventurers called \"Silver.\" Seeing the intensifying battle for the throne he decided \"I don\'t want to die, so let\'s have my little brother become the emperor...\" This is the tale of absurd secret maneuvers of the prince who is uninterested in the title of the emperor.\n\n(Source: Shousetsuka ni Narou, translated)'),(56738,'Shinigami Bocchan to Kuro Maid 3rd Season',1420,81.4,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1988/142714.webp','tv','2024-04-07','finished_airing','Although everything the young duke touches perishes, his existence is far from lonely. His spirited siblings Viola and Walter, loyal butler Rob, and the eccentric witches Cuff and Zain are regularly livening up his secluded mansion. But it is the duke\'s flirty maid, Alice Lendrott, who fills him with the promise of a beautiful tomorrow and the determination to break this hellish spell cast upon him.\n\nThe identity of the witch who cursed the duke has been uncovered thanks to Zain\'s unique magic and the help of Daleth, the leader of the underworld. However, the villain is a notoriously fearsome and powerful witch, who, enraged by the duke and his companions\' trip back in time, torments them even from the afterlife. Moreover, an unexpected loved one reappears, strengthening the duke and Alice\'s hope to break the curse and finally close the distance between them.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56740,'Kanojo, Okarishimasu Petit 3rd Season',90,57.9,14,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1593/138732.jpg','ona','2023-09-09','finished_airing','Mini anime for the third season of Kanojo, Okarishimasu.'),(56741,'Temple Specials',808,64.9,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1927/138733.webp','special','2023-10-25','finished_airing','Specials included in the BD/DVD release of Temple.'),(56743,'Hyakushou Kizoku Specials',300,64.5,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1034/144567.jpg','special','2023-12-20','finished_airing','Specials included in the special DVD release of Hyakushou Kizoku bundled with the 8th volume of the manga.'),(56746,'Ensemble Stars!! Tsuioku Selection Checkmate',673,71.8,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1499/141979.jpg','ona','2024-03-10','finished_airing','New Ensemble Stars!! web animated series based on the game story \"Checkmate\".'),(56749,'Gozen 3-ji no Kamen Butoukai',140,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1958/138749.webp','movie','2018','finished_airing','Graduate Work 2018 by Karin Kobayashi (Maro Tasoya), Department of Graphic Design, Tama Art University.'),(56750,'Bakeneko Dance',130,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1126/138751.webp','movie','2017-08','finished_airing',''),(56752,'Shiguang Dailiren: Yingdu Pian',1933,83.10000000000001,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1496/147189.webp','ona','2024-12-27','finished_airing','Lu Guang loses everything when a mysterious man bursts into the photo studio that he is renting with his close friend Cheng Xiaoshi. The man, who comes to punish the members at the studio for playing with time, murders both Qiao Ling and Cheng Xiaoshi in cold blood. However, Lu Guang inherits his friend\'s power to go back in time and decides to save everyone from their grim fate.\n\nNow in the past, Lu Guang travels to Bridon to help Cheng Xiaoshi investigate his father\'s whereabouts; however, he discovers an uncanny series of small disparities that cause the situation to spiral into complete uncertainty. Suddenly unable to rely on his ability to predict the future, Lu Guang must invent a new strategy to foil the plans of the man who took everything from him.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56755,'Object',208,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1542/138773.webp','movie','2021','finished_airing','Graduate Work 2021 by Iamu Aiamu, Department of Graphic Design, Tama Art University.'),(56756,'Niu Lang Zhi Nu',155,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1720/138774.webp','movie','2018','finished_airing','An adaptation of the Chinese folktale The Cowherd and the Weaver Girl.'),(56758,'Boushoku no Berserk Mini',166,56.900000000000006,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1384/138776.webp','ona','2023-09-27','finished_airing',''),(56762,'Bikkuriman: Kirakira Tokubetsu Zoukan-gou',2857,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1298/138792.jpg','special','1988-10-05','finished_airing','A special edition from the Bikkuriman TV series about sweets bonus stickers, which reorganizes the complicated story from the gathering of the Wakamiko to breaking through the Unconnected Zone at a good pace and summarizes it in an easy-to-understand manner.\n\n(Source: U-NEXT)'),(56763,'Bikkuriman: Rococo & Maria Kiseki',1080,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1798/138793.webp','ova','1988','finished_airing','A mysterious OVA distributed only to the winners of Bikkuriman Chocolate\'s giveaway.\n\n(Source: U-NEXT)'),(56764,'Aoshi Jiuchong Tian',1549,73.8,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1337/138795.webp','ona','2023-10-01','finished_airing','Reborn for the sake of a previous life. Reborn for the sake of martial arts. Chu Yang was under attack for the sake of the Jiu Jie Sword. Our hero was trapped and outnumbered by plunderers. Unexpectedly, between life and death, he was brought back 16 years in the past. Is this fate, or a coincidence? Will Chu Yang be able to change the past?'),(56765,'Zhengjing Shao Zhu de Xingfu Shenghuo',1431,69.9,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1189/138796.webp','ona','2023-10-22','finished_airing','In the wild world, human beings are small, but not humble. Whether it is Shennong and his people in the human domain, or the various clans in Beiye, they are working hard and developing vigorously in their own way. Although he will be bewitched and suppressed by the Star God, he will also launch a tenacious resistance to the Star God in order to protect his tribe, his relatives and bloodline. \n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(56766,'Qi Hou Bilu',1320,71.6,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1831/138798.webp','ona','2023-10-28','finished_airing','Two thousand years ago, a descendant of the Yinyang Family felt sad for the burning of books and burying of scholars at the order of Qin Shihuang (the first emperor of the Qin Dynasty) and the burning of Epang Palace. In order not to let the scholars die in vain, he began to turn their spirits into brushes for inheritance by future generations. Back to the present day, Luo Zhongxia, an ordinary college student, accidentally gets a brush with Li Bai\'s spirit, and gains its superpower. But before long, various forces are in a mad scramble for the power, putting Luo Zhongxia in danger in many occasions. To avoid more dangers, Luo Zhongxia tries to find the way to return the brush, but fails every time. On the contrary, Luo Zhongxia becomes inextricably bound up with seven brush spirits.\n\n(Source: Bilibilil)'),(56768,'Tadaima, Okaeri',1420,77.4,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1272/139785.webp','tv','2024-04-09','finished_airing','Hoping for a fresh start, househusband Masaki Fujiyoshi, his spouse Hiromu, and their toddler son, Hikari, move to a new neighborhood. The couple\'s union was frowned upon by many due to Masaki\'s status as an omega—a secondary gender that allows an individual to give birth. Even for an alpha—seen as the superior secondary gender—such as Hiromu, discrimination seems to be commonplace and a hindrance to a life of domestic bliss.\n\nFortunately, the new family is not alone. Little Hikari becomes attached to Yuuki Hirai, the Fujiyoshis\' lonely college student neighbor. Despite his initial reluctance, Yuuki ends up befriending the infant. Moreover, the family can also confide in Hiromu\'s childhood friend and coworker Tomohiro \"Matsu\" Matsuo.\n\nAlthough everything is going well for the young couple and their child, a sudden presence from the past might pose a problem for the peaceful life they dream of.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56769,'Mo Shi',590,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1480/138803.webp','movie','2017','finished_airing',''),(56771,'Waluolan Xiao Zhen',247,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1397/138806.webp','ona','2023-09-28','finished_airing','Valoran Town is a official League of Legends: Wild Rift animation published by Riot Games China. It tells the story of a rich girl, Lux, who moves to Valoran Town to start an independent life to escape the control of her brother Garen. This is the hilarious daily story of the stubborn and troublesome Jinx, the malevolent and cute Veigar, and the narcissistic and romantic Ezreal becoming roommates.\n\n(Source: Papuchochoł)'),(56772,'Quan Zhi Ming',240,0,11,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1217/150233.jpg','ona','2023-10-06','finished_airing',''),(56773,'Wan Jie Zhizun 2nd Season',600,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1967/138810.webp','ona','2023-09-28','currently_airing','The second season of Wan Jie Zhizun.'),(56774,'Wangzhe Da Shixiong',1087,70.7,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1200/138813.jpg','ona','2023-09-30','finished_airing','After Jiang Beiran came to Xuanlong Continent, he experienced the ups and downs of human relationships, and gradually figured out the rules of survival in this world, and was later accepted as a disciple of Guixin Sect. In the sect, he appears to be a low-key disciple who loves Go, but in fact he is proficient in chess, calligraphy, and painting, and is capable of literary and martial arts. He secretly helped the sect discover and train a group of outstanding disciples, and started the path of cultivating immortality in a low-key way...\n\n(Source: Tencent, Google translated)'),(56778,'No Waifu No Life!',1330,63.4,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1911/149974.webp','ova','2024-02-23','currently_airing',''),(56779,'Doukyo Suru Neneki',939,60.8,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1090/141638.webp','ova','2023-11-10','finished_airing',''),(56784,'Bleach: Sennen Kessen-hen - Soukoku-tan',1478,86.7,14,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1595/144074.webp','tv','2024-10-05','finished_airing','After an awe-inspiring battle with Ichibei Hyousube—leader of the Soul Society\'s Royal Guard—the powerful Yhwach moves into the final stage of his master plan. He aims to slay the Soul King, the being whose very existence maintains the status quo of three worlds: Hueco Mundo, the Soul Society, and the realm of humans that Ichigo Kurosaki and his closest friends hail from. Conquering his own bout with the remainder of the Royal Guard, Uryuu Ishida joins Yhwach in his efforts to create a new world in his image.\n\nWith a flood of resolution and newfound power, Ichigo rushes to stop Yhwach from accomplishing his ultimate goal and save the countless lives within the three existing realms. But Ichigo has a complicated lineage, one that leaves him susceptible to Yhwach\'s sinister influence.\n\nMeanwhile, in a final desperate gambit, Jirou Sakuranosuke Shunsui Kyouraku, the newly promoted head captain of the Soul Society\'s combat corps, enlists the help of an old enemy whose immense power may turn the tide of battle.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56785,'Meitantei Conan Movie 27: 100-man Dollar no Michishirube',6622,79.2,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1888/141209.jpg','movie','2024-04-12','finished_airing','Twenty seventh Detective Conan movie.'),(56787,'Shaonian Ge Xing: Haiwai Xianshan Pian',1189,69.80000000000001,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1621/138844.webp','ona','2023-10-25','finished_airing','The third season of Shaonian Ge Xing.'),(56791,'Shangri-La Frontier: Kusoge Hunter, Kamige ni Idoman to su Mini Anime',120,63.3,9,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1687/138921.webp','ona','2023-09-28','finished_airing',''),(56795,'Wo Shi Na Zha 2: Yingxiong Guilai',5100,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1948/138855.jpg','movie','2023-09-29','finished_airing',''),(56796,'Kung Fu Wang: Kuaile Tongnian',935,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1030/138856.jpg','tv','2023-04-11','finished_airing',''),(56797,'Kung Fu Wang: Meng Hu Shangshan',4920,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1572/138857.jpg','movie','2023-09-29','finished_airing',''),(56798,'Bei Ken Xiong: Huoxing Renwu',5760,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1248/138858.jpg','movie','2023-09-28','finished_airing',''),(56799,'Xiao Meirenyu: Dahai Guai Chuanshuo',4800,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1887/138859.jpg','movie','2023-09-29','finished_airing',''),(56800,'Kozukuri Ninkatsu Bu!',900,63.9,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1606/138969.webp','ova','2023-11-10','finished_airing','Ao Suto is a self-confessed otaku. He talks about otaku with her classmates every day, and of course he has never had a girlfriend. Perhaps because he is seen like this, his classmate, Umi Tono calls him Otaku-kun instead of his name and treats him coldly. But he also had a dream. His goal is to find a good partner and start a family. The school also has a club to make dreams come true, a child-making and pregnancy club. The child-making and pregnancy-hunting club is a nationally sanctioned club activity that encourages students to become pregnant and conducts pregnancy-hunting activities. Ao was able to join the club after the selection process. According to his advisor, there is a girl who wants to be Ao\'s partner. Ao couldn\'t believe her eyes because the girl who entered the club room was Ukai Tono, who treated Ao coldly.'),(56806,'Ming Jing Gao Xuan',52,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1963/138865.webp','movie','2019','finished_airing','An ink brush film by Shykeumo Animation Studio produced at China Academy of Art.'),(56807,'Da Li Si Rizhi Qixi Pian',249,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1451/138866.webp','ona','2020-08-21','finished_airing','A collaboration between Chinese e-commerce company JD.com (Jingdong) and Da Li Si Rizhi to celebrate the Qixi Festival.'),(56808,'Boku ga Kowai Kuroi Mono',360,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1395/138867.webp','movie','2023','finished_airing','The sea at night. The sister in my mom\'s belly. (She\'s coming out soon.) These two things scare me. Why? Because I don\'t know what\'s inside them...\n\n(Source: Geidai Animation)'),(56820,'Sanshiliu Qi',1140,65.19999999999999,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1180/138887.webp','ona','2023-10-09','finished_airing',''),(56828,'Guardy Girls',4746,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1507/138911.webp','movie','2022-10-14','finished_airing','Three amazing girls--the far-too-strong Silvia, the gun-totin\', bullet-blastin\' Laurie, and the scientific magical girl Fumi--have formed the Guardy Girls, a brand new team of heroes! They\'re faced with a rogues gallery of wacky, off-kilter villains--and fellow do-gooders, too! It\'s a grand way to kick off the Girls\' daunting, amazing dream of a hero run! \n\n(Source: Official YouTube upload)'),(56830,'Journey to Bloom',270,72.1,5,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1652/138994.webp','ona','2023-09-30','finished_airing','A series commemorating the 3rd anniversary of the Project SEKAI COLORFUL STAGE! feat. Hatsune Miku mobile game.'),(56835,'Code Geass: Dakkan no Rozé',1440,65.3,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1342/142228.webp','ona','2024-06-21','finished_airing','After the supposed death of its 99th emperor, the Holy Britannian Empire broke up, and the areas it controlled finally regained their independence. While most joined the United Federation of Nations, a group aiming to create everlasting peace, remnants of the oppressive empire continue to exist. One such faction, Neo-Britannia, has taken over Japan\'s Hokkaido island after killing its governor, Juugo Sumeragi.\n\nThe Seven Shining Stars, a resistance group in Hokkaido, finds itself at an impasse as it struggles to find a way to defeat the Neo-Britannian Empire. As a last resort, it enlists the aid of the Nameless Mercenaries: brothers Rozé, a genius strategist; and Ash, an exceptional Knightmare pilot. Though Rozé and Ash are Britannian, they have made a name for themselves by protecting the Japanese and killing the empire\'s officials. With their help, the resistance may finally be able to recapture its territory and prevent another reign of terror. \n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56836,'Akira (Shin Anime)',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1361/138919.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','A new anime adaptation for Otomo\'s highly acclaimed post-apocalyptic cyberpunk manga series Akira.'),(56837,'Cencoroll 3',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1193/138920.webp','movie','','not_yet_aired','Third movie in the Cencoroll series.'),(56838,'One Room, Hiatari Futsuu, Tenshi-tsuki.',1420,70.3,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1833/141321.jpg','tv','2024-04-06','finished_airing','Shintarou Tokumitsu leads an ordinary high school life while living in a studio apartment just for himself. This changes drastically one morning after he finds something strange on his balcony—an angel from Heaven. The innocent and kind girl named Towa was sent to Earth by God to learn more about humans and their way of interacting. It does not take long for her to get attached to Shintarou, who eventually allows her to live with him.\n\nHowever, the small apartment provides little personal space and privacy, and hiding Towa\'s real identity from the public proves difficult. As he learns to navigate his new life with Towa, Shintarou\'s encounters with other girls may only complicate the circumstances.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56840,'T.P BON',1652,69.2,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1003/142645.webp','ona','2024-05-02','finished_airing','An ordinary high school student named Bon becomes part of a team of time-traveling agents tasked with saving people\'s lives during historical events that happen across different eras and locations around the globe. \n\n(Source: Netflix)'),(56842,'Kagejitsu! Second',120,71.2,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1512/138927.webp','ona','2023-10-04','finished_airing','The second season of Kagejitsu!.'),(56843,'Goukon ni Ittara Onna ga Inakatta Hanashi',1420,74,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1198/145156.webp','tv','2024-10-05','finished_airing','College student Tokiwa gets invited to a mixer by his female classmate Suo. But when he arrives with his friends, they\'re greeted by three dazzlingly handsome men?!\n\n(Source: Square Enix)'),(56845,'Saikyou Tank no Meikyuu Kouryaku: Tairyoku 9999 no Rare Skill-mochi Tank, Yuusha Party wo Tsuihou sareru',1404,61.2,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1384/140829.webp','tv','2024-01-07','finished_airing','Rud is a tank of the Hero\'s Party and is said to have the highest defense ever in history. The party often does labyrinth raids, but to Rud, it means more than just a raid. To cure his beloved sister\'s illness, he is in search for the wish-granting treasure that might be hidden in those labyrinths. But one day, the arrogant hero kicks him from the party after an unsuccessful raid attempt, blaming it on his skills whose effects he is still unaware of.\n\nWith nowhere else to go and nothing to do, he decides to return to his hometown, where his sister is waiting. On his way there, he saves a girl who was being attacked by a monster. Unexpectedly, this girl has an extremely rare skill called \"Appraisal.\" Thanks to her skill, Rud is able to discover the truth behind his unknown skills, which turn out to be very powerful skills. With a defense of 9999 and powerful skills, thus begins the adventure of the strongest tank, Rud!\n\n(Source: Square Enix)'),(56852,'Shunka Shuutou',1443,58.6,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1671/138955.webp','ova','2023-12-22','finished_airing',''),(56853,'I.Cinnamoroll Animation',155,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1364/138956.webp','ona','2023-10-05','currently_airing','In Cinnamoroll\'s origin story, a white dog flew down from the skies one day and was discovered by a female Cafe Cinnamon worker. The \"I.Cinnamoroll\" brand depicts an alternate world that poses a what-if question: What if Cinnamoroll had not met the Cafe Cinnamon worker on that fateful day? The \"I\" in the title stands for both the English first-person pronoun \"I\" and the Japanese word \"ai\" (love), and it represents the brand\'s theme of taking care of one\'s own body and mind. \n\n(Source: ANN)'),(56854,'Mushoku no Eiyuu: Betsu ni Skill Nanka Iranakatta n da ga',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1082/148406.jpg','tv','2025','not_yet_aired','\"Classes\" are given at the age of 10, and the presence or absence of \"skills\" greatly affects life. Arel, the son of \"Sword Princess\" Fara and \"Magic King\" Leon, has been branded as \"Classless\"... But even without a job or skills, Arel believes he can persevere through effort. \n\n(Source: Earth Star Entertainment, translated)'),(56861,'Pokemon Yuenchi',240,55.599999999999994,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1022/141144.webp','ona','2023-09-15','finished_airing','The rhythm series of \"Pokemon Kids TV\" is fun to watch! It\'s a fun \"Pokémon Playground\" where you can follow the rhythm! Look for as many Pokemon as you can at the park!\n\n(Source: Official YouTube Channel)'),(56864,'Geneshaft Pilot Film',230,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1413/146526.jpg','special','2001-08-25','finished_airing','Pilot film included with the first DVD volume of Geneshaft.'),(56869,'Bokura no Ame-iro Protocol Mini Anime',120,57.800000000000004,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1160/139152.jpg','ona','2023-10-06','finished_airing',''),(56876,'Otonari no Tenshi-sama ni Itsunomanika Dame Ningen ni Sareteita Ken 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1026/148655.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Otonari no Tenshi-sama ni Itsunomanika Dame Ningen ni Sareteita Ken.'),(56877,'Ao no Orchestra 2nd Season',0,0,21,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1430/147966.webp','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','Second season of Ao no Orchestra.'),(56882,'Ochibi-san Tanpen Movie',42,59.1,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1560/139009.webp','ona','2019-07-05','finished_airing','Short videos to commemorate the releases of volumes 9 and 10 of Ochibi-san.'),(56885,'Sousou no Frieren: ●● no Mahou',80,74,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1045/150038.jpg','ona','2023-10-11','currently_airing','Frieren loves collecting peculiar spells, and her ever-growing arsenal of magic contains the perfect spells for many occasions. Whether it be by stealthily removing alcohol from Heiter\'s drinks or by remedying her own sleep issues, Frieren is sure to brighten her companions\' days with her magic.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56891,'Nappeungyejibae',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1606/139059.jpg','movie','2025','not_yet_aired','Continuation in honor of the 35th anniversary of the original series.'),(56892,'Kkomimanyeo Lara Season 2',0,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1348/139060.jpg','tv','2023-10-14','finished_airing',''),(56893,'Binggrae Me2ker Leul Wihayeo',300,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1637/139061.webp','ona','2023-10-06','finished_airing',''),(56894,'Dragon Ball Daima',1430,76.5,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1723/145231.webp','tv','2024-10-11','finished_airing','After saving the world from the destructive might of Majin Buu, Gokuu Son and his allies look forward to a well-earned rest. However, unbeknownst to them, their battle was recorded and observed by Gomah, an evil being who assumes the title of King in the Demon Realm, filling the void left behind with the death of former ruler Dabura.\n\nAt Gomah\'s side is Degesu, the younger brother of Higashi no Kaioshin, a being who lords over the universe. Jealous of his brother\'s power, Degesu works alongside Gomah to steal Earth\'s Dragon Balls and preemptively subdue any potential future enemies. Calling upon the power of the legendary dragon Shenron, Gomah wishes for Gokuu and his friends to be reverted into children, intending to rob them of the limitless power that defeated Buu. With Earth\'s greatest warriors shrunken down, Gomah abducts Dende, the planet\'s acting god.\n\nBut Gokuu refuses to be set back by his new body, working to master his younger form to fight as proficiently as he could as an adult. Joined by Kaioshin and Glorio—a mysterious but seemingly rebellious demon—Gokuu pursues Gomah to the Demon Realm in order to rescue Dende and restore his friends to their natural ages.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56902,'In:App',420,0,56,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1671/139079.webp','tv','2020-11-21','finished_airing','Inside our small smart device is a world very much like our own, where countless Appmen work to run their apps as smoothly as possible. Each of our thoughtless taps or pretty selfies can easily drive Smart World into chaos. But the same goes the other way – when our smartphone malfunctions our days can easily be ruined. \n\nIn this oddly balanced back and forth – where what seems small in one world can become huge in the other – are our protagonists Jackie and Robin. These two don’t quite mesh. They are a team with no teamwork. They just don’t seem reliable enough for us to entrust our smart devices. But they do remind us that their, and our \"Smart Life\" can easily become comedy.\n\n(Source: WelCon)'),(56903,'MyGO!!!!! Member no Nichijou',33,65.4,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1336/139081.jpg','ona','2022-08-24','currently_airing','Shorts showing the daily lives of members of the band MyGO!!!!! released on the official YouTube channel.'),(56904,'Saero Doljanchi',431,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1715/139082.jpg','ona','2023-10-12','finished_airing',''),(56905,'Yuusha-hime Miria',986,55.7,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1884/139086.webp','ova','2023-12-22','finished_airing',''),(56906,'Isekai de Cheat Skill wo Te ni Shita Ore wa, Genjitsu Sekai wo mo Musou Suru: Level Up wa Jinsei wo Kaeta (TV Special)',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1351/148718.webp','tv_special','','not_yet_aired','New TV Special of Isekai de Cheat Skill wo Te ni Shita Ore wa, Genjitsu Sekai wo mo Musou Suru: Level Up wa Jinsei wo Kaeta.'),(56907,'Koujo Denka no Kateikyoushi',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1431/146723.jpg','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','After failing the final exam for his dream job at the royal court, promising young sorcerer Allen wants nothing more than to retreat to a simple life in the countryside. Unfortunately for him, he can\'t even afford the train fare! His only solution is to get a job, but his one lead is anything but modest—Duke Howard, one of the kingdom\'s most powerful nobles, needs a private tutor for his daughter Tina.\n\nDespite her academic brilliance, Tina is incapable of casting even a single spell. To make matters worse, entrance exams for the prestigious Royal Academy are fast approaching, and magical aptitude is mandatory! Can Allen use his unique brand of spellcasting to help Tina overcome her magical impairment, a mystery that not even the kingdom\'s finest sorcerers have been able to solve? And does her father, the duke, even want him to?\n\n(Source: J-Novel Club)'),(56908,'Pororo Movie: Superstar Daemoheom',4620,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1297/139096.jpg','movie','2023-12-13','finished_airing',''),(56909,'Porong Porong Pororo 8',660,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1515/139097.jpg','tv','2023-08-28','finished_airing',''),(56910,'Ddotty Yeongwonui Tab',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1447/140069.jpg','movie','2023-12-27','finished_airing',''),(56916,'Rainbow Bubblegem',660,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1262/139111.jpg','tv','2023-08-30','finished_airing',''),(56917,'The Concubine Contract PV',68,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1530/139112.webp','pv','2021-12-13','finished_airing',''),(56919,'Bugsbot G',240,0,15,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1238/139114.jpg','tv','2020-09-29','finished_airing',''),(56921,'Bite-Choicar Hyper',1320,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1159/139116.jpg','tv','2021-02-06','finished_airing',''),(56923,'Lv2 kara Cheat datta Motoyuusha Kouho no Mattari Isekai Life',1440,68.2,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1103/142513.webp','tv','2024-04-08','finished_airing','When a humble merchant named Banaza is summoned to the magical kingdom of Klyrode in another world, the citizens hope he will become the hero who can take down the threatening Dark Army. Unfortunately, Banaza does not gain any exceptional powers at level one as hero candidates usually do, and he has no way of returning to his old world. As compensation, he is sent to live in a faraway forest. Upon arriving, Banaza levels up once and suddenly gains limitless powers that he now has no idea what to do with.\n\nTo avoid drawing attention, Banaza changes his appearance and assumes the name Flio. While away from home, he stumbles across a young demi-human girl named Fenrys, who is seemingly searching for the same forest Flio was sent to. However, she attacks him and reveals her true identity—a lupine demon. Luckily, Filo\'s unrivaled magic overpowers Fenrys, and she swears undying loyalty to him. However, Flio refuses to hold power over her; the two instead begin pretending to be a married couple and embark on a new life together.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56927,'Shen Cang',1214,62.400000000000006,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1303/139147.jpg','ona','2023-11-07','finished_airing','Modern-day Daoist Fang Yi wakes up one day with a superpower—the ability to sense antiques and artifacts! From there, he becomes an artifact-collecting wonder. Countless treasures all become his, and he leads his band of brothers on a journey to the very peak of life!\n\n(Source: Anime-Planet)'),(56929,'World End Economica',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1952/139141.webp','movie','','not_yet_aired','Yoshiharu Kawaura is part of the first generation of humans born on the Moon and has a wild dream: to be a part of the elite who live in the center of Lunar City. As a homeless teenage runaway with only meager savings and an irreverent attitude, he hides and sleeps in internet cafes while trading stocks on the Lunar Stock Exchange. With his hard work and natural intuition of the market, his seed money of one thousand mools grows to seventy-two thousand mools in a matter of months, with the end to his streak nowhere in sight.\n\nUnfortunately, despite the Moon being an economic paradise with limited regulations and low taxes, street urchins like Yoshiharu must always remain on the lookout. After an especially close call with the police, he takes refuge in a church owned and ran by Risa, a part-time worker at a Chinese restaurant. In a stroke of fate, also staying at the church is Hagana, a cold girl with mean eyes and genius-level mathematical abilities. Yoshiharu—now assuming the pseudonym Haru—immediately sees Hagana\'s potential as a quantitative analyst and establishes a partnership with her for a virtual stock trading competition known to be a ticket into the financial community. As their growing success both in and out of the competition leads to more people investing in Haru and his goal, will he be able to keep his cool and stay on top of the ever-volatile market?\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56930,'Jian Yu Feng Yun 3rd Season',600,67.1,104,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1159/139387.webp','ona','2023-10-29','finished_airing','Third season of Jian Yu Feng Yun.'),(56941,'Baishe',340,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1417/139169.jpg','movie','2007','finished_airing',''),(56942,'Time Slip Shima Kousaku',60,0,25,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1100/139170.jpg','ona','2023-07-28','finished_airing',''),(56943,'Jomji: Zombi Jibangi',240,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1296/139171.jpg','ona','2020-06-30','finished_airing',''),(56944,'LG gram 360 x Julia Ryu: Shimcheong Dive',59,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1906/139940.jpg','ona','2022-09-22','finished_airing','A commercial for LG Electronics.'),(56945,'Salangeun Oneuldo Malgeum',244,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1597/139189.webp','ona','2016-10-28','finished_airing',''),(56946,'Salangi Ona Bom',216,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1674/139190.webp','ona','2017-04-04','finished_airing',''),(56947,'Mabeobdalpaengi Wau',399,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1028/139191.jpg','ona','2023-03-20','finished_airing',''),(56948,'Boku no Kokoro no Yabai Yatsu: Twi-Yaba',1267,76.8,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1869/140298.webp','ona','2023-12-10','finished_airing','Side stories of Boku no Kokoro no Yabai Yatsu, based on a series of shorts that were posted on X (formerly Twitter).'),(56958,'Tai Yi Jian Xian Chuan',1080,66.10000000000001,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1873/139208.jpg','ona','2023-10-20','finished_airing','In the Jiuzhou Continent, the Immortal Way is prosperous, and everyone in the world is proud to worship the Immortal Sect. However, cracks in the boundary wall suddenly appeared, and demons from other worlds began to sneak into the Kyushu Immortal Sect secretly. After the alien demons infiltrated into the major immortal sects, they tried to gradually take over the power of the immortal sects and attempted to subvert the Kyushu Continent. \n\nSword Immortal Mu Xun and his friends stopped the demon invasion, but unfortunately fell into the demon trap and were mistaken for a traitor from the immortal sect. In order to look for opportunities and clues to the lurking demons, Mu Xun decided to hide his traces and never show anyone else, and handed over his only son Dongfang Hao to his wife\'s clan to raise and take care of him. \n\nDongfang Hao, who has the blood of the Imperial clan but has no spiritual roots, has always been regarded as mediocre and bullied by his fellow tribesmen. He was originally a swordsman queen, but his life was rough because his father was framed by the demon clan. In times of crisis, he Resolutely relied on unremitting efforts to turn danger into safety, and step by step towards the road of enlightenment and immortality. \n\nIn the secret realm of Taichu, the capital of Zhaowu King, Dongfang Hao stood up with loyalty and saved his friends in danger many times. At the same time, Dongfang Hao never forgot to search for his missing father. Taming dragons, competing for immortal souls, and constantly improving his cultivation, he is determined to find his father, reunite the major immortal sects, and drive the demons out of the Kyushu continent.\n\n(Source: Youku, translated)'),(56960,'Xiehou Ta de Shaonu Shidai',1057,77.2,18,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1876/143338.jpg','ona','2024-05-23','finished_airing','\"Mom, I\'m sorry. Please don\'t die.\" When Henry realizes death is at his mother\'s doorstep, he strikes a deal with a lifespan dealer to give years of his own life to his ailing mother. Now, his mother is a 20-year-old college student with a full life ahead of her, and Henry devotes his remaining days to helping her live life to the fullest. But things turn complicated when his friend falls in love with her!\n\n(Source: LINE Webtoon)'),(56963,'Jin Zhan Fashi',1049,72.8,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1228/139235.jpg','ona','2023-11-02','finished_airing','It mainly tells the story of Gu Fei, a super warrior but a physical education teacher in school. He started playing online games on the recommendation of his students, but he mistakenly chose the profession of mage, and finally became a melee violent mage, embarking on a new game path. \n\n(Source: Tencent, Google translated)'),(56964,'Raise wa Tanin ga Ii',1420,71.9,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1428/143773.webp','tv','2024-10-07','finished_airing','After years of animosity, the leaders of Osaka\'s Somei and Tokyo\'s Miyama yakuza groups have called a truce—by arranging an engagement between their respective grandchildren, Yoshino Somei and Kirishima Miyama. To this end, 17-year-old Yoshino moves to Tokyo to live with the Miyama family and attend school with her new fiancé. Although Kirishima is all smiles and perfectly polite, there is something unsettling about his demeanor that Yoshino cannot put her finger on.\n\nYoshino\'s suspicions are soon confirmed: despite his manners, Kirishima is a masochistic maniac. He hurts people without batting an eye and also revels in being punished verbally and physically himself. What he wants most is a spoiled and arrogant fiancée who will ruin his life. When Yoshino does not quite meet his expectations, he reveals his true colors and openly insults her. However, instead of running away in fear, Yoshino decides to take revenge by making Kirishima fall in love with her and then ruthlessly breaking his heart.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56967,'Kamierabi 2nd Season',1370,62,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1475/145570.jpg','tv','2024-10-03','finished_airing','After the mysterious disappearance of one of its participants, the battle meant to name a successor to God is brutally interrupted, leaving behind a trail of destruction and shaking the world. Twelve years later, while the former contestants in the divine competition struggle to fit in society after they were turned into semi-permanents—beings unable to age—Lall refuses to let go of her brother, who has been forgotten by everyone.\n\nDetermined to resurrect her brother—the only one she sees fit to sit on the heavenly throne—Lall steals her his cellphone from a cult run by a past competitor, which accidentally restarts the competition. Helped by her classmate Eko Sasaki, Lall will show no mercy to prevail against her enemies in her efforts to finally see her brother again.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56968,'Xuyuan Shu',480,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1361/139248.jpg','movie','2023-10-14','finished_airing',''),(56969,'Yaoguai Senlin',4800,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1783/149946.jpg','movie','2023-10-13','finished_airing',''),(56970,'Zhong Sheng Xiang',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1143/139269.jpg','movie','2023-10-13','finished_airing',''),(56972,'Ginga Tetsudou Monogatari: Eien e no Bunkiten - Waga Kokoro no Sirius Shoutai',1220,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1423/139267.jpg','special','2007-06-27','finished_airing','The Galaxy Railways is attacked by Metanoids...'),(56975,'Maomao no Hitorigoto',90,66,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1756/139266.jpg','ona','2023-10-23','finished_airing','Mini anime for Kusuriya no Hitorigoto released on YouTube.'),(56978,'Tearmoon Teikoku Monogatari: Dantoudai kara Hajimaru, Hime no Tensei Gyakuten Story Mini Anime',180,59.800000000000004,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1190/139277.jpg','ona','2023-10-13','finished_airing',''),(56980,'Karasu wa Aruji wo Erabanai',1500,80.5,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1084/142685.jpg','tv','2024-04-06','finished_airing','In the Kingdom of Yamauchi, people have the ability to transform into three-legged crows known as yatagarasu. While the men plot over daily governance, women compete for the hand of Wakamiya, the crown prince who was selected as the Kinu, the servant to the Mountain God. Four young women arrive at the court to join the competition, including one named Asebi.\n\nWhile the kind and innocent Asebi sticks out like a sore thumb compared to the other women, the crown prince has to fight for his place in the clan. Despite being born both to a concubine and as a second son, the royal priests still chose Wakamiya to be the Kinu over his older brother. This decision created a rift between the siblings while enraging Wakamiya\'s stepmother in the process. \n\nWhen Yukiya, one of the teenage sons of the village chief, is sent to the palace to become Wakamiya\'s new attendant, the prince  is not pleased in the slightest. However, Yukiya\'s presence at the imperial courts is no mere coincidence.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(56981,'Shi Fang Wu Sheng',1117,68.8,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1499/139309.jpg','ona','2023-11-10','finished_airing',''),(56986,'Riseman',670,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1974/139295.jpg','tv','2023-10-18','finished_airing',''),(56987,'Ni De Rensheng Shi Wo Lai Chi Le',923,0,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1274/139298.webp','ona','2023-11-07','finished_airing','In the name of \"sister\", Jiang Lan adopted Gu Chi, who no one wanted to take care of, and became a ray of light in Gu Chi\'s dark life. Gu Chi also gradually fell in love with this beautiful \"sister\". Will the age gap hinder the development of their relationship? How will the domineering \"sister\" respond to the \"brother\'s\" confession? \n\n(Source: Bilibili, Google translated)'),(56988,'Larva Pendant',1980,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1097/139299.jpg','ona','2022-05-25','finished_airing','Bug friends Red and Yellow leave the island behind and go to the big city.\n\n(Source: IMDb)'),(56989,'DinoCore Season 2',660,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1225/139300.jpg','tv','2017-03-17','finished_airing',''),(56990,'DinoCore Season 3',660,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1278/139301.jpg','tv','2017-10-07','finished_airing',''),(56991,'DinoCore Evolution',660,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1214/139302.jpg','tv','2018-03-17','finished_airing',''),(56992,'DinoCore Evolution Part 2',660,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1451/139303.jpg','tv','2018-10-12','finished_airing',''),(56993,'Nandemo Bakukai! Koyori-chan',53,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1077/139304.jpg','ona','2023-08-17','currently_airing','A series of shorts starring Hakui Koyori that ends with a bang!'),(56996,'Larva Family',420,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1925/139335.jpg','ona','2023-05-04','finished_airing','After yellow and red is captured by Mauve that flies them inside the greenhouse of a new location (that is close to New York, and the island) they begin their adventures inside the greenhouse while raising a baby larva, Magenta. Their parenthood adventures begins now. '),(56997,'Sumikko Gurashi: Sorairo no Mainichi',300,0,5,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1796/139313.webp','tv','2023-10-26','finished_airing','Short TV anime focusing on the origin of the five main characters.'),(57003,'Meitantei Pikachu: Kareinaru Morning Routine',390,60.099999999999994,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1961/139330.webp','ona','2023-10-25','finished_airing','Detective Pikachu just wants to film his morning routine, but Tim has a bigger problem: his flan has disappeared from the fridge! It\'s definitely a mysterious case, but if anyone can solve it, this dynamic duo can in this animated short!\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(57005,'Mukuwarenakatta Murabito A, Kizoku ni Hirowarete Dekiai sareru Ue ni, Jitsu wa Motteita Densetsu-kyuu no Kami Skill mo Kakusei shita',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1695/149452.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Matteo, who was supposed to be just a common villager, is reborn as the grandson of an imperial aristocrat, Lawrence. He spends his days being doted on by his powerful grandfather. With his immense magical powers, Matteo rapidly hatches a dragon egg and tames the dragon, naming it Eva. When his magical abilities are measured, it\'s revealed that he possesses the strongest magic power ever recorded!\n\nHe quickly learns how to use magic, reviving ancient spells and effortlessly drawing the most powerful sword that absorbs magic, making it the strongest. Matteo is also favored by the emperor he meets, but the emperor holds a secret—?\n\nClever, illustrious, strong, as expected! The life of the most beloved noble, where everything is affirmed, boldly begins!\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(57006,'Sinbi Apartment: Ghost Ball Zero - Du Beonjjae Iyagi',1560,0,15,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1918/139337.jpg','tv','2023-11-30','finished_airing',''),(57012,'Harimaware! Koinu',270,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1813/140934.jpg','tv','2024-01-06','finished_airing','The story of the series follows Koinu, a serious-minded dog who goes to work one day only to find that his company has gone bankrupt. At a loss, Koinu takes a job from a mysterious recruitment agent and is hired to paste dog stickers all over the city. Even though he doesn\'t understand the purpose of this strange assignment, Koinu works hard every day at his new employment.\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)'),(57015,'Wu Shuang Shu',1678,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1606/139364.jpg','ona','2023-11-01','finished_airing',''),(57016,'Magical: Gongjuleul Usgyeola',4914,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1204/139368.jpg','movie','2020-09-17','finished_airing',''),(57017,'Eomma Katuri',1680,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1474/139369.jpg','movie','2011-06-02','finished_airing',''),(57018,'Eomma Katuri the Movie: Dosilo Gan Katuri Gajog',4560,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1521/139370.jpg','movie','2022-09-08','finished_airing',''),(57025,'Tondemo Skill de Isekai Hourou Meshi 2',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1018/149619.webp','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','Second season of Tondemo Skill de Isekai Hourou Meshi.'),(57031,'Vampire Dormitory',1420,62.1,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1375/141863.webp','tv','2024-04-07','finished_airing','Homeless and fresh out of employment, Mito Yamamoto faces familiar loneliness and despair. Luck is simply not on Mito\'s side; when he stumbles upon a cafe and cuts his hand, a strange server named Ruka Saotome licks the blood from his wound and even dramatically retches at its apparent disgusting taste. Offended and dispirited, Mito runs off to a bridge, hoping to put an end to his misery.\n\nBut when Mito accidentally slips, he is miraculously saved by Ruka, who reveals he is a vampire. Unable to drink blood from just any woman for mysterious reasons, Ruka proposes that Mito become his thrall—a vampire\'s human servant and primary source of food. In this deal, Ruka will shower Mito with love to sweeten his blood, and Mito will gain a warm place to call home.\n\nHowever, there is an issue: Mito is a girl! Concealing her long, flowing hair and feminine body, Mito readily takes this chance and enrolls in the Hijirigaoka Boys\' High School while working part-time at the cafe with Ruka. But the more Mito\'s bond with Ruka deepens, the more she struggles to hide her secret.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57034,'Ple Ple Pleiades × Kagejitsu!',630,71.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1880/139404.webp','ona','2023-10-31','finished_airing','For some reason, Ainz and Shadow have swapped bodies! But... no one has noticed!? Even if the masters have swapped, there\'s no problem!\n\n(Source: Official YouTube, translated)'),(57037,'Ghost Tale',163,62,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1537/139454.webp','ona','2023-10-31','finished_airing','Su and Uh use the power of telekinesis to impress Lah by lifting up objects. Lah then tries to use telekinesis, too, but lacks this power, so Su and Uh help her.\n\n(Source: Sonic Wiki Zone)'),(57040,'The Button',160,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1423/139419.jpg','movie','1964','finished_airing',''),(57044,'Fleur The Animation',1200,70.19999999999999,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1961/139429.jpg','ova','2024-01-26','currently_airing',''),(57050,'Kisaki Kyouiku kara Nigetai Watashi',1420,56.4,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1711/146319.jpg','tv','2025-01-05','finished_airing','Duchess Leticia Dorman has been betrothed to Crown Prince Clarke since age seven. She was once a rambunctious and free-spirited child, but the strict education she’s receiving to make her a fit future princess has really put a cramp in her lifestyle. Her only hope is that the prince might someday take an interest in someone else—so when Clarke shows up to a royal ball with an unknown woman at his side, Lettie is overcome with delight, presuming her dream has come true and her engagement has been broken off! She wastes no time retreating to an easygoing countryside life, but her newfound peace is cut short when the prince shows up and claims she’s still his fiancée! Clarke is determined to win Lettie over and marry her, while Lettie is determined to resist his charms and escape! Who will emerge victorious in this heart-pounding battle of wills?\n\n(Source: J-Novel Club)'),(57051,'G vs. G',61,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1358/139439.jpg','ona','2019','finished_airing','Gigan crashes near Mount Fuji and goes on a rampage, easily destroying the JSDF fighter jets sent to stop him. Godzilla appears to challenge him, equally unfazed by the military\'s attacks, and they battle in a city. As four more Gigans arrive, Godzilla unleashes his atomic breath.\n\n(Source: Wikizilla)'),(57058,'Ore wa Subete wo \"Parry\" suru: Gyaku Kanchigai no Sekai Saikyou wa Boukensha ni Naritai',1465,68.89999999999999,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1747/143101.webp','tv','2024-07-05','finished_airing','The Kingdom of Clays faces a dire crisis: an assassination attempt has just been made on its own Princess Lynneburg, and its neighboring countries eye the aftermath like starving vultures, plotting the Kingdom\'s downfall. The ensuing conflict will shape the face of the continent for centuries to come...but Noor doesn\'t have a clue about any of that! Having freshly arrived at the royal capital after over a decade of rigorous, isolated training at his mountain home, he\'s dead set on achieving his childhood dream of becoming an adventurer, even if the only skills he possesses are useless ones. Sure, he can \"Parry\" thousands of swords in the span of a single breath, but everybody knows you need more than that if you want to be an adventurer! Our hero\'s road to making his dream come true will be long(?) and arduous(?)—but if there\'s one thing Noor\'s not afraid of, it\'s some good ol\' fashioned hard work!\n\n(Source: J-Novel Club)'),(57060,'Xing Qia Meng Shao Nu: Hua Yu Bi Ji',522,0,40,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1443/139460.jpg','ona','2023-11-03','finished_airing',''),(57061,'Minazuki wo Eien ni',240,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1245/139939.webp','movie','2014','finished_airing',''),(57062,'Nanzoya',300,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1199/139461.jpg','movie','2019','finished_airing','Every day I make a choice and take action. But sometimes, before my mind can comprehend the situation in front of me, I feel my mind and body being sucked into something…\n\n(Source: Letterboxd)'),(57065,'Mei Shaonu Da Picha 3rd Season',290,0,17,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1261/139474.jpg','ona','2017','finished_airing',''),(57066,'Dungeon ni Deai wo Motomeru no wa Machigatteiru Darou ka V: Houjou no Megami-hen',1422,79.1,15,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1299/144738.jpg','tv','2024-10-05','finished_airing','Goddess Festival—A fruit festival that brings the labyrinth city of Orario to life. Goddesses symbolizing fertility are enshrined on the altar, and among them is the Goddess of Beauty. Bell Cranel, who has survived and returned to his daily life from the dead depths of the dungeon, is here and ready to enjoy the bustle of the Goddess Festival until he receives a letter from a girl at a small bar in a corner of Orario—\"To Mr. Bell, please go on a date with just the two of us at the upcoming Goddess Festival. From Syr.\" Syr\'s single-minded determination will drive both Bell and the labyrinth city crazy. Meanwhile, the Einherjar, the warriors who claim to be the \"strongest,\" are now suddenly on the move...\n\n(Source: HIDIVE)'),(57067,'Fanren Xiu Xian Chuan: Xinghai Feichi',1200,82.30000000000001,48,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1119/139470.jpg','ona','2023-11-25','finished_airing','Third season of Fanren Xiu Xian Chuan.'),(57071,'Ginga Eiyuu Densetsu: Die Neue These (Zoku-hen)',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1567/139481.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Sequel to Ginga Eiyuu Densetsu: Die Neue These - Sakubou'),(57073,'Kasa',300,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1648/139493.jpg','movie','2016','finished_airing','In the world of constant black rain, people live under umbrellas’ protection. One day a man threw his umbrella away, which resulted to brought him a green plant, only existing green in that world. People desire his plant and start to scramble for it.\n\n1st year work 2016 by Wenrui Huang, Tokyo University of the Arts, Graduate School of Film and New Media, Department of Animation.\n\n(Source: Geidai Animation)'),(57077,'Totonoe! Sakuma-kun by &sauna',150,0,11,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1778/139497.webp','tv','2023-11-12','finished_airing',''),(57078,'Gei wo Lai ge Xiao Huli',240,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1449/139504.webp','ona','2023-09-29','finished_airing',''),(57079,'Shan Gaogao',752,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1531/139505.jpg','movie','2022-06-30','finished_airing','Xiao Ning, a girl separated from her parents, had to return to her hometown for school due to household registration issues. She accidentally discovered a secret hidden in the high mountains. After experiencing that unknown, dreamlike night, she seemed to have made new friends and truly integrated and understood this big family and its unique cultural heritage. The pain of separation no longer troubled her, and the hustle and bustle of the city gradually faded away from her. She continued to grow freely and happily in the high mountains.\n\n(Source: Animated Film Box)\n'),(57081,'Yangguang Shai Pigu',609,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1058/139507.jpg','movie','2022-07-28','finished_airing','An ordinary night in an ordinary family. The child who is afraid of the dark seems to have grown up a bit, and the parents who are busy with their livelihood seem to be happier. Life is mostly made up of such small and insignificant changes, slowly forming our lives.\n\n(Source: Animated Film Box)'),(57084,'Orangeback + Hoo-D Pilot',260,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1603/139514.webp','ona','2020-09-17','finished_airing','Pilot film for an original series project involving the animator Seo-Ro Oh (Osro) and Dalgona Entertainment. It was released on Seo-Ro Oh\'s official YouTube channel.'),(57085,'Sockpuppet!',60,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1689/139515.jpg','ona','2010-06-12','finished_airing','Comedic animation about a girl playing with sock puppets until mayhem ensues, released on Seo-Ro Oh (Osro)\'s YouTube channel.'),(57086,'Artist-110',966,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1942/139516.jpg','movie','2013','finished_airing','Seo-Ro Oh (Osro)\'s student film, finished sometime during his third year in school back in 2013.'),(57088,'Voyant',216,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1502/139525.jpg','movie','2016-04-12','finished_airing','A short film by Yu Yu (余聿).'),(57089,'Play House',163,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1080/139526.jpg','movie','2016-12-10','finished_airing','The whole family is waiting for the father to come home for dinner. Yet when the father finally gets home, he focuses on nothing else but the screen he holds, until he sees another family\'s picture...\n\n(Source: Vimeo)'),(57093,'Princess Principal: Crown Handler Movie 4',3540,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1461/147981.jpg','movie','2025-05-23','finished_airing','The fourth film of Princess Principal: Crown Handler.'),(57094,'Princess Principal: Crown Handler Movie 5',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1262/139534.webp','movie','','not_yet_aired','The fifth film in Princess Principal: Crown Handler.'),(57095,'Princess Principal: Crown Handler Movie 6',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1686/139535.webp','movie','','not_yet_aired','The sixth film in Princess Principal: Crown Handler.'),(57096,'Bu Si Bu Mie',1159,66.5,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1153/139542.webp','ona','2023-11-16','finished_airing','An ordinary young man in a small town tries to learn the essence of martial arts, but he is set up by someone, and then suffers a tragic love and gets involved in a dispute in the martial arts world. He is wronged by others due to his identity. While struggling to survive, he gradually gets back his memories of his previous life and embarks on a journey to fight against the heaven. During this process, he wins the sincerest friendship and the most precious love. Even he has to go through countless difficulties and face the risk of death, he still stays true to himself. He fights for himself, for his fate and for justice, and never flinches no matter how powerful his opponents are.\n\n(Source: IMDB)'),(57097,'Wanneng Lian Ai Zahuo Dian',1054,76.10000000000001,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1223/139544.webp','ona','2023-11-09','finished_airing','Shi Ye is a police inspector who has no such interests in things like love and romance. One day, Ye finds himself up against a crafty witch who offers peculiar solutions to love problems. Follow Shi Ye as he tries to solve the mystery of the Ultimate Love Bazaar and its peculiar owner.\n\n(Source: INKR)'),(57099,'Na Nare Hana Nare',1420,63.6,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1430/143526.jpg','tv','2024-07-07','finished_airing','In any competitive cheerleading contest, it is almost certain that Kanata Misora is going to be the star of the show. As a member of the winning squad in Japan\'s middle school cheerleading nationals, she joins Takanozaki Prefectural High School with her friend Megumi Kaionji intending to seek glory once more. However, following an incident at a competition, she loses touch with her talents and never returns to the club for practice.\n\nWhile despondent, Kanata ends up spotting internet sensation Suzuha Obunai parkouring with an impressive level of athleticism and ends up befriending her in the process. Through Suzuha, Kanata meets Anna Aveiro and Nodoka Ootani, as well as Suzuha\'s classmate Tanizaki Shion—each carrying their own talents that apply to competitive cheerleading. Gathering through sheer coincidence, the six girls now work together and cheer each other on to chase their unique dreams.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57100,'The New Gate',1425,64.5,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1898/141857.jpg','tv','2024-04-14','finished_airing','Trapped with thousands of people in The New Gate, a virtual reality game, the elite player Shinya Kiritani resolves to clear the game and finally return home. However, after he manages to single-handedly defeat the final boss, Shinya is transported to a new world—seemingly indistinguishable from the one he just escaped.\n\nShinya discovers that as long as the game menu and his skills are unchanged, he cannot leave this oddly familiar world. In his search of a way to break out from this new dimensional prison, Shinya encounters Tiera Lucent, a hotel receptionist who happens to be a protégée of Schnee Raizar—one of Shinya\'s former party members. With this glimmer of hope, Shinya strives to reunite with Schnee and find out the truth about The New Gate.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57101,'1 Cho',660,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1599/139552.jpg','tv','2024-11-24','finished_airing','Every second counts when you\'re a first responder. But what if you could see a glimpse into the future? Hosu is a firefighter with the supernatural ability to do just that. There’s just one catch. It only works when he feels extreme stress under pressure. Will knowing what will happen ahead of time help Hosu extinguish fires before they completely destroy homes and lives? And will he learn to wield his ability when he needs it most?\n\n(Source: Webtoon Entertainment)'),(57102,'Houkago Shounen Hanako-kun Part 2',600,70.7,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1910/144517.webp','tv','2024-10-08','finished_airing','Second part of Houkago Shounen Hanako-kun.'),(57103,'Penpe to Pinpi Season 2',95,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1221/139573.jpg','ona','2023-10-06','finished_airing',''),(57104,'Nyankamuchu',120,0,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1869/139571.jpg','ona','2022-04-17','finished_airing',''),(57106,'Hello Carbot Season 14',660,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1449/139570.jpg','tv','2023-11-05','finished_airing',''),(57107,'Gegege no Kitarou: Kappa no Terraforming',1500,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1138/139565.webp','movie','2023-10-01','finished_airing',''),(57109,'Azur Lane 3rd Anniversary: Stars of the Port',378,58.099999999999994,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1652/139567.jpg','ona','2021-08-12','finished_airing','Le Malin and Dunkerque are presenting awards to different shipgirls for their dedication to the port. However, Le Malin might have a mishap?\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(57110,'Scuffing no Uta',156,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1795/139568.webp','pv','2023-05-10','finished_airing','A promotional video for Pocari Sweat\'s sustainability campaign. The video features the song Scuffing no Uta by Kaho Nakamura.'),(57111,'Nyankamuchu Season 2',135,0,5,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1324/139574.webp','ona','2023-11-08','finished_airing','The second season of Nyankamuchu.'),(57112,'Geugjangpan Geomjeong Gomusin: Jeulgeoun Naui Jib',4740,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1260/139575.jpg','movie','2022-10-06','finished_airing',''),(57113,'Geomjeong Gomusin',1440,0,7,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1588/139576.jpg','tv','2000-12-15','finished_airing',''),(57114,'Geomjeong Gomusin 2nd Season',1460,0,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1562/139577.jpg','tv','2001-02-09','finished_airing',''),(57115,'Geomjeong Gomusin 3rd Season',1460,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1460/139578.jpg','tv','2004-06-16','finished_airing',''),(57116,'Geomjeong Gomusin 4th Season',1460,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1448/139579.jpg','tv','2015-05-11','finished_airing',''),(57117,'Dinoster: Gonglyongsuhodae',740,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1209/139580.jpg','tv','2023-08-28','finished_airing',''),(57118,'Miniforce Part 2',800,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1544/139581.jpg','tv','2015-03-02','finished_airing',''),(57119,'Miniforce X',680,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1280/139582.jpg','tv','2018-05-30','finished_airing',''),(57120,'Miniforce X Part 2',680,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1163/139583.jpg','tv','2019-01-30','finished_airing',''),(57121,'Miniforce: Saeloun Agdangui Seubgyeog',3600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1014/139584.jpg','movie','2015-02-05','finished_airing',''),(57123,'Miniforce: Yeongungui Tansaeng',4080,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1014/139585.jpg','movie','2016-02-04','finished_airing',''),(57124,'Miniforce X Movie',4080,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1542/139586.jpg','movie','2018-04-08','finished_airing',''),(57125,'Miniforce: Super Dino Power Part 2',680,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1460/139587.jpg','tv','2020-08-27','finished_airing',''),(57126,'Miniforce: Gonglyongwang Dino',4380,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1517/139588.jpg','movie','2020-02-06','finished_airing',''),(57127,'Miniforce: Haembeogeogoemului Seubgyeog',5160,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1642/139589.jpg','movie','2020-09-30','finished_airing',''),(57128,'Miniforce:  Super Dino 7',680,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1728/139590.jpg','special','2021-04-12','finished_airing',''),(57129,'Miniforce Animaltron',680,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1275/139591.jpg','tv','2021-09-03','finished_airing',''),(57130,'Miniforce V Rangers',680,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1097/139592.jpg','tv','2022-09-01','finished_airing',''),(57131,'Choeganggyeongchal Miniforce',680,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1259/139593.jpg','tv','2023-11-28','finished_airing',''),(57132,'Hero Inside',800,0,11,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1668/139595.jpg','tv','2023-11-08','finished_airing','Heroes can pop out of their comic books when summoned in this comedic action-adventure.\n\nThe cartoonist Scott mysteriously disappears, leaving behind 100 volumes of superhero comic books that spread throughout San Francisco. The protagonist, Mike, stumbles upon \"Crying Man\" and ends up summoning the superhero from the book, forever changing his life. But it\'s not just Mike, but many people begin to summon superheroes from these comic books, leading to a series of events unfolding throughout San Francisco.'),(57136,'Nare no Hate',70,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1498/139601.webp','pv','2023-10-24','finished_airing','A promotional video for Shigeaki Katou\'s novel Nare no Hate.'),(57142,'Flow',218,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1416/139614.webp','ona','2022-04-12','finished_airing','All living things are born and die. Water flows and never returns back. The money you have might be gone away. However, you might become friends with someone who was your enemy. Everything keep changing and never be the same. Even these ideas could be changed, just in a moment.\n\n(Source: Vimeo)'),(57150,'Creature Hunters',920,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1274/139625.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired',''),(57152,'Mahoutsukai no Yakusoku',1420,55,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1116/146903.webp','tv','2025-01-06','finished_airing','On her way home, kindhearted high school student Akira Masaki is whisked away to another world full of magic. Those who can wield it are called wizards, and some are chosen to fight against the Great Calamity annually. Although battling the catastrophe was manageable in the past, it has become so powerful that it has claimed many lives.\n\nIn the midst of all the chaos, the Great Sage has the power to guide the chosen wizards in the combat against the Great Calamity—a role that has been passed to Akira. Even though the girl desires to return home, she agrees to stay with the surviving wizards and help them find their new comrades scattered across five countries. Akira must now convince them to join the cause and lead the group against the imminent evil.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57160,'Sand Land: The Series',1440,74.9,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1004/142114.webp','ona','2024-03-20','finished_airing','In the far future, war has destroyed the entire Earth, leaving only a barren wasteland where the supply of water is controlled by the greedy king. In search of a long-lost lake, Sheriff Rao asked the king of the demons for help...and got the king\'s son, Beelzebub, and his assistant, Thief. Together the unlikely trio sets off across the desert, facing dragons, bandits and the deadliest foe of all... the King\'s army itself! \n\n(Source: Viz Media)'),(57166,'Shounen Miyamoto Musashi: Wanpaku Nitouryuu',3780,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1152/139647.jpg','special','1982-10-06','finished_airing',''),(57167,'Princess Principal: Crown Handler Movie 3 - Cost for Custom Cars',502,67.30000000000001,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1414/139832.jpg','special','2023-11-22','finished_airing','Short special included with the Princess Principal: Crown Handler Movie 3 Blu-ray release.'),(57179,'No.5',60,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1380/139670.jpg','pv','2003-02-25','finished_airing','A promotional video by Kamikaze Douga for Taiyo Matsumoto\'s No.5. It was included with the first issue of Monthly Ikki.'),(57180,'Yami Shibai 12',242,58.6,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1187/139674.webp','tv','2024-01-15','finished_airing','Twelfth season of Yami Shibai.'),(57181,'Ao no Hako',1433,82.2,25,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1496/147108.jpg','tv','2024-10-03','finished_airing','Every morning, incoming first-year Taiki Inomata hurries to his high school gym in order to further refine his badminton skills. However, his true motivation stems from sharing the otherwise empty gym with second-year Chinatsu Kano, Taiki\'s crush and the star player of the girls\' basketball team. Although Chinatsu seems unapproachable, Taiki gradually finds opportunities to get to know her little by little.\n\nUnbeknownst to Taiki, his tireless work ethic and admiration motivate Chinatsu to work harder and strive to achieve her greatest ambitions. When her family must suddenly move overseas for work, Chinatsu decides to remain in Japan and shoot for victory at the national level. With nowhere to stay, she is taken in by Taiki\'s mother, who is longtime friends with Chinatsu\'s own. Overwhelmed with the new reality of living alongside the girl he loves, Taiki resolves to join Chinatsu at the national level in his own sport—and grow closer to her in the process.\n\nStill, despite being good enough to catch his coach\'s eye, Taiki must fight an uphill battle to qualify for a spot on the starting team. Cheered on by both Chinatsu and gymnast Hina Chouno, his childhood friend, Taiki aims to make a name for himself among his powerful upperclassmen.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57183,'Wu Dong Qian Kun 4th Season',1440,78.60000000000001,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1843/139679.jpg','ona','2023-11-25','finished_airing',''),(57184,'Great Pretender: Razbliuto',1320,67.9,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1552/139680.webp','ona','2024-02-23','finished_airing','Presumed dead, master con artist and recovering amnesiac Dorothy is discovered by Shanghai Longu-bang, a mob who wants payback for her conning them. With no memories and nowhere to go, she must rely on a local crime underboss to elude Taipei’s criminal underworld all while tracking down leads to her mysterious past.\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)'),(57185,'Heart Cocktail Colorful: Haru-hen',300,0,5,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1823/139682.jpg','tv','2023-03-28','finished_airing',''),(57186,'Heart Cocktail Colorful: Natsu-hen',300,0,5,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1624/139683.jpg','tv','2023-07-31','finished_airing',''),(57189,'Debu to Love to Ayamachi to!',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1110/139700.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','\"This is the punishment for a fat, ugly girl like me falling in love with someone as beautiful as you...\" Yumeko had a mountain of complexes about herself. Then, a terrible accident befalls her. Though somehow saved from the brink of death, Yumeko wakes up a completely different person. \"This is...me...?! I\'m SO cute!!\" Those around her can\'t hide their surprise and wonderment at this 180°change... But, Yumeko\'s new hyper-positive attitude starts to change her surroundings, too. Worries and complexes can affect anyone, and Yumeko will chop right through those of her various supporting characters!! In love, work, friendship... And an attempted murder case?! This frenzied romantic comedy will leave you bubbling with energy!\n\n(Source: Solmare Publishing)'),(57192,'Yeosin Gangnim',1140,66,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1535/139699.webp','ona','2024-08-07','finished_airing','Tired of being looked down upon for her unattractive appearance, middle schooler Lim Jugyeong turns to the transformative powers of makeup. First, she experiments with BB cream, lip tint, and eyeliner; then she begins using mascara, double eyelid glue, and colored contacts. Before she knows it, Jugyeong goes from being a girl who is bullied for her ugliness to being praised as a high-class beauty. Constantly surrounded by those who adore her goddess-like appearance, Jugyeong can now live a more than comfortable life at school—she simply has to keep her bare face a secret.\n\nHowever, everything changes when the new transfer student, Lee Suho, enters her life. Not only does the handsome Suho become immediately popular among their peers, but in a chance encounter, he also becomes the only classmate of Jugyeong\'s to see her face beneath the makeup. With her reputation on the line, Jugyeong must do whatever it takes to hide the truth about her appearance from the rest of her classmates. But the more time she spends with Suho, the more Jugyeong finds herself questioning whether one\'s true beauty lies solely in their looks.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57196,'I\'m Late',660,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1510/148568.jpg','movie','2021','finished_airing','If your girlfriend would tell you \"my period hasn’t come yet,\" or if your period hasn’t come after the affairs with your boyfriend, how would you feel and how would you behave?\n\nA handful of people, of different ages, boys and girls, react to those questions and by doing so, let us discover their relationship to sex, parenthood, life, and the society in general.\n\n(Source: Official Site)'),(57198,'Tsuma Netori Kan: Bijutsu Kyoushi no Baai',1800,57.300000000000004,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1760/139713.webp','ova','2023-11-17','finished_airing','A gripping tale of desire, betrayal, and difficult choices. This story delves into the complexities of love and temptation, exploring how a moment of weakness can lead to life-changing consequences. With intense emotions and dramatic encounters, the characters face the reality of their actions, revealing the darker sides of relationships. An intense narrative filled with unexpected twists, emotional turmoil, and the raw exploration of human nature.\n\n(Source: TMDB)'),(57205,'Mijime na Kiseki',492,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1367/146368.jpg','movie','2023','finished_airing','Inspired by Henri Michaux\'s book of poetry and drawings of the same name. Masterful in both vision and execution, the film explores the limits of language and perception, creating dazzling connections between sound, meaning, shapes and movement. Propelling viewers beyond the page, guided by Tony Robinow\'s feverish voiceover, the poems map the human psyche to the very edges of alienation and transcendence.\n\n(Source: NFB)'),(57207,'Godzilla vs. Gigan Rex',382,68.8,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1365/139722.jpg','ona','2022-11-03','finished_airing','The hordes of Gigans that appeared in the previous movie attacked the earth again. In addition, a red-colored Gigan called \"Gigan Rex\", that rules the other Gigans has just appeared.\nWill Godzilla be able to defeat the Gigan Rex, which boasts of its outstanding fighting ability?\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(57217,'Katsute Mahou Shoujo to Aku wa Tekitai shiteita.',750,75.7,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1653/143959.jpg','tv','2024-07-09','finished_airing','An evil army is leading a ground invasion against Earth, and their Lieutenant Shun Miller is determined to wreak havoc upon the populace. Miller\'s ruthless reputation strikes fear even into the hearts of his own subordinates, making him the perfect leader of a charge against a city protected by a powerful magical girl, Byakuya Mimori. However, his attack comes to a halt on the day of their first encounter—because he unexpectedly falls in love with Byakuya at first sight!\n\nOvercome by Byakuya\'s adorably delicate innocence, Miller begins to shower her with gifts and kindness. But Miller soon learns that Byakuya\'s Angel—the cat-like familiar who turned her into a magical girl—has been exploiting and manipulating her all along. This discovery solidifies Miller\'s resolve to ensure Byakuya goes on to lead a happier life, but as the war continues, they wonder if their blossoming affection can overcome the reality of their differences.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57218,'Geomeongsupeul Jikyeola! Birdy Friends',780,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1488/139750.jpg','tv','2023-11-23','finished_airing',''),(57219,'Feng Qi Luoyang: Shuangzi Zhui Xiong',3960,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1733/139751.webp','ona','2023-11-16','finished_airing',''),(57220,'Meiyi Duo Hua er',517,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1351/139752.jpg','movie','2018-05-25','finished_airing','A short film by Yuanqing Cai (蔡源青).'),(57221,'Diqiu Shang Zuihou Yige Nanren',148,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1386/139753.webp','movie','2019-11-11','finished_airing','A short film by Junyi Xiao (肖君逸).\n\nThe last man on Earth sat alone in a room. There was a knock on the door...\n\n(Source: Vimeo)'),(57222,'Sheng ANIMA',745,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1027/139754.webp','movie','2016-06-10','finished_airing','A short film by Kong Youyang (孔佑阳).'),(57226,'Jiu Tian Xuan Di Jue 5th Season',600,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1222/139758.webp','ona','2023-11-20','finished_airing','The fifth season of Jiu Tian Xuan Di Jue.'),(57229,'Artiswitch: Ruru\'s Episodes of Memories',236,64.4,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1217/139761.webp','ona','2023-11-20','finished_airing','This is the story of Ruru before she meets a trainee witch in Ura Ura-Harajuku. A 15-year-old girl, Ruru is unsure of what she wants to do or what she likes. One day, she finds something she likes for the first time in her life. In a world filled with things she hates, she wishes to at least fill herself with what she likes.\n\n(Source: Artiswitch Channel)'),(57233,'Jiaonang Jihua 2',960,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1580/139770.jpg','ona','2023-12-05','finished_airing',''),(57238,'Dreamfaireez',114,59.5,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1954/139782.webp','ona','2023-07-07','finished_airing',''),(57239,'Takahashi Rumiko Gekijou Ningyo no Mori Specials',1460,67.4,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1715/139784.jpg','special','2004-05-19','finished_airing','DVD-only episodes 12-13 of Takahashi Rumiko Gekijou Ningyo no Mori that adapt the Ningyo no Kizu chapter.'),(57264,'Bai Lian Cheng Shen 2nd Season',1297,75.6,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1393/139861.webp','ona','2023-12-08','finished_airing','Second season of Bai Lian Cheng Shen.'),(57271,'Nissin Yakisoba U.F.O. CMs',30,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1376/141572.jpg','cm','2023-03-08','currently_airing','Commercials for Nissin Yakisoba U.F.O.'),(57272,'Lucky Chunhyang',143,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1577/139879.webp','cm','1956','finished_airing','Commercial for the LG\'s \"Lucky\" products.'),(57273,'Gaekkum',180,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1582/139880.jpg','movie','1936','finished_airing',''),(57274,'Salgijohgo Balgeunnala, Naegagajin i Hanpyolo',188,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1248/139881.jpg','movie','1961','finished_airing',''),(57275,'Gaemiege Bejjangi',297,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1553/139882.jpg','movie','1961','finished_airing',''),(57276,'Jal Sal su Issneungil',558,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1530/139883.jpg','movie','1963','finished_airing',''),(57277,'Naneun Mulida',353,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1632/139885.jpg','movie','1963','finished_airing',''),(57278,'Bunsue Majge Salja',144,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1505/139889.jpg','movie','1964-05-02','finished_airing',''),(57279,'Dasineun Sogjimalja',400,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1755/139890.jpg','movie','1964','finished_airing',''),(57280,'Eodumi Jinamyeon',475,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1824/139891.jpg','movie','1964','finished_airing',''),(57281,'Bacchus D',93,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1959/145449.jpg','cm','1962','finished_airing','Commercial for \"Bacchus\" drink that is based on the fairy tale about the Hare and the Tortoise.'),(57283,'Mitasarete Mezameru Asa ni, Jimi na Choushoku wo The Animation',1106,69.9,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1876/139893.webp','ova','2024-02-22','finished_airing','Koutarou and Sayaka, who were both dumped by their lovers, meet at a class reunion, and end up spending the night together at Koutarou’s house.\n\nThe two have polar opposite views on love and personalities, but their physical chemistry is outstanding, and they spend a night connecting both body and mind.\n\n(Source: Official site)'),(57286,'Bai Yao Pu Special: Meng Hui Youhun',80,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1795/139903.webp','ona','2020-09-17','finished_airing',''),(57303,'Ultraman: Darkness Heels',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1295/139917.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Anime adaptation for the Ultraman franchise\'s Darkness Heels project.\n'),(57305,'C9 Hui Jia',5400,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1743/139918.jpg','movie','2016','finished_airing',''),(57306,'Qingwa Wangguo: Jixian Yundong',5100,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1845/139922.jpg','movie','2022-09-10','finished_airing',''),(57307,'Qingwa Wangguo: Qihuan Nuwang Lixian',5100,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1544/139919.jpg','movie','2023-04-01','finished_airing',''),(57308,'Hybe: Above and Beyond',45,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1762/141569.jpg','cm','2021-03-19','finished_airing','HYBE Labels brand identity film.'),(57314,'Benghuai: Xing Qiong Tiedao - Qian Xing Ji You PVs',185,73.7,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1153/139924.jpg','pv','2023-05-03','currently_airing','Animated trailers for the game Honkai: Star Rail, the animation is unique and is not present in the game.'),(57315,'Meitou \"Isekai no Yu\" Kaitakuki: Around 40 Onsen Mania no Tensei Saki wa, Nonbiri Onsen Tengoku deshita',235,52.400000000000006,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1502/139926.webp','tv','2024-01-12','finished_airing','Kouzou Yukawa is a passionate hot springs enthusiast—a hot springs hunter who was able to sniff out the source of springs. One day, while searching for a hidden hot spring to revitalize a town, he slips off a cliff and dies. He is then reincarnated into another world by an Inari deity of a small shrine hidden in the rocks. Kouzou is joined by Inari\'s messenger princess, Mayudama. The hot spring hunter within Kouzou is stirred right away, as he takes a bath with Mayudama in the hot spring he just discovered. Then, an elf girl appears...\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(57317,'Yuzhou Huwei Dui: Gang Jia Bawang Long',789,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1685/139933.jpg','tv','2021-09-06','finished_airing',''),(57319,'Napolitan no Yoru',379,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1297/139930.webp','movie','2014','finished_airing',''),(57325,'Ramen Akaneko',1400,73.8,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1805/142211.webp','tv','2024-07-04','finished_airing','Meet Tamako, who\'s found her way into an interview at a ramen shop run solely by cats. When the feline manager asks if she likes cats, Tamako admits that she\'s actually more of a dog person...only to be hired on the spot! But her job description isn\'t quite what she expects — rather than serving ramen, she\'s now a dedicated cat caretaker...?!\n\n(Source: MANGA Plus)'),(57334,'Dandadan',1437,85.1,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1584/143719.jpg','tv','2024-10-04','finished_airing','Reeling from her recent breakup, Momo Ayase, a popular high schooler, shows kindness to her socially awkward schoolmate, Ken Takakura, by standing up to his bullies. Ken misunderstands her intentions, believing he has made a new friend who shares his obsession with aliens and UFOs. However, Momo\'s own eccentric occult beliefs lie in the supernatural realm; she thinks aliens do not exist. A rivalry quickly brews as each becomes determined to prove the other wrong.\n\nDespite their initial clash over their opposing beliefs, Momo and Ken form an unexpected but intimate friendship, a bond forged in a series of supernatural battles and bizarre encounters with urban legends and paranormal entities. As both develop unique superhuman abilities, they learn to supplement each other\'s weaknesses, leading them to wonder if their newfound partnership may be about more than just survival.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57336,'Mythteria',740,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1687/139977.jpg','tv','2019-08-30','finished_airing',''),(57337,'Mythteria 2nd Season',740,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1561/139978.jpg','tv','2023-11-27','finished_airing',''),(57342,'Power of \'Love\'',88,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1070/141566.webp','pv','2021-05-17','finished_airing','A 2021 concept trailer for Korean band SEVENTEEN.'),(57348,'Seventeenth Heaven: Opening Ceremony',91,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1630/141881.webp','pv','2023-10-01','finished_airing',''),(57351,'Zhen Wu Dianfeng 3rd Season',592,68.89999999999999,104,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1065/140007.jpg','ona','2023-11-29','finished_airing','Third season of Zhen Wu Dianfeng.'),(57353,'Mofa Gongzhu de Xiao Fannao',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1289/149565.webp','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','In the novel The Lovely Princess, the secondary character Athanasia de Alger Obelia is the most pitiful of all. Her mother died in childbirth and her father, Emperor Claude, never gave his daughter even an inch of love. Forever yearning for even the slightest bit of parental love, she was ultimately framed for a crime and executed by the orders of her beloved father.\n\nWhen a woman from modern-day Korea falls asleep with some sleeping pills, she later awakens in the infant body of Athanasia. Knowing the unenviable fate that awaits her, she resolves to remain out of her tyrannical father\'s sight so that she may never incur his wrath. However, fate isn\'t so kind, and she meets him at only five years of age. With her original plan tossed out of the window, she now aims to endear herself so much to her father that he would never dream to hurt her.\n\nHowever, as many work toward their own ends, her plan is thrown into chaos—Athanasia\'s biological \"sister\" Jennette Margarita longs for a family, high-ranking nobility vie for power, and a shadow from Claude\'s past threatens to destroy everything he holds dear.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57357,'Shuwawan!',300,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1129/140004.jpg','tv','2023-03-22','currently_airing','Shuwawan! chronicles the family life of real-life photographer and essayist Harumichi Saitou. Saitou and his wife are both deaf, his children are both hearing, and the family communicates in sign language. The anime draws on Saitou\'s own Ikuji Manga Nikki (Child-rearing Manga Diary) work.\n\n(Source: ANN)'),(57358,'Azur Lane 4th Anniversary: A Day at the Port Ice Cream Shop',566,59,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1738/140005.jpg','ona','2022-08-13','finished_airing','Le Malin, Dunkerque and Magdeburg are in the ice cream shop. Seems like something interesting happened - let\'s check it out!\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(57360,'Kabushikigaisha Magi-Lumière',1440,69.6,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1926/145102.jpg','tv','2024-10-04','finished_airing','In recent years, creatures known as Kaii have frequently attacked cities and wrought destruction. Exterminating these monsters quickly became a popular and well-respected profession, carried out by magical girls. More than five hundred magical girl companies, ranging from small ventures to large corporations, offer their aid to those who need it.\n\nKana Sakuragi is a studious college graduate struggling to land a job despite attending numerous interviews. But when a Kaii attacks during her latest interview, she finds herself assisting the magical girl responding to the crisis. Although she lacks battle experience, Kana relies on her exceptional memory and knowledge to help subdue the monster.\n\nHitomi Koshigaya, the headstrong magical girl who faced the Kaii, recognizes Kana\'s potential and invites her to join Magilumiere Magical Girls Inc.—the startup where Hitomi works. Wishing to make a difference, Kana accepts the offer to become a magical girl herself. While Kana may not be suited for the corporate world, it soon becomes clear that her true calling is to rise as one of the most talented magical girls in existence.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57362,'Hoshifuru Oukoku no Nina',1420,73.7,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1436/144553.webp','tv','2024-10-10','finished_airing','On the dusty streets of the castle town Dayah in the Fortna Kingdom, a young orphan named Nina steals for survival. Experiencing one tragedy after another, she has little to hope for in her life. Believing it best for Nina, her closest friend, Saji, hands her over to Second Prince Azure Seth Fortna, who has been searching for someone with unique and intense deep-blue eyes—just like Nina\'s.\n\nThe kingdom\'s princess, the revered Astral Priestess Alisha, has recently died on her way to the Galgada Kingdom, where she was to marry the tyrant First Prince Sett. However, her death is concealed for political reasons, and that is where Nina needs to step in. With nowhere else to go and no one to turn to, Nina assumes Alisha\'s identity and future duties. But with each moment spent with Azure, Nina feels herself drawn to his warmth, fearing that once she is wed to another, nobody will remain to remember her true self.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57364,'Fiction Shigi Yama',415,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1665/140021.jpg','movie','2023-04-17','finished_airing','A story about a dharmapala, a Buddhist deity that often takes on the form of a child, who helps a monk on various adventures. From healing a sick emperor to returning a stolen rice bowl, this charming story is rooted in the mythology of Chougosonshi-ji temple on Mt. Shigi in Nara, Japan.\n\n(Source: Collaborative Cataloging Japan)'),(57369,'Paripi Koumei: Road to Summer Sonia',7140,71.2,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1465/140538.jpg','movie','2024-03-01','finished_airing','Compilation movie of Paripi Koumei.'),(57371,'Mingyun Quan Tai',1494,72.1,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1773/140580.webp','ona','2023-12-22','finished_airing','This is a young girl\'s story. She is naive and enquisitive about the world. However, a tragic accident altered her life. Her loved ones abandoned her, leaving her alone and despondent. She adopted boxing as a means of expressing her inner pain. But she had no idea how tough and hazardous this journey would be. \n\n(Source: bilibili) '),(57372,'Huoxing Xi Lu 7 Hao',1149,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1218/140035.webp','ona','2023-12-20','finished_airing','During the interstellar Spring Festival travel rush, tickets were in short supply. In order to go to Earth for an interview, cartoonist Li Ha was forced to take an interstellar taxi, with a door that didn\'t even close. Due to a strange combination of circumstances, accidents occurred frequently during this trip, and Li Ha unexpectedly married his beloved wife and gave birth to two children in one day. They are the wife Damei who is wandering around the galaxy, her daughter Nana, the Iron Fist girl, and the robot Xiaodang. This piece of happy pie has been ruining Li Ha for ten years. The mysterious family members who are interstellar agents often provoke alien weirdos, causing them to fall into major crises again and again. Li Ha\'s adoptive father Li Dalong also begins to show up? \n\n(Source: Billibili)'),(57380,'Isekai Yururi Kikou: Kosodateshinagara Boukensha Shimasu',1430,66.8,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1690/141987.webp','tv','2024-07-08','finished_airing','Due to a careless mistake, god of wind Silphyleel unintentionally kills a 28-year-old man named Takumi Kayano. Unfortunately, Silphyleel cannot return Takumi to Earth. Instead, the deity reincarnates Takumi into the fantasy world of Etelldia.\n\nEquipped with an assortment of magical powers and bottomless inventory, Takumi spawns in the Forest of Gaia, where high-level monsters roam free. There, he meets five-year-old twins who, despite the dangerous environment, are still alive thanks in part to their extraordinary physical strength. Takumi decides to take them under his wing, naming them Allen and Elena. As the trio embarks on their grand adventure in Etelldia, their very existence may impact the world\'s destiny.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57384,'Kaixin Chaoren: Yingxiong de Xin',5793,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1644/140056.jpg','movie','2022-07-22','finished_airing',''),(57385,'Zhu Luo Ji da Leyuan',5220,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1769/140057.jpg','movie','2022-07-15','finished_airing',''),(57386,'Fengle! Gui Bao: Sanxing Duo Bao',6060,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1607/140058.jpg','movie','2022-07-29','finished_airing',''),(57387,'Mini Shijie: Juexing',5929,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1237/140059.jpg','movie','2022-07-30','finished_airing',''),(57389,'Xiong Chumo: Ban Wo \"Xiong Xin\"',5730,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1098/140063.jpg','movie','2023-01-22','finished_airing',''),(57390,'Wonderful Precure!',1430,75.6,50,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1852/140786.jpg','tv','2024-02-04','finished_airing','The Wonderful Precure! anime is set in Animal Town, a town where animals and people live together in harmony. Second-year junior high school student Iroha Inukai is best friends with her dog named Komugi. Out for a walk one day, Iroha and Komugi encounter a mysterious creature named Garugaru, who goes on a rampage in the city. Komugi suddenly transforms into a Pretty Cure named Cure Wonderful, to protect Iroha.\n\n(Source: ANN)'),(57391,'Astro Note',1440,65.5,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1372/141859.webp','tv','2024-04-05','finished_airing','Takumi, a gifted chef, was just let go from his job. He lands a gig at an old boarding house called Astro-sou but hesitates to accept after learning he must also live there full-time. That is until he meets the beautiful and charming caretaker, Mira, and he is sold. The two begin to work together, and their connection deepens. But Mira has a secret: she is not from this world!\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll, edited)'),(57398,'Azur Lane 5th Anniversary: The Best Gift From Enterprise',190,58.8,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1199/140081.webp','ona','2023-08-14','finished_airing','Enterprise is worrying about what gift to give the Commanders for the 5th anniversary... So, what does she finally choose? Let\'s find out together!\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(57415,'The Happy Dorm',77,57.9,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1104/140107.jpg','ona','2020-06-01','finished_airing','Chibi shorts to celebrate various holidays and events in Azur Lane.'),(57416,'Xiong Chumo: Nizhuan Shikong',6464,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1572/140109.jpg','movie','2024-02-10','finished_airing',''),(57417,'Dayu',6120,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1713/140111.webp','movie','2024-01-12','finished_airing',''),(57418,'Jiangtun: Feng Shi Wu',5079,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1634/140112.jpg','movie','2024-01-20','finished_airing',''),(57422,'Cong Hong Yue Kaishi',1134,72.2,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1422/140125.webp','ona','2023-12-25','finished_airing','The story tells the story of a blood-red moon suddenly appearing in the sky, which is known as the red moon event in history. The remaining survivors had to hide in the city protected by high walls. Among the survivors, some people also suffered from mental mutations. Among them, those who could not control their own mental mutations would emit mental plague and radiation. It contaminates the normal people around it and poses a great threat to the surviving humans. In order to solve the source of the pollution, High Wall City established a special pollution cleanup department, recruiting people who can control spiritual energy, and our protagonist Lu Xin is applying for the most dangerous cleanup department!\n\n(Source: Tencent, Google translated)'),(57424,'Azur Lane Port Diary',66,57.599999999999994,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1346/140127.jpg','ona','2023-04-23','finished_airing','Commander, for this episode of the AzurLane Port Diary series, let\'s find out what happened to Hammann and Yorktown on a peaceful day!\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(57433,'Seishun Buta Yarou wa Santa Claus no Yume wo Minai',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1823/149858.webp','tv','2025-07-05','not_yet_aired','Sequel to Seishun Buta Yarou wa Randoseru Girl no Yume wo Minai.'),(57434,'Tensei shitara Slime Datta Ken Movie: Guren no Kizuna-hen Specials',60,63.3,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1505/140140.jpg','special','2023-07-28','finished_airing','Unreleased scenes from the movie included in the BD/DVD release: \"Intermission: Kurobee\'s Blacksmith Workshop\" and \"Intermission: Gabiru and Wyvern\".\n\n(Source: Official Website)'),(57435,'Street Fighter 6 x Spy x Family Movie: Code: White',72,67.6,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1319/140408.jpg','cm','2023-12-04','finished_airing','A short animated collaboration promoting Spy x Family Movie: Code: White and the video game  Street Fighter 6.'),(57436,'Heart Cocktail Colorful: Fuyu-hen',300,0,5,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1682/140141.webp','tv','2023-12-11','finished_airing',''),(57439,'Huo Feng Zhong Tian',6300,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1993/140143.jpg','movie','2023-09-18','finished_airing',''),(57440,'Zhongguo Jingqi Xiansheng (2023)',4140,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1755/150223.webp','ona','2023-11-30','finished_airing',''),(57441,'Meitantei Conan vs. Kaitou Kid',4816,69.2,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1411/140221.webp','movie','2024-01-05','finished_airing','A special edited version of the TV series that presents the birth of the magician under the moon, Kaito Kid, and the first confrontation with the biggest and eternal rival Conan / Shinichi with new scenes!!\n\n(Source: Official website)'),(57442,'Shixiong A Shixiong 2nd Season',1260,76.39999999999999,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1859/140151.jpg','ona','2023-12-14','finished_airing','The second season of Shixiong A Shixiong.'),(57446,'Momomo Mozzarella Alien Again',138,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1357/140184.webp','cm','2017-04-27','finished_airing','The second Mozzarella Alien commercial.'),(57447,'Shakafuri Song',151,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1872/140182.webp','cm','2017-02-28','finished_airing','A Meiji commissioned commercial promoting their new nutrient supplements.'),(57448,'Fureru.',6360,66.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1488/150090.webp','movie','2024-10-04','finished_airing','Aki, Ryo, and Yuta, childhood friends who grew up on the same island, are 20 years old and start living together in Takadanobaba, Tokyo. Even though their living environments are different: they work part-time at a bar, work as salespeople at a real estate company, and are students at a vocational school for clothing designers, the three are always connected in their hearts. The reason is, the mysterious creatures brought from the island, Touch, have mysterious powers similar to telepathy that connect them with different hobbies and personalities. The friendship between the three should continue, but they discover another hidden power of touch...\n\n(Source: MU, translated)'),(57449,'Tian Jiang Daren',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1238/140507.jpg','movie','2024-01-06','finished_airing',''),(57454,'Siji Tongnian',5114,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1692/140181.jpg','movie','2023-12-15','finished_airing',''),(57455,'Shuke Beita: Wujiao Feidie',5545,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1781/140183.jpg','movie','2023-12-30','finished_airing',''),(57458,'Mayi Chuanqi: Zhongji Yi Zhan',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1408/140185.jpg','movie','2023-12-09','finished_airing',''),(57459,'Yuzhou Huwei Dui: Fengbao Liliang',5603,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1947/140186.jpg','movie','2023-04-29','finished_airing',''),(57460,'Mohuan Qi Yuan: Baoshi Gongzhu',4800,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1963/140187.jpg','movie','2023-04-29','finished_airing',''),(57461,'Xin Zhu Zhu Xia Da Dianying: Chaoji Saiche',5100,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1154/140188.webp','movie','2023-04-29','finished_airing',''),(57462,'Chao Meng Shikong Baobei',4680,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1893/140189.jpg','movie','2023-04-29','finished_airing',''),(57463,'Kara He Mayi Lixian Ji',5640,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1394/140190.jpg','movie','2023-03-22','finished_airing',''),(57464,'Zhu Zhu Xia Da Dianying: Xingji Xingdong',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1006/150130.jpg','movie','2024-05-01','finished_airing',''),(57466,'Honzuki no Gekokujou: Shisho ni Naru Tame ni wa Shudan wo Erandeiraremasen - Ryoushu no Youjo',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1804/146827.webp','tv','2026','not_yet_aired','Anime adaptation of part three of the Honzuki no Gekokujou light novel.'),(57468,'Zhen Dao Ge 2nd Season',1359,0,14,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1623/140195.webp','ona','2023-12-05','finished_airing',''),(57469,'Douluo Dalu: Daoyan Jianji Ban',7380,73.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1825/140196.webp','ona','2023-12-02','finished_airing','The director\'s version of the film retells the events of the last three episodes of the series with the addition of some changes.'),(57470,'Modaete yo, Adam-kun',392,69.7,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1868/140198.jpg','ona','2023-12-08','finished_airing','This is the story of a boy who became the lone Adam among four billion Eves. In a world where a pandemic has rendered all men impotent, high school student Itsuki is the sole exception. In order to protect this secret, he transfers to a very special high school, which turns out to be composed 90% of girls!\n\nThere, he encounters an upbeat and friendly senior, a sexually frustrated female teacher, a tomboyish school \"prince,\" and an heiress from a wealthy family. For Itsuki, who has his pick of any woman in the world, the question remains: which one will he choose?\n\n(Source: Official site, edited)'),(57474,'Levity',83,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1051/140203.jpg','ona','2016-01-11','finished_airing',''),(57478,'Kuramerukagari',3696,62.800000000000004,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1764/141678.webp','movie','2024-04-12','finished_airing','This is a story that weaves together people and a town. A coal mining town crowded with small-scale excavators, commonly known as the \"Hakoniwa.\" In this town that changes daily like a labyrinth, there\'s a girl named Kagari who runs a mapmaking business and a boy named Yuya who dreams of breaking free from the \"Hakoniwa.\" Eventually, the two, along with the unique residents of the town, find themselves confronting a conspiracy that shakes the entire town. The fate of the” Hakoniwa\" depends on Kagari\'s drawings on the map.\n\n(Source: ANN)'),(57480,'Hua Jianghu: Tiangang',6060,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1891/140224.jpg','ona','2023-12-29','finished_airing',''),(57485,'Azur Lane Avengers!',98,60,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1053/140230.jpg','ona','2023-04-01','finished_airing','An April Fools\' video for Azur Lane.'),(57487,'Rising Impact',1560,75.4,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1002/142134.webp','ona','2024-06-22','finished_airing','A young boy, Gawain, lives in a mountainous, rural area with an incredible love for baseball and making the ball really fly. One day he runs into a visitor to the small area and she introduces him to a sport that can really make a ball take to flight: golf! It just takes one shot and Gawain is hooked. With his grandpa\'s approval he sets off to Tokyo with this mysterious woman to learn all he can about golf, encountering many colorful characters and obstacles along the way.\n\n(Source: mangatraders)'),(57488,'Kabigon to Karakara',60,63.8,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1982/140236.webp','ona','2023-12-08','finished_airing','The friendship between Cubone and Snorlax blossoms over the course of all four seasons!\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(57489,'Fudanshi Shoukan: Isekai de Shinjuu ni Hameraremashita 6th Season',120,57.599999999999994,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1294/140365.webp','ona','2023-12-08','finished_airing','Sixth season of Fudanshi Shoukan: Isekai de Shinjuu ni Hameraremashita.'),(57496,'Hadopelagic',70,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1125/140285.jpg','ona','2014-05-14','finished_airing',''),(57499,'Crayon Shin-chan Movie 32: Ora-tachi no Kyouryuu Nikki',6293,71.10000000000001,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1882/150076.jpg','movie','2024-08-09','finished_airing',''),(57500,'Shi ga Utsukushii Nante dare ga Itta',4200,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1344/140290.jpg','movie','2023-12-22','finished_airing',''),(57501,'SiNiSistar',933,47.800000000000004,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1536/140291.webp','ova','2024-01-26','finished_airing','Rabiane is a nun sent by the church with increased physical strength. Her task is to save the city of Essaria, which has been destroyed by monsters, and to fight all the monsters. So she sets off to hunt the monsters through dark forests. It\'s a true nightmare; soon she finds herself unarmed by the brutal monsters. What will she do?'),(57502,'Meiji Gekken: 1874',1632,63.2,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1538/140687.webp','tv','2024-01-14','finished_airing','Shizuma Origasa, once a renowned samurai in the Aizu Domain, has fallen on hard times following his home region\'s crushing defeat against the new imperial government. To make ends meet, Shizuma now works as a rickshaw puller in Tokyo. Meanwhile, he tirelessly searches for his missing fiancée, Sumie Kanomata, the younger sister of his close friend Gennosuke, who had entrusted Shizuma with her safety in his final moments.\n\nAfter foiling an assassination plot, Shizuma is hired by the police force, and he uses this opportunity to further his pursuit of Sumie. However, he soon lands in a whirlpool of political conspiracies involving government loyalists, persistent rebels, cunning courtesans, meddlesome foreigners, and even a mysterious yakuza member, Kyoushirou Shuragami.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57508,'Trapezium',5640,70.1,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1373/142124.webp','movie','2024-05-10','finished_airing','Driven by an unwavering passion for becoming an idol, Yuu Azuma, a young, ambitious first-year student at Joshu East High School, embarks on a journey to form an idol group. To make her dream a reality, she recruits one girl from each of her region\'s four high schools, located to the north, east, south and west, and soon finds her fellow group members.\n\nJoining Yuu is Ranko Kashima, a sophisticated second-year student at Holy Teneritas Southern Girls\' Academy, with a distinctive curly hairstyle and admiration for Madame Butterfly; Kurumi Taiga, a student at West Tech Vocational High School, who wears cute, oversized jackets with long sleeves and dreams of winning the championship at a robotics competition; and, Mika Kamei, a student who also hails from Joshu North High School, known for being a kind-hearted girl and for her dedication to volunteering.\n\nWith the help of Shinji Kudou, Yuu\'s \"collaborator\" and confidante, these four young girls set off on the road to stardom. But the journey hides unexpected trials, rigorous demands, setbacks and pressures, threatening to undo all that Yuu has worked so hard for.\n\n(Source: AMC, edited)'),(57512,'Yishi Zhi Zun',1129,69.3,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1190/140325.jpg','ona','2024-02-18','finished_airing','Meng Qi, a time-traveler who wants to be a dashing swordsman in white, fails in endless extreme missions in the \'reincarnation space\'. The wind suddenly changed and he became the world-famous \"Thunder Sword Mad Monk\". However, all of this turned out to be the treacherous plan of the ancient power. Let’s look at the invincible and funny little monk who is happy in the world and proud of the three worlds.\n\n(Source: bilibili)'),(57513,'Shenyuan Youxi',1344,66.10000000000001,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1916/150232.jpg','ona','2023-12-14','finished_airing',''),(57517,'Puniru wa Kawaii Slime',1430,69.3,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1681/145175.jpg','tv','2024-10-06','finished_airing','This is the story of Puniru the slime and Kotarou, a middle school student, until they cease being friends...\n\nKotarou Kawaii is a second-year middle school boy. When he was in elementary school, a slime he created came to life, and for the past seven years, he has been spending time with the slime named Puniru as his \"friend.\" However, there is one problem for Kotarou...\n\nOver the seven years, both have grown significantly, and Puniru has transformed into an incredibly beautiful girl!\n\nBesides her beautiful appearance, Puniru freely transforms into various cute forms as a slime, causing Kotarou to be both excited and bewildered by her carefree behavior every time.\n\nWill Puniru and Kotarou be able to continue spending time together as \"friends\" despite these challenging days ahead?\n\n(Source: Official website)'),(57519,'Boku no Hero Academia: Memories',1430,66.6,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1607/142483.jpg','tv_special','2024-04-06','finished_airing','Recap of Boku no Hero Academia leading up to the seventh season.'),(57520,'Xiao Lu He Xiao Lan 4th Season',501,66.7,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1655/150230.webp','ona','2023-12-20','finished_airing',''),(57522,'Colorful na Everyday',120,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1714/140354.jpg','tv','2023-12-19','finished_airing','The original essay manga whimsically depicts Mumei\'s childhood memories and daily life, such as \"if a stupid grade school student got a manicure at school…,\" \"the story of when my first armpit hair sprouted,\" and \"a Filipino mom whacking a melonpan bun like a baseball.\"\n\n(Source: ANN)'),(57524,'Make Heroine ga Oosugiru!',1440,81.19999999999999,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1332/143513.webp','tv','2024-07-14','finished_airing','Despite not understanding much about fleeting teen romance, first-year high school student Kazuhiko Nukumizu still wonders how he would react if his life were to be turned into a love story. Regardless, as a self-proclaimed \"background character,\" Nukumizu is satisfied continuing his life as an introvert with a negligible social life. However, he suddenly finds himself too close to the spotlight when he witnesses his popular classmate Anna Yanami be rejected by her childhood friend in the middle of a family restaurant. \n\nWhile Nukumizu wishes he could just forget what he saw and move on, Anna ends up forcefully confiding herself in Nukumizu, lamenting her status as a childhood friend fated to have her beloved stolen. As he becomes dragged into Anna\'s situation, Nukumizu soon gets caught up in the relationship drama of two more girls: Lemon Yakishio, an outgoing member of the track and field club; and Chika Komari, a shy member of the literature club. Now thrust out of his comfort zone, Nukumizu finds himself a major character in the lives of too many losing heroines. \n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57528,'Risou no Himo Seikatsu',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1349/140367.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Yamai Zenjirou is your everyday office worker in modern Japan. One morning, he suddenly finds himself summoned to a tropical world where dinosaurs roam the land. He is told that this is the kingdom of Capua and the person who summoned him—its monarch, Queen Aura—wants him to marry her and leave his old life behind for a life of carefree extravagance as her prince consort. The reasons for her offer are many and varied, but she needs an heir, and she wants him to be the one to provide it!\n\nIf he accepts, he\'ll never have to work again, lazing around in luxury with no worries other than securing the kingdom its next monarch. Certainly, sleeping with the buxom beauty is far from a hardship, but is everything really as it seems? He\'ll also need to give up everything he knows on Earth. Is he ready to drop it all at a moment\'s notice for her sake? And how well will he be able to navigate the politics, people, and culture of this new world if he does?\n\n(Source: J-Novel Club, edited)'),(57532,'Sakigake!! Reiwa no Danjuku',268,0,36,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1959/140377.webp','ona','2023-12-18','finished_airing',''),(57533,'Youkai Gakkou no Sensei Hajimemashita!',1419,72.4,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1800/145662.webp','tv','2024-10-08','finished_airing','Following a bad experience teaching at a public high school that resulted in a break from working, Haruaki Abe eagerly takes up a new job at Hyakki Academy. Despite his cowardice, the novice teacher is motivated to do better this time around. However, his mind quickly changes when he finds out that everyone at the school is actually a supernatural being known as a youkai, leaving him glaringly out of place as the only human around.\n\nFacing his class as its new homeroom teacher, Abe immediately becomes a target for the students\' antics due to his quick-to-scare nature. Though as the man starts to learn more about the creatures, as well as himself, getting along with the unruly group might not be as hard as he originally thought as their school lives begin to get more vibrant.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57538,'Sai-Kyo-Oh! Zukan: The Ultimate Battles',300,0,50,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1827/149980.jpg','tv','2024-01-06','finished_airing',''),(57544,'Midnight Grand Mos Burger',45,63.4,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1212/140400.jpg','ona','2022-09-14','finished_airing','A collaboration between Midnight Grand Orchestra	and MOS Burger to promote the release of the their Tsukimi Focaccia sandwich.'),(57554,'Rurouni Kenshin: Meiji Kenkaku Romantan - Kyoto Douran',1370,77.69999999999999,23,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1314/145530.jpg','tv','2024-10-04','finished_airing','After living peaceful days at the Kamiya dojo, Kenshin Himura finds himself at a crucial crossroads, as his vow to never end a life is put to the ultimate test.\n\nFollowing the murder of his former commander, he now has to retread the road of violence and blood to take down Makoto Shishio—the assassin prodigy who calls himself the notorious Battousai\'s successor. With ambitions to overthrow the Meiji government and establish his dominion in Kyoto, Shishio has meticulously schemed for a decade, building a formidable anti-government military force. Now, Shishio has turned his sights toward recruiting Aoshi Shinomori, a cold-blooded killer and the former leader of the legendary Oniwaban Group warriors.\n\nAs Kenshin travels through a village abandoned by the government and currently under the iron fist of Shishio\'s henchmen, he is determined to prevent the country from spiraling back into civil war. He allies with his former rival, Hajime Saitou, forging a fragile partnership in a battle against Shishio\'s empire that will determine the fate of Japan.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57555,'Chainsaw Man Movie: Reze-hen',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1773/148746.webp','movie','2025-09-19','not_yet_aired','Sequel to Chainsaw Man.'),(57556,'One Piece: Dai Tokushuu! Momonosuke no Mei Shougun e no Michi',1460,63.099999999999994,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1569/140420.jpg','tv_special','2023-12-24','finished_airing','This is the 11th recap special of the Wano arc.'),(57557,'The One Piece',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1105/140422.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','Remake of One Piece.'),(57559,'MF Ghost 2nd Season',1420,78,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1037/145338.jpg','tv','2024-10-07','finished_airing','The second race in the MFG tournament at the notoriously difficult Lake Ashinoko track is underway. Though his car is severely disadvantaged in terms of horsepower, tune-ups to Kanata Katagiri\'s Toyota 86 GT allow him to quickly soar into a qualifying position. However, torrential downpour on the final day of racing brings tire traction woes and causes all drivers to struggle. \n\nThanks to the environment he grew up in and his extensive training, Kanata surprises everyone when he is able to pull ahead of the pack—albeit with some very risky maneuvers. However, there are still two formidable competitors ahead of Kanata: last race\'s winner Michael Beckenbauer and Lake Ashinoko record holder Kouki Sawatari. But even if Kanata can close the gap, he still needs to watch out for the drivers in his rearview preying on even a single mistake that they can take advantage of. \n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57562,'Hyakushou Kizoku 2nd Season',240,67.8,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1107/145108.jpg','tv','2024-10-04','finished_airing','Second season of Hyakushou Kizoku.'),(57567,'Shy 2nd Season',1420,69.2,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1518/143558.webp','tv','2024-07-02','finished_airing','After her battle against the mysterious organization Amarariruku, Teru Momijiyama returns to her regular life in Tokyo—all while secretly continuing to save people as Japan\'s hero Shy. As a result of her experiences with others, Teru is able to slowly gain confidence in herself. While she still has a long way to go, Teru continues to make progress towards learning what being a hero truly means.\n\nWhile walking around the city after school, Teru runs into Ai Tennouji, whom she quickly befriends and begins to open up toward. Teru quickly learns more about her new friend’s past—she has run away from her village in search of something directly related to Teru\'s work as Shy. While the threat of Amarariruku continues to loom over her,Teru must decide how closely she is willing to work with the mysterious Ai. \n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57575,'Wu Nao Monu 2nd Season',503,67,15,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1503/150231.jpg','ona','2024-01-02','finished_airing','The suddenly awakening ghost power leads to a conflict between Alois and the five ghosts that have been lingering in Agate\'s house. It turns out that these ghosts were all Agate\'s friends before death. The two sides have a negotiation at Agate\'s family graveyard. Alois wants all ghosts to go to the Hell Valley for reincarnation, but all ghosts want to find out the cause of Agate\'s suffering. In order not to hurt Agate any more, all ghosts decide to leave. They share their memories with Alois before leaving, hoping that he could find some clues. After seeing the memories of a woman called A Zhu, another child called Lv collapses, and Alois feels very weak and also the urgency.\n\n(Source: Bilibili Youtube)'),(57584,'Kage no Jitsuryokusha ni Naritakute! Movie: Zankyou-hen',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1570/140518.webp','movie','','not_yet_aired','Sequel to Kage no Jitsuryokusha ni Naritakute! 2nd Season.'),(57586,'Santa Tell Me',35,60.199999999999996,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1104/140522.jpg','ona','2023-12-05','finished_airing','A collaboration between Chiikawa and Ariana Grande featuring her song Santa Tell Me.'),(57587,'Tokyo',354,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1230/140523.webp','movie','1999','finished_airing','A short film by Tomoyasu Murata.'),(57588,'Tooryanse',438,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1106/140524.webp','movie','2004','finished_airing','A short film by Tomoyasu Murata.'),(57590,'Oshiri Tantei Movie 5: Saraba Itoshiki Aibou (Oshiri) yo',4260,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1383/140526.jpg','movie','2024-03-20','finished_airing','Oshiri Tantei\'s partner who disappeared 10 years ago suddenly reappears. He receives a mysterious message from Suisen and soon finds himself embroiled in a case of counterfeit art involving a massive plot to shake up the art galleries around the world.\n\n(Source: ANN)'),(57591,'Suteki! Sakura Mama',300,0,18,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1228/140527.jpg','tv','2000-12-02','finished_airing','I, Sakura Haruno, together with my loving husband Yo and my lovely Mika, am going to learn more and more about how to live and build a wonderful family. In this program, we will use a combination of animation and live-action footage to convey the wisdom of daily life in an easy-to-understand manner!\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(57592,'Dr. Stone: Science Future',1442,82.4,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1403/146479.webp','tv','2025-01-09','finished_airing','Having resolved the crisis in the Petrification Kingdom, Senkuu and his companions gear up to deal directly with the mastermind behind the petrification phenomenon—who supposedly resides on the moon. The ambitious spaceship project, however, requires immense manpower and critical resources scattered across the world. Thus, the Kingdom of Science exploration team kick-starts its transcontinental journey on the ship Perseus to gather them all.\n\nEquipped with modern technology and bolstered by the new, capable members in their ranks, the exploration team feels confident about setting sail to their first destination: America. They soon realize that the region now hosts adversaries controlling the resources they need, doing so with scientific technology which rivals and even exceeds their own. In a battle of science versus science, Senkuu and his team must outsmart their rivals if they are to have any chance of ensuring the continued survival and rejuvenation of humanity.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57593,'Hajimete no Futarikkiri Ryokou',278,62.1,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1953/140539.jpg','ova','2024-03-13','finished_airing','A short animation released with the limited edition of the LIPxLIP album \"Umarete Kita Koto ni Kansha Shinasai!\"'),(57594,'Dan Dao Zhizun',540,71.9,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1390/140540.jpg','ona','2023-12-22','currently_airing','In the ancient medicine continent, there are thousands of races, and the alchemist is revered. The Yin and Yang Alchemy God Su Beihuang spent all his efforts to refine the divine elixir, but was plotted by the beauty, integrated with the elixir and hidden for a hundred years. A hundred years later, his descendant Su Beitian was humiliated but still resisted tenaciously. He unexpectedly received the inheritance of the Alchemy God and returned with domineering power! Awakening the dual martial arts of ice and fire, practicing alchemy again, and becoming a young hero. As the truth behind his mother\'s disappearance is investigated, conspiracies gradually emerge. Let’s see Su Beitian go through many disasters, explore the extremes of martial arts, and become the supreme master of alchemy!\n\n(Source: Iqiyi, Google translated)'),(57595,'Pokemon Sleep CMs',30,60,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1657/140542.webp','cm','2023-12-21','currently_airing','Animated commercials for Pokemon Sleep.'),(57598,'Maca and Roni 3',780,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1872/140546.jpg','tv','2023-10-28','finished_airing',''),(57600,'Cherry Mahou Mini Gekijou',60,63.9,11,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1137/140559.jpg','ona','2023-12-22','finished_airing',''),(57603,'Suki na Ko ga Megane wo Wasureta Short Episode Specials',46,61.4,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1730/140561.webp','special','2023-12-20','finished_airing','Episodes of Suki na Ko ga Megane wo Wasureta Short Episode exclusive to volumes 1-3 of the Blu-ray.'),(57605,'Shinobanai! Crypto Ninja Sakuya: Ni no Maki',210,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1394/140564.jpg','tv','2024-01-11','finished_airing','Second season of Shinobanai! Crypto Ninja Sakuya.'),(57609,'Megumi no Daigo: Kyuukoku no Orange Recaps',1380,59.2,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1146/140566.jpg','tv_special','2023-12-23','finished_airing','Recap episodes of Megumi no Daigo: Kyuukoku no Orange.'),(57611,'Kimi wa Meido-sama.',1380,70.7,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1909/144684.jpg','tv','2024-10-06','finished_airing','One day, Hitoyoshi Yokoya wakes up to a mysterious nameless girl dressed as a maid ringing his doorbell, asking to be his servant. With her former master referring her to the Yokoya household, she offers her expertise as an assassin. Intimidated by her background, Hitoyoshi tries to send her away; but when she leaves something behind, he rushes to return it to her and is nearly hit by a truck in the process. With her fast reflexes, the girl saves him just in time, and Hitoyoshi ends up taking her in. \n\nIronically, the maid lacks any skills apart from the art of killing she has perfected since childhood. Nevertheless, Hitoyoshi welcomes the girl with open arms, encouraging her to leave her monochromatic past behind and experience a normal life. To seal the deal, Hitoyoshi names her Yuki, marking the beginning of her path to redemption and happiness.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57612,'Kikansha no Mahou wa Tokubetsu desu 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1988/140571.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Kikansha no Mahou wa Tokubetsu desu.\n'),(57613,'Wangu Kuang Di',960,69.1,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1650/140573.webp','ona','2024-01-01','finished_airing','Chu Kuangsheng, son of Patriarch Chu in the remote Shiyang town in Shenlong Empire, was born weak and unable to train. Due to his cultivation impairment, he is the laughingstock of the entire town. Three years ago, his parents go missing while on official duty. His talented and beautiful sister, Chu Liu\'er, is the apparent successor to head the Chu family but she suffers a strange illness. Since then, Chu Kuangsheng\'s situation gets increasingly difficult. During an ambush, the injured Chu Kuangsheng inherits the ancestral technique of Chu family, rebuilding his damaged meridians. From then on, Chu Kuangsheng\'s training progresses rapidly. \n\nDespite appearing weak and incompetent on the surface, he has another identity — the renowned Kuangzun in the martial world. Chu Kuangsheng discovers the collusion of the Chu clan leader with outsiders may be related to his parents\' disappearance. He uses his hidden identity of Kuangzun to secretly make connections with heroes, accumulating strength and gathering information. With one face and two identities, he eliminates the corrupt individuals in the Chu clan, He then leaves the small town for Siling Academy to train while he investigates and traces the clues to his parents\' disappearance. \n\nWielding his sword, cutting off the past and battling against heroes in the vast universe, Chu Kuangsheng\'s name resonates across myriad domains — he becomes the master.\n\n[Written by AnastasiaWun]'),(57614,'Shadowverse Flame: Arc-hen',1432,66.3,23,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1826/140574.jpg','tv','2024-04-13','finished_airing','Third part of Shadowverse Flame.'),(57616,'Kimi no Koto ga Daidaidaidaidaisuki na 100-nin no Kanojo 2nd Season',1430,79.80000000000001,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1093/145470.jpg','tv','2025-01-12','finished_airing','Ever since Rentarou Aijou found out that he would meet a total of one hundred soulmates in high school, his life has been anything but boring. Now with six girlfriends—each with their own unique quirks—Rentarou has never been happier.\n\nThe group expands once again when Rentarou meets Kurumi Haraga, a girl with a never-ending appetite; and Mei Meido, the maid of the Hanazono family. As he encounters more of his soulmates, Rentarou has to juggle ways to date them all, since failure results in a grim fate. Fortunately, Rentarou has no shortage of love to give to each of his girlfriends!\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57619,'Tori no Machi',250,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1890/140584.jpg','movie','2005-07','finished_airing','Graduation work by Toshiaki Hanzaki.'),(57622,'Uta no☆Prince-sama♪ Movie: Taboo Night Kisses',3360,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1643/147974.jpg','movie','2025-05-09','finished_airing',''),(57623,'Nijiyon Animation 2',210,68.4,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1023/140587.webp','tv','2024-04-05','finished_airing','Second season of Nijiyon Animation.'),(57629,'Da Yuzhou Shidai',1356,64.2,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1661/150248.jpg','ona','2024-01-22','finished_airing',''),(57635,'Kamonohashi Ron no Kindan Suiri 2nd Season',1420,76,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1917/144334.webp','tv','2024-10-07','finished_airing','Not long after forming their partnership, detectives Ron Kamonohashi and Totomaru Isshiki have proven adept at solving various cases together. However, the two are further motivated to continue their work when they discover that the House of M—an infamous crime syndicate—orchestrated Ron\'s expulsion from the prestigious Detective Training Academy BLUE five years prior. It appears that this group is also linked to Ron\'s mysterious ability that causes those around him to lose their lives, a phenomenon which Ron is desperate to stop.\n\nA member of the House of M soon starts to commit boastful serial murders around Shibuya as an act of provocation toward Ron. Consequently, the investigative pair must do their best to apprehend the culprit for the sake of justice as well as learning more about Ron\'s dark past and present condition.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57646,'Mob kara Hajimaru Tansaku Eiyuutan',1420,58.2,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1578/143664.webp','tv','2024-07-06','finished_airing','Meet Kaito Takagi, your typical high schooler with a low profile. He spends his days exploring dungeons in Japan, hunting slimes for some extra cash. On the side, he quietly admires his childhood friend, the popular girl in class. One day, a rare golden slime shows up, and after Kaito defeats it, he finds a super valuable item—a card that can summon mythical beings! He decides to use it and summons a stunning warrior maiden. Now, Kaito has a chance to rise above his ordinary explorer life. Get ready for a modern fantasy story filled with battles!\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(57647,'Uma Musume: Pretty Derby - Shin Jidai no Tobira',6431,85.1,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1427/142210.webp','movie','2024-05-24','finished_airing','A film adaptation of the Uma Musume: Pretty Derby franchise.'),(57648,'Nihon e Youkoso Elf-san.',1419,72.9,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1650/146113.webp','tv','2025-01-10','finished_airing','Since childhood, Kazuhiro Kitase has been able to dream of a different world. He can return to reality by falling asleep or dying, and he can pick up where he left off by sleeping again. For years, he has had many adventures alongside Mariabelle, a beautiful elf who works for the Sorcery Guild.\n\nOn one of their escapades, they come across the lair of a dragon taking care of its eggs. They inadvertently wake the slumbering beast, who promptly reduces them to ashes. For Kazuhiro, it is merely a temporary setback, as he can simply go back. However, he is shocked to find Mariabelle herself safe and sound asleep next to him.\n\nKazuhiro realizes that his dream world is an alternate reality altogether. In the meantime, he makes the most of this bizarre circumstance, introducing Mariabelle to the sights and wonders of Japan. Now, with their time together spanning two worlds, their real adventures have just begun!\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57652,'Macky to Eucky no Midnight Gallery',512,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1130/140633.webp','movie','2015','finished_airing',''),(57656,'Yi Ren Jun Moye',1468,66.9,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1151/140635.jpg','ona','2024-01-24','finished_airing',''),(57657,'Xian Yu Ge 2nd Season',1397,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1757/140636.jpg','ona','2024-02-15','finished_airing','The carefree Brother Xianyu is still enjoying an ordinary and happy daily life on Yushen Island. The gods from the Nantianmen Group broke the original peace of the island in order to investigate the stolen divine tablets. As unexpected events happened one after another, the mysteries surrounding the \"Fish God\" and \"Seren\" slowly unfolded due to Brother Xianyu\'s unexpected involvement. Faced with racial differences and worldly prejudices, how will Brother Xianyu use his unique way of doing things to pass this test...\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(57658,'Jujutsu Kaisen: Shimetsu Kaiyuu',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1889/147024.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Sequel to Jujutsu Kaisen 2nd Season.'),(57660,'Ojisan de Umeru Ana The Animation',950,65.1,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1985/140643.webp','ova','2024-03-29','finished_airing',''),(57661,'Kotowarenai Haha',1244,64.1,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1385/140644.webp','ova','2024-03-15','finished_airing',''),(57662,'Ruins Seeker',880,53.4,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1547/140789.webp','ova','2024-03-29','finished_airing','In a world full of dungeons with mystical monsters, there are brave people who take on the challenge of exploring them. One of these people is our protagonist. However, the unthinkable happens during her first exploration: she falls into a trap and is cursed with a curse that makes her attractive to monsters. Will she be able to get rid of the curse?'),(57663,'Kui Cheng Shoufu Cong Youxi Kaishi',1140,77.1,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1635/140669.webp','ona','2024-02-03','finished_airing','Pei Qian, an ordinary migrant worker, was accidentally bound to the wealth conversion system, which gave him a good opportunity to spend money in business and start his life over again. However, the system stipulates that you can only earn one yuan if you make a profit of 100 yuan, but all the money you lose can go into your own pocket. In order to lose money, Pei Qian chose the high-risk, money-burning game industry, and deliberately produced \"alternative\" games that went against the rules of the market. However, he unexpectedly became popular time and time again, earning a lot of money, and painfully became Pei Qian is the \"business wizard\" admired by everyone, but only Pei Qian understands that I really just want to lose money...\n\n(Source: Bilibili, Google translated)'),(57670,'Gintama x Meta Quest 3 Collaboration CM',40,56.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1212/141421.webp','cm','2023-12-01','finished_airing',''),(57677,'Bibliomania',1380,69.4,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1886/140840.webp','movie','2013-04-06','finished_airing',''),(57678,'Chaotic Order',120,54.2,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1184/140666.jpg','ona','2011-11-08','finished_airing','Another follow up film for Timbre A-Z.'),(57691,'Fate/Grand Order: Fujimaru Ritsuka wa Wakaranai - Dai Bounen Otanoshimikai 2023',301,62.300000000000004,7,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1544/140683.webp','tv_special','2023-12-31','finished_airing','Ritsuka Fujimaru—humanity\'s last master. It would not have been possible to restore humanity without him. However, he does have a shortcoming... he is far too honest! A slapstick comedy in which Fujimaru\'s simple questions sway the heroic spirits!\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(57694,'Yoru Mac PoteNage CMs',20,67.30000000000001,9,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1915/140689.webp','cm','2023-09-20','finished_airing','A series of commercials animated by Urachan for McDonald\'s Japan\'s Yoru Mac PoteNage.'),(57698,'Kubrick',15,0,14,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1995/140693.jpg','ona','2012-02-01','finished_airing','A series of geometric shorts by Mirai Mizue.'),(57699,'Wangzhe Rongyao: Rongyao Zhi Zhang',1612,70,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1137/140696.jpg','ona','2024-01-13','finished_airing','The exciting 3D series revolves around the main character Li Bai and focuses on the main theme of \"love and homecoming.\" The story invites the viewer to take an adventurous journey with Li Bai to the city of Chang\'an on the mainland of Glory of Kings. The young man investigates, discovers the truth and solves the case of his hometown, the City of Broken Moon, demonstrating the pursuit of truth, goodness and beauty in a positive, courageous and forward-looking spirit. In pursuit of a higher purpose, young Li Bai leaves his family and embarks on a long journey. However, a letter from his family, which affects the wanderer\'s thoughts of returning to his hometown, brings about a shocking crisis that affects Chang\'an.'),(57700,'Mawangui Ttal Ireesha',5074,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1526/140698.jpg','movie','2019-10-26','finished_airing','The adventures of high school girl Ireesha and her friends (talking frog and guitar-fairy Robby) as she visits Elf world to retrieve her friend’s soul.'),(57701,'Bai Bian Xiao Ba: Chao Xue Xianfeng 3nd Season',940,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1833/140699.jpg','tv','2021','finished_airing',''),(57702,'Zaiyuki Pilot',535,66.7,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1167/140701.webp','ona','2023-12-30','finished_airing','Pilot version of the upcoming Zaiyuki series released on Twitter.'),(57709,'Kudamonou',120,59,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1847/140711.jpg','tv_special','2023-12-29','finished_airing',''),(57710,'Bai Bian Xiao Ba: Chao Xue Xianfeng 4nd Season',935,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1085/140712.jpg','tv','2021','finished_airing',''),(57718,'Kennedy Knights Pilot Film',387,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1037/146527.jpg','movie','2003-03-21','finished_airing','Unaired pilot movie based on the Kennedy Knights manga by Mikiya Mochizuki.'),(57719,'Akuyaku Reijou Tensei Ojisan',1440,74,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1255/146484.jpg','tv','2025-01-10','finished_airing','Although Kenzaburou Tondabayashi is a 52-year-old bureaucrat, he is well versed in reincarnation stories where a protagonist suddenly awakens in a fantasy world. After being hit by a truck, Kenzaburou lands in that exact situation. However, what baffles him is the fact he wound up in the world of an otome game—as the young villainess and the daughter of a duke, Grace Auvergne.\n\nFortunately for Kenzaburou, he is somewhat familiar with his new world, as it is based on the game called Magical Academy: Love & Beast. He was a proud father in his previous life, and he often listened to his daughter rave about the game\'s setting and characters. Armed with background knowledge and a lifetime\'s worth of dad skills, Kenzaburou strives to make the most of his new life, though his kind-hearted nature makes it difficult to fully embrace the role of a villainess.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57722,'Valis the Animation',173,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1471/140738.jpg','ona','2022-02-10','finished_airing','A web series for the the group VALIS.'),(57738,'Disney: Twisted-Wonderland CMs',30,63.2,7,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1253/140745.webp','cm','2020-07-15','finished_airing','The distinguished Night Raven College, an all-boys arcane academy, houses its students in dormitories modeled after the historical figures known as the Great Seven. These dorms—Heartslabyul, Savanaclaw, Octavinelle, Scarabia, Pomefiore, Ignihyde, and Diasomnia—are like worlds of their own, each governed by a housewarden who holds near absolute authority. But individuals with power often hide the most severe traumas, and eventually, even those suppressed emotions must overflow.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57743,'Kaixin Chaoren: Shikong Yingjiu',6120,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1224/140753.jpg','movie','2024-01-20','finished_airing',''),(57744,'Magical Fang',810,0,15,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1117/150116.jpg','tv','2024-01-06','finished_airing',''),(57746,'Twisted-Wonderland: Glorious Masquerade PV',90,63.2,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1564/140759.webp','pv','2022-10-25','finished_airing','Students of Night Raven College are invited to a gathering of prospective mages being held at Noble Bell College, in the distant City of Flowers. Clothed in borrowed finery, the visiting delegates anticipate the glorious masquerade that will mark the climax of the cultural exchange. Meanwhile, the bell that is the college\'s namesake rings relentlessly.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57751,'Coffee Kousou',103,58.099999999999994,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1413/140763.jpg','cm','2023-01-30','finished_airing','A collaboration between Tokyo Revengers and DyDo Blend for their run of coffee beverages with collectible cans featuring characters from the series.'),(57752,'Bai Bian Xiao Ba 7th Season',790,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1772/140764.jpg','tv','2021','finished_airing',''),(57753,'Jantama Kan!!',300,58.3,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1551/142498.webp','ona','2024-04-25','finished_airing','Sequel to Jantama Pong☆.'),(57754,'BanG Dream! It\'s MyGO!!!!! Movie',7080,69.1,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1055/145734.jpg','movie','2024-09-27','finished_airing','Theatrical compilation of BanG Dream! It\'s MyGO!!!!!.'),(57759,'Xiaoke de Huatu Xie Hua Specials',66,62.9,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1101/140778.jpg','ona','2022-04-23','finished_airing','Special episodes of Xiaoke de Huatu Xie Hua which aired before the series.'),(57760,'D4DJ Short Anime',50,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1293/145453.webp','ona','2023-10-25','finished_airing',''),(57765,'Bai Bian Xiao Ba 8th Season',805,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1918/140785.jpg','tv','2021','finished_airing',''),(57771,'Bai Bian Xiao Ba 9th Season',805,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1089/140797.jpg','tv','2022','finished_airing',''),(57779,'Dorohedoro (Zoku-hen)',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1419/140814.webp','unknown','2025','not_yet_aired','Sequel to Dorohedoro.'),(57780,'Bai Bian Xiao Ba 10th Season',805,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1490/140818.jpg','tv','2022','finished_airing',''),(57782,'Yubisaki to Renren Mini Anime',97,64.3,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1969/140836.webp','ona','2024-01-07','finished_airing',''),(57788,'Bai Bian Xiao Ba 11th Season',806,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1850/140837.jpg','tv','2022','finished_airing',''),(57789,'Ateuma Chara no Kuse shite, Super Darling Ouji ni Chouai sareteimasu.',420,61.2,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1539/140838.webp','ona','2024-04-08','finished_airing','Side Character — Unimportant. Constantly getting in the way of the main characters\' love story.\n\nAfter finding himself reincarnated into the world of a novel, Loneal goes to great lengths to steer clear of Prince Alec, the hero, to avoid disrupting the main storyline between Alec and the heroine, Lily. However, to Loneal\'s great surprise, the prince becomes infatuated with...him?!\n\n\"A charming physique, such as yours, more than makes up for your lack of experience.\"\n\nBefore he knows it, he finds himself melting into the prince\'s arms... Why is everything so different from the novel?!\n\n(Source: Official site)'),(57796,'Touhai: Ura Rate Mahjong Touhairoku',1421,66.10000000000001,25,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1306/145571.webp','tv','2024-10-05','finished_airing','Ever since moving into his own apartment, quiet high school student Kei has been looking for a new thrill. He soon finds himself playing mahjong, but his whole life takes a dramatic turn when he is forced to play the game with a criminal group. Even though the odds seem against him, Kei is able to outmatch the others. Instead of claiming his reward in cash, however, he decides to take an abducted girl named Amina under his wing.\n\nDue to Kei\'s skills and cold playstyle, the mysterious Hideharu Seki takes an interest in him, introducing him to mahjong parlors and new potential opponents. But when matched up against an experienced player named Doujima, Kei is severely outskilled and only narrowly escapes going into serious debt. If he wants to protect his new life with Amina, Kei must find a way to outwit these shady characters and come out on top in every game he plays.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57797,'Calabi Yau no Sukima',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1099/140851.jpg','movie','','not_yet_aired',''),(57798,'Shinkalion: Change the World',1424,58.9,39,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1133/141311.webp','tv','2024-04-07','finished_airing','Once upon a time, an unidentified enemy, the Unknown, suddenly appeared. The \"Super Evolutionary Railway Development Agency,\" had developed the \"Shinkalion,\" a robot that transforms into a bullet train, as a countermeasure against this threat.\n\n(Source: Official Website, translated)\n'),(57799,'Bai Bian Xiao Ba 12th Season',805,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1226/140855.jpg','tv','2023','finished_airing',''),(57801,'Bai She 3: Fusheng',7967,69.80000000000001,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1448/140857.jpg','movie','2024-08-10','finished_airing',''),(57810,'Shoushimin Series',1383,73.2,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1164/143459.jpg','tv','2024-07-07','finished_airing','Jougorou Kobato has a habit of inserting himself into other people\'s problems. After realizing his detective skills are neither wanted nor appreciated, he makes an agreement with his shy friend Yuki Osanai to become ordinary together. Now entering high school, they aim to be perceived as regular people, yet Kobato cannot help but fall back into his deductive ways when faced with everyday mysteries.\n\nUnfortunately, mundane occurrences are not all the duo stumbles across. As they go through their school days trying to avoid drawing attention to themselves, Kobato and Osanai at times get caught up in incidents that put their plan of a peaceful, average life at risk.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57821,'Wanpaku! Touken Ranbu',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1237/140883.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired',''),(57822,'Atashin\'chi Next',600,0,5,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1642/144180.jpg','ona','2024-06-05','finished_airing',''),(57825,'Muupon',55,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1696/140895.jpg','tv','1999-04-03','finished_airing',''),(57826,'Muupon 2nd Season',55,0,22,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1059/140896.jpg','tv','2000-04-01','finished_airing',''),(57827,'Mashin Souzouden Wataru',1440,60.9,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1550/145123.jpg','tv','2025-01-12','currently_airing','New Wataru project.'),(57828,'Mashin Eiyuuden Wataru: Shichikon no Ryuujinmaru - Saikai',7200,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1938/140898.webp','movie','2022-01-07','finished_airing','A compilation of Mashin Eiyuuden Wataru: Shichikon no Ryuujinmaru with some new animation cuts.'),(57834,'Shangri-La Frontier: Kusoge Hunter, Kamige ni Idoman to su - Saishin Wa made Maruwakari! Chousoku Digest',1380,65.1,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1508/140903.webp','tv_special','2024-01-14','finished_airing','Recap of the first 14 episodes of Shangri-La Frontier: Kusoge Hunter, Kamige ni Idoman to su with new narration by Sunraku, Pencilgon, and OiKatzo.'),(57836,'Yun Zhongju San Zi',849,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1435/140906.jpg','ona','2024-01-17','finished_airing',''),(57837,'Yun Zhongju San Zi: Ni Nu Po',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1933/140907.jpg','movie','2019','finished_airing',''),(57838,'Sylvanian Families: Freya no Happy Diary - Birthday Present',660,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1617/140910.jpg','special','2022-12-29','finished_airing',''),(57845,'Elf-san wa Yaserarenai.',720,56,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1382/143437.jpg','tv','2024-07-07','finished_airing','Tomoatsu Naoe leads an ordinary life working as a massage therapist, but this changes when he encounters a peculiar client named Erufuda. During her visit, Naoe discovers her secret: she is actually an elf! After leaving her world, Erufuda fell in love with junk food and now cannot return home because of her weight gain.\n\nNaoe decides to help the elf with dieting so that she can eventually go back to her world. Although Erufuda puts in the work and reaches her goal, it does not take long for Naoe to stumble upon her again—and she has regained the lost pounds. As Naoe continues to give her advice, the two begin encountering other people from another world, all with the same desire to lose weight.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57846,'VSPO! x Vanguard Animation PV',66,59.699999999999996,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1513/140923.jpg','pv','2024-01-06','finished_airing','An animated promotional video for a collaboration between VSPO! and Cardfight!! Vanguard.'),(57857,'Kanojo wa Utau, Dakara Boku wa.',413,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1336/145454.jpg','ona','2020-07-30','finished_airing',''),(57858,'Shirarezaru \"Momowarou Monogatari\"',156,61.8,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1312/140939.jpg','ona','2024-01-11','finished_airing','Signboards depicting one of Kitakami\'s oldest folktales are scattered throughout the land—yet none of them make mention of Pecharunt. What could be the true tale of this Mythical Pokémon?​\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(57859,'Egao no Taenai Shokuba desu.',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1826/148165.webp','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','New shoujo manga artist Nana Futami works hard every day while being supported by Kaede Satou, her female editor who is older than her, and Mizuki Hazama, her assistant. According to the girl herself, she sometimes drums up intense daydream delusions of occupational illness! A working girls comedy set in the entertainment industry, brought to you by an author who always draws various girls.\n\n(Source: Kodansha, translated)'),(57860,'69: Itsuwari no Bishou',1380,61.4,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1858/140947.webp','ova','2024-02-22','finished_airing','She is a girl with excellent grades, modest personality, reserved and smiling face. Midori Aoi is a smiling girl who has been making a desperate effort to produce a \"smiley face\". Today, Midori is enjoying a blissful moment of smiling and being loved not only by the opposite sex but also by the same sex. The result of the recent examination was an unexpected mistake, and she has fallen far from her position. Midori is in a hurry to find a way out of this situation, but her opponent is her homeroom teacher, Izumi Kuwabara, who is rumored to be a slacker. However, the opponent is much tougher than she had imagined, and she unintentionally uses the following method...... This is Ms. Yoshimura, the teacher\'s fiancée, isn\'t it? What is playing on Midori\'s phone is a scene of his teacher\'s fiancée, Maho Yoshimura, having fun with multiple students. Midori is brought to a dangerous negotiation with Izumi\'s leaping hands and bare flesh...... Midori realizes her blunder when she feels the pain of a towering rod poking deep into her first bud and twisting it.......\n\n(Source: Getchu, translated)'),(57861,'Konomi ja Nai kedo: Mukatsuku Ane to Aishou Batsugun Ecchi',885,71.7,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1720/150108.webp','ova','2024-04-19','currently_airing','Two siblings have been constantly fighting, but their lives take an unexpected turn when they realize they are sexually attracted to each other.'),(57864,'Monogatari Series: Off & Monster Season',1504,86.7,14,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1142/146776.jpg','ona','2024-07-06','finished_airing','Koyomi Araragi spent his last year of high school helping girls in his town resolve various supernatural afflictions. But now Araragi has departed for university, leaving his friends to fend for themselves against new problems and curses that plague them. Yotsugi Ononoki, once a human corpse and now a living doll, takes residence in Araragi\'s home, keeping watch over his sister Tsukihi, a girl harboring a mystical secret of her own. As part of her duties, Yotsugi fills Araragi\'s vacated role as occult expert, assisting others in town with their issues.\n\nOne of these girls, middle school student Nadeko Sengoku, slowly recovers from her own recent brushes with the paranormal. She avoids returning to school, instead spending time alone in her room and pursuing her dream of becoming a professional manga artist. In order to speed up Nadeko\'s quest for mastery of her craft, Yotsugi convinces her to create four copies of herself, each representing a distinct aspect of Nadeko\'s personality. However, the clones refuse to help Nadeko, instead escaping into the town and creating a chaotic mess. Now forced to grapple with her own fractured sense of identity, Nadeko sets out to capture them and resolve her inner conflict.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57865,'Taigu Xing Shen Jue',639,67.5,40,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1627/140954.webp','ona','2024-01-25','finished_airing','Chen Xing is the young master of the Chen family in Dongyang City. Both his parents died. He could have succeeded him as the head of the family when he came of age, but was plotted and plotted by the ambitious acting head of the family, Chen Sheng, to occupy the magpie nest. \n\nWho would have thought that Chen Xing would survive the catastrophe, accidentally obtain the long-lost supreme skill \"The Ancient Star God Art\", and learn some of the moves, come back strong, expose Chen Sheng\'s ugly face, and imprison him. The matter was put aside for the time being. Chen Xing took precautions and carefully studied the \"Ancient Star God Technique\" to collect the star beasts needed for the technique and grow rapidly. \n\nDuring this period, Chen Xing rescued Mu Qinglan, the daughter of the palace lord of Xuanyang Palace, because of a star beast, and on her advice, she went through all kinds of hardships to enter Xuanyang Palace. However, as soon as he started, Chen Xing had constant disputes with Jian Feikong, the son of the deputy sect leader.\n\n(Source: Youku, translated)'),(57866,'Zhandou Wang Zhi Jufeng Zhan Hun 6',780,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1879/140956.webp','tv','2022-10-27','finished_airing','A teenager called Lin wants to become a World Nado champion. Lin travels with his master and meets young Nado players, and their hard-work will have an impact on him. He will make new friends, achieve his goals and become famous in all championships! \n\n(Source: alphagroupanimation.com)'),(57871,'Odekake Kozame x Chiba-ken Kuro Ajillo',60,61.1,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1152/141060.jpg','cm','2024-01-18','finished_airing','A collaboration between Odekake Kozame and Chiba Prefecture\'s Kuro Ajillo.'),(57875,'Tomoya!',273,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1124/140971.webp','movie','2022','finished_airing','Graduate Work 2022 by Masataka Kihara, Tama Art University.'),(57876,'Maougun Saikyou no Majutsushi wa Ningen datta',1420,64.1,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1814/143744.webp','tv','2024-07-03','finished_airing','Under the tutelage of the great demon warlock Romberg, Ike grew up with knowledge regarding an ancient advanced civilization that once ruled the land. Coupled with his innate talent in magical arts, this upbringing allows Ike to quickly rise in the Demon Lord\'s army ranks, leading his brigade to consecutive victories against humans.\n\nHowever, Ike has a secret—he is a human himself. Despite knowing all too well the consequences if this information is ever to leak, Ike is willing to face such immense danger to achieve his goal: find a way for humans and demons to coexist and stop the war that has been carried on for far too long.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57877,'Sheng Zu',876,65.7,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1917/140976.webp','ona','2024-01-23','finished_airing','Young Luo Lie was accidentally selected to be summoned to the other world to live in the identity of others. The large and small forces in the other world are divided, and there are hidden killing opportunities everywhere. The homesick Luo Lie relied on his tenacious character and mysterious ability acquired when he wore his soul to overcome many difficulties in the treacherous situation, break through his own limits, and make a name for himself. However, the dangerous predicament, treacherous and cunning tricks are pressing on him step by step, with the help of his childhood sweetheart, Luo Lie, who has no intention of becoming a hero, unexpectedly embarked on a heroic road, what awaits him in front of him is the abyss of no return, or the light that clears the clouds and sees the sun?'),(57878,'Shenlong Xing Zhu',556,0,48,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1099/140977.webp','ona','2024-01-20','finished_airing','Gu Zhengfeng was originally the divine dragon that guarded the Dragon Star. He was seriously injured in an ancient battle with alien enemies and fell into a long sleep. He wakes up and finds that the Dragon Star has changed, and is now called evil. In order to investigate and retrieve the treasure hidden in the Dragon King Academy, he changed into a human form and entered as a tutor in the Dragon Slaying Department.\n\n(Source: TVDB)'),(57879,'Mijika na Mono ni AGC Ofuro-hen',37,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1897/140981.webp','cm','2018-10-01','finished_airing','This animation was produced by Towaflo LLC as a production partner, and produced two versions: a male version and a female version. SNS manga artists Saki Kaoru and Atou Rie are in charge of the original work. In addition, the songs used in the commercial are sung by popular voice actors Uchida Maaya and Kaji Yuki, making this work a bit different from the commercial.\n\n(Source: prtimes.jp)'),(57881,'Sakuretsu! Amabie-hime. Season 3',220,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1621/141030.jpg','tv','2024-01-14','finished_airing','The third season of Sakuretsu! Amabie-hime.'),(57882,'Gasonshi!!: Esper Shoujo to Ninja no Abiko Monogatari',390,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1450/141420.jpg','ona','2023-12-02','currently_airing',''),(57883,'Monster Strike Anime: Masamune - Shimei no Akaki Yaiba',1365,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1661/140989.jpg','ona','2023-12-29','finished_airing',''),(57885,'Hua Luo Yi Meng',300,0,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1807/140996.jpg','ona','2019-12-13','finished_airing',''),(57888,'Chichi wa Eiyuu, Haha wa Seirei, Musume no Watashi wa Tenseisha.',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1637/148702.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Being a girl of both spirit and human blood, eight-year-old Ellen has power over the elements—though not the traditional four-element kind. She has the power to transform her surroundings by manipulating the elements of the periodic table. On top of that, Ellen also has a great amount of scientific knowledge due to being a scientist in her past life.\n\nDuring the war against a neighboring kingdom, Rovel Vankrieft, the hero of the Kingdom of Tenbahl and eldest son of house Vankrieft—as well as Ellen\'s father—was fatally injured. However, the spirit who fought by Rovel’s side, Lady Origin, brought him to her realm to save him from the clutches of death. Lady Origin, who happens to be the Queen of the Spirit Realm as well as Ellen\'s eventual mother, is one of the most powerful spirits in existence, making little Ellen quite powerful in contrast to her innocent looks.\n\nChichi wa Eiyuu, Haha wa Seirei, Musume no Watashi wa Tenseisha. is a story that follows this wholesome family of three, who are each quirky in their own little ways. But even a family as happy as this one has its fair share of problems, as Ellen and her parents are forced to reconnect their old ties to the Vankreift household in order to defend their relatives\' honor—all while hiding Ellen\'s dangerous existence from the public to preserve their undisturbed happiness.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57889,'Aru Hi no Gogo',65,59.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1779/141004.webp','ona','2024-01-19','finished_airing','Short animation shown during the 2nd year anniversary stream for NEEDY GIRL OVERDOSE.'),(57890,'Yume Juuya',135,60.7,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1328/141005.jpg','ona','2023-03-07','finished_airing',''),(57891,'Hitoribocchi no Isekai Kouryaku',1422,65.7,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1714/145320.webp','tv','2024-10-04','finished_airing','High school student Haruka has always been a content loner. One day, he and his class are abruptly transported to another world and given skill points to use when choosing from an assortment of abilities and magical powers. Unfortunately, Haruka arrives last, and he can only use his points on the seemingly impractical abilities the others had no interest in. Although he is on his own again and must adjust to his new life by himself, he much prefers it that way.\n\nHowever, Haruka\'s peaceful solitude is short-lived, as he runs into some of his classmates. Weak to their pleas for help, he ends up sheltering and helping them reunite with the others. But the different cliques struggle to see eye to eye, forcing Haruka to find a way to end the infighting and restore harmony between them to survive the unfamiliar world.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57892,'Hazurewaku no \"Joutai Ijou Skill\" de Saikyou ni Natta Ore ga Subete wo Juurin suru made',1450,64.80000000000001,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1914/143630.webp','tv','2024-07-05','finished_airing','When loner Touka Mimori is summoned to another world alongside his classmates, he obtains the power to inflict status ailments, such as paralysis or poison, on his enemies. Unfortunately for him, skills of this nature are considered useless due to their low success rate, and Touka is thus assigned the title of E-rank hero. Things take a further turn for the worse when Vicius, the goddess who summoned the class, reveals that the lowest-ranked hero will be disposed of so that they do not hinder those with greater talent.\n\nBanished to a notoriously dangerous area, Touka comes face-to-face with death after being cornered by a minotaur-like creature. In a desperate attempt to survive, he uses his supposedly worthless skill—only to quickly realize that it works almost every time. Armed with the ability to render the monsters standing in his way completely helpless, Touka resolves to track down the goddess that tossed him aside and exact his revenge.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57905,'Yodaka',506,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1657/141032.webp','movie','2023','finished_airing','The Nighthawk is an ugly bird. So ugly that everyone thinks he stole the name and the Hawk demands that he relinquish it. The Nighthawk cannot accept this, but he also realizes that he\'s not much different from the Hawk.\n\n(Source: Geidai Animation)'),(57906,'Jian Xian Zai Ci 2nd Season',691,0,50,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1250/141051.webp','ona','2024-01-27','finished_airing',''),(57907,'Tate no Yuusha no Nariagari Season 4',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1638/148142.jpg','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Fourth season of Tate no Yuusha no Nariagari.'),(57909,'Ramen wo Tabete Iru Toki dake Naze ka Nounai de Kaiwa ga Dekiru Futari',95,64.80000000000001,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1487/141056.jpg','cm','2024-01-17','finished_airing','The story of Saki and Ken, who are mysteriously able to converse in their heads only when they are eating.\n\n(Source: Official YouTube, translated)'),(57910,'Pui Pui Molcar the Movie: MOLMAX',4140,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1110/145824.webp','movie','2024-11-29','finished_airing','CG animated movie based on Pui Pui Molcar.'),(57911,'Zou no Katachi',492,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1866/141064.webp','movie','2022','finished_airing','Graduate Work 2022 by Yuxuan Sang, Tokyo Polytechnic University, Faculty of Arts, Department of Animation.'),(57915,'Suu-funkan no Yell wo',4080,71.7,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1864/142437.webp','movie','2024-06-14','finished_airing','Kanata Asaya, a high school boy who is immersed in making music videos, is deeply moved by a street performance one day. He strongly wishes to create a music video for the song. However, the person singing was Yuu Orie, a female teacher who had given up on pursuing a career in music.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(57916,'Ensoku Datta Hi',300,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1842/141080.webp','movie','2023','finished_airing','Graduate Work 2023 by Hiroki Kurasawa, Musashino Art University.'),(57918,'Hontou no Watashi ga Mieru?',616,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1025/141082.webp','movie','2023','finished_airing','Graduate Work 2023 by Ye Jing, Kyoto University of the Arts.'),(57923,'Itsudemo Kirby CMs',37,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1973/141423.webp','cm','2022-02-01','finished_airing','Animated shorts created to celebrate Karameru\'s work illustrating for the picture book series It\'s Kirby Time.'),(57924,'Tono to Inu',150,65.8,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1614/147192.jpg','tv','2024-10-10','finished_airing','In the warring states era, there were those who performed feats resembling demons or gods—though that is now a thing of the past. The Lord now lives in a completely declined and impoverished tenement. The Lord who has fallen into such circumstances, encounters a single dog. Feeling pity for its peculiar short-limbed appearance, the Lord reaches out a hand, but soon becomes amused by its mischievous behaviors. Thus begins the cohabitation of the fearsome Lord and cheerful dog, bringing peace and harmony to their lives!\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(57925,'Milky☆Highway',220,67.9,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1384/141093.jpg','ona','2022-02-23','finished_airing','In the galaxy far far far away, there is an interplanetary road called Milky☆Highway. To kill time during a weekend, Makina the cyborg and Chiharu the super human decide to go for a drive. Wherever those troublesome friends drive, there is always a danger! Not smart, not tear-jerking, not touching. The only two words that can describe this discount cyberpunk story is Speedy and Unprecedented!!\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(57927,'Kimi wa Sekai de Ichiban Utsukushii Iro PV',104,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1898/141095.webp','pv','2023-03-01','finished_airing','A promotional video for Kadokawa\'s release of Golo Zhao\'s Ni Shi Shijian Zui Meihao De Secai.'),(57928,'Wu Chuang Yinxing Dao',5400,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1718/141100.jpg','movie','2024-01-20','finished_airing',''),(57929,'Huo Shen: Tianqi Zhizi',4037,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1194/141101.webp','ona','2024-01-28','finished_airing',''),(57930,'Senba Xingfu Dao: Wo Yao Hui Jia',4680,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1486/141102.jpg','movie','2024-01-27','finished_airing',''),(57931,'Ba Jie: Tian Peng Xiajie',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1082/149996.webp','movie','2024-02-10','finished_airing',''),(57932,'Wo Shi Bawang Long',4800,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1815/141104.jpg','movie','2022-10-01','finished_airing',''),(57933,'Xiong Haizi: Tanxian Xiong Bing',4800,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1403/141105.jpg','movie','2024-02-10','finished_airing',''),(57936,'Rennyuu Order The Animation',1570,70.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1004/141114.jpg','ova','2024-04-26','finished_airing','The protagonist, Takayuki, lives alone in Japan after being separated from his parents, who are away excavating in archaeological ruins in a distant country. One day, suddenly, Sasha, the princess of a mysterious country called Al-Fazhar and a cinnamon-skinned heroine, appears. She brings with her a letter from her father, which surprisingly reveals that Sasha has become Takayuki’s wife. Without wasting time, Sasha bewilders Takayuki by seeking the consummation of their marriage to conceive an heir and fulfill her marital duties.\n\n(Source: TMDB)'),(57937,'Mebuki The Animation',935,60.8,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1759/141115.webp','ova','2024-04-26','finished_airing',''),(57939,'Arknights 4th Anniversary PV',302,64.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1835/141119.jpg','pv','2024-01-09','finished_airing','Dear Doctor, the Arknights 4th Anniversary Livestream will begin on January 13. The Operators are busy setting up the scene right now. Let\'s take a look!\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(57944,'Party kara Tsuihou sareta Sono Chiyushi, Jitsu wa Saikyou ni Tsuki',1403,57,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1721/145335.webp','tv','2024-10-06','finished_airing','Throughout his youth, unskilled healer Laust was taken advantage of by unscrupulous adventurers. Despite intensive efforts to improve himself, Laust is swindled by the members of Blades of Lightning—the first party that he joins after completing his training—and is eventually banished by its leader Margulus.\n\nAs the subject of public ridicule, Laust is not hopeful about his future prospects. However, novice adventurer Narsena unexpectedly offers to form a party with him, and he happily accepts. The duo quickly gain fame by conquering uncharted parts of the labyrinth. While there seems to be a reason behind Narsena\'s hasty proposal, Laust is oblivious to what it could be.\n\nMeanwhile, Margulus fails for the second time to slay a poisonous hydra, even after enlisting the help of elite healer Lyra for the quest. Laust soon finds himself being asked to rejoin Blades of Lightning, but it is not as easy as he imagined to move on from his former comrades-in-arms despite his new path and current companion.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57945,'Tasuuketsu',1320,55.5,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1482/143629.webp','tv','2024-07-03','finished_airing',' During his school computer class, Saneatsu Narita is presented with a strange screen posing a yes-or-no question that quickly disappears. The next day, Saneatsu wakes up to a world where everyone, save for himself and a few others, is dead.\n\nAn announcement from a mysterious figure known only as the Emperor begins to shed light on the situation. The question that Saneatsu saw on the screen is part of a game called Tasuuketsu. Every day, the survivors will see a question appear on a screen, and answering it will determine who lives to see the next day. Responding the same as the majority will guarantee death, and the last player standing will earn the right to meet the Emperor.\n\nSaneatsu resolves to beat the Emperor at their own game, making use of the hidden envelopes containing powers that can aid the players. With the help of his small group of friends, Saneatsu must avoid falling into the machinations of the other players and win this wicked game.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57946,'Himitsu no AiPri',1380,64,51,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1913/145169.webp','tv','2024-04-07','finished_airing','Ever since she was a child, Himari Aozora has adored the world of the idol princesses known as AiPri. Long ago, Himari made a promise with her best friend, Mitsuki Hoshikawa, that they would debut as AiPris together. However, Himari has grown to be incredibly shy, and she has all but given up on her dream.\n\nBoth girls enroll as first years at Paradise Private Academy. On the first day of school, Himari gets lost on her way back to the dormitory and stumbles upon a room radiating a pink light. She falls into the room, and a bracelet clasps onto her wrist, transporting her to the AiPriVerse—the world where AiPris perform.\n\nHimari accidentally enters the newcomer auditions for the AiPriVerse, and her performance impresses Paradise Academy\'s Student Council. They offer to become her producers, with the condition that she will conceal her status as an AiPri. Little does Himari know that Mitsuki herself is also an AiPri and has been hiding it from her! Their childhood dream of performing together gradually comes to fruition—even as the academy\'s principal threatens to ban AiPri from school grounds entirely.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57947,'Mayonaka Punch',1420,73.60000000000001,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1700/143395.jpg','tv','2024-07-08','finished_airing','Masaki\'s career on NewTube ends abruptly when the Harikiri Sisters decide to kick her out of their group during a livestream. With her bad reputation, Masaki has a slim chance of returning to popularity with a solo channel and she is plagued by comments of hate.\n\nMasaki soon meets Live, a vampire who just woke up from her slumber in which she dreamed of Masaki and developed an obsession with her. Believing this discovery will be the next internet sensation, Masaki forms a pact with Live: in exchange for Masaki\'s blood, Live will help her reach the milestone of a million subscribers.\n\nNow, with the other vampires in Live\'s house on board with Masaki\'s ambitious plan, she and Live work together to film videos and restore her to career glory.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(57950,'Enjou Bokumetsu! Mahou Shoujo Aiko',256,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1211/141136.jpg','tv','2024-01-11','finished_airing',''),(57952,'Jijia Yingxiong: Ji Dou Yongzhe 2nd Season',760,0,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1109/141139.jpg','tv','2023-11-10','finished_airing',''),(57953,'Chikomaru Episode 0',96,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1262/141140.jpg','ona','2024-01-25','finished_airing',''),(57960,'Balala Xiao Mo Xian: Xing Yuan Die Qi 2',780,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1075/141252.jpg','tv','2023-12-28','finished_airing',''),(57961,'Rakuen Tsuihou: Kokoro no Resonance',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1437/146525.webp','movie','2026','not_yet_aired','Sequel to Rakuen Tsuihou.'),(57969,'Nukitashi the Animation',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1587/149982.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','Seiran Island. Even here in paradise, there are those who work in the shadows to bring it down...\n\nUnited, these misfits stand side by side as the secret society NLNS. As their founder and head honcho, I, Junnosuke Tachibana, won\'t stop until we\'ve crushed this crazy law once and for all!\n\nI\'ve even found a benefactor in this crusty old rich guy, name unknown... He\'s hooked us up with a secret base and a buttload of cash already. In return, he wants us to find someone and \"protect her at all costs.\" Apparently, she holds the key to our mission\'s success...? In which case, there\'s only one thing to do: locate this mystery girl. And all while keeping the SHO off our scent, too...\n\nMake no mistake! I\'ll stop that law in its tracks, just wait and see! \n\n(Source: Shiravune, edited)'),(57971,'Ran',120,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1701/141170.webp','movie','2014','finished_airing','Short animation by Eri Kinoshita.'),(57975,'Sewing Love',513,60.7,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1950/141174.jpg','movie','2022','finished_airing','The expression of emotional desire called love. Everyone is an individual whose spirit and soul cannot be bound. The emotion between people leads to good and bad results, happiness or misery. In the river of natural life, it is the stream injected halfway and the water vapor evaporated halfway. Two very strong individuals, whether they are right or not, whether they need to be morally criticized, whether they need to be examined by us, in the end, death, rebirth, corruption are all part of the river.\n\n(Source: Film Freeway)'),(57979,'Eyeshield 21: 21st Anniversary PV',46,60.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1455/141180.jpg','pv','2024-01-28','finished_airing',''),(57990,'Zombie no Afureta Sekai de Ore dake ga Osowarenai',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1113/141213.webp','tv','2026','not_yet_aired','Yuusuke is an office worker with a dislike for people, preferring to do his job alone and in silence. When the company he works for suddenly goes bankrupt, he loses his job, and with that, all his motivation disappears, and he becomes a complete shut-in. On one of the rare days he decides to leave his apartment after a week-long video game binge, a mysterious man attacks him and bites his arm. Though Yuusuke manages to escape back to his room, he comes down with a fever and becomes bedridden for several days.\n\nWhen Yuusuke wakes up, recovered, he goes to resume his normal life, but he soon finds that in the short time he was asleep the world has completely changed. Zombies have emerged in every corner of the world simultaneously, and the few human survivors are now in hiding. However... \"Why am I the only one the zombies don\'t attack?\"\n\nHow will Yuusuke take advantage of his new situation, and what will he discover?\n\n(Source: VNDB)'),(57993,'Oomuro-ke: Dear Friends',2580,77.6,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1613/141223.webp','movie','2024-06-21','finished_airing','Part two of the spin-off of Yuru Yuri featuring Sakurako and her sisters.'),(57994,'Ningen ni Shiawase ni suru Ningen, Teijin',30,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1368/141227.webp','cm','','finished_airing','A series of commercials from 1990\'s for Teijin featuring Moomin characters.'),(57995,'Bai Yao Pu 4th Season',1399,75.6,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1523/145774.jpg','ona','2024-02-23','finished_airing','Fourth season of Bai Yao Pu.'),(57996,'Lili Kurong',92,63.8,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1802/141229.jpg','ona','2024-01-28','finished_airing','A short film directed by Yakumo Crack for the Arknights 2024 Spring Festival Gala.'),(58001,'Xi Xing Ji: Kuang Wang',1061,0,9,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1508/141316.webp','ona','2024-02-28','finished_airing',''),(58012,'Liang Chen You Meng',156,65.9,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1873/141269.jpg','ona','2024-02-02','finished_airing','Liang Chen You Meng is a Pokémon animated short that was released on Weibo, Douyin, and Bilibili in mainland China on February 2, 2024 in celebration of Chinese New Year.\n\n(Source: Bulbapedia)'),(58014,'Kiiroi Kaiyou Kishoudai',898,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1463/141247.webp','movie','1988','finished_airing',''),(58015,'One Piece: Dai Tannou Kikaku! \"Shi no Gekai\" Trafalgar Law',1460,65.1,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1868/141248.jpg','tv_special','2024-02-04','finished_airing','The first recap special of Egghead arc that covers Trafalgar Law\'s history with narration by Bepo and Chopper.'),(58016,'Mabeobsonyeo Dee Dee 2',750,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1447/141249.jpg','tv','2021-04-29','finished_airing',''),(58018,'Yu-Gi-Oh! Card Game: The Chronicles PV',373,74.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1344/141253.webp','pv','2024-02-03','finished_airing','A showcase advertising Konami\'s new animation department depicting several different themes.\n\nIt should be noted this is not a trailer for upcoming shows, but more of a demo reel to showcase the talents of Konami animation, with a variety of animation styles.\n\n(Source: ygorganization)'),(58032,'HololiveEN PVs',111,61.4,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1235/141263.webp','pv','2021-07-31','finished_airing','Teaser promotional animations Prelude and Omen for Hololive English\'s second generation reveal.\n'),(58033,'Kore wa, Watashi no Monogatari.',123,59.699999999999996,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1563/141264.jpg','ona','2021-08-11','finished_airing','A 3D animation short celebrating Lamy Yukihana\'s first anniversary in hololive.'),(58034,'Ibrahim 3-shuunen Kinen Anime',187,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1873/141265.webp','ona','2023-02-01','finished_airing','A special animation made to commemorate the third anniversary of Ibrahim\'s debut as a VTuber.'),(58035,'Tom to Jerry Gokko Aeon Cinema Collab Movie',20,60.7,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1479/141266.webp','cm','2024-02-05','finished_airing','A collaboration short between Tom to Jerry and Aeon Cinema shown in Aeon Cinema theaters before films.'),(58048,'Fei Ren Zai Spring Festival Special',710,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1139/141298.webp','ona','2024-02-02','finished_airing',''),(58055,'Shenyi Jiu Xiaojie 2nd Season',650,65.8,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1914/141293.jpg','ona','2024-02-11','finished_airing','Second season of Shenyi Jiu Xiaojie.'),(58056,'Yi Ren Zhi Xia: Xiu Tie Chong Xian',4210,66.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1540/141294.jpg','ona','2024-02-15','finished_airing',''),(58057,'Dubu Wangu 2nd Season',660,69,90,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1222/141295.jpg','ona','2024-02-09','finished_airing',''),(58059,'Tsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria',1425,78.7,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1281/144104.webp','tv','2024-07-07','finished_airing','When humanity was oppressed by mysterious foes known as the Celestial Hosts, five exceptional mages joined forces to defeat them. In fear that these formidable enemies would return, the five most powerful mages, known as the Magia Vander, built a magical dome and a tower to contain them. Since then, the five strongest mages of every generation are tasked with monitoring the dome from the top of the Wizard\'s Tower.\n\nInspired by this story, childhood friends Will Serfort and Elfaria Albis Serfort promised each other that they would climb to the top of the Wizard\'s Tower. However, now a sixth-year student at Regarden Magic Academy, Will\'s future looks bleak. Although Elfaria managed to join the ranks of the Magia Vander five years prior thanks to her unparalleled magical power, Will has no magical abilities whatsoever, attracting the ire of teachers and students alike.\n\nHowever, blessed with an exceptional physique, Will is able to slay monsters in the labyrinth and prevail against skilled magicians with the only aid of his sword and a few magical items. Determined to climb the Wizard\'s Tower at all cost, Will is determined to not let anyone or anything prevent him from keeping the promise he made to Elfaria.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58066,'Sorairo Utility (TV)',1422,71.39999999999999,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1909/146787.webp','tv','2025-01-04','finished_airing','Avid gacha player Minami Aoba finds herself at an impasse when her favorite game announces the end of its live service. Left adrift without her beloved characters, she realizes she has been wasting her first year of high school and sets out to try different clubs to find a new, more productive hobby. However, the harsh truth sets in that she is completely unfit for pretty much every sport her school\'s clubs have to offer.\n\nOne fateful afternoon, Minami stumbles upon a golf driving range after helping an old man carry his equipment there. Inside, she meets Haruka Akane, who promptly introduces her to the sport. Much like her previous attempts at athletics, Minami has no natural talent for golf, but something about the rhythm of swinging the club captivates her. Finally, Minami feels the spark of genuine excitement that she has been looking for—a new obsession within her reach.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58068,'Wo Kao Chongzhi Dang Wudi 2nd Season',480,0,30,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1124/141318.webp','ona','2024-02-24','finished_airing','Second season of Wo Kao Chongzhi Dang Wudi.'),(58079,'Lutu Weiji! Sheng Freya Hao Tebie Shijian',2165,74.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1127/142151.jpg','ona','2024-02-09','finished_airing','This is the much-anticipated perfect vacation for everyone.\nOn the luxurious spaceship, St. Freya, heading towards the moon, we believed we could enjoy this rare and relaxing journey to the fullest — or so we thought.\n\nMysterious shadows, sudden weightlessness, disappearing items, glaringly faulty alibi...\nIs the culprit among us?\n\n(Source: Official Twitter account)'),(58080,'Kenka Dokugaku',1375,73.4,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1594/142521.jpg','tv','2024-04-11','finished_airing','The bullies at Yoo Hobin\'s high school are no ordinary trouble-makers: they are NewTubers, budding internet celebrities who force Hobin to partake in humiliating videos and host live-streams in his house. Hobin only manages to stay strong by reminding himself that he needs to work hard to support his hospitalized mother. However, during his classmate Woo Jihyeok\'s live stream, Hobin completely snaps after a humiliating incident. As a result, the two men engage in a grotesque fistfight that lasts until dawn.\n\nThe following day, Hobin discovers that the livestream of his fight went viral on NewTube, turning him into a celebrity overnight. After he realizes that making viral videos is a very lucrative endeavor, Hobin agrees to team up with Jihyeok to create a channel that features his martial prowess. However, Hobin needs to become a seasoned fighter and keep his distance from those who seek to use him for his newfound fame, unless he wants a lack of views to become the least of his problems. Thankfully for him, the unexpected discovery of a series of obscure self-learning videos might be just what he needs to survive in the content creation industry.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58082,'NEET Kunoichi to Nazeka Dousei Hajimemashita',720,61.2,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1748/148595.webp','tv','2025-01-05','finished_airing','Tsukasa Atsumi is a salaryman who leads an ordinary, solitary life. On his way back from work one evening, he is saved from a demon attack by a mysterious woman in a ninja outfit. Introducing herself as Shizuri Ideura, she claims that demons target people like Tsukasa, who have Samurai Blood in their veins, and that her kind have been protecting them from the shadows.\n\nTold by Shizuri that the attacks are going to become more frequent, Tsukasa makes a deal to provide her with housing in exchange for his safety. To his surprise, he quickly finds out that Shizuri is a shut-in who loves to play video games whenever she is not busy with her ninja duties. As the two spend more time together, Tsukasa grows to appreciate Shizuri\'s company—and his feelings just might be mutual.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58086,'Guonian Zhe Lianmeng: Xun Long Ji',276,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1242/141342.jpg','ona','2024-02-09','finished_airing',''),(58087,'Kabigon Meets Snorlax',66,53,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1621/141345.jpg','pv','2024-02-09','finished_airing','A promotional video for CHRIS\'s solo exhibition KABIGON meets SNORLAX at KOMIYAMA TOKYO G. It is a collaboration with Project Snorlax.'),(58091,'Gintama on Theater 2D: Ikkoku Keisei-hen',6540,70.8,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1495/150101.webp','movie','2024-06-21','finished_airing','A compilation film of the Courtesan of the Nation Arc, episodes 5–9 in the third season, featuring additional footage. The movie is a part of the \"Gintama 20th Anniversary Project.\"'),(58121,'Kateikyoushi x ** 2 The Animation',1047,61.7,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1733/141390.jpg','ova','2024-04-05','finished_airing',''),(58122,'Succubus ★ Connect!',990,60.199999999999996,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1193/142060.jpg','ova','2024-04-26','currently_airing','Yuina loves her non-biological big brother. One night as she thinks about her brother, she suddenly finds herself in a new world. She gets harassed by a man, whereupon a succubus appears in front of her and saves her. Succu, the succubus, explains to Yuina that she can return to her old world via a portal. In order to create a large enough portal she has to become a succubus herself and in order to do that she has to seduce enough men and so the adventure of Yuina and Succu begins.'),(58123,'Dearest Blue',1386,56.3,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1423/142059.jpg','ova','2024-04-26','currently_airing','Rio and Mamoru are childhood friends and love each other, but have not yet managed to confess their feelings to each other. Rio won a beauty contest where she became an idol and now works under a big agency. There\'s just one problem: With her increasing popularity, Rio is falling into the eyes of some powerful malevolent men who are playing a more macabre game. This game is about watching Rio suffer and making her sacrifice everything. When Mamoru finds out about this, he sets his sights on protecting Rio, but will he really be able to protect her?'),(58125,'Look Back',3433,86.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1716/142633.jpg','movie','2024-06-28','finished_airing','Ayumu Fujino may only be in the fourth grade, but she already basks in high praise for her hand-drawn four-panel comics featured in the school\'s newspaper. However, when she is asked to share the page with Kyoumoto—a reclusive student she has never met—Fujino feels inadequate for the first time: her free-spirited drawings look embarrassingly amateurish next to Kyoumoto\'s breathtakingly detailed art.\n\nFor a year, Fujino shuts out the world, obsessively studying manga creation and drawing tirelessly to catch up to her faceless competition. But Kyoumoto\'s talent far exceeds hers, and Fujino quits it all. Another year passes, and on the day of their graduation, Fujino finally meets Kyoumoto. This unkempt, shy, and stuttering girl has actually been Fujino\'s biggest fan all along. Their encounter reignites Fujino\'s passion for art and sparks the beginning of a years-long friendship built on rivalry, admiration, and their shared love of manga.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58131,'Shiunji-ke no Kodomotachi',1420,70.1,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1955/148360.jpg','tv','2025-04-08','currently_airing','The love between brother and sister. The love between man and woman. That which is most forbidden is most unyielding. The two sons and five daughters of the Shiunji family shine like brilliant gems, each with intelligence and beauty in equal measure. And with the pedigree of their wealthy father behind them, how could they not be the talk of the town? Eldest son Arata has spent his life being tossed around by the whims of his colorful sisters, yet a little teasing won\'t stop him from valuing his family over anything and anyone else. But when his youngest sister turns fifteen, their father reveals a long-hidden secret of the Shiunji \"siblings\" and knocks Arata\'s world off its axis...\n\n(Source: Yen Press)'),(58137,'Kagaku x Bouken Survival!',1440,0,21,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1798/150102.jpg','tv','2024-10-05','finished_airing',''),(58139,'Kimi ga Nozomu Eien: Ayu Mayu Gekijou Prologue',180,56.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1393/141451.webp','ova','2006-08-11','finished_airing','Prologue episode of Kimi ga Nozomu Eien: Ayu Mayu Gekijou included on the PC age CD-ROM2 Vol.05.'),(58143,'Aishang Ta de Liyou Extra',626,79.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1569/141456.webp','ona','2024-02-13','finished_airing',''),(58146,'Tensei Akujo no Kuro Rekishi',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1471/148472.jpg','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','Konoha Satou has a dark history. After all, she spent her teen years writing self-indulgent fantasy romance fics-like her Dark History. But since she\'s become its most despicable villainess, remembering every last detail is now a matter of life-and-death. Having avoided the first couple of death flags, Satou\'s suddenly left in the dark when a mysterious stranger returns from the Lily Kingdom-a character she doesn\'t recall writing in the original script. Although Yomi claims to be her ally, can Satou really trust a character she knows nothing about in such a dangerous world?\n\n(Source: Yen Press)'),(58154,'Untei',264,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1795/141470.webp','movie','2019','finished_airing','It’s summer vacation and all the kids in the neighborhood have left to visit relatives. But there in the relentless glare of the sun, is a boy looking up at the sky.\n\n(Source: Geidai Animation)'),(58155,'Hotarubi no Migomori',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1828/141471.webp','movie','2020','finished_airing','The boy got pregnant. Through the pain of morning sickness and prejudice, he finally gives birth.\n\n(Source: Geidai Animation)'),(58159,'Spy x Family Movie: Code: White Manner Movie',59,69.7,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1567/141475.webp','movie','2023-07-28','finished_airing','Wit Studio and Cloverworks released a new short film using Spy x Family to remind the general public of basic movie theater etiquette. You’ll be able to watch it from all Toho cinemas in Japan. All members of the immediate Forger family are present. It focuses on Loid and Yor teaching Anya how to behave when in a movie theater. \n\n(Source: siliconera.com)'),(58171,'Story of Krishna',229,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1947/141490.webp','movie','2019','finished_airing','A short animation from Tomori Komazaki for the Joshibi Art Museum in Japan.'),(58172,'Nageki no Bourei wa Intai shitai',1429,70.5,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1679/145660.jpg','tv','2024-10-01','finished_airing','As dungeon-like treasure vaults started appearing throughout the land, more and more people began signing up as treasure hunters—risking their lives to obtain the vast riches and ancient relics inside. In the imperial capital of Zebrudia, the top hunter party is the Grieving Souls—a group of six childhood friends led by Krai Andrey, who is thought to be the strongest of them due to having a reputed wide array of skills.\n\nHowever, Krai actually has no special talent. His accomplishments are actually the result of his friends being overpowered. Krai has repeatedly attempted to leave the party out of fear his lack of aptitudes would one day cause his companions\' downfall. Nevertheless, everyone around Krai thinks differently, making him feel obligated to remain the group\'s leader.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58173,'Mahoutsukai ni Narenakatta Onnanoko no Hanashi',1422,61.8,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1535/145026.webp','tv','2024-10-05','finished_airing','From a young age, Kurumi Mirai has aspired to become a magician. Driven by her ambition, she has spent her childhood preparing to join the prestigious Rettoran Academy of Magic. Although Kurumi excels in the selection exam, her dream is crushed when she is not chosen for the elite magic class.\n\nAdmitted to the standard class at the academy instead, Kurumi soon befriends Maki Kumiiru, her new roommate; and Yuzu Edel, another girl unhappy with her placement. However, to everyone\'s surprise, their homeroom teacher, Minami Suzuki, promises to teach the class magic anyway. Although skeptical at first, the girls start to believe that this may be their second chance at realizing their dreams and becoming wonderful magicians.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58178,'Krasue',720,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1834/141601.webp','movie','2021','finished_airing','In a town of South-East Asia, at night, a Yakuza is facing a bloody conflict with local gangs. During the fight, he encounters with a ghost called Krasue (pronounced Gasoo), a flying woman head with her guts exposed, and is followed by her because of his blood\'s taste. Their battle eventually leads them to the depth of a dark and damp maze-like jungle, where boundaries between humans, animals and ghost seem to fade. With a howling noise, \"BOY MEETS GIRL\" metamorphoses into \"Encounter with another species.\"\n\n(Source: New Chitose Airport International Animation Festival)'),(58179,'Tokimeki ni Shinda Koibito yo',95,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1920/141503.jpg','tv_special','2013-01-02','finished_airing','Animation by Ryo Hirano created for the NHK TECHNE program.'),(58182,'Brunetto-sensei, Koko ni Oide deshita ka?',240,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1630/141508.jpg','movie','2021-10-31','finished_airing','Dante \"The Divine Comedy\" The Inferno, Canto XV, Circle Seven, Round Three In this circle of Hell, homosexuals are being tortured for violating the order of nature. It is here that Dante finds his mentor, Ser Brunetto Latino. Fast forward 700 years to a fictional modern Japan where Dante the cat is a university student. His town has put a ban on alcohol.\n\n(Source: Official website)'),(58184,'Kasabuta',540,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1458/141510.jpg','movie','2014','finished_airing','Student work by Honami Yano.'),(58185,'Midareuchi',975,67.1,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1263/150010.webp','ova','2024-04-26','currently_airing','Kitamura Kaori is the president of her school\'s tennis club. There\'s a tennis tournament coming up soon, but one of her juniors, Sasaki Ami, has been missing from all of the training sessions lately. Out of concern, Kaori wants to pay her a visit. When she arrives at Ami\'s, Kaori rings her doorbell, but Ami is just about to have fun with a man. She doesn\'t like the presidents since she\'s never been able to beat her, so Ami lets Kaori in and Kaori sees her sleeping with a man. Kaori is overwhelmed and asks what that is about, but suddenly the man makes his way in her direction. What is happening?'),(58196,'Koneko no Chi: Ponponraa Natsuyasumi',720,64.7,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1800/143647.jpg','ona','2024-07-19','finished_airing','Sequel to Koneko no Chi: Ponponra Dairyokou.'),(58197,'Nyaight of the Living Cat',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1071/146842.jpg','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','A virus spreads across the world, transforming all humankind into wild, slavering, furry beasts: cats, to be precise. Those few survivors who remain human take refuge in the dark corners of the earth as they fight back against the feline horde. Kunagi, a man with no memory of his past yet a deep knowledge of cats, struggles to hold on with only his wits and a will to survive. Yet the virus transmits merely through cuddles, and Kunagi finds kitties so hard to resist! Is his willpower strong enough to withstand this hair-raising cat-tastrophe?\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)'),(58198,'Jintian Kaishi Zuo Mingxing: Tianshi Qingge',5340,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1158/141557.jpg','ona','2021-08-03','finished_airing','Recap of Jintian Kaishi Zuo Mingxing.'),(58199,'Yoru wa Neko to Issho Season 3',120,67.2,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1241/144618.webp','ona','2024-12-04','currently_airing','Third season of Yoru wa Neko to Issho.'),(58201,'Nintama Rantarou Movie: Dokutake Ninja Tai Saikyou no Gunshi',5400,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1107/145856.jpg','movie','2024-12-20','finished_airing',''),(58205,'Eri',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1098/141579.jpg','movie','','not_yet_aired','Eri, a Holstein cow, lives in a mountain ranch enclosed by a fence. One day, Jersey cows arrive from the outside. Among them is Sou, with whom Eri falls madly in love at first sight.  In order to refine her feeling of love for Sou, Eri submits herself to various trials.\n\n(Source: Miyu Productions)'),(58211,'Phase Connect Nihon Jouriku!! Phase KALEiDO Debut!',103,62.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1419/141587.jpg','pv','2024-01-24','finished_airing','PV for Phase Connect\'s new Japanese branch of VTubers.'),(58213,'Dino!',1500,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1058/141588.jpg','movie','2020','finished_airing','The boy and his friend Dino the crocodile continued their journey to find the lost crown. A tapir is chasing them.'),(58215,'NocturnaL',1355,65.8,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1457/141593.webp','ova','2024-04-05','finished_airing','Sayoko Miyamura is an exemplary student, well-liked among her peers, and often the center of attention in social settings. One evening, as she walks home alone at night, Eto, who harbors feelings for her, witnesses her being pursued by a group of men. Despite his initial reluctance to intervene, he musters up the courage to grab her arm and save her from danger. However, upon closer inspection, he realizes that this version of Sayoko is vastly different from the one he knows from school. This new persona, known as \'Yoko,\' possesses a rebellious demeanor, a foul mouth, and an insatiable sexual desire.'),(58216,'Übel Blatt',1420,62.800000000000004,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1647/146961.jpg','tv','2025-01-11','finished_airing','Once admired as the strongest swordsman of the empire, Ascheriit is betrayed and brutally killed by seven of his brothers-in-arms after defeating the evil forces of Wischtech. Twenty years later, Ascheriit\'s name has fallen into infamy while his murderers are now admired everywhere and dubbed as the Seven Heroes.\n \nHowever, Ascheriit returns from the dead as a half-elf named Köinzell with only one goal in mind: to take revenge on his old companions. Soon joined by new allies who share his thirst for justice, Köinzell will stop at nothing to expose the crimes of the Seven Heroes and find ultimate solace.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58217,'Atarashii wo Uchi ni Chu',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1442/141596.webp','movie','','not_yet_aired','Why do people live with cats at home? A short animation that explores and reconsiders the expectations and anxieties of living at home with a cat from the perspectives of a child and an adult.\n\n(Source: Au Praxinoscope, translated)'),(58219,'Yonde Yobarete',134,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1546/141599.jpg','movie','2020','finished_airing','Graduate Work 2020 by Miho Takahashi, Tama Art University.'),(58220,'Tsui no Hane',288,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1902/141600.webp','movie','2021','finished_airing','Graduate Work 2021 by Tomoka Hiroshige, Tama Art University.'),(58222,'Given Movie 3: Umi e',4800,84,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1663/144261.webp','movie','2024-09-20','finished_airing','Second part of Given Movie: Hiiragi Mix.'),(58224,'Ore dake Level Up na Ken: How to Get Stronger',1417,62.400000000000006,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1043/141605.webp','tv_special','2024-02-25','finished_airing','Recap of the first seven episodes of Ore dake Level Up na Ken.'),(58226,'Bucchigiri?! Yomigaeru! Konya wa Bucchii Back to the Chuuka!',1429,56.8,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1607/141611.jpg','tv_special','2024-02-24','finished_airing','Recap of the first six episodes of Bucchigiri?!.'),(58229,'Harutsugeuo to Fuuraibou',300,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1825/141613.jpg','tv_special','2024-02-16','finished_airing','A little covetous breeze makes a pretty melody blowing in the wind. The story of a mysterious journey of tiny creatures intertwine through the hommono wilderness.\n\n(Source: Tecarat)'),(58230,'Natsumatsuri',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1458/141614.webp','movie','','not_yet_aired','A girl moves to a certain town and goes to a summer festival in the neighborhood with her grandmother. As she was excited by the lively people and the unfamiliar food stalls, she suddenly lost sight of her grandmother.\n\n(Source: Au Praxinoscope, translated)'),(58238,'Seijuu Kirin Creative Relay',45,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1968/141624.webp','cm','2019-11-26','finished_airing','Four short advertisements made for the Kirin Company.\n\n1) 聖獣麒麟クリエイティブリレー#1/ シシヤマザキ\n2) 聖獣麒麟クリエイティブリレー#2/ 菅俊一\n3) 聖獣麒麟クリエイティブリレー#3/ 冠木佐和子\n4) 聖獣麒麟クリエイティブリレー#4/ 久野遥子'),(58240,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Christmas da! Minna Atsumare',1564,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1042/141626.jpg','ova','1995-11-01','finished_airing','Christmas has come again, and Anpanman and his friends have all gathered to prepare for some kind of grand effort, but Baikinman, without even knowing the details, will do everything he can to get in the way!'),(58242,'Tsuma wo Dousoukai ni Ikasetara',990,64.6,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1855/141639.webp','ova','2024-06-07','finished_airing','Yuri, a married woman, attends a class reunion despite her husband\'s concerns. There, she reunites with her ex-boyfriend Tatsuhiko. While Tatsuhiko continues to drink and show romantic interest in Yuri, she worries about his well-being due to his careless behavior and lack of alcohol control. Despite her concern, Yuri accompanies him to the bathroom when he feels unwell, but Tatsuhiko takes the opportunity to try to seduce her. Tatsuhiko had been pretending to be drunk to be alone with Yuri.'),(58247,'Pokemaze CM',30,56,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1196/141662.jpg','cm','2024-02-27','finished_airing','An animated commercial for Pokemon Café ReMix.'),(58248,'Pokemon Masters EX: 4.5-shuunen wo Kinen Shita Buddies ga Toujou!',94,59.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1499/141663.jpg','pv','2024-02-27','finished_airing','A promotional video to celebrate 4.5 years of Pokemon Masters EX.'),(58259,'Douse, Koishite Shimaunda.',1455,60.8,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1021/146952.jpg','tv','2025-01-10','finished_airing','Aspiring manga artist Mizuho Nishino has grown alongside her four childhood friends: Kizuki Hazawa, Shuugo Hoshikawa, Shin Kashiwagi, and Airu Izumi. But on Mizuho\'s 17th birthday, Kizuki suddenly asks to be her boyfriend. Having no previous experience with romance, Mizuho brushes it off easily, but Kizuki is genuine and intends to win her heart.\n\nKizuki no longer hides his affections, and Mizuho hesitates, worried about the consequences their potential relationship could have on their whole friend group. As Mizuho works through the confusion of youth, it seems that the other three boys have fallen for her as well—and she must find a way to sort her feelings out without shattering the close-knit group she holds dear.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58260,'Neko no Maneko',300,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1460/141682.jpg','tv_special','2019-01-25','finished_airing','His charm points are the leaves on his head and his proud tail that moves around. Maneko is a cat who loves imitating his friends. Who will you imitate today?\n\n(Source: NHK, translated)'),(58261,'Puppu to Pappa',300,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1056/141683.jpg','tv_special','2021-03-24','currently_airing','Puppu and Pappa live in a big strange tree and love to have fun.\n\n(Source: NHK, translated)'),(58262,'Oishiku Tsukurou! Puchipuchi Dance',300,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1488/141684.jpg','tv_special','2015-12-31','finished_airing','A story about a meerkat cook who comes to Eddie\'s town.\n\n(Source: Studio Placebo, translated)'),(58263,'Eto Eto Setora',300,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1981/141685.webp','tv_special','2021-01-01','finished_airing','The unique superstars of the zodiac have arrived aboard the \"Eto Eto Setora.\"\n\n(Source: NHK, translated)'),(58265,'Babanbabanban Vampire',1390,65.8,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1221/146649.jpg','tv','2025-01-11','finished_airing','A decade ago, 450-year-old vampire Ranmaru Mori was saved from the brink of death by Rihito Tatsuno, a young and innocent boy. Ever since then, Ranmaru has been working at the Tatsuno family\'s bathhouse with a secret: he wants a taste of Rihito\'s virgin blood as soon as he turns 18. However, his plan is threatened when Rihito falls in love with a girl on his first day of high school.\n\nJealous and scared that Rihito\'s pureness will be ruined, Ranmaru begins to lurk in the shadows to protect him from any harm. During his operation, the vampire must keep his real identity hidden and make sure his target\'s virginity remains unsullied.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58267,'Hanakappa Special: Bokura no Daibouken',1800,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1156/141691.jpg','tv_special','2012-03-23','finished_airing','An adult member of the Kappa tribe has contracted a legendary disease that causes the flowers on his head to stop blooming. To fix it, it is said that pollen from the Papon flower, which blooms only on Papon Island, located at the end of the eastern sea, is needed. In order to help the adults, Hanakappa and his friends set off for Papon Island.'),(58271,'Honey Lemon Soda',1375,71.8,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1382/144602.webp','tv','2025-01-09','finished_airing','First-year high school student Uka Ishimori wants a fresh start. In middle school, Uka was given the nickname \"Rocky\" by her peers, being misunderstood as having no emotions when she was actually shy and introverted. As a result, Uka was relentlessly bullied and experienced a lonely, isolated school life. Now, Uka is determined to change.\n\nDuring the first week of school, Uka accidentally gets drenched in lemon soda by her classmate Kai Miura—whose cool personality is the complete opposite of hers. After the incident, Uka is surprised when Kai performs small acts of kindness for her, encouraging her to gradually break out of her shell. Like a lemon soda, bubbly and exciting feelings are beginning to stir.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58272,'Boku no Tsuma wa Kanjou ga Nai',1420,67.6,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1101/143646.jpg','tv','2024-07-02','finished_airing','Takuma Kosugi is an office worker who does not have enough time to take care of everything at home. To make his daily life easier, he purchases a secondhand housekeeping robot named Mina, who quickly proves her worth. One day, after returning from work and having one too many beers, Takuma somewhat jokingly blurts out that she should become his wife! Much to his surprise, Mina takes his words seriously, and the two gradually begin living as if they are married.\n\nAs the days go by, Takuma and Mina grow closer and start doing more activities together, like going on a picnic and spending a day at the beach. However, much of society still considers human-robot relationships unusual. The couple must figure out if their arrangement can succeed and how to convince the people around them of their sincerity.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58274,'Hana (2018)',176,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1027/141708.jpg','movie','2018','finished_airing','A boy born in a pitch-dark place surrounded by lush grassland sets out on a journey in search of his final destination.\n\n(Source: Official Site, translated)'),(58275,'Duel Masters LOST: Tsuioku no Suishou',1456,64.3,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1711/150099.webp','ona','2024-10-04','finished_airing','One day, mysterious incidents occur frequently in Shinjuku City, Tokyo, where people\'s have suddenly disappeared. Half a year ago, Win Kirifuda, who woke up in this town, had lost all his memories. In his high school and part-time job he started attending on a whim, he couldn\'t fit in with those around him. He spent his days feeling frustrated, hanging out in the park at night with classmates such as Niika. Such daily life transforms with the appearance of Crysta, a mysterious transfer student who claims to \"know everything about Win.\" She says that they are engaged, but a dubious presence lurks behind her. What is the truth behind the frequent mysterious incidents? What is Crystas\'s sudden goal? And what about Win\'s hidden past? A new story begins to recover the lost memories.\n\n(Source: Duel Masters Wiki)'),(58278,'Kyonyuu Onna Shikan Sennou Saimin',980,64,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1954/141722.webp','ova','2024-05-31','finished_airing','The battleship Chevalier sailed through space under the command of the experienced Captain Maria. The management sent an order to cut down inefficient crew members, and the stern woman carried it out. At the same time, her assistants began to complain of strange memory lapses. Then the large-sized Madame Empire began to investigate. The determined and heavy pounding of her heels echoed through the compartments. She entered Aaron\'s technician\'s quarters, and there.....'),(58279,'Nintama Rantarou: Ninjutsu Gakuen Nyuugaku Annai no Dan',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1944/141725.jpg','tv_special','2017-11-03','finished_airing','People who wants to entroll into Ninjutsu Academy, gather now! Rantarou, Kirimaru, Shinbei and their friends present the glamor of Ninjutsu Academy as a commemoration of the 25th anniversary of the  Nintama Rantarou TV anime.\n\n(Source: Nintama Rantarou Wiki)'),(58280,'Nintama Rantarou: 100% Yuuki! Dokutake Dejiro wo Yattsukero no Dan',1800,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1349/141775.jpg','tv_special','2022-05-04','finished_airing','Rantarou, Kirimaru, Shinbei and the others were taking a walk when they found a beautiful field. Due to a sudden idea from the school principal, everyone at the Ninjutsu Academy decides to go on a field trip, not knowing it\'s all part of the terrifying plan of the Dokutake ninjas.'),(58281,'Enomoto The Animation',1200,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1173/141727.jpg','ova','2022-09-07','finished_airing','An anime film of Shunji Enomoto\'s legendary short-gag manga.'),(58288,'\"Pokemon Shirt Sizing\" Concept Movie',91,58,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1206/141774.jpg','pv','2022-11-04','finished_airing','From \"Pokemon shirts\" made by freely combining Pokemon patterns, \"Pokemon shirt sizing\", a body measurement service using a smartphone, is now available! A concept movie is now available to help you understand more about the service!\n\nA certain trainer tries to measure Pikachu in order to give him a shirt, but it seems like he\'s having a hard time.\nAt the end of the video, the secret of the \"Pokemon shirt\" logo is revealed?\n\nPlease pay attention to Pikachu\'s cute behavior.\n\n(Source: Pokemon official YouTube channel; translated)'),(58295,'Bai Jia Jue Zhi: Jianghu Gui Shi Lu',1150,0,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1811/141776.jpg','ona','2024-03-03','finished_airing','In the future city, science and robots have become necessities in people\'s lives. The research, development and use of technology maintain a delicate balance between the scientific ethics committee, the technology chaebol, and the third-party security system company Mosh. Wang Xiaoyun, the only son of the Wang Group, was assassinated by an illegal robot while he was out hunting. Everyone in his entourage was spared. The balance of power has been broken, and the undercurrent is surging. \n\nBai Wuxie, captain of the 24th Operation Team in charge of public security, found Zhang Bingyi and Shang Weiyang, consultants who are good at mechanical networks, to assist in the investigation. After several on-site investigations, it was discovered that the murderer turned out to be a product of the \"robot oligarchy\" Aibozer Company. \n\nAt the same time, Mosh also encountered a security crisis, and everything seemed to be driven by someone behind the scenes. Zhang Bingyi, Bai Wuxie and Mo Shangshuang from Mosh Company were forced to form a special operations team to find out the truth behind the scenes.\n\n(Source: iQIYI, translated)'),(58297,'Yumiui Sepodeul',5580,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1099/141778.jpg','movie','2024-04-02','finished_airing',''),(58302,'The iDOLM@STER Shiny Colors 2nd Season',1440,63.2,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1978/145055.webp','tv','2024-10-05','finished_airing','Following the success of Shiny Colors\' first concert, Mano Sakuragi and her friends continue to face new challenges. After Straylight, a new unit of 283 Production, makes its debut concert, the members of the units are temporarily shuffled into new groups to prepare for a Halloween event to help them grow individually as idols.\n\nWhile Mano struggles to express her ideas, her fellow unit member Hiori Kazano feels left out by her new comrades\' talent. At the same time, Fuyuko Mayuzumi, who has bitterly failed to become Straylight\'s center, proves completely unable to show her real personality, jeopardizing the entire project in the process. Shiny Colors\' producer will have to find a way for Fuyuko to break out of her shell if he wants to see his idol units illuminate the world once more.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58307,'One Piece x Kawaisouni: Kono Boushi wo Omae ni Azukeru',100,57.400000000000006,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1548/141799.jpg','pv','2024-03-04','finished_airing','Collaboration with creator \"Poor\" who is very popular on SNS with a unique world view. The new PV has been released.\n\n(Source: Official YouTube Channel)'),(58308,'Hakofugu to Minamata no Umi',1120,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1661/141807.jpg','special','2024-03-02','finished_airing','Based on a picture book titled Hakofugu no Negai (The Wish of the Boxfish) by Sakana-kun, the story is about the main character, Hakofugu, who is unsure of himself, who meets Himetatsu, a lost child, and together they begin their adventure to the \"Sea of Minamata\".\n\n(Source: Patreon)'),(58318,'Pop Pop City',641,68.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1373/141821.jpg','ona','2024-03-22','finished_airing','The night of a family birthday party. The mother is tired from work and wants to drink a beer as soon as possible. The father is fidgety and keeps an eye on the clock. A little girl is excited about the sumptuous meal and runs around the house. The intercom rings. There, a \"new family member\" is standing there...\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(58319,'Bridge: My Little Friends',570,65.4,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1121/141822.jpg','ona','2024-03-22','finished_airing','\"I\'ll let you meet Shiro. I promise!\" Jin the cat promised Mugi, who was grieving over the loss of his beloved dog Shiro. Jin loves Mugi very much, and after hearing the story of the Rainbow Bridge from his owner Kageyama, he decided to let Mugi meet Shiro at the end of the rainbow! Will Jin be able to save Mugi from her sadness? He invites the pigeons and squirrels from the neighborhood, and now Jin\'s big plan begins!\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(58320,'Kicks And Punk',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1709/141823.webp','ona','2024-03-22','finished_airing','\"Let\'s go. In search of treasure\"\nNike, a punky outsider girl, runs through the city of the future! In a city where the transportation infrastructure has developed dramatically and walking is no longer necessary, Nike runs alone in her favorite sneakers. Her goal is to get sneakers from the legendary manufacturer \"Dynameros\", which can only be obtained on the black market. As Nike runs despite being chased by a horde of cyber police, a woman appears in front of her. That woman is none other than Sherry, the daughter of the president of \"Fractal Walter\", a major company that created the era. What kind of story will the encounter between these two opposing people produce?\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(58321,'Ephemere',605,65.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1993/141824.webp','ona','2024-03-22','finished_airing','Uta, who works and lives in a hotel on Uranus, has always thought that she is different from other people. Whenever she has free time, she sits in front of her computer making things she likes and enjoys herself alone, or goes to cafes alone. One day, she receives a \"Future Ticket\" - the key to a new life. Despite this, Uta continues to live her life as she always has. However, as the \"Star Festival\", a festival to commemorate the closest point between Uranus and Neptune, approaches, she meets Paula, a popular influencer from Neptune whom she admires. After becoming close to her, Uta makes a major decision about her life.\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(58322,'Huang Pi: Tian Jiang Caishen Mao',4920,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1522/141825.jpg','movie','2024-02-10','finished_airing',''),(58323,'Ba Bi Na Zha Cheng de Chuanshuo',4980,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1167/141826.jpg','movie','2024-02-23','finished_airing',''),(58325,'Xiao Lu He Xiao Lan 5th Season',501,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1878/146569.webp','ona','2024-03-13','finished_airing',''),(58331,'Mizuki Shigeru no Youkai Ehon Yose',300,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1858/141837.webp','tv_special','2021-12-24','finished_airing',''),(58332,'Mother Goose Ehon',300,0,5,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1437/141838.jpg','tv_special','2019-12-23','finished_airing',''),(58333,'Uji ni wa Monogatari ga Aru',390,67.1,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1585/145679.jpg','ona','2024-03-09','finished_airing','The protagonist visits Uji and tours the town, which has been shaped by the accumulation of history and culture from various eras, including the Heian period.\n\n(Source: Official Site)'),(58339,'Sucre Town Terminal PV',161,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1443/146693.jpg','pv','2012-10-17','finished_airing','Cinnamon, who traveled all over the world with the \"Trette Cinnamon Photo Festa\", will deliver fun music from all over the world together with the OSTER project.\n\nLet\'s travel around the world with Cinnamon and friends!\n\n(Source: Sanrio Official YouTube Channel, translated)'),(58342,'Mofu☆Mofu: Happy ni Naru Mahou',325,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1196/141845.jpg','special','2008','finished_airing','A short musical animation about the fluffy alien Moffu and the twin sisters Meru and Miru.\n\n(Source: Official YouTube; translated and edited)'),(58344,'11-piki no Neko Marathon Taikai',300,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1542/141850.jpg','tv_special','2012-02-14','finished_airing',''),(58345,'Mizuki Shigeru no Youkai Ehon',300,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1007/141851.jpg','tv_special','2017-06-09','finished_airing',''),(58346,'Mizuki Shigeru no Youkai Ehon: Shokoku Manyuu-hen',300,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1489/141852.webp','tv_special','2021-12-20','finished_airing',''),(58351,'Chibi Godzilla no Gyakushuu 2nd Season',120,66.5,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1568/150146.jpg','tv','2024-04-03','finished_airing','Sequel to Chibi Godzilla no Gyakushuu.'),(58357,'Tensui no Sakuna-hime',1450,67.30000000000001,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1888/143803.jpg','tv','2024-07-06','finished_airing','Spoiled harvest goddess Sakuna finds herself banished from her opulent celestial home to an island overrun with demons. In the untamed wilderness, she must rediscover her birthright as the daughter of a warrior god and harvest goddess by weathering the elements, fighting monsters, and cultivating rice, the source of her power. By her side in this forbidding place is her guardian Tama and a group of outcast humans. Together, these unlikely companions must join hands to tame both the soil and the demons of Hinoe Island. \n\n(Source: Steam)'),(58359,'Isshun de Chiryou shiteita noni Yakutatazu to Tsuihou sareta Tensai Chiyushi, Yami Healer toshite Tanoshiku Ikiru',1440,64.9,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1211/147335.webp','tv','2025-04-03','currently_airing','Life hasn\'t been kind to Zenos. He was born in the slums, and his dirt-poor background has denied him almost every opportunity. After an encounter with a healer, he throws himself into studying to become one and finally catches a break when an adventurer invites Zenos into his party. Zenos is thrilled—so thrilled, in fact, that he\'s willing to put up with his teammates treating him like garbage. They fail to appreciate his talents and ultimately kick him to the curb, claiming he\'s outlived his usefulness to them.\n\nNow bereft of money and out of options, Zenos decides to put his self-taught skills to use elsewhere and opens an underground clinic. Word quickly spreads about the brilliant healer working incredible magic in the city\'s shadowy underbelly. Even the royal palace is taking notice...\n\nCan Zenos buck the odds and carve out a life for himself in a world that\'s spit in his face? And can he save the lives of the patients who wind up on his doorstep in the process?\n\n(Source: J-Novel Club)'),(58367,'Nira-chan Shuuketsu',35,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1430/141922.jpg','cm','2024-02-22','finished_airing','For the first time in history, the four Nira-chan who appear in the past ZUTOMAYO MVs gathered together in the same world wearing Nike Air Max while listening to the popular song \"Obenkyou Shitoite yo\" (Study Me). Nira-chan running through with maximum individuality.\n\n(Source: ABCMART Official YouTube Channel, translated)'),(58368,'Ore no 1-shuukan',70,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1118/141920.webp','ona','2021-02-18','finished_airing','The daily life of artist Onkun Suko.'),(58369,'Kanojo, Okarishimasu 3rd Season: Kanokari Call',60,61.1,25,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1962/141902.webp','special','2023-11-29','finished_airing','A short type of picture dramas released with blu-ray volumes 1-2 of Kanojo, Okarishimasu 3rd Season.'),(58375,'Xiong Chumo: Quaishou Jihua 2',720,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1046/141915.jpg','tv','2022-08-12','finished_airing',''),(58376,'Xiong Chumo: Xiao Xiao Shijie',740,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1329/141916.jpg','tv','2024-03-08','finished_airing',''),(58377,'Xiong Chumo: Xiongxiong Leyuan 4',740,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1262/141917.jpg','tv','2021-07-15','finished_airing',''),(58379,'Larva in Mars',180,0,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1292/141918.jpg','tv','2024-01-13','finished_airing',''),(58380,'Cinnamon Anime Damon',30,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1326/141921.webp','ona','2023-03-03','currently_airing','A series of shorts featuring Cinnamoroll.'),(58382,'Shigotoba Series',300,0,17,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1344/141926.jpg','tv_special','2015-07-20','finished_airing',''),(58383,'Iikara Iikara',300,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1267/141927.jpg','tv_special','2008-02-26','finished_airing',''),(58384,'Pekay to Gaako',300,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1441/141928.webp','tv_special','2013-06-17','finished_airing',''),(58390,'Yofukashi no Uta Season 2',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1509/148453.webp','tv','2025-07-04','not_yet_aired','Second season of Yofukashi no Uta'),(58395,'Neko ni Tensei shita Ojisan',84,62,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1562/149986.jpg','tv','2024-10-07','currently_airing','Once an average office worker, an old man finds himself reincarnated as a sweet little cat named Pun-chan. Unsure of how he got into this position, he tries to find his way around in his new body. However, the cat soon runs into familiar faces—including his former boss, who quickly becomes fond of him. Regardless, there does not seem to be a dull day ahead for Pun-chan as he learns to adapt to his new life.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58426,'Shikanoko Nokonoko Koshitantan',1415,69.9,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1094/143324.webp','tv','2024-07-07','finished_airing','Torako Koshi is the epitome of perfection. With her peerless beauty, top-notch grades, and position as student council president, her popularity in school is unrivaled. However, she harbors a dark secret—she was a delinquent back in middle school—and this is something she conceals to the best of her abilities.\n\nUnfortunately, when she meets the mysterious deer girl Noko Shikanoko, Torako\'s hidden shame is constantly on the precipice of being exposed due to Shikanoko\'s rather weird antics. To maintain the reputation she worked so hard for, Torako must go along with Shikanoko\'s whims, even going so far as to become president of the newly established Deer Club. All her efforts will be rewarded if she can prevent the menacing doe from accidentally blurting out damaging details about her personal history that will undoubtedly unleash Torako\'s greatest nightmare.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58429,'Pig Movie Butaodor',33,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1307/142006.webp','movie','2001','finished_airing','A little pig wearing earphones dances!'),(58436,'Tamagotchi Short Anime',120,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1857/147445.jpg','ona','2024-03-01','finished_airing','A short series focusing on the lives of Tamagotchi and their caretakers.'),(58437,'Botsuraku Yotei no Kizoku dakedo, Hima Datta kara Mahou wo Kiwametemita',1430,60.7,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1245/147612.webp','tv','2025-01-07','finished_airing','What\'s a guy to do when his life suddenly changes while innocently enjoying a nice, cold drink after work? And I mean really changes. This middle-aged commoner now finds himself in the body of Liam Hamilton, the young son of a noble house teetering on the brink of collapse. Between his fervidly desperate father and his utterly apathetic brothers, the only bright side to his new situation is that Liam can finally try learning magic like he\'s always wanted. Little does he know his hobby of choice may be about to turn his life upside-down yet again! Will Liam be able to master the craft of magic? And will it be enough to save him from the shadow looming over his family...?\n\n(Source: J-Novel Club)'),(58439,'Pokemon Go CMs',30,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1466/145588.jpg','cm','2018-10-09','currently_airing','Animated commercials for Pokemon Go.'),(58445,'Sayounara Ryuusei, Konnichiwa Jinsei',1450,63.4,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1225/144606.webp','tv','2024-10-11','finished_airing','Long ago, a human managed to defeat the oldest, most powerful dragon of them all. This dragon was so strong that even the gods feared it, but it accepted its end all alone. Then, suddenly, the dragon woke up in a new life as a guy named Dolan, living in a faraway village.\n\nLiving as a regular person now, Dolan works hard in the fields and hunts for food. Even though life in the village is simple, it\'s also cozy and makes him happy in ways he never felt as a dragon.\n\nBut one day, while exploring a swamp, Dolan meets Celina, a creature who\'s part human and part snake called a lamia. She\'s looking for a partner but admits she\'s not great at getting humans to like her because she\'s part snake. Despite their differences, Dolan and Cerina start to become friends. However, they face lots of challenges from outside forces.\n\nJoin them on a magical adventure as a once-mighty dragon begins a new life in a quiet corner of the world!\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(58447,'Shibuya♡Hachi',120,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1084/142078.jpg','tv','2024-04-06','finished_airing','In the anime, Hachi has been watching over the city as the symbol of Shibuya station\'s loyal dog Hachiko statue. Hachi begins to move in present day Shibuya, spending a relaxed and fun daily life with his cheerful friends.\n\n(Source: ANN)'),(58448,'Yong Sheng: Qizhuang Shanhe',1174,75.7,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1586/142081.webp','ona','2024-04-19','finished_airing','How can the hero Fang Han use his own strength to traverse the vast fantastical world? By clinging to an unwavering refusal to accept defeat, he cracked the code of supernatural abilities and transformed his mortal body into an immortal one. Fang Han will reveal a new and prosperous world filled with immortals, demons, and mortals, along with countless innovative magic weapons. In addition, Fang Han will encounter conflicts between immortals and demons, love and hate. It will eventually lead to success.\n\n(Source: bilibili)'),(58449,'Suki demo Kirai na Amanojaku',6135,68.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1698/142716.webp','movie','2024-05-24','finished_airing','Suki demo Kirai na Amanojaku tells the story of Hiiragi Yatsuse, a first-year high school student who struggles to make friends despite his efforts to please others. His life takes an unexpected turn when one summer day, he meets Tsumugi, an oni (demon) girl on a quest to find her mother in the human world. Snow mysteriously begins to fall... and their adventure begins. \n\n(Source: Netflix, edited)'),(58460,'Nissin x Matsuo no Anime',30,0,5,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1054/145664.webp','cm','2021-04-07','finished_airing','Collaboration commercials between Nissin and Matsuo no Anime to promote their food products.'),(58462,'Wonderful Precure! Movie: Dokidoki Game no Sekai de Daibouken!',4380,65.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1488/143721.jpg','movie','2024-09-13','finished_airing','Komugi, Iroha, Yuki, Mayu, Daifuku, and Satoru have gathered to play the super popular game \"Doki Doki♡TanuKingdom\"! Everyone starts the game happily! Or so they thought...but it seems they\'ve been sucked into a world of the game with a suspicious tanuki...and now they\'re in even more trouble! Komugi has been separated from Iroha and the others...!?\n\n\"I want to be by Iroha\'s side forever and ever!\" To meet her beloved Iroha, Komugi decides to challenge herself to various game battles!\n\nHow on earth did this happen...? What is the secret hidden in the world of the game...? The clue is in the hands of Natsuki, the young girl who created the game.\n\n\"Hirogaru Sky! Pretty Cure\" and \"Mahou Tsukai Pretty Cure!\" have also gathered together! When everyone\'s feelings come together, will a wonderful miracle unfold?!\n\n(Source: Pretty Cure Wiki)'),(58463,'Kumarba',110,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1509/150111.jpg','tv','2024-04-06','finished_airing','Kumarva is having fun watching videos today with his partner Tavris. One day, they suddenly receive an SOS from a friend on the Internet world. \"Many viruses have arrived! Help Kumarva!\" In order to save their friend from a crisis, Kumarva jump into the world of the internet!\n\n(Source: Official Site, translated)'),(58473,'S-Rank Monster no \"Behemoth\" dakedo, Neko to Machigawarete Elf Musume no Pet toshite Kurashitemasu',1422,57.800000000000004,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1656/146916.webp','tv','2025-01-04','finished_airing','Nobody asked to be a cat!\n\nAfter dying in a fight against the forces of evil, a knight is shocked to discover that instead of being reborn as a hero of humanity, he starts his new life as a behemoth-one of the most powerful monsters in the world! The only problem is that a baby behemoth looks an awful lot like...an adorable house cat?! Things grow even more confusing when a beautiful elf adventurer rescues him from the brink of death rather than finishing him off. This house-cat-slash-knight\'s baffling journey is just getting started...\n\n(Source: Yen Press)'),(58476,'Fanpai Chushihua',1080,71.3,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1025/142135.jpg','ona','2024-04-16','finished_airing','The super villain Ling Chen (alias Penrose) accidentally traveled back to 2030 during a fierce battle with his arch-enemy superhero Ye Mu. At this time, he was not the feared Penrose, but an ordinary high school student Ling Chen. Before unfortunate events could happen again, Ling Chen decided to do his best to protect the people around him and prevent the tragedy from happening again!\n\n(Source: bilibili)'),(58483,'Ben Yue Fu Yan',288,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1600/142152.webp','ona','2023-03-21','finished_airing',''),(58484,'Ishura 2nd Season',1425,72.1,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1699/146979.webp','tv','2025-01-08','finished_airing','Second season of Ishura.'),(58487,'Xuwu Bianjing',1320,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1681/142158.jpg','ona','2024-04-10','finished_airing','Nihility is the world\'s greatest catastrophe. Humans can only unite their allies against \"blessers\", monsters from the world of nihility. Shazhou, the continental border, becomes an important line of defense against invaders. A dark force called \"Shadow of Blessing\" is looking for the power that has been sealed. Dark Island, the leading state of the human alliance, sends White Wolf Yujia to destroy the dark force. But a mysterious girl called Coral from the world of nihility causes a storm in Shazhou. The red thread of fate connects everyone holding the belief of uncovering the historical truth hidden in nihility. The girl is fighting against her fate beyond her belief, and a romantic legend officially begins.\n\n(Source: bilibili Youtube)'),(58488,'Sengoku Youko: Senma Konton-hen',1430,75.9,22,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1948/143550.jpg','tv','2024-07-18','finished_airing','The chaotic aftermath of a confrontation between Jinka Yamato and Yazen results in the power dynamics between the magically gifted katawara and humans being turned upside down. As the news of the downfall of dangaishu—the katawara-hunting monks led by Yazen—spreads across the country, rogue groups of katawara start to form, worsening the already-fragile relationship between them and humanity.\n\nHaving lost faith in his abilities, Shinsuke Hyoudou now spends his time heavily drinking in the company of Senya, a former enemy of his who controls one thousand katawara within his body. Senya indirectly causes the death of the father of Tsukiko, his newfound friend, after a surprise attack of a local god gone berserk.\n\nDespite the circumstances, Tsukiko holds no grudge against Senya and is determined to become Shinsuke\'s disciple no matter what. Although Shinsuke refuses to become Tsukiko\'s sword instructor, he reluctantly agrees to let her travel with him and Senya. While the unlikely trio heads towards their next destination, Tama Youko continues her journey to find the trail of Jinka, the nine-tailed fox who has the power to destroy the world.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58490,'Shen Zhiyi Jiao',780,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1137/142165.jpg','ona','2024-04-08','finished_airing','This is a story about Pin Xiang, a senior high school student born with potential and good at insignificant skills, and how he strives to become a super soccer hero.\n\n(Source: bilibili)'),(58491,'Ganbatte Ikimasshoi',5700,63.9,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1663/144309.webp','movie','2024-10-25','finished_airing','Set in Matsuyama City, Ehime, the movie depicts the growth and life-sized fluctuations of the hearts of high school girls who devoted their youth to the rowing club.\n\n(Source: Official Site, translated)');
INSERT INTO `anime` VALUES (58492,'Mono',1440,76.8,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1677/148603.jpg','tv','2025-04-13','currently_airing','The Photography Club is in danger of shutting down?! And the Cinema Club too?! Fret not, for they shall merge and become... Cinephoto Club! Now club members Satsuki, An, and Sakurako are asked to be the main characters for manga artist Haruno\'s latest work that\'s centered around action cameras. The girls head out to capture the lovely sights of Japan, experimenting with gadgets beyond photography and film equipment, and of course, chomping on the local delicacies along the way!\n\n(Source: Yen Press)'),(58493,'San Xiuzhi Wang',654,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1419/142176.jpg','ona','2024-04-01','finished_airing',''),(58494,'Yin Shizong Men Zhang Jiao',690,66.3,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1346/149617.jpg','ona','2024-03-23','finished_airing','Jiang Beichen traveled to a fantasy world and accidentally got the strongest master system, and established the \"Xiandao Sect\". In the early days of the sect, he had to rely on abducting the son of luck to upgrade the sect. Every day, he had to pretend to be a master and bluff a group of talented disciples who admired him. Slowly, Jiang Beichen discovered that his small sect had really become the top hidden sect!\n\n(Source: iQIYI, translated)'),(58495,'Macross Δ: Delta Toki no Meikyuu Shou Gekijou',422,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1823/142178.jpg','special','2022-09-28','finished_airing','Short episode included with Macross Delta: Zettai Live!!! Blu-ray.'),(58498,'Ipponbashi Wataru',300,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1645/142190.webp','tv_special','2013-06-12','finished_airing',''),(58499,'Dokonjo Gaeru Yanen',60,0,25,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1929/142191.jpg','ona','2024-02-22','finished_airing',''),(58502,'Zenshuu.',1435,76,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1003/146841.webp','tv','2025-01-05','finished_airing','After graduating from high school, Natsuko Hirose starts her career as an animator. Her talent quickly flourishes, and she makes her debut as a director in no time. Her first anime becomes a massive hit, sparking a social phenomenon and earning her recognition as an up-and-coming genius director. Her next project is set to be a romantic comedy movie themed around first love! However, having never been in love herself, Natsuko struggles to understand the concept of first love, and as a result, she\'s unable to create the storyboard, causing the movie production to come to a standstill. One day, she passes out while working on her storyboard and wakes up in the world of her favorite childhood anime movie \"A Tale of Perishing.\"\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)'),(58505,'Mato Seihei no Slave 2',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1668/148737.webp','tv','2026','not_yet_aired','Second season of Mato Seihei no Slave.'),(58506,'Harimaware! Koinu 2nd Season',240,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1344/143568.jpg','tv','2024-07-06','finished_airing','Second season of Harimaware! Koinu.'),(58507,'Pokemon Card wo Yattemita',30,56.6,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1117/142216.jpg','cm','2024-03-21','finished_airing','Animated commercial for the Pokemon Battle Academy starter kit.'),(58508,'Mitsuketa! Kuwassu Daisousaku Campaign',60,57,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1507/142217.jpg','pv','2024-03-21','finished_airing','Promotional video for the Mitsuketa! Kuwassu Daisousaku campaign held at the Pokemon Center.'),(58509,'Zhu Xian 2nd Season',1219,79.2,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1700/142221.jpg','ona','2024-03-30','finished_airing','Ten years have passed since the war between good and evil. Zhang Xiaofan transformed into Ghost Li and conquered all directions in the internal struggle of the demon sect. At this time, the appearance of a strange treasure in the Death Swamp caused a fight among various forces. Gui Li and Lu Xueqi reunited, and the two fell into a deeper love-hate entanglement. After Gui Li traced the disappearance of his subordinates to Fenxiang Valley, he accidentally rescued Xiaobai, the nine-tailed sky fox, and obtained clues from the ancient witch clan. Finally, after Gui Li experienced nine deaths, he finally asked the great wizard who mastered the magic of spiritualism to agree to rescue Baguio., what is the outcome of ten years of long-cherished wish...\n\n(Source: Douban)'),(58510,'Hanma Baki vs. Kengan Ashura',3606,64.2,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1477/142881.webp','ona','2024-06-06','finished_airing','A crossover anime movie between Hanma Baki and Kengan Ashura.'),(58511,'Nanatsu no Taizai: Mokushiroku no Yonkishi 2nd Season',1427,74.4,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1109/145389.webp','tv','2024-10-06','finished_airing','Second season of Nanatsu no Taizai: Mokushiroku no Yonkishi.'),(58514,'Kusuriya no Hitorigoto 2nd Season',1440,88.5,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1025/147458.jpg','tv','2025-01-10','currently_airing','Using her wit and vast knowledge of medicines and poisons alike, Maomao played a pivotal role in solving a series of mysteries and conspiracies that plagued the imperial court. Having recently come to terms with the secrets of her parents, she returns to fulfill her normal duties on behalf of the emperor\'s highest-ranking consorts. Maomao also works alongside the eunuch Jinshi to better the consorts\' many ladies-in-waiting, including helping them learn to read.\n\nHowever, with the arrival of a merchant caravan comes a new wave of intrigue. A pattern of strange coincidences involving the visitors and their wares unsettles Maomao, driving her to investigate the puzzling circumstances behind the convoy. As dangers from both outside and within threaten the balance between the imperial concubines, Maomao continues to utilize her cunning and medical expertise to keep the women safe from harm.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58515,'Kekkon Yubiwa Monogatari 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1017/142241.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Kekkon Yubiwa Monogatari.'),(58516,'Ao no Exorcist: Yuki no Hate-hen',1419,74.6,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1617/144043.webp','tv','2024-10-06','finished_airing','Demonic activity worldwide has significantly increased due to the involvement and corrupt practices of the Illuminati. To combat the unnatural influx of demons, the Vatican Headquarters decides to hold the annual Exorcist Certification Exam early and allow for as many exorcists as possible to take up the mantle.\n\nStraight from the Vatican, one of the most powerful exorcists, Lewin \"Lightning\" Light, arrives at True Cross Academy to help prepare the students for the exam. The ease and mastery with which Lewin performs exorcisms quickly impresses Ryuuji \"Bon\" Suguro, who has lost his ambition to continue his studies, and Lewin surprisingly accepts him as his apprentice. Amid the worsening situation, twin brothers Rin and Yukio Okumura are sent to locate the recently missing exorcist Shura Kirigakure, who seems to be chained to a decades-long contract with a powerful, immortal demon hiding in Aomori Prefecture\'s dangerous, snowy mountains.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58517,'Uma Musume: Pretty Derby - Road to the Top (Movie)',5880,76.39999999999999,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1421/142243.webp','movie','2024-05-10','finished_airing','Theatrical compilation of Uma Musume: Pretty Derby - Road to the Top with new scenes.'),(58518,'Sasaki to Pii-chan Season 2',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1055/145202.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Sasaki to Pii-chan.'),(58521,'Daydreamer or NiGHTTHiNKER',300,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1057/142273.jpg','ona','2023','finished_airing','Mint is a mysterious boy with two horns and blue hair. In his dreams, he always meets unique and mysterious characters and ends up having various stories with them. So, what kind of character are you waiting to have a conversation with in your dream today?\n\n(Source: U-NEXT, translated)'),(58522,'SutoPuri Movie: Hajimari no Monogatari - Strawberry School Festival!!!',4980,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1498/143396.webp','movie','2024-07-19','finished_airing','An anime movie based on the boy band Strawberry Prince.'),(58523,'Huan Chong Shi',1407,73.4,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1196/150209.webp','ona','2024-05-26','finished_airing','The young Chu Mu was plotted against and implanted with the White Nightmare by Xia Guanghan, and was taken to the Green Nightmare Island. Under the control of the Nightmare Palace, he and his soul pet Mo Xie were forced to fight bloody battles for survival, and eventually became the youngest king of the Prison Island. He became famous in front of the princess and was promoted to the Nightmare Master of Henghai. Chu Mu had some freedom and immediately returned to Gangluo City to save his family from danger. At the same time, Mo Xie\'s talent attracted Xia Guanghan\'s covetousness. Chu Mu fought again, and after a narrow victory, he was saved by his mother whom he had not seen for many years...\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(58524,'Himesama \"Goumon\" no Jikan desu 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1313/149494.webp','tv','2026-01','not_yet_aired','Second season of Himesama \"Goumon\" no Jikan desu.'),(58525,'Hodong Wangjawa Laglang Gongju',4351,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1867/142282.jpg','movie','1990','finished_airing',''),(58527,'Hodong Wangjawa Laglang Gongju (2022)',2700,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1014/142284.jpg','movie','2022-12','currently_airing',''),(58531,'High Card: The Flowers Bloom',1608,67,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1682/146129.webp','ona','2024-11-05','finished_airing','Twenty-fifth episode of High Card.'),(58535,'Ojamajo Carnival!!',116,76,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1093/142299.webp','ona','2024-03-23','finished_airing','Ojamajo Carnival!! commemorates the 25th anniversary of Ojamajo Doremi.'),(58537,'Yuanshen: Tiwate Pian Mu Jian PV - Dong Ye Yu Xi',258,77.8,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1695/142650.webp','pv','2022-07-11','finished_airing','Promotional video showcasing the aftermath of the Inazuma storyline of  Genshin Impact from the Eleven Fatui Harbingers\' side.'),(58546,'Say You to Yoasobi Animation: Ikuda Momo! Sobi-',300,0,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1639/142326.jpg','ona','2024-03-11','finished_airing','Short animation featuring Say You to Yoasobi Abema show mascot character, and the hosts voicing other characters.'),(58549,'30-sai made Doutei dato Mahoutsukai ni Nareru Rashii Movie',3600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1079/146486.webp','movie','2024-12-13','finished_airing','Compilation film for 30-sai made Doutei dato Mahoutsukai ni Nareru Rashii and will depict episodes not shown in the TV anime.'),(58551,'Hui Ming: Fenghuo San Yue',1177,71.5,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1756/142338.jpg','ona','2024-05-02','finished_airing','Zheng Shaopeng, a high school student, dozed off during a history lesson. When he awoke, he discovered that he had changed into the impoverished scholar Yang Lin and had traveled to the Danzhu Dynasty in the history textbook. Initially, Yang Lin struggled to adjust to life in the past, but when he applied contemporary ideas to create a few modest innovations, he won the villagers\' affection and eventually discovered a feeling of identity of his own.\n\nYang Lin lived through a time of both internal and exterior unrest, experiencing battles and seeing the agony of the populace. By relying on his knowledge and abilities to acquire access to the court, he eventually oversaw the Danzhu Dynasty\'s efforts to combat internal corruption and repel formidable adversaries.\n\n(Source: bilibili)'),(58554,'Jintian de Wancan Jiushi Ni',697,0,36,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1584/142340.webp','ona','2024-06-05','finished_airing','Food is the best thing in the world. It can let someone feel indescribably wonderful. The genius Mo Bai once thought that he stood at the peak of the culinary world. However, since his encounter with that person... it opened up a door to a whole new world for him!\n\n(Source: Bilibili Comics)'),(58555,'You Shou Yan 3rd Season',392,76.8,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1102/142342.webp','ona','2024-05-17','finished_airing',''),(58556,'Yuanqi Qi Shi',240,0,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1557/142343.jpg','ona','2022-07-11','finished_airing',''),(58557,'Xin Xiyou Lixian Ji',810,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1193/142344.jpg','tv','2024-01-19','finished_airing',''),(58559,'Yuanqi Qi Shi 2',420,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1820/142346.jpg','ona','2024-01-18','finished_airing',''),(58560,'Beuledeu Ibalso Movie: Selleob in Beikeolitaun',4380,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1376/142347.jpg','movie','2024-03-01','finished_airing',''),(58561,'Shanhai Chuanqi',800,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1759/142348.jpg','tv','2024-03-18','finished_airing',''),(58563,'Natsu ga Owaru made: Natsu no Owari The Animation',1003,62.199999999999996,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1303/142350.webp','ova','2024-06-28','finished_airing',''),(58564,'Sexfriend no Senpai The Animation',957,65.5,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1141/142409.webp','ova','2024-06-28','finished_airing',''),(58567,'Ore dake Level Up na Ken Season 2: Arise from the Shadow',1420,87.4,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1448/147351.jpg','tv','2025-01-05','finished_airing','Sung Jin-Woo, dubbed the weakest hunter of all mankind, grows stronger by the day with the supernatural powers he has gained. However, keeping his skills hidden becomes more difficult as dungeon-related incidents pile up around him.\n\nWhen Jin-Woo and a few other low-ranked hunters are the only survivors of a dungeon that turns out to be a bigger challenge than initially expected, he draws attention once again, and hunter guilds take an increased interest in him. Meanwhile, a strange hunter who has been lost for ten years returns with a dire warning about an upcoming catastrophic event. As the calamity looms closer, Jin-Woo must continue leveling up to make sure nothing stops him from reaching his ultimate goal—saving the life of his mother.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58569,'Kkoma Bus Tayo 7',660,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1508/142387.jpg','tv','2024-02-28','finished_airing',''),(58572,'Shangri-La Frontier: Kusoge Hunter, Kamige ni Idoman to su 2nd Season',1430,82.89999999999999,25,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1996/147601.webp','tv','2024-10-13','finished_airing','Ever since Rakurou \"Sunraku\" Hizutome started to play the extremely popular virtual reality game Shangri-La Frontier, he has truly fallen in love with it. Sunraku has quickly made a big name for himself by fighting two of the seven unique, nearly unbeatable monsters, which is unthinkable for most players. To progress the game\'s story, he sets out on an adventure with his leporine guide, Emul, to acquire a magic operation unit from an ancient workshop.\n\nThough Sunraku breezes through this quest alongside his clanmates Towa \"Arthur Pencilgon\" Amane and Kei \"OiKatzo\" Uomi, there seems to be an ulterior motive as to why the two of them decided to help Sunraku in the first place. Nevertheless, Sunraku gains valuable knowledge and allies, critical for his advancement in the game. By seeking out powerful enemies and unraveling the inner workings of the game\'s world, Sunraku may just change Shangri-La Frontier forever.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58573,'Baki-dou',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1634/142394.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Growing complacent with his title of \"World\'s Strongest Boy,\" Baki Hanma spends his days in a haze of boredom. After finally settling the feud with his demonic father Yuujirou, Baki defends his title in the Kourakuen Underground Arena while stifling yawns brought about by the ease with which he defeats his challengers. Baki\'s friends and mentors also struggle with this new peaceful stasis, completing great feats of strength training with little enthusiasm.\n\nSoon, Japan is shaken by the reveal of a long-gestating science experiment that results in the successful cloning of legendary samurai Musashi Miyamoto. The famed warrior relishes in testing his strength against Baki and the other fighting icons of Tokyo, but he struggles to assimilate with the modern era. Miyamoto clings to his ancient ideals of honor and dueling to the death, a philosophy that clashes with the more tranquil present.\n\nAs the resurrected swordsman attempts to rise to the top of this unfamiliar society by cutting through Baki\'s friends, he finds himself on a collision course with the vengeful teenager. Baki embraces this rush of excitement and meets his new rival head-on.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58575,'Hangugsa Daemoheom',1320,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1653/150227.jpg','tv','2024-03-30','finished_airing',''),(58576,'DMZ Dongmul Teuggongdae',4500,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1990/142397.jpg','movie','2024-02-14','finished_airing',''),(58577,'DoReMi Friends',620,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1854/150119.jpg','tv','2024-02-26','finished_airing',''),(58578,'Charging Topspinner BX',800,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1896/142399.jpg','tv','2024-01-27','finished_airing',''),(58586,'Kodomo Keiji Memetan',243,0,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1957/142412.jpg','tv','2015-11-08','finished_airing',''),(58592,'Tensei shitara Slime Datta Ken 3rd Season: Kanwa - Diablo Nikki',1420,67.6,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1092/142426.webp','tv_special','2024-03-31','finished_airing','Recap of Tensei Shitara Slime Datta Ken 2nd Season Part 2.'),(58600,'Ameku Takao no Suiri Karte',1510,71.5,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1096/147327.webp','tv','2025-01-02','finished_airing','Nestled away on the rooftop of Tenikai General Hospital is the unconventional Department of Investigative Pathology headed by the eccentric Dr. Takao Ameku. The tiny department, consisting of Takao and her sole resident Yuu \"Kotori\" Takanashi, treats complex cases that most other departments within the hospital cannot resolve on their own.\n\nThe mystery-obsessed Takao always tries to insert herself into cases that capture her fancy—much to the dismay of her colleagues and the police. Even if her meddling creates more problems for the hospital and those around her, none can deny the brilliance that the young department head exhibits as she weaves a diagnosis together. No matter the specialty, no case is impossible for Takao and a somewhat reluctant Takanashi to solve.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58602,'YouTuNya 2nd Season',90,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1651/142452.jpg','tv','2024-04-02','finished_airing','The second season of YouTuNya.'),(58603,'Ageo to Tim',90,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1397/142454.jpg','tv','2024-04-02','finished_airing','A planet inhabited by creatures that never see the light of day. There\'s nothing to be proud of, but that\'s okay.'),(58604,'Youkoso Ninchishou Sekai e',300,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1573/142457.jpg','tv','2022-08-14','currently_airing','Travel through the words of people with dementia by seeing how they experience the everyday and problems they face.\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(58605,'Moja to Majo (TV Special)',300,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1265/142517.webp','tv_special','2024-03-29','finished_airing','Moja is a cotton familiar that can be turned into any stuffed animal. A sewing witch uses her magical powers to sew cloth together to create a fuzzy body. I wonder what it will look like today?\n\n(Source: NHK, translated)'),(58606,'Girls & Panzer: Saishuushou Part 4 Specials',837,72.9,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1079/142459.webp','special','2024-03-27','finished_airing','Specials included with Girls & Panzer: Saishuushou Part 4 Blu-ray and DVD.'),(58607,'Rebirth ChocoReba',56,0,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1173/142460.jpg','ona','2024-03-20','finished_airing','Mini anime released on the official Rebirth YouTube channel.'),(58608,'Rokurou no Daibouken',300,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1470/142461.webp','ona','2024-04-01','finished_airing','One day, twelve amulets that protect the world are shattered. By whom? While the curse of shattered pieces is spreading to people around the world, for some reason there is only one person who is not under the curse. That is Rokuro. Rokuro sets on a journey with his big brother Goro and younger sister Nanako to save their family and eventually the world. With a magic brush that he got from a hermit, Rokuro\'s great adventure starts! \n\n(Source: Official Site)'),(58614,'Teogonia',1420,67.9,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1066/148358.jpg','tv','2025-04-12','currently_airing','In the harsh region known as the borderlands, humans must fight an endless battle against demi-human creatures that come at them relentlessly, intent on taking their land and their gods. A young boy named Kai, fighting to defend his village, sustains a life-threatening injury that causes him to regain memories from a past life. If you\'re not a guardian bearer, it\'s like you\'re playing life on hard mode... Kai\'s newfound knowledge gives him a new sense of the unfair \"rule set\" that governs the world around him. One thing is clear: For those without a god to serve as their guardian, life is a constant struggle for survival. Thus begins the epic tale of a young boy\'s ascent into a vast world filled with magic, bloodshed, and mystery.\n\n(Source: J-Novel Club)'),(58616,'Haramaseya The Animation',960,66.39999999999999,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1289/142480.jpg','ona','2024-03-22','finished_airing','Haramaseya revolves around Terada Akito, a man with \"super sperm\" capable of impregnating any woman. Akito is hired by a sperm bank to impregnate its clients, with the first being Kurumi Iijima, a woman unable to conceive due to her husband\'s azoospermia.'),(58617,'Bo & To\'s',60,0,50,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1092/142485.jpg','ona','2016','finished_airing','Mr. A is a kindhearted man who runs a coffee shop. He doesn’t have many customers but his regulars truly appreciate his coffee. He has a cat named Bori. Mr. A adopts two more street cats, Toto and Mozzi. He enjoys his new companions. Yet, at some point, the number of stray animals in the neighborhood begin to increase, and unusual things start happening.\n\n(Source: Official Site)'),(58618,'Cafe Wingcle',234,0,5,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1522/142493.webp','ona','2016-10-25','finished_airing','Every little thing\'s exciting at Cafe Wingcle! Wingcle\'s friends come in everyday to visit Wingcle. Don\'t you want to find out who his friends are? Wingcle\'s dream is to make Cafe Wingcle a cozy place where anyone can swing by and relax.\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(58619,'SpoGomi: Machi no Kizunazukuri-hen',1560,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1564/142487.jpg','movie','2023-03-07','finished_airing','Although several years have passed since the SpoGomi exhibition match, recognition of the sport in Japan remains low. Akari and Tokio visited various places and worked to spread SpoGomi. Meanwhile, it has been decided that the SpoGomi World Cup will be held near Okawa, a river in a certain city.\n\n(Source: U-NEXT, translated)'),(58623,'Nijiyon Animation 2 Specials',210,65.1,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1280/142494.jpg','special','2024-06-26','finished_airing','Three unaired episodes bundled on the Nijiyon Animation 2 Blu-ray BOX.'),(58628,'Kagami no Kojou no Mae to Ato',124,64.2,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1015/142509.webp','special','2023-05-26','finished_airing','Special animation shown during a rescreening of the movie. Later included in the limited BD/DVD edition.'),(58630,'Oshiri Tantei 8th Season',1200,0,15,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1779/142515.jpg','tv','2024-04-06','finished_airing','Eighth season of Oshiri Tantei.'),(58631,'Oshiri Tantei 9th Season',1200,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1128/149981.jpg','tv','2025-04-05','currently_airing','Ninth season of Oshiri Tantei.'),(58632,'AOTU Xueyuan 3rd Season',420,0,15,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1748/142518.jpg','ona','2023-09-29','finished_airing','The third season of AOTU Xueyuan.'),(58635,'Kagari Hibana',992,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1575/142523.webp','ona','2021-11-26','finished_airing','A boy genius, Hurt, and a flower girl, Hibana. Hibana, a flower girl, is a dropout. The two childhood friends have lived completely different lives since they were small children. Hurt speaks warmly to Hibana to encourage her to run away from the coming-of-age ceremony. However, his voice did not reach her heart. Then, an incident occurred that changed their destiny drastically... A great adventure set in the World Tree. A few years before the day of their journey In the deep forest, what is it that befalls the inexperienced boy and girl...!\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(58638,'Ito wo Yoru',1200,55.7,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1231/150113.jpg','ova','2024-07-19','currently_airing','A schoolgirl track and field athlete takes shelter from the rain at a lonely and secluded bus stop. Shortly after, a student otaku arrives at the same stop to seek shelter from the rain as well. As they talk, their dark desires show themselves and they both satisfy each other sexually.\n\n(Source: TMDB)'),(58641,'Mugoku no Kuni no Alice',938,53.6,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1213/142540.jpg','ova','2024-05-31','currently_airing',''),(58642,'Shuumatsu Hospital',1440,61.4,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1331/142541.jpg','ova','2024-05-31','finished_airing','Akao Misuzu is a nurse newly transferred from another hospital. Everything seems normal, except that people die unusually often during her shifts: she offers sexual services to dying people and leads one or two gentlemen to their graves more quickly. The other nurses are on her trail... Will she be able to keep her secret?'),(58644,'Yozakura-san Chi no Mini Sakusen',90,63.7,28,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1275/142552.webp','ona','2024-04-11','finished_airing','A comedy series featuring the Yozakura Family\'s life.'),(58646,'Moja to Majo',60,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1143/142554.webp','ona','2023-04-28','finished_airing','This is a stop motion animation of the cotton enchantress Moja and the sewing witch. Their day begins with making Moja\'s body.\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(58648,'Housoushitsu no Kigurumi Girl',300,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1284/142556.jpg','ona','2023-12-30','finished_airing','Nao Kurusu transferred to an all-girls school in the countryside after her father\'s job move. While she was trying her best to get used to the new school, she runs into someone in her class wearing a costume. Why are there costumes at school? Who is inside this costume? Nao is curious and tries to find out their identity but...!?\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(58649,'Ikkyuumono-san',65,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1921/142557.jpg','ona','2024-01-09','finished_airing','A collaboration between Ikimono-san and Ikkyuu-san.'),(58655,'Dixia Cheng Yu Yongshi: Po Jie Shaonu',1488,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1452/142607.jpg','ona','2024-01-18','finished_airing',''),(58663,'One Piece: Innen no Log! Mugiwara no Ichimi to Cipher Pol',1460,64.80000000000001,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1446/142604.jpg','tv_special','2024-04-14','finished_airing','The second recap special of Egghead arc that covers the battle history between the Straw Hats and CP9.'),(58680,'Panda Narikiri Taisou',82,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1847/142630.webp','ona','2024-03-02','currently_airing',''),(58681,'Anhe Zhuan Part 2',1221,69.3,14,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1556/142631.jpg','ona','2024-04-17','finished_airing','The second part of Anhe Zhuan.'),(58689,'Yuanshen: Jinzhong Ge',425,80.9,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1229/142648.jpg','ona','2024-04-17','finished_airing','Animated short film about the backstory of the Knave from Genshin Impact.'),(58696,'Yuanshen: Xuqu PV - Zhi Zhongmu de Huanyan',222,74.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1623/142653.jpg','pv','2023-07-03','finished_airing','Promotional video showcasing the Fontaine cast of characters in Genshin Impact.'),(58705,'Shadowverse Flame: Seven Shadows-hen Recap',1433,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1232/142663.jpg','tv_special','2024-04-06','finished_airing','Recap of Shadowverse Flame: Seven Shadows-hen.'),(58707,'Yuri!!! on Ice The Movie: Ice Adolescence PV',60,65.9,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1716/142666.jpg','pv','2020-11-26','finished_airing','A preview for the canceled Yuri!!! on Ice The Movie: Ice Adolescence.'),(58711,'Jueshi Zhan Hun',600,71.5,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1290/150120.jpg','ona','2024-04-27','currently_airing','The Xuanling Sect, the head of the four major sects, came to Shuicheng to select disciples for the first time in many years. The Fang and Qin families started fighting openly and secretly around this opportunity that would determine their fate. In the end, Qin Nan relied on his dedicated training, excellent talent, and the God of War Soul obtained by chance, and under the fair judgment of the messenger Xiao Qingxue, he successfully reversed the decline and defeated the Fang family. \n\nAfter entering the sect, Qin Nan aroused the hatred of Ouyang Jun, the son of the sect leader, because of his involvement in Xiao Qingxue\'s forced marriage. In order to continue to become stronger and repay Xiao Qingxue\'s kindness, Qin Nan repeatedly defeated powerful enemies, won the first place in the Wanxiang Competition and the Outer Sect Competition, entered the Wuyuan Pavilion with the four major sect geniuses, and obtained the power to stir up the continent. \n\nA shocking secret, an appointment with Leng Feng to fight in the Palace of Life and Death, overcoming the siege of Linshui City by the Beihai family, exploring the Nine-Character Mantra Tower, and vowing to fight the evil forces of the sect to the end. \n\n(Source: Iqiyi, Google translated)'),(58714,'Saikyou no Shienshoku \"Wajutsushi\" de Aru Ore wa Sekai Saikyou Clan wo Shitagaeru',1420,76.10000000000001,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1683/145446.jpg','tv','2024-10-07','finished_airing','Noel longs to be a Seeker like his heroic grandfather, slaying the beasts that emerge from Abysses and exploring far-off lands. Unfortunately, it turns out he\'s nothing but a measly Talker–a job with no combat skills whatsoever. Undaunted, Noel sets out to establish the strongest clan in all the land, using his silver-tongued Talker skills to unite assassins and heroes under his leadership.\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)'),(58717,'Garouden: The Way of the Lone Wolf',1463,64.5,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1534/142687.jpg','ona','2024-05-23','finished_airing','On the run from his troubled past, Juuzou is forced into competing in a deadly underground fighting tournament. Skilled in the respected martial art Takemiya-ryuu, Juuzou must navigate a path filled with formidable foes and his personal demons — all while dealing with a bounty of three million yen on his head and a detective on his trail.\n\n(Source: Netflix, edited)'),(58725,'Ninja to Koroshiya no Futarigurashi',1420,73.5,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1855/146642.jpg','tv','2025-04-10','currently_airing','Satoko Kusagakure, a female ninja who left her village with her comrades, finds herself living with Konoha, a high school girl working as an assassin in the city. Satoko possesses the ability to transform objects using ninjutsu, which catches Konoha\'s attention. They strike a deal: Konoha provides Satoko with a place to live in exchange for Satoko\'s help in cleaning up after her assassination jobs.\n\nAs they face off against assassins sent by Satoko\'s village, indulge in delicious meals using money earned from assassination jobs, and navigate the chaos of their unusual living situation, the story captures the heartwarming yet chaotic lives of these two unlikely roommates.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(58728,'Teikou Penguin',300,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1555/142707.webp','ona','2019-01-22','currently_airing','Follows a penguin working at a black company and his daily life as he grapples with the absurdities of society, such as his boss who forces him to work overtime and his customers who make complaints.\n\n(Source: Wikipedia, translated)'),(58732,'Boku ni Harem Sexfriend ga Dekita Riyuu',995,72.5,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1909/149939.jpg','ova','2024-06-28','currently_airing',''),(58735,'Hanarokushou ga Akeru Hi ni',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1375/147506.webp','movie','2026','not_yet_aired','The Obinata Fireworks Shop factory is getting prepared for an administrative action for confiscation tomorrow. It has been six years since Keitarou has been holed up in a closed-down factory creating fireworks by himself, chasing after an illusion of his father who vanished. It is a story about three young people who overcome the extreme weather conditions, disasters, and environmental problems imposed on them and establish their own identities. \n\n(Source: Cannes Film Festival)'),(58738,'Hiro & Hana: Rakko no Okiniiri',307,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1814/142724.jpg','movie','2018-10','finished_airing','Hiro and Hana own a little café. One day a sad sea otter visits them for some tea and refreshments.'),(58739,'Momentary Lily',1420,59.1,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1107/143656.webp','tv','2025-01-03','finished_airing','Robotic invaders wiped out all life, but Renge fights to survive using her powers. With no memories, she roams the city until she meets five other young women, each with unique abilities. Together, they make the most of their lives, cooking delicious meals between battles with mechanical monstrosities. As they uncover the secrets of their powers and pasts, they find strength in their friendship.\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)'),(58744,'Yao Shen Ji 8th Season',480,76.39999999999999,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1939/142733.webp','ona','2024-04-30','finished_airing','Eight season of Yao Shen Ji.'),(58746,'Wanwan Train Doko e Iku?',45,58.6,9,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1950/142738.webp','ona','2024-04-24','finished_airing',''),(58749,'Arknights: Rise from Ember',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1790/149462.jpg','tv','2025-07-04','not_yet_aired','New season of Arknights.'),(58751,'Arknights 2024 Special Commemorative Animation PV',126,71.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1502/142743.webp','pv','2024-04-27','finished_airing','We search for the once flickering dawn, walking side by side through the light and over the darkness. Even with empty hands, let\'s keep moving forward together.\n\n(Source: Official YouTube)'),(58753,'Gotchard Short Anime: Gotchanime - Furasu Koukou Nanafushigi wo Gotcha Seyo!',360,0,5,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1616/142745.webp','ona','2024-04-29','finished_airing','Kamen Rider Gotchard shorts released on the Toei Tokusatsu Fanclub (TTFC) app.'),(58754,'Xiaobing Chuanqi',1200,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1784/142762.webp','ona','2024-04-28','finished_airing','He has always been ambitious, hoping to become the Army Marshal that united the universe. In his mind, in order to become the Army Marshal, he first need to become General, and way before that, a soldier. A journey of hero, an average looking young man, recently graduated from his high school accidentally enlisted in a division that, technically no longer exists. His journey began with torture, but a good torture by his instructors. He always had a dream of becoming an Army Marshal that united the humanity in the universe, and his instructors laid the foundation for him, using an unorthodox teaching methods. The first step, or the first hurdle for him was to survive his basic training in a boot camp, withstanding the good-willed tortured of his instructor. He did survive, he graduated successfully, and the sky\'s limit for him.\n\n(Source: Novel Updates)'),(58755,'5-toubun no Hanayome*',1452,74.5,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1915/145336.webp','tv_special','2024-12-24','finished_airing','5-toubun no Hanayome* centers on the honeymoon trip of Fuutarou Uesugi and the Nakano sisters.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(58756,'Killtube',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1972/143492.webp','movie','2026','not_yet_aired','In 2026, Japan continues its isolation under the Edo Shogunate. Amidst strict social hierarchies, three individuals, treated as scums of society, cross paths in a prison cell destined for a fateful encounter. They join the dueling video platform \"KILLTUBE\" to pursue fortune and to win their freedom in a segregational world.\n\nIn an era dubbed the \"Age of Great Duels,\" where one can amass immense wealth simply by defeating the strong, they face discrimination from samurais and merchants seeking power and authority. As they break the limits of convention and claim victory after victory, they rise in popularity, becoming decorated celebrities of their time.\nHowever, just as they reach the height of their fame, they uncover the hidden truth behind \"KILLTUBE\"...\n\n(Source: Official YouTube Channel)'),(58759,'Michitas to Fumidasu Ippo',60,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1843/142785.jpg','cm','2024-01-05','finished_airing','A commercial for Meiji\'s Michitas beverages.'),(58762,'Salaryman Mudaeri Yonghada Yonghae',3457,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1433/142799.jpg','movie','2001','finished_airing',''),(58772,'Kakuriyo no Yadomeshi 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1726/142804.jpg','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','Second season of Kakuriyo no Yadomeshi.'),(58773,'Keroro Gunsou (Anime Shin Project)',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1012/142805.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','New Keroro Gunsou project to celebrate its 20th anniversary.'),(58774,'Mamahaha no Tsurego ga Motokano datta Picture Drama',140,62.800000000000004,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1077/142809.webp','ona','2022-02-14','finished_airing','Picture drama episodes which were released online on their official YouTube and Twitter channel.'),(58776,'Seiyoku Tsuyotsuyo The Animation',990,70.7,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1712/149952.jpg','ova','2024-07-26','currently_airing','High school student Haruka Nanase dates Ryousuke. All her friends envy her, because Ryousuke is a real macho, and also an athlete. After some time, the girl becomes irritated and nervous. It\'s all about her boyfriend\'s selfishness in terms of sex, in which she receives virtually no pleasure. Nervousness grew every day, and to relieve stress, Haruki decided to make fun of the quiet Nozaki. Wanting to disgrace the guy, she pulled off his pants.'),(58779,'Shi Cao Lao Long Bei Guan Yi E Long Zhi Ming 2nd Season',810,68,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1294/145877.webp','ona','2024-10-02','finished_airing','The old herbivorous dragon, who gets mistaken for an evil dragon, and Reiko, a young girl with miraculous powers, arrive in a totally new country, Asgar, where the herbivorous dragon keeps taking the blame when he gets caught up in an elaborate conspiracy. Even though he just wants to live a peaceful life, the herbivorous dragon is continuously getting stuck in his role as the evil dragon and walks further and further down the road towards overthrowing the demon king.\n\n(Source: bilibili, translated)'),(58783,'Yeon-aejehanguyeog',300,69.2,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1321/142828.webp','ona','2023-12-29','finished_airing','Eunkyum has been at his company for a year now. He is friendly, bright, and has a great relationship with his colleagues. But he is unlucky in love—most likely because he is a sucker for looks. That is why he was thrilled when his hot new boss joined the company... before he made Eunkyum\'s life hell.\n\n(Source: Manta Comics, edited)'),(58788,'Ikoku Nikki',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1138/142838.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Thirty-five-year-old novelist Makio Koudai never had a good relationship with her older sister Minori, who always berated her for being different. Due to this, Makio is not stricken with grief upon hearing the news that Minori and her husband die in a car crash. But when Makio is asked to identify their bodies, she runs into her 15-year-old niece, Asa Takumi, whom she has not seen in years.\n\nStruggling to process her parents\' death, Makio reassures Asa that her complicated feelings are valid and suggests that the teenager start writing in a diary as a way to cope with the loss. Upon learning that no other relatives wanted to take in Asa, Makio decides to become her guardian despite her lack of experience. In a world full of uncertainty, the novelist and teenager must learn to live with each other while figuring themselves out.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58792,'Jantama 5-shuunen Kinen PV',208,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1557/142855.webp','pv','2024-04-25','finished_airing','A special animation made to celebrate Mahjong Soul\'s 5th anniversary.'),(58794,'Dies Irae: Irasshai Zonnenji Specials',351,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1841/142863.jpg','special','2018-01-31','finished_airing','Three unaired episodes of Dies Irae: Irasshai Zonnenji that were included on the DVD release.'),(58797,'Wanmei Shijie Movie: Huo Zhi Huijin',2206,74.7,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1730/145386.webp','ona','2024-09-14','finished_airing','The reunion of Huo Sang plays the tragic song of sin and blood, and the stone spirit is reborn from the desperate situation when the ashes fall.\n\n(Source: v.qq, translated)'),(58799,'Sorotani no Animetchi',120,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1581/142869.jpg','ona','2021-07-04','currently_airing',''),(58800,'Amebas!',70,0,18,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1637/142870.jpg','ona','2024-03-29','finished_airing','Terry and Small are two amoebas who live inside the stomach of Nakamoto, a gluttonous boy. However, Nakamoto is unaware of the existence of microorganisms. Are they good? Bad? Neutral? What he does know is that he loves eating and playing.\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(58805,'Luka to Taiyou no Hana',1740,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1858/142883.jpg','tv_special','2024-04-26','finished_airing','A story set in a village covered with clouds depicting the bond between a young boy, Luka, and his childhood friend, Rosa. One day Rosa, who has the power of the sun, hears from a mysterious duo named Kiyu and Orico that there is a way to clear the clouds. Meanwhile, Luka is attracted to a traveling band that visits the village, and decides to leave the village.\n\n(Source: NHK, translated)'),(58806,'Parking Area',532,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1184/142884.webp','movie','2022','finished_airing','A woman visits a parking area. She experience something strange there.\n\n(Source: SHORTSHORTS)'),(58807,'Niku ni Matsuwaru Nichijou no Hanashi',265,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1881/142885.jpg','movie','2023','finished_airing',''),(58810,'Choboraunyopomi Gekijou Dai San Maku Ai Mai Mii: Surgical Friends - Konetashuu 2017, Haru.',213,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1623/142892.webp','special','2017-04-21','finished_airing','Unaired episode included with the Blu-ray/DVD release.'),(58811,'Tougen Anki',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1235/148715.jpg','tv','2025-07-11','not_yet_aired','Individuals with Momotarou and Oni blood coursing through their veins maintain a longstanding rivalry. The Oni are careless, rash, and disorderly, while the Momotarou protect the human world from the uncontrollable Oni. Shiki Ichinose is a reckless and irresponsible teenager, aware of his defiance and even proud of his expulsion from school. Despite Shiki\'s rebellious attitude, his foster father, Tsuyoshi, cares about him deeply.\n\nTsuyoshi\'s selfless love is soon shown in an explosive incident when a Momotarou barges in looking for Shiki. As a Momotarou himself, Tsuyoshi has been hiding Shiki for years and keeping his Oni origins a secret even from him. As he gives up his life to save Shiki and confesses everything in his dying breath, Shiki\'s Oni blood awakens for the first time, transforming him into an unruly monster overflowing with rage and a thirst for revenge.\n\nShiki\'s momentary outburst attracts the attention of Naito Mudano, an Oni teacher at the Rakshasa Academy—an institution for young Oni in need of understanding and perfecting their powers. Before Shiki can avenge his father, he must learn to control his headstrong and impulsive nature and, above all, fight against his own demonic blood.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58812,'Shin Samurai-den Yaiba',1430,74.6,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1073/149267.webp','tv','2025-04-05','currently_airing','Upon enrolling in school, Yaiba quickly crosses swords with his soon-to-be rival, Onimaru. When Onimaru is transformed into a demon by the cursed power of Fujinken, the Wind God’s Sword, Yaiba embarks on a quest to Mount Tengu to find his own enchanted sword. But Yaiba lacks the skill and knowledge to use such a powerful weapon. If he can’t control himself, it will control him!\n\n(Source: VIZ Media)'),(58813,'Upapuro',60,0,50,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1255/142904.jpg','tv','2017','finished_airing',''),(58814,'Genki Genki Non-tan: Kirakira Shanshan Ohoshisama☆',1282,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1290/142907.jpg','movie','2020','finished_airing',''),(58816,'Selector Loth WIXOSS',100,64.6,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1103/145381.jpg','pv','2024-04-26','finished_airing','Special PV released to commemorate the 10th anniversary of selector infected WIXOSS depicting the original cast as adults with callbacks to the original series\'s first opening.'),(58820,'Awajima Hyakkei',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1889/149784.jpg','tv','2026','not_yet_aired','This omnibus adolescent drama is about a group of young girls who all attend a \"girls-only musical school,\" recounting the formative years they shared, at times shifting between different characters\' viewpoints and time.\n\nAwajima Musical School Training Camp, dubbed the \"boarding house,\" is where young girls gather from all over Japan to perform on stage. Tabata Wakana aspires to be a musical star; housemaster Takehara Kinue attends to carry on her best friend\'s wishes; beautiful Okabe Emi is a scholarship student who is always at the center of attention; and Ibuki Katsurako, who became a teacher at the school though originally from a family of actresses.\n\nThe unique environment of the musical school is simultaneously a respite space for these aspiring girls and also a harsh battleground that pits young students against each other. It is a place where perseverance can lead to blossoming talents, but also to a cruel reality at times. The clear depiction and psychological portrayal allow the subtle inner workings of each character to come through.\n\n(Source: Japan Media Arts Festival, edited)'),(58822,'Izure Saikyou no Renkinjutsushi?',1420,66,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1431/146222.webp','tv','2025-01-08','finished_airing','A salaryman is surprised to find himself summoned to another world by accident. With no way of returning to Earth, he receives the name Takumi Iruma, a different younger body, magic powers, and a fresh start in an unfamiliar land. To preserve his quiet life, Takumi settles in a local village and assumes the job of an alchemist, allowing him to create almost anything he desires. Making the most of his time, he explores his new abilities and even tames an unlikely pet.\n\nHowever, Takumi decides to move on to a big city in hopes of improving his alchemy skills and business. As he keeps learning about his profession and gaining new connections, Takumi might just be able to become the greatest alchemist of all time.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58827,'Okaimono Panda!',180,0,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1668/149988.jpg','tv','2024-11-06','finished_airing','TV anime of Okaimono Panda! to celebrate its 11th anniversary.'),(58828,'Koukou Eisei',510,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1181/142927.jpg','movie','1923','finished_airing','A short film by Seitarou Kitayama to promote oral hygiene.'),(58829,'Katei Sekken',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1596/142928.webp','cm','1922','finished_airing','An advertisement for Nakayama Taiyodo\'s (Club Cosmetics) soap. It is considered to one of the oldest animated advertisements from Japan and is speculated to be made by Seitarou Kitayama.'),(58832,'Kujima Utaeba Ie Hororo',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1464/142932.jpg','unknown','','not_yet_aired','In the autumn of his first year of middle school, Arata Kouda meets Kujima, a strange creature that sort-of looks like a bird. Since Kujima is hungry, Arata brings it home with him... But because of his older brother who failed his entrance exams, Kujima gets carried away by the situation and ends up freeloading at the Kouda residence. He says it\'s just until he makes it through winter, and the warmth of spring comes, but...\n\n(Source: Shogakukan, translated)'),(58833,'Kakushite! Makina-san!!',726,58.2,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1843/146935.webp','tv','2025-04-07','currently_airing','Makina Agatsuma, the school idol, moves into the home of Eita Akutsu, an introverted mechanical otaku. Eita, who has secretly harbored feelings for her, thinks he\'s hit the jackpot! But it turns out, she\'s actually a robot made for sexual purposes. Caught off guard by her sudden physical advances, the virgin Eita is at a loss. Furthermore, he finds himself in a frenzy trying to help her maintain her secret identity. A romantic comedy with a slightly risqué mechanical revelation, where hilarity ensues as they try to keep the secret under wraps!\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(58835,'Pokemon Home Introduction Video',45,55.599999999999994,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1476/142938.jpg','pv','2024-05-10','finished_airing','For those of you who play the \"Pokémon\" series but don\'t use \"Pokémon HOME\", I\'d like to introduce you to the charm of \"Pokémon HOME\"!\n\n(Source: Official YouTube Channel)'),(58837,'Odekake Kozame Movie: Tokai no Otomodachi',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1258/148356.jpg','movie','2025-08-22','not_yet_aired','Movie of Odekake Kozame.'),(58844,'Harinezumi no Luchika',184,61.6,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1852/142957.webp','ona','2024-05-10','finished_airing','An adaptation of the picture book Harinezumi no Luchika.'),(58845,'Tongari Boushi no Memole (Movie)',900,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1005/142980.jpg','movie','1985-03-16','finished_airing','After the series, a 15-minute \"movie\" was released combining parts of Episodes 1, 2, 7, 24 and 25.\n\n(Source: AniDB)'),(58849,'Garena Free Fire',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1933/143090.jpg','unknown','','not_yet_aired',''),(58850,'Fujiko Fujio no Kiteretsu Daihyakka',4320,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1267/143091.webp','tv_special','1987-11-02','finished_airing','A special episode released before the airing of the Kiteretsu Daihyakka TV series'),(58853,'Kuroiwa Medaka ni Watashi no Kawaii ga Tsuujinai',1430,65.8,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1792/146404.webp','tv','2025-01-07','finished_airing','There is not a single room that Mona Kawai enters where she does not become the center of attention—dealing with this everlasting spotlight is but a fact of her daily life. Mona\'s absolute confidence in her own charms, however, is shaken when she meets Medaka Kuroiwa, a recent transfer student to her highschool. Unlike all other classmates who constantly fawn over her, Medaka frowns every time they interact. Seeing his disinterest as something to be rectified, Mona pulls out all the stops in the hopes of winning Medaka over, only to be met with one stern face after another.\n\nTurns out, Medaka\'s indifference to Mona stems from his wish to one day become a monk, and hence must leave all worldly desires behind. As the unknowing Mona ramps up her attacks on Medaka, all her antics might lead her into falling for him instead.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58854,'Kinoko Inu',1424,68.8,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1954/144622.webp','tv','2024-10-03','finished_airing','Grief-stricken over the death of his last family member, his dog Hanako, picture book writer Hotaru Yuuyami suffers from writer\'s block for nearly two months. Despite his childhood friend and editor Tsubaki Uehara\'s best efforts, nothing seems to alleviate his pain. But all of this changes one day with the sudden apparition of Kinoko Inu, a mysterious mushroom from his garden that turns into a dog-shaped animal. Much to the great dismay of Tsubaki, Hotaru hastily invites the creature into his abode.\n\nDays after Hotaru and Kinoko Inu start living together, the strange mushroom-dog decides to burn the last of Hanako\'s personal belongings in order to alleviate Hotaru\'s depression. However, the cohabitation between the overworked writer and his mischievous guest proves more difficult than expected, and Hotaru must let go of his grief if he wants to properly take care of Kinoko Inu.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58855,'Yuru Camp△ Season 3 Specials',451,75.3,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1597/143098.webp','special','2024-06-26','finished_airing','Specials included in the BD/DVD release of Yuru Camp△ Season 3.'),(58856,'Hibike! Euphonium 3: Extra Episodes',258,69.2,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1230/143099.webp','special','2024-06-26','finished_airing','Specials included in the BD/DVD release of Hibike! Euphonium 3.'),(58857,'Totemo Mijikai',318,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1594/143100.jpg','movie','2024-04-25','finished_airing','Somewhere between calligraphy, embryology and words from beyond the grave, a convulsive poem wraps itself around the Japanese syllable ‘da’ — a breath that could just as well be the first as the last.\n\n(Source: Directors\' Fortnight)'),(58859,'Benghuai: Xing Qiong Tiedao - Yanchu Kaishi Qian',103,69.6,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1817/143109.jpg','cm','2024-04-30','finished_airing','Animated commercial promoting the 2024 concert for Honkai: Star Rail.\n\n'),(58861,'Hanazakari no Kimitachi e',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1015/143111.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','After seeing Izumi Sano at a high jump competition, Mizuki Ashiya became completely enamored by him—even moving from the United States to Japan and enrolling in the same institute as him. However, Sano\'s academy is an all-boys school!\n\nDue to her bright personality, Mizuki quickly befriends her class without drawing suspension to her gender. To her surprise, she ends up being not only Sano\'s classmate but also his roommate. Though she is now able to admire Sano in close proximity, she learns that Sano has quit high jumping and refuses to pick up the sport ever again for unknown reasons. Moreover, the academy\'s doctor, Hokuto Umeda, might be onto Mizuki\'s facade. Now, Mizuki has to find a way to reignite Sano\'s passion—all without revealing her secret.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58866,'Mahou Shoujo holoWitch! PV',279,66.8,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1061/143162.webp','pv','2024-05-16','finished_airing','Magical Girl holoWitches! is a brand-new multimedia project comprised of hololive VTubers that hopes to introduce various forms of content such as anime, manga, and livestreams  based on magical girl lore and setting.\n\n(Source: Official YouTube Channel)'),(58869,'Bajie',5760,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1663/143170.jpg','movie','2023-11-18','finished_airing','In the future, technology and humankind will be fused. The world\'s largest corporation, \"Nirvana Corporation,\" implants a \"Nirvana ID\" into newborns that serves convenience functions such as identification and payment and preserves every person’s complete life record. Set in the distant future, lazy and selfish Pigsy embarks on a journey of deceit and swindling to attain a better life, only to find out that true happiness is closer than you think.\n\n(Source: Taiwan Pavilion)'),(58873,'Mark Your Kiss The Animation',761,55.199999999999996,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1558/143178.webp','ona','2023-06-14','finished_airing',''),(58876,'Jinwu Wei: Feng Qi Jinling',1178,0,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1311/143181.jpg','ona','2024-05-18','finished_airing','Thunder and fire kill people, rumors spread, and rat-faced sinister soldiers rampage across the imperial capital. Everything seems to point to the secrets of the former dynasty that were wiped out by thunder and fire. A pair of hands brought three very different young men together. Jing Yifei, the cold and proud female master of Jinwu Guard, was ordered to find out the truth about the rat soldiers. Bai Qi, the descendant of Jieyi who lives in seclusion in the mountains, led his master to go down the mountain to find a young machine master to join the Jinwu Guard. But the person he was looking for, Qin Ming, was deceiving and abducting him!? As the three of them continued to work together, they gradually came closer to the truth about Lei Huo.\n\n(Source: iq.com)'),(58877,'Diamond no Ace: Act II Second Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1697/149820.webp','tv','2026','not_yet_aired','Sequel to Diamond no Ace: Act II.'),(58878,'Sayonara Lara',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1790/143186.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','A new original anime inspired by The Little Mermaid follows the story of a mermaid who wishes to be loved by a human but tragically dies. She is reincarnated 200 years later in Lake Biwa in modern-day Japan. As she navigates her new life, she learns how to fit into the human world.'),(58883,'Dead Dead Demons Dededede Destruction (ONA)',1433,79.3,17,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1528/143212.webp','ona','2024-05-31','finished_airing','When you look up at the sky, what do you see? A blue sky? Freedom? A hopeful future? The people of Tokyo see none of these. Instead, an ominous alien mothership looms overhead, engulfing the city skyscape.\n\nThree years ago, they came. The arrival of the \"Invaders\" sparked the greatest war humanity had ever faced—one that threatened to end the world. The Japanese government scrambled to fight the Invaders. Weapons were mass-produced, sparking controversy and pacifist movements.\n\nThat day, everything changed. And yet, nothing has changed. Kadode Koyama and Ouran Nakagawa live their final days like they always have: going to school, playing with friends, and doing what any carefree high school girl would do.\n\nAs they grow up, they come to learn what it truly means to be an adult, in a world where adults seem to be demons who only deceive and destroy. They come to learn the real threat to humanity is not the Invaders, but humanity itself.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58886,'Darwin Jihen',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1740/146583.jpg','tv','2026-01','not_yet_aired','The Animal Liberation Alliance, an eco-terrorist organization, rescues a pregnant chimpanzee from an animal testing lab—only for it to give birth to a half-human, half-chimpanzee \"humanzee\" named Charlie! Fifteen years later, Charlie\'s human foster parents are finally ready to send him to a normal high school, where he makes his first friend: a human girl named Lucy. In the meantime, however, the ALA\'s stance has become ever more extreme, and now they\'re here to drag Charlie into their terrorist plot...\n\n(Source: Kodansha USA)'),(58888,'Yatara Yarashii Fukami-kun',360,68,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1801/148054.jpg','ona','2025-03-14','currently_airing','\"How does someone as perfect as me get turned on by a guy who\'s so... ordinary?!\"\nKaji’s good looks and charm have made him popular with everyone at his office. However, beneath the surface, he secretly looks down on others and judges them by a scoring system! If only he could find the perfect bottom who could live up to his standards.\nOne day, Kaji finds himself on an overnight business trip with his bland colleague, Fukami. Unimpressed by the plain-looking Fukami, Kaji vows that even if they were the last two people on a deserted island, he would never consider sleeping with him!\n\nAt least, that’s what he thought... until he glimpsed Fukami coming out of the shower and realized his irresistibly cute and erotic side!\n\n(Source: Official website)'),(58890,'Yarakashi',1440,61.8,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1945/143209.webp','ova','2024-06-28','currently_airing',''),(58891,'Gobaku: Moe Mama Tsurezure',1440,66.9,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1257/143210.jpg','ova','2024-06-28','currently_airing','Haruka Miyama sees Hiro, her best friend\'s son, as a member of her family. However, things become complicated when Hiro confesses his love and seduces Haruka while the latter\'s husband is on a business trip. Knowing that what they are doing is wrong, Haruka tries as best she can to reject him without hurting him, but she ends up giving in.'),(58892,'Bubble de House de *** The Animation',1860,74.4,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1316/143211.webp','ova','2024-08-30','currently_airing',''),(58894,'Touken Ranbu Kai: Douden Chikashi Haberau Monora',4128,64.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1725/144268.webp','movie','2024-08-16','finished_airing','Prequel movie of Touken Ranbu Kai: Kyoden Moyuru Honnouji.'),(58897,'Jiadao Zhong Er',440,0,120,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1329/143215.webp','ona','2024-05-01','finished_airing',''),(58898,'Kaiju Yi Zuo Shan 2nd Season',870,0,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1913/143216.jpg','ona','2024-05-06','finished_airing','Second season of Kaiju Yi Zuo Shan.'),(58899,'Zhongxiao Zhi Bang Bang da',270,0,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1757/143217.jpg','tv','2020-07-03','finished_airing',''),(58905,'Yoasobi Gurashi!',390,64.4,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1818/143230.jpg','ona','2024-07-08','finished_airing','Meet Kazuto, whose hopes of becoming a photographer didn\'t pan out, and Yayoi, who successfully achieved her dream of becoming a model. Two childhood friends who have grown apart... Suddenly find themselves living together! In the beginning, there\'s an awkward tension between them, and Yayoi has a secret she can\'t tell Kazuto... Then, one night, things start to change... Could they be more than just childhood friends...?!\n\n(Source: Official Site)'),(58906,'Zhao Chai',150,0,28,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1500/143231.jpg','ona','2023-12-19','finished_airing',''),(58907,'Dubu Xinghai',1184,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1376/143232.jpg','ona','2019','finished_airing',''),(58908,'Muzik Tiger In the Forest',60,0,30,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1924/149987.jpg','tv','2025-04-02','currently_airing','In the Muzik Forest, by a beautiful lake, live three tigers—Toffee, Tiffy, and Teffi— along with a mouse named Willy\nand a moon rabbit called Polmi. \n\nThey lead a carefree life, not working, but every day is filled with fun and fascinating moments\n\n(Source: Official site)'),(58913,'Hikaru ga Shinda Natsu',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1104/148614.jpg','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Best friends Yoshiki and Hikaru have been stuck together like glue for most of their lives. Living in a small village and being the only children their age, the two boys find solace in each other\'s company. Their friendship seems picturesque at first glance, but Yoshiki has noticed a shift in Hikaru\'s demeanor ever since one fateful summer.\n\nThe \"Hikaru\" that sits beside him now is nothing like his friend. Despite his physical appearance and memories remaining exactly the same, Yoshiki knows something is amiss and that the Hikaru he once knew is gone. When he brings this up, Hikaru partially transforms into an otherworldly being, threatening to kill Yoshiki if he cannot accept it—while also professing its love for him.\n\nWracked with grief and unable to let go of his best friend, Yoshiki struggles to move on with his life as he finds himself getting closer to the new Hikaru. At the same time, strange occurrences begin to plague their village, bringing unsettling chaos.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58916,'Haha Da Maoxian 2nd Season',200,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1593/143256.webp','tv','2017','finished_airing','Second season of Haha Da Maoxian.'),(58917,'Haha Da Maoxian 3rd Season',200,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1196/143257.webp','tv','2018','finished_airing','Third season of Haha Da Maoxian.'),(58918,'Haha Da Maoxian 4th Season',200,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1591/143258.webp','tv','2019','finished_airing','Fourth season of Haha Da Maoxian.'),(58919,'Hyakuemu.',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1385/149361.webp','movie','2025-09-19','not_yet_aired','Togashi is born to run. As a kid, he is naturally gifted and wins every 100-meter race without effort. But in sixth grade, he meets Komiya, a transfer student who is full of determination but lacks technique. In teaching him, Togashi gives Komiya a new purpose: to win no matter what. Years pass by, Togashi and Komiya meet again as rivals on the track and reveal their true selves.\n\n(Source: Annecy Festival)'),(58920,'Dead Dead Demons Dededede Destruction (ONA) Episode 0',1433,72.30000000000001,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1514/143260.webp','ona','2024-05-24','finished_airing','Episode 0 of Dead Dead Demons Dededede Destruction (ONA).'),(58924,'Xuan Di Chuanshuo',420,0,200,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1088/143268.jpg','ona','2024-03-28','currently_airing',''),(58925,'Kuroko no Basket: Basket Kyoushitsu',1474,64.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1231/143270.webp','special','2023-03-24','finished_airing','An original picture drama included with the Kuroko no Basket Thanks Disc: 10th Anniversary BD/DVD.'),(58926,'Egumi Legacy',630,67,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1755/143273.jpg','tv','2024-07-09','finished_airing','Floating in a certain ocean is an island called \"EGU Island.\" The sole entertainment on this island is listening to the songstress, \"End of the World.\" Day after day, the islanders are enchanted by her singing. However, this tranquil time is shattered in an instant. Since the disappearance of the songstress, the island has been filled with \"anger,\" \"doubt,\" and \"anxiety.\" Various thoughts and intentions begin to stir...A licking war unfolds around, \"End of the World!\" The one who holds her destiny is the legendary legacy \"EGUMI Legacy.\"\n\n(Source: Ani-One Asia)'),(58929,'Koukaku Kidoutai (TV)',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1728/149221.webp','tv','2026','not_yet_aired','In the year 2029, Niihama City has become a technologically advanced metropolis. Due to great improvements in cybernetics, its citizens are able to replace their limbs with robotic parts. The world is now more interconnected than ever before, and the city\'s Public Security Section 9 is responsible for combating corruption, terrorism, and other dangerous threats following this shift toward globalization.\n\nThe strong-willed Major Motoko Kusanagi of Section 9 spearheads a case involving a mysterious hacker known only as the \"Puppet Master,\" who leaves a trail of victims stripped of their memories. Like many in this futuristic world, the Puppet Master\'s body is almost entirely robotic, giving them incredible power.\n\nAs Motoko and her subordinates follow the enigmatic criminal\'s trail, other parties—including Section 6—start to get involved, forcing her to confront the extremely complicated nature of the case. Pondering about various philosophical questions, such as her own life\'s meaning, Motoko soon realizes that the one who will provide these answers is none other than the Puppet Master themself.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58930,'Yuanshen: Weixing zhi Lu',204,78.8,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1613/143280.webp','ona','2024-05-24','finished_airing','Animated short film about the twins Aether and Lumine from Genshin Impact.\n'),(58931,'Grami\'s Circus Show',180,0,45,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1264/143288.jpg','tv','2014-05-17','finished_airing',''),(58932,'Grami\'s Circus Show 2nd Season',180,0,27,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1497/143289.jpg','tv','2016-02-09','finished_airing','Second season of Grami\'s Circus Show.'),(58933,'Dinoster: Gonglyongsuhodae 2nd Season',720,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1368/143290.jpg','tv','2024-02-26','finished_airing','Second season of Dinoster: Gonglyongsuhodae.'),(58934,'Mashle (Zoku-hen)',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1495/143295.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Sequel to Mashle: Shinkakusha Kouho Senbatsu Shiken-hen.'),(58935,'Nyaaaanvy',180,56.8,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1857/143301.webp','tv','2024-05-25','finished_airing',''),(58939,'Sakamoto Days',1427,75.9,11,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1026/146459.webp','tv','2025-01-11','finished_airing','The name Tarou Sakamoto once instilled fear in every villain. No other professional hitman matched his prowess, and fellow assassins revered him. However, Sakamoto fell in love. In five short years, he married, became a father, put on some weight, and traded his weapons for an apron as he became the owner of a humble convenience store.\n\nAlthough Sakamoto is decidedly retired, he finds his old life of crime hard to shake off. His former partner, Shin Asakura, reappears and resolves to stay with Sakamoto\'s family under their strict no-kill rule. To make matters worse, a large bounty is placed on Sakamoto\'s head. Numerous assassins now pursue him—but they are in for a surprise. Sakamoto has not lost his edge, and no matter what tricks his enemies pull, he will fight off every last one to protect his dear family.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(58940,'Tomoncar',180,0,60,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1587/143325.jpg','tv','2019','finished_airing','The Mischievous Speed Mania Raymon! The World’s Cutest Minimon! The Clever Fixer, Pictmon! Sassy AI-Powered Electric Tomoncar, Elecmon! Powerful heroine yet Warm-hearted Milimon! Every day in the Toy World where the monster cars live, big and small accidents happen. But Toy Monsters always help each other to solve problems and learn to cooperate. The adventure in Tomon World now begins!\n\n(Source: Tomoncar)'),(58941,'Emerald no Wa',136,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1354/143326.webp','movie','2017','finished_airing','A story about two girls who cross paths through badminton.\n\n(Source: Sotsuten)'),(58942,'Nalang Salgu Sip-eumyeon Kkoli Jeob-eo',136,61.2,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1299/143328.jpg','cm','2024-04-18','finished_airing','Lotte Chilsung\'s Soju Saero commercial.'),(58944,'Jochum',60,0,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1827/143336.jpg','tv','2024-07-13','finished_airing','The first animation of Sanrio character \"JOCHUM\" jointly developed by Sanrio and JO1.\n11 friends living in the share house \"JOCHUM\'S HOUSE\" where dreams are said to come true if you live in this house. Everyone has a dream and is fighting hard towards their dreams every day while living a leisurely life today!'),(58949,'Tish Tash',300,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1551/143346.webp','tv','2020-09-28','finished_airing','Growing up can be tough, especially when you\'re a family of bears and your younger brother is a bit of a wild animal. Luckily Tish has a ridiculously huge imagination and a larger than life, imaginary friend Tash. No matter what troubles they face, be it tackling the age-old terror of boredom or maybe just helping your baby brother not to be sad about losing his favorite toy; Together they can create new worlds around themselves, embarking on imaginative adventures and finding their own creative angle to help solve any problems that life throws at them.\n\n(Source: WelCon)'),(58951,'Kikyou',132,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1773/143349.webp','movie','2015','finished_airing','A short film centered around the theme of memory.'),(58953,'Pokemon Concierge Part 2',0,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1873/148170.webp','ona','2025-09','not_yet_aired','Second part of Pokémon Concierge.'),(58954,'Yaku nara Mug Cup mo Movie',8940,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1968/148456.webp','movie','2025-03-22','finished_airing','Compilation movie of Yaku nara Mug Cup mo.'),(58957,'9: Ruler\'s Crown',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1278/149789.webp','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','The scene: Shiromitsugawa, a run-of-the-mill college town that has launched several failed attempts to drum up tourism and revitalize itself, including sponsoring a high-budget-but-poorly-written anime based on local folklore. A storm is about to descend on this sleepy town.\n\nWe follow Kakeru Niimi, a man who can be a bit curt at times but who has a strong sense of responsibility and a kind heart. Kakeru\'s ordinary life is thrown into chaos after the local shrine\'s sacred relic shatters. In the wake of this event, several young men and women awaken to superhuman abilities.\n\nWhat was once a run-of-the-mill life in a run-of-the-mill town soon turns into a quest to track down a super-powered serial killer before they can strike again.\n\n(Source: Sekai Project)'),(58959,'Pipilu Anquan Tegong Dui Part 2',600,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1909/143369.jpg','tv','2019-07-12','finished_airing','Second part of the first season of Pipilu Anquan Tegong Dui.'),(58960,'Pipilu Anquan Tegong Dui 2nd Season',480,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1236/143370.jpg','ona','2021-03','finished_airing','Second season of Pipilu Anquan Tegong Dui.'),(58962,'Pipilu Anquan Tegong Dui 3rd Season',480,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1538/143372.jpg','ona','2021-08-06','finished_airing',''),(58964,'Ninja Batman tai Yakuza League',5340,69.4,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1542/144025.webp','movie','2025-03-21','finished_airing','Sequel to Ninja Batman.'),(58966,'Robotex',1404,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1556/143380.jpg','tv','2015-08-21','finished_airing','Robotex are highly advanced  metallic alien life-forms who are provided with infinite energy from a giant spinning top shaped core. However, they are oppressed by the mainframe and unable to have creativity. Kai, Taf and Iota have escaped this system to run away to earth. The mighty corps 1 from the Robotex mother planet, led by Volcan has been sent to chase after them. Yoo-seok and friends from earth become the amigos of Kai and his group to help the powerful Robotex unleash their strengths with creativity.\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(58967,'Haikyuu!! Movie: vs. Chiisana Kyojin',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1767/148248.jpg','movie','','not_yet_aired','The second Haikyuu!! Final movie.'),(58972,'Manga de Wakaru! Fate/Grand Order Tankoubon CMs',15,57.400000000000006,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1771/143387.jpg','cm','2017-07-29','finished_airing','Short commercials released on FGOs official YouTube channel that will tell you everything about FGO.'),(58974,'Black Lagoon CM',30,58,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1491/143391.jpg','cm','2018-11-19','finished_airing','A TV commercial featuring characters from volume 11 of Black Lagoon manga.\n\n(Source: Official YouTube Channel)'),(58975,'Sasayaku You ni Koi wo Utau Recaps',1422,62.699999999999996,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1995/143392.webp','tv_special','2024-06-09','finished_airing','Recap of the first six episodes of Sasayaku You ni Koi wo Utau.'),(58978,'Kimi ni Todoke: Digest Eizou',793,66.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1867/143398.webp','ona','2023-12-30','finished_airing','A video of series highlights looking back at major moments from the first two seasons involving Kazehaya, Sawako and the other characters has been released! Reexperience each scene with newly produced visuals.\n\n(Source: Netflix Anime\'s YouTube channel)'),(58985,'0-saiji Start Dash Monogatari',175,54.2,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1973/144062.webp','tv','2024-07-07','finished_airing','Lilia, the newborn daughter of a marquis, has the memories of her previous life! With cheat-like gamer knowledge she aims to become the strongest girl in this new \"other world\"!\n\n(Source: Shusuisha)'),(58991,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Happy Otanjoubi Series',1500,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1198/143426.jpg','ova','2015-02-18','finished_airing','Celebrate your birthday with Anpanman and friends! Each episode features characters, songs, and stories related to one month of the year.'),(58992,'Porong Porong Pororo Guchuljagjeon',1818,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1387/143429.jpg','tv_special','2013-12-25','finished_airing','A pirate ship arrives on the island, the pig pirates thinks there\'s treasure on that island. When they discover there\'s no treasure, they kidnap everyone except for Eddy and Pororo, who escaped. Will Pororo and Eddy manage to rescue the friends with the help from Tong Tong?\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(58993,'Pororo Sinnaneun Ujuyeohaeng',720,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1611/143430.jpg','movie','2014-09-24','finished_airing','Pororo the Little Penguin and his friends are off to an adventure where they can go to the space! But, curious Crong follows to find his watch and loses his friends. Crong meets the aliens that help him to get back to his friends. Will all of Pororo and his friends come back to their Porong Porong Island safely? What will happen on their adventure in the space? Light up and Go Spaceship!\n\n(Source: Amazon Prime)'),(58996,'Osomatsu-san 4th Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1871/149453.jpg','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Fourth season of Osomatsu-san.'),(59001,'Cheng He Titong',1500,78.5,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1340/143445.jpg','ona','2024-06-14','finished_airing','Yu Wanyin is teleported into a novel about palace struggles. The female protagonist of the novel is also teleported into it. To reverse her fate as a villain, Yu Wanyin chooses to join forces with a tyrant, who also turns out to be a modern man teleported in. Yu Wanyin hopes for the three modern people to put aside the palace struggles and just play cards and eat hotpot together peacefully. However, the female protagonist believes she is the chosen one, and still chooses to go against Yu Wanyin and the male protagonist King Duan\'s team. Thus, Yu Wanyin has to carry out a series of actions in order to survive and help Xia dynasty prevent the drought crisis...\n\n(Source: Iqiyi EN)'),(59002,'Hazure Skill \"Kinomi Master\": Skill no Mi (Tabetara Shinu) wo Mugen ni Taberareru You ni Natta Ken ni Tsuite',1420,57.599999999999994,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1703/146128.jpg','tv','2025-01-07','finished_airing','Light has obtained a bogus skill known as \"Fruitmaster\", a skill that specializes in the cultivation of fruits. Weighed down by the vast difference between him and his childhood friend who became an S-Rank adventurer, he spends his days working the farm and practicing his swordsmanship. However, one day, he accidentally eats a second skill fruit, which normally results in death...but not only does he miraculously survive, he discovers that his bogus skill actually contains a secret ability!\n\n(Source: Kodansha USA)'),(59005,'Leviathan',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1964/143449.webp','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','In 1914, on the eve of war, a fugitive prince and a girl in disguise meet aboard a bioengineered airship, the HMS Leviathan, and change the course of history. \n\n(Source: Netflix)'),(59006,'Pororo Mabeobsa: Jeonseol-ui Mabeobbong-eul Jikyeola',960,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1838/143450.jpg','ona','2018-10-24','finished_airing','Pororo and friends are on their magical program at a magic school led by Professor Tongtong. He is a well-known wizard around the town. They learn how to use magic wands, how to fly around on broomsticks, and more! All of a sudden, an evil wizard appears and threatens Tongtong for a hidden legendary magic wand. The evil wizard captures Tongtong in a glass ball and takes him.\n\n(Source: Amazon Prime)'),(59007,'Pororo Mabeobsa 2: Dragon Gisaga Doeeola',870,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1320/143451.jpg','ona','2019','finished_airing','Pororo becomes the Dragon Knight Wizard! Meet the newest movie to the Pororo the Wizard Series!\n\n(Source: Amazon Prime)'),(59010,'Yami Shibai 13',240,60.4,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1688/143456.webp','tv','2024-07-15','finished_airing','Thirteenth season of Yami Shibai.'),(59011,'Gendai Goyaku',720,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1189/144078.webp','tv','2024-07-07','finished_airing','The series focuses on teaching students famous quotations from historical figures from all over the world by presenting the quotations incorrectly at first as \"mistranslations\" in the \"modern day,\" encouraging the students to learn the correct quotes in the process.\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)'),(59012,'Wuliao Jiu Wanjie',1099,71.6,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1292/143461.webp','ona','2024-07-05','finished_airing','Men Ke, a social animal working as an office worker, was so bored in the first half of her life that she doubted her life, but in the second half of her life, she will die of boredom. How can the Earth heroine, who faces the threat of death every day but continues to go to work, and the alien hero, who is enthusiastic and wants to save her but is not very good at it, overcome boredom and live with a smile! \n\n(Source: Bilibili, Google translated)'),(59013,'Bubble Beam Berry Blast',68,59.6,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1858/143465.jpg','ona','2024-06-07','finished_airing','Join our aquatic party of Palafin, Greninja, Quaxly, and Piplup as they lend each other a Helping Hand in their pursuit of berries!\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(59014,'Crong Crong Ujudaesodong',1260,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1758/143469.jpg','ona','2020-05','finished_airing','All of the sudden, aliens who look exactly like Crong appeared in Porong Porong Village! Crong followed those aliens who look and act just like him into the space. Pororo and Eddie decided to go to space to find Crong. Where did the aliens, who looked like Crong come from? Will Crong can return to Porong Porong village?\n\n(Source: Amazon Prime)'),(59015,'Pororo Movie: Geugjangpan Dragon Castle Daemoheom',4320,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1362/143470.jpg','movie','2022-07-28','finished_airing','Pororo and his friends meet a young dragon who\'s been cast out of his castle. Together, they must outsmart a wizard who wants to be the new Dragon King.\n\n(Source: Netflix)'),(59018,'Xia Meng Hui',840,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1486/143473.jpg','movie','2023-05-23','finished_airing','The dream of a goldfish to return into its wild form uproars her long-forgotten memories, and a self-conscious monsoon is about to be uninhibited. \n\n(Source: FilmFreeway)'),(59019,'MF Ghost Battle Digest',4037,63.9,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1259/145369.jpg','ona','2024-03-19','finished_airing','Compilation film re-editing the original MF Ghost into a movie format.'),(59021,'Pororo-wa Chingudeul Geugjangpan Baileoseuleul Eobs-aejwo!',3780,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1757/143487.jpg','movie','2022-12-01','finished_airing','When a virus inside Pororo\'s video game escapes his tablet and causes trouble in the real world, the brave penguin and his friends jump to the rescue.\n\n(Source: Netflix)'),(59022,'Pororo 20-junyeon Special: Chuldong! Linawang-gug Daejagjeon',2760,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1715/143488.jpg','tv_special','2023-05-05','finished_airing','Pororo and his pals discover a cursed prince stuck as a wooden doll and set off to help him reclaim his kingdom from the evil duke who cast the spell.\n\n(Source: Netflix)'),(59024,'Chan',379,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1754/143490.jpg','movie','2023','finished_airing','Mom always braided my hair so tautly that it carved a distinct path atop my head. But one day, she cut off the carefully braided hair. As I took my first steps forward alone, my stride faltered. Along the path on my head, I touched our unbreakable inner attachment, and the journey of female growth we were both unprepared to face.\n\n(Source: Official Site)'),(59027,'Spy x Family Season 3',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1496/148625.webp','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','Third season of Spy x Family.'),(59029,'One Piece: Kizamareru Rekishi! Gekidou no Shinkyuu Yonkou!',1460,64.7,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1946/143496.webp','tv_special','2024-06-16','finished_airing','The third recap special of Egghead arc. Zoro and Brook give a recap of the Four Emperors.'),(59031,'Pororo Movie: Badas-sog Daemoheom',4260,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1038/148872.jpg','movie','2025-01-01','finished_airing','Pororo and his friends visit the stronghold of the Red Hunters, the guardians of the ocean, filled with admiration in their hearts. They face consecutive attacks from sea garbage, nasty sharks, and the terrifying sea monster Situs. Though Pororo and Crong are rescued by Merlok, their attempt to hunt Situs fails, and the creature escapes with their friends swallowed. Refusing to give up on their friends, Pororo and Crong decide to help Merlok capture Situs. However, Merlok’s revealed plan to sacrifice their friends shocks Pororo deeply. Can Pororo and Crong stop Merlok and save their friends?\n\n(Source: K-Movie Entertainment)'),(59032,'Cong Gu Huo Niao Kaishi: Long Cheng Fengyun',1080,0,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1377/143507.jpg','ona','2024-06-08','finished_airing','Li Yan, a martial artist with extraordinary talent, has only a few months left to live due to a terminal illness. When he was in a desperate situation, he accidentally met a man who called himself \"Tapir\" and was sent into a fruit of the \"Yanfu Fruit Tree\". Li Yan must complete three tasks issued by the system within the time limit, and earn money through boxing matches in exchange for Yanfu points to buy medicine that can cure terminal illnesses. \n\nAs he gets to know Longyuan Fortress where he is located, Li Yan is gradually involved in the disputes in the fortress, and he also realizes that there are other Yanfu Walkers competing with him in secret. After overcoming many difficulties, Li Yan finally successfully completed the task and gained a new life.\n\n(Source: bilibili, translated)'),(59033,'Pororo Loopy Moheom',1320,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1546/143508.jpg','ona','2020-09-26','finished_airing','Oh, no!! Pororo\'s friends are taken by the Giant!! However, Pororo and Loopy continue fighting because they are so different! Can Pororo and Loopy finish their adventure and successfully save their friends?\n\n(Source: Amazon Prime)'),(59035,'Baby',156,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1007/143510.webp','ona','2019-03-19','finished_airing','Unalloyed living beings, neither male nor female, are not ashamed of and do not hide themselves from anything. Each individual member of the group is having a meal, dancing and swimming together. They all dream of Utopia in which they can love each other and have a positive attitude toward the world without being tied down by rules and a grade of rank.\n\n(Source: Vimeo)'),(59036,'Shitasaki kara Koi 2nd Season',90,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1451/143514.webp','ona','2024-05-19','finished_airing','Second season of Shitasaki kara Koi.'),(59037,'Pororo Jyulagi Gujodae',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1265/143516.jpg','ona','2018','finished_airing','Stop, there!! Hellus saurus! Here comes the Pororo Jurassic Rescue Squad to save dino eggs and the world from the bad scientist Hellus Saurus! Hey, friends! Please support Pororo and friends so they can defeat Hellus!!\n\n(Source: Amazon Prime)'),(59038,'Porong Porong Sang-eo Bimiljagjeon',1320,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1259/143517.jpg','ona','2020','finished_airing','Pororo and friends decided to travel in the sea, which is full of various fish friends, pretty corals and seaweeds! Besides, there\'s a coral playground ! Fish friends told us not to go to coral playground, but Crong and I wanted to sneak in. But...what we met there was the horrible shark! Aah! Wait! I think the shark is hiding something. What is the secret story that the sharks want to tell us?\n\n(Source: Amazon Prime)'),(59040,'Mou Inu Chuui',51,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1470/143519.jpg','ona','2014-03-20','finished_airing','A short anime about a very cute animal called a dog. It has a cute face and also says dirty jokes! It\'s not just cute!\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(59041,'Qian Ting Zong Dong Yuan: Xun Long',5100,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1818/143529.jpg','movie','2024-06-01','finished_airing',''),(59042,'Gangtie Zhi Cheng',3600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1313/150213.jpg','ona','2024-06-03','finished_airing',''),(59043,'Huanying Lai Dao Duo Li Zhi Jia',5100,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1007/143523.jpg','movie','2024-06-10','finished_airing',''),(59047,'Tamon-kun Ima Docchi!?',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1633/148194.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Idol group F/ACE has recently risen in popularity all thanks to Tamon Fukuhara—its handsome, wild, and talented leader. Seventeen-year-old Utage Kinoshita is one of the vocal fans who greatly admires F/ACE. As her life revolves around worshiping Tamon, Utage works at a housecleaning company to earn money and continue supporting him.\n\nWhen her coworker gets sick, Utage is assigned to a new client with the same name as Tamon. She believes it is merely a coincidence—until she comes face to face with the real celebrity! Her surprise only grows when she discovers that, unlike the extroverted superstar known to the public, Tamon is actually a gloomy guy with no friends or self-confidence.\n\nGiven that Utage\'s adoration for Tamon knows no bounds, she vows to keep his secret and stay by his side—but dealing with Tamon\'s contrasting behaviors in and out of work might be the toughest job out there.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59049,'Maarui Kanojo to Zannen na Kareshi',690,59.2,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1141/143535.webp','tv','2024-06-08','finished_airing','The romantic comedy follows Mariko, a plus-sized nurse who loves to eat. Having no love experience, she thinks her life is devoid of love, until she meets a handsome man named Nagi at a group date that she is invited to. Nagi then asks her out on a date.\n\n(Source: ANN)'),(59051,'Pororo Gonglyong-woldeu',840,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1775/143541.jpg','ona','2019','finished_airing','Oh my gosh! A scary giant dinosaur ordered the pink dino Kong to bring one of Pororo\'s friends back to his planet. Their invasion to the Earth has begun! Meanwhile, the great inventor Eddy finishes his work on new outfits for the Pororo heroes. The outfits have some special power that will help the heroes to fight against dino Kong. Would the Pororo heroes be able to defeat the dinosaurs?\n\n(Source: Amazon Prime)'),(59052,'Pororo Gonglyong-woldeu 2',1140,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1136/143542.jpg','ona','2019','finished_airing','Finally, Pororo Heroes 2 is coming!! A scary giant dinosaur ordered the pink dino Kong to bring one of Pororo\'s friends back to his planet. Would the Pororo heroes be able to defeat the dinosaurs and save their friend?\n\n(Source: Amazon Prime)'),(59055,'Hana wa Saku, Shura no Gotoku',1380,71.39999999999999,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1787/146809.jpg','tv','2025-01-08','finished_airing','Since childhood, Hana Haruyama has been enthralled by the art of storytelling. After watching a child her age perform on television with mesmerizing grace, Hana decides to try it herself. She practices by reciting tales to Tonaki Island\'s children, who are always enthusiastic about her performances. However, growing up in such a small community, Hana remains unaware of the possibilities beyond her world, satisfied with how things are.\n\nEntering Sumomogaoka High School as a first-year student, Hana catches the attention of Mizuki Usurai, the president of the broadcasting club, with her skills. Despite Hana\'s hesitation and anxiety about the road ahead, Mizuki successfully convinces her to join the club, nurture her gift, and perhaps one day reach the top—the nationals of the NHK Broadcasting Competition.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59062,'Gachiakuta',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1543/143560.jpg','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Living in the slums of a wealthy town, Rudo and his foster father Regto try to coexist with the rest of the town\'s residents, but Rudo despises the wastefulness of the upper class. Ignoring the warnings from those around him, Rudo regularly rummages through the town\'s garbage in search of anything useful or valuable to save from the \"Abyss\"—a massive hole where anything considered trash is dumped, including people. Rudo\'s biological father was one such person, having been thrown into the Abyss after he was accused of murder.\n\nOne day, after running into a mysterious figure on the way home, Rudo returns to find Regto\'s dying body on the floor. He is immediately found at the scene by the authorities and is charged with murder. No one believes his claims of innocence, and he is thrown into the Abyss. Instead of dying, however, he finds himself in a strange, foul-smelling place surrounded by monsters made out of trash.\n\nWhen Rudo is attacked by said monsters, he is saved by a man named Enjin, who reveals himself to be a \"Cleaner\"—someone who uses special weapons called Vital Instruments to combat these creatures. In order to get his revenge on the one who killed Regto, Rudo reluctantly becomes a Cleaner to fight his way back up and out of the Abyss.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59063,'Tianting Ban Zhuan Xia',889,65.7,18,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1415/143561.webp','ona','2024-06-12','finished_airing','Li Ji, a cold and arrogant genius student in the Department of Architecture, was kidnapped by a creature from another world, Dark Qilin, and taken to a secret realm called Po Nian Space. The secret realm contained the ruins of an ancient heaven. Dark Qilin told him that he had to pass through if he wanted to go back. The test of heaven, and this test is to rebuild heaven...\n\n(Source: iQIYI, translated)'),(59064,'Pororo Gonchung Daemoheom',1200,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1767/143562.jpg','ona','2019','finished_airing','One sunny day, Pororo played hide and seek with his new friend Bomi. Suddenly, they saw a strange light and turned small like bugs! After that, they met a honey bee \'Haney\' who wants to become a singer. Haney is so bad at singing but she feels so happy while singing. Will Haney become a singer? Can Pororo and Bomi finish their adventure and successfully come back to home?\n\n(Source: Amazon Prime)'),(59065,'Pororo Gonglyong Ppyeoga Sal-anassda!',2040,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1621/143563.jpg','ona','2023-04-28','finished_airing','One early morning, Pororo and his friends visit the nature history museum. Suddenly, the museum starts to shake, and the exhibits begin to tumble down! TongTong\'s magic spell misfires, and all of the exhibits come to life. Can our friends set everything back as they are? Come along for a wild museum adventure with Pororo and his friends!\n\n(Source: Amazon Prime)'),(59068,'Dungeon Meshi 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1796/143572.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Dungeon Meshi.'),(59070,'Guilty Gear Strive: Dual Rulers',1419,60.5,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1750/150046.jpg','tv','2025-04-05','finished_airing','After the decline of the once robust fields of science and technology, a new energy source known as magic fuels the modern era. Humanity creates forbidden biological weapons: Gears. Those Gears eventually stand against humanity in a rebellion. Although they manage to overcome in the struggle for survival known as the Crusades, humanity\'s losses are so great that even after several decades pass, their emotional wounds remain unable to fully heal.\n\nSin Kiske, the child of a human and a Gear, heads to his father Ky and mother Dizzy\'s wedding ceremony. Their wedding breaks the ultimate taboo: a union between a human and a Gear. Even with the world at peace, it took many years for such a ceremony to come to fruition. Despite the complex array of emotions surrounding it, the wedding ceremony is met with blessings. When suddenly, a mysterious girl appears... The fated child inheriting Gear blood–and the mysterious girl who despises Gears. Their meeting would shake the world.\n\n(Source: Official site)'),(59072,'Ttogttog Bagsa Eddy',300,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1930/143578.jpg','tv','2010-12-01','finished_airing','Let\'s learn things about color, shapes, math, and manners with Eddy. Do you have a problem or a question on anything? Eddy will help you to solve it. Because, he\'s the clever fox Eddy!\n\n\n(Source: Amazon Prime)'),(59073,'Ttogttog Bagsa Eddy 2nd Season',300,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1669/143579.jpg','tv','2012-10-12','finished_airing','Second season of Ttogttog Bagsa Eddy.'),(59077,'Benghuai: Xing Qiong Tiedao - Gelamo de Yujin',363,79.6,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1367/143582.webp','ona','2024-06-14','finished_airing','Article 22 of Glamoth\'s military regulations: Knights must give all they have to Her Majesty, the queen. Including their lives.\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(59078,'Princession Orchestra',1420,66,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1831/149970.jpg','tv','2025-04-06','currently_airing','Alicepia, a land of wonder that has existed somewhere in the world since ancient times, was once home to loving inhabitants known as the Alicepians. Their peaceful lives were disrupted when a mysterious monster, Jamaock, began to appear, threatening the sparkling brilliance of their homeland. If nothing is done, Alyspia will lose its radiance forever.\n\nThis is the story of the \"Princesses,\" whose unwavering songs of courage and hope shine even in the darkest times. A pop-song fantasia filled with energy and bravery -- Princession Orchestra!\n\n(Source: Official YouTube, translated)'),(59084,'Jin Can Wangshi',900,0,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1321/143601.jpg','ona','2024-06-10','finished_airing','Adapted from the phenomenal suspense and strange story novel \"Miaojiang Gu Shi\" by Namo Jiasha. Lu Zuo, an ordinary young man who originally worked in a shop in Dongguan, accidentally obtained the powerful power of the golden silkworm from his grandmother when he returned to his hometown to visit his relatives. However, conspiracies and struggles surrounding the golden silkworm came one after another. How should Lu Zuo, who was involved in the disputes, deal with it?\n\n(Source: Youku, translated)'),(59087,'Jiandao Di Yi Xian 2nd Season',480,0,120,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1646/143610.jpg','ona','2024-06-12','finished_airing','The second season of Jiandao Di Yi Xian.'),(59088,'Tokyo Revengers: Santen Sensou-hen',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1340/148694.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Sequel to Tokyo Revengers: Tenjiku-hen.'),(59091,'Douwa Revenger',198,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1921/143615.jpg','ona','2024-10-27','currently_airing','A mini-anime which will adapt various fairy tale stories with the characters from Tokyo Revengers.'),(59093,'Kenyuu Densetsu Yaiba Pilot',768,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1672/145343.jpg','ova','1991','finished_airing','An unaired pilot episode of Kenyuu Densetsu Yaiba produced in 1991 for Sunday magazine. It was re-released in 2004 alongside the Kenyuu Densetsu Yaiba DVD box set.'),(59094,'Shuumatsu Train Doko e Iku? Recap',1420,59.900000000000006,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1036/143623.jpg','tv_special','2024-06-17','finished_airing','Recap of the first eleven episodes of Shuumatsu Train Doko e Iku?.'),(59095,'Tensei shitara Dainana Ouji Datta node, Kimama ni Majutsu wo Kiwamemasu 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1154/149614.webp','tv','2025-07-10','not_yet_aired','Second season of Tensei shitara Dainana Ouji Datta node, Kimama ni Majutsu wo Kiwamemasu.'),(59097,'Page of Lambda',90,64.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1569/143626.jpg','pv','2024-06-15','finished_airing','Nijisanji members Lize Helesta, Ange Katrina, and Inui Toko.\nCommonly known as \"Sanbaka,\" what if their original story was made into an anime?\nWe imagined and created a world where these girls could exist together and produced the opening animation and setting materials.\nThis is a new story of Sanbaka that transcends the boundaries between reality and fiction.\nLet\'s go on a journey together to imagine and create new sides to these girls!\n\n(Source: Official Webpage, translated)'),(59098,'Bai Lian Feisheng Lu 2nd Season',720,0,40,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1557/149938.jpg','ona','2024-06-14','finished_airing',''),(59105,'Majo no Takkyuubin x McDonald\'s CMs',15,61.6,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1114/143643.jpg','cm','2024-06-19','finished_airing','Kiki and Jiji bring you the delicious tastes of Europe.\n\n(Source: McDonaldsJapan)'),(59111,'Gujeyeogeseo Sala Dolaon Dwaeji',6300,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1081/143654.jpg','movie','2024-06-11','finished_airing',''),(59113,'Farmagia',1440,56.7,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1406/146839.webp','tv','2025-01-10','finished_airing','In Felicidad Underworld, farmers who can produce monsters from seeds and befriend them are called Farmagia. One of the world\'s five continents, Avrion, is home to a spirited Farmagia, Ten, and his friends—Chica, Arche, Leii, and a fairy named Lookie-Loo. They spend their days in peace, cultivating their fields alongside their monsters.\n\nEverything changes when the Magus, the leader of Felicidad, unexpectedly dies. Oración Seis, the six generals serving the ruler directly, choose one of their own, Glaza, as the new Magus. However, Glaza plans to renounce those without powers and elevate only the talented ones. Worse still, his forces attack Avrion to separate it from the rest of the world.\n\nWith the help of their allies, Ten and his friends resist the invasion. The party, each with their own creatures, must now rise up and fight to save Felicidad from imminent doom.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59114,'Daemon X Machina: Order Zero',270,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1658/146513.webp','ona','2019-07-31','finished_airing','Prologue animation for Daemon X Machina video game featuring original animation by studio Satelight.'),(59117,'Shadowverse Flame: Arc-hen Recaps',1432,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1856/143672.webp','tv_special','2024-06-22','finished_airing','Recap episodes of the Shadowverse Flame: Arc-hen.'),(59118,'Reginetta-san no Bouken',960,57.400000000000006,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1493/143667.webp','ova','2024-08-30','currently_airing',''),(59119,'Imaria',960,67.4,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1413/150092.jpg','ova','2024-08-30','currently_airing',''),(59120,'Shounen ga Otona ni Natta Natsu',1200,67.8,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1421/150018.webp','ova','2024-09-06','currently_airing','Ryuuki Kirishima is a boy who lives with his older sister, Reiko, after the tragic death of their parents in a car accident. One summer day, Ryuuki and his friends gather to watch adult videos for fun. Although Ryuuki doesn\'t usually enjoy this type of content, he feels inexplicably attracted to videos featuring Kiriru, a new and popular porn actress.\n\nAs he watches, Ryuuki feels a strong attraction to Kiriru, and to his surprise, she appears before him in person.\n\n(Source: TMDB)'),(59123,'Kumarba Season 2',60,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1897/144484.jpg','tv','2024-10-05','finished_airing','Second season of Kumarba.'),(59130,'Isekai Mokushiroku Mynoghra: Hametsu no Bunmei de Hajimeru Sekai Seifuku',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1013/148555.jpg','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Takuto Ira succumbed to illness at a young age and ended up reincarnating in a world that resembles the fantasy turn-based strategy game Eternal Nations. Not only did he reincarnate into his favorite game, but as the god who commands the evil civilization Mynoghra. With Mynoghra\'s beautiful hero unit, Sludge Witch Atou by his side, not even legendarily difficult race traits will stand in the way of restarting their civilization!\n\n(Source: Cross Infinite World)'),(59131,'Tensei Kizoku, Kantei Skill de Nariagaru 2nd Season',1419,74.6,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1280/143705.webp','tv','2024-09-29','finished_airing','Second season of Tensei Kizoku, Kantei Skill de Nariagaru.'),(59135,'Class no Daikirai na Joshi to Kekkon suru Koto ni Natta.',1420,67.8,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1775/147330.jpg','tv','2025-01-03','finished_airing','There is only one person that high school student Saito Houjou truly cannot stand—and that is his temperamental classmate, Akane Sakuramori. The two have always been on bad terms; their contrasting views and personalities only lead to endless fighting. However, everything changes when Saito\'s grandfather and Akane\'s grandmother arrange a sudden meeting and insist that the two get married!\n\nWalking down the aisle is the last thing Saito and Akane want, but they are quickly coerced into accepting the ridiculous plan and soon move into a shared house as husband and wife. Although Saito and Akane despise each other, navigating life together under the same roof may just turn their bitter hatred into everlasting love.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59136,'Tasokare Hotel',1419,72,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1974/147269.jpg','tv','2025-01-08','finished_airing','Situated within an endless twilight, the Tasogare Hotel welcomes anyone stuck between life and death. Unaware of their fate, guests must regain lost memories through mementos hidden in their designated hotel room. Most guests pass on or return to the world of living within days, while few others find themselves staying at the hotel for much longer than usual.\n\nNeko Tsukahara, a young woman with an expressionless face, finds herself at this hotel. As she is guided along by the staff, Neko regains enough of her memories to become invested in the plights of the other guests. Solving the guests\' affairs and the mystery behind the hotel turns out to be too interesting of a situation to pass up; Neko decides that simply being a guest is not enough to satisfy her curiosity.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59138,'Mash Burnedead-tachi to School Life',143,67.30000000000001,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1450/143717.jpg','ona','2023-08-13','finished_airing','Picture drama episodes released online and later included in the BD/DVDs.'),(59139,'Tsuki ga Michibiku Isekai Douchuu 3rd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1055/143718.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Third season of Tsuki ga Michibiku Isekai Douchuu.'),(59140,'Tobot V Season 2',660,0,48,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1888/143733.jpg','tv','2020-03-19','finished_airing',''),(59141,'Tobot V: Swag\'s Secret',660,0,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1781/143730.jpg','tv','2019-08-22','finished_airing',''),(59142,'Unnamed Memory Act.2',1420,70.9,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1137/147179.webp','tv','2025-01-07','finished_airing','Second season of Unnamed Memory.'),(59144,'Fuguushoku \"Kanteishi\" ga Jitsu wa Saikyou Datta',1420,63.3,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1683/146293.webp','tv','2025-01-09','finished_airing','In a fantasy world where \"jobs\" are god-given from birth, heroes are born, not made—and Ein\'s job of \"Appraiser\" has put him about as far from the \"hero\" pedestal as possible. Used, abused, and eventually abandoned by his fellow adventurers, Ein decides it just isn\'t worth going on. Lucky for Ein, though, the end may just be the beginning, as well as a new lease on life. Turns out, his \"worthless\" job may just be the key to becoming a hero after all.\n\n(Source: Kodansha USA, edited)'),(59145,'Ranma ½ (2024)',1331,80.19999999999999,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1155/144299.webp','tv','2024-10-06','finished_airing','During their martial arts training expedition in China, Ranma Saotome and his father Genma suffered an accident, which in turn, afflicted them with a curse—whenever they are doused with cold water, Ranma transforms into a girl, while his father turns into a panda! Only hot water can reverse these changes, but any further contact with cold water opens the can of worms once more.\n\nUnfortunately, the trouble does not end there, as Ranma finds out about his betrothal to one of the daughters of Soun Tendou, his father\'s closest friend. During the families\' first meeting, it is decided that Ranma is to be married to Akane, the youngest daughter, a decision that is met with vehement protests from both sides. The two are simply not compatible, yet they are forced to live under one roof. Ranma\'s status quo further adds to the chaos, leading him to a series of comedic situations and misunderstandings that, in the grand scheme of things, may just be what he needs to work with Akane.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59146,'Sore Ike! Anpanman Movie: Baikinman to Ehon no Lulun',3840,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1146/143727.jpg','movie','2024-06-28','finished_airing','One day, Baikinman finds a picture book. He hears a voice from the book saying, \"Baikinman, warrior of love and courage, come and save me!\" and is sucked into the book. He meets Lulun, a forest fairy, in a large forest beyond the desert. Lulun is scared and can\'t muster up her courage, so she asks Baikinman to defeat the \"Sucking Elephant\" that is rampaging through the forest. Although she is reluctant at first, Lulun is inspired by Baikinman\'s refusal to give up and stand up to her. However, she has a hard time with the strength of the Sucking Elephant! In a desperate situation, Baikinman tells Lulun, \"Call Anpanman!\" Anpanman and Baikinman join forces and do great things! \n\n(Source: Official Site, translated)'),(59147,'Tobot V: Ujusuhodae',680,0,32,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1691/143736.jpg','tv','2021-05-26','finished_airing',''),(59148,'Mirai no Kuromaku-kei Akuyaku Reijou Moriarty no Isekai Kanzen Hanzai Hakusho',630,59,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1769/144658.webp','tv','2024-07-19','finished_airing','After suffering a crushing defeat against a legendary detective, James Moriarty is reincarnated as a ghost in another world. He wakes up in the body of Sherry Moriarty—a severely bullied student from the elitist All Blue Academy—and manages to save the young woman, who was attempting to take her own life.\n\nAlthough James has forgotten his name and past, he has retained his criminal expertise and is determined to help Sherry get revenge against Porgrette Whey Cochon and the other noblewomen who have made Sherry\'s existence miserable. The bullies of All Blue Academy will learn the hard way that when two Moriartys unite to commit the perfect crime, no one can stand in their way.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59149,'Holostars★Survival: Oretachi no Kaitaku Seikatsu',160,59.6,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1895/143737.jpg','ona','2024-03-18','finished_airing','A short following the eccentric and hilarious daily lives of the Holostars VTubers in a survival setting!'),(59150,'Wu Liuqi: Jiyi Suipian',900,81.8,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1126/145681.jpg','ona','2024-10-02','finished_airing','In order to find his cherished partner, Wu Liuqi returns to Xuanwu Country and faces those forgotten fragments of memory. The dusty truth brings pain and anger, but now he is no longer alone. What is the purpose of having power? This time, Wu Liuqi has to make a new choice for his life...\n\n(Source: Official Site)'),(59151,'Wudi Lu Zhandui 2nd Season',720,0,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1542/143753.jpg','ona','2022-01-14','finished_airing',''),(59152,'Wudi Lu Zhandui 3rd Season',720,0,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1699/143754.jpg','ona','2023-08-04','finished_airing',''),(59156,'Ludi Jian Xian',480,0,150,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1748/150196.jpg','ona','2024-06-24','currently_airing','The top of the immortals, proud of the world, as long as my ancestor An is there, there is the sky. There are three million sword immortals in the world, and they must bow their heads when they meet me. As a sword immortal, I should suppress all enemies in the world. Who claims to be invincible, who claims to be undefeated?\n\n(Source: iQIYI)'),(59160,'Wind Breaker Season 2',1435,78.7,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1526/148873.jpg','tv','2025-04-04','currently_airing','Second season of Wind Breaker.'),(59161,'Bad Girl',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1672/148848.webp','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Yuu Yuutani, a first-year high school student with sharp eyes, large piercings, and flashy two-tone hair, is not a well-known bad girl who everyone makes way for. She is actually a very good girl at heart, and her mind is always full of thoughts of the school\'s Madonna, Atori Mizutori. Wanting to attract the attention of the disciplinary committee chairman Atori, Yuu decides to quit being an honor student and become a \"bad delinquent!\" A school comedy depicting the struggles of a slightly foolish self-proclaimed delinquent is about to begin!\n\n(Official Site, translated)'),(59162,'Kinnikuman: Kanpeki Chоujin Shiso-hen Episode 0',1427,64.9,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1937/143762.jpg','tv_special','2024-07-07','finished_airing','Episode 0 of Kinnikuman: Kanpeki Chоujin Shiso-hen.'),(59163,'Robot Trains Season 2',780,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1288/143893.jpg','tv','2018-09-20','finished_airing',''),(59165,'Lunny-chan to Tanjoubiya-san',78,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1288/143767.jpg','ona','2024-06-21','finished_airing','An adaptation of the picture book Lunny-chan to Tanjoubiya-san.'),(59167,'Dame da yo',226,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1607/143769.jpg','movie','2023-08-11','finished_airing','A short film by Atsushi Wada for the Kitaro Expo, which celebrated the 100 year anniversary of Shigeru Mizuki\'s birth.'),(59169,'Aru Majo ga Shinu Made',1420,70.8,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1620/148221.jpg','tv','2025-04-01','currently_airing','On her seventeenth birthday, the apprentice witch Meg learns that she only has one year left to live. Her teacher, the long-lived witch Faust, explains that the only way to undo the death curse is to collect tears of joy and grow the seed of life. To find them, Meg will have to leave the sheltered life she\'s always known and head out into the world. There will be meetings, partings, and friendships aplenty, and of course many tears. Meg will learn the most important lessons for a witch are bright, sweet, and somewhat heart wrenching.\n\n(Source: Yen Press)'),(59173,'Futsuma *jo Charlotte',960,57.599999999999994,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1904/143783.webp','ova','2024-09-27','currently_airing',''),(59174,'Mahouka Koukou no Rettousei Movie: Yotsuba Keishou-hen',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1134/143786.webp','movie','2025','not_yet_aired','An anime movie adapting the Yotsuba Succession Arc.'),(59175,'Ooi! Tonbo 2nd Season',1453,73.2,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1115/145549.webp','tv','2024-10-05','finished_airing','After graduating middle school, Tonbo Ooi sets sail from the isolated island of Tokara to Kumamoto in hopes of advancing her golf career. Using his connections, Tonbo\'s mentor Kazuyoshi Igarashi is able to convince coach Hajime Udou to train her. While Tonbo initially has trouble showing off her abilities with her peculiar playstyle and inexperience with using a variety of golf clubs, she quickly proves her worth at her course debut by making use of her unique skills.\n\nLeaving an impression on Hajime and the people around her, Tonbo is sent to compete in the Kyushu Women\'s Championship. Met with familiar faces and new rivals, she is determined to dive deeper into the professional world of golf.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59176,'Mahou no Shimai Lulluto Lilly',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1774/143806.webp','tv','2026','not_yet_aired','A new magical girl project by Studio Pierrot.'),(59177,'Kaijuu 8-gou 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1049/147109.webp','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Second season of Kaijuu 8-gou.'),(59178,'Zhui Xu 2nd Season',1403,72.2,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1296/143811.webp','ona','2024-07-28','finished_airing','The second season of Zhui Xu.'),(59179,'Guai Xiang Shou',960,68.1,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1077/143812.webp','ona','2024-08-05','finished_airing','Wei Ran, a college graduate, was accidentally led into a world he never thought existed by a cat. When he was trying to find a way to return home, he learned that the only train that could take him back to the human world would only arrive in half a year. He could only temporarily live in the shop run by Mao Mao Yaya - Guaixiang Sale. Just when life seemed to be settling down, Wei Ran unexpectedly discovered that no matter where he went, dragon scales would appear. And every time the dragon scales appear, it causes completely different strange effects... \n\n(Source: Bilibili, Google translated)'),(59180,'Bai Fa Shen La',1114,0,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1442/143813.jpg','ona','2024-07-11','finished_airing','Shen La, a special investigator of the \"Poll Bureau\" of the mysterious incident management agency, was seriously injured in the execution of his mission. When he was about to die, he accepted the inheritance of Wu Rendi, the director of the Sixth Office - a \"seed\" containing mysterious power. After regaining consciousness, Wu Rendi\'s senior brother Guangren accepted him as his disciple. In order to find the fragments of the Tianli Diagram, Shen La, after going through the Tianshan Wolf Tomb, energy backlash, foundation conspiracy and other incidents, was finally recognized by Wu Rendi and received the ancient artifact-the Twin Swords of Crime and Punishment given by him. At the same time, the problem of the insider in the polling bureau became more complicated and confusing, and Shen La and her partner Sun Desheng went into battle again.\n\n(Source: Bilibili, Google translated)'),(59181,'Long Zhong Ren',1056,70.3,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1395/143814.jpg','ona','2024-08-06','finished_airing','Fei Xingkong and Sirui suddenly found themselves living in a comic cage, and they wanted to escape back to the real world. However, facing the absolute control of the \"author\", the two were forced to flee in the unpredictable world of the story... \n\n(Source: Bilibili, Google translated)'),(59182,'Xi Jing Sushe',929,66.6,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1699/143815.jpg','ona','2024-08-29','finished_airing','Bai Junyan, a neighbor\'s white lotus with the fragrance of tea; Luo Ben, a flower of wealth in the world with eyes higher than the top. The two drama queens were assigned to the same dormitory and joined the same drama club. In front of them, there appeared the sophomore drama club senior and iceberg male god Gao Shu, and his mysterious roommate Ouyang who is highly socially afraid... At this point, the actors on the stage have gathered. Will they take off their masks and be honest? treat each other; or will they each show their special powers and create a campus drama of intrigue?\n\n(Source: Bilibili, Google translated)'),(59183,'Sanguo Sha: Taiping Tianshu',1371,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1244/143816.jpg','ona','2024-06-18','finished_airing','The Grand Prize Challenge was born, and the talented player Guo Xiaoye, who had been suspended for two years due to a frame-up, once again challenged the top. In order to prove that he has regained his original intention, he and his natural general Guo Jia passed the test, but discovered a shocking conspiracy during the game - the damage in the game can actually be transmitted to real players!\n\n(Source: Tencent, Google translated)'),(59185,'Sex ga Suki de Suki de Daisuki na Classmate no Ano Musume',900,71.2,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1503/150019.jpg','ova','2024-09-06','currently_airing','Sakurai Taichi, facing a financial crunch, lands a job as an assistant on a film shoot where he reunites with his schoolmate and the most beautiful girl in school, Himawari Kanan. To his surprise, the shoot turns out to be for an adult video, which initially shocks Taichi, who tries to decline the offer. However, Kanan accepts the role, claiming it will be an educational experience. Despite feeling uncomfortable with Kanan\'s bold actions, Taichi finds enjoyment in working alongside her. During the shoot, the lead actor has an accident, and Taichi steps in to replace him, which leads Kanan to also participate in the video.\n\n(Source: TMDB)'),(59186,'Fuuto Tantei Movie: Kamen Rider Skull no Shouzou',4920,73.4,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1396/150089.jpg','movie','2024-11-08','finished_airing','\"How were Gaia Memories created?\" \"Why did W begin to fight?\" To answer Tokime\'s questions, Shoutarou quietly begins to tell a story. He speaks of his meeting and parting with a man he admired and called his old man—his mentor, Soukichi Narumi.\n\nMysterious people called Dopants, who utilized the powers of Gaia Memories, had begun appearing in the shadows of Fuuto, the windy city. A young Shoutarou had become an assistant of the detective Soukichi and, though called half-baked, began to follow in his footsteps. Unaware that, in addition to his detective work, Soukichi was secretly acting as Skull, Shoutarou began to grow frustrated with his mentor. That was when the Narumi Detective Agency received a phone call—a request from Hell inviting Shoutarou and company to a fateful night! When Shoutarou tracked down Soukichi to deliver the \"trump card\" bestowed by the mysterious caller, what did he see?\n\nShoutarou and Philip. The one detective made of two and the night when Kamen Rider W began. That whole story will finally be revealed.\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(59189,'Sentai Daishikkaku 2nd Season',1438,76.2,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1405/147694.jpg','tv','2025-04-13','currently_airing','Second season of Sentai Daishikkaku.'),(59190,'Genjitsu no Yohane: Sunshine in the Mirror Movie',5340,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1192/145164.webp','movie','2024-11-29','finished_airing','Theatrical compilation of Genjitsu no Yohane: Sunshine in the Mirror.'),(59192,'Kimetsu no Yaiba Movie: Mugen Jou-hen',0,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1681/148216.jpg','movie','2025-07-18','not_yet_aired','Anime movie trilogy adaptation of the Infinity Castle Arc.'),(59193,'Mushoku Tensei III: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1826/143892.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Third season of Mushoku Tensei: Isekai Ittara Honki Dasu.'),(59199,'Classic★Stars',1420,54.3,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1564/148380.jpg','tv','2025-04-06','currently_airing','Gloria Private Academy is a school where promising young people gather in all fields of entertainment, including music, art, and sports. In the music department, those who match the \"talent\" of great musicians are transplanted with a \"gift\" into their bodies and are called by the name of that musician. Beethoven, a young man who was discovered to be compatible after an injury, is one of them. After transferring to the school, Beethoven meets classmates with different gifts and discovers the charm of music, while aiming to win the competition.\n\n(Source: Official Site, translated)'),(59200,'Etopirika: Omoi wo Tsumugu Tori',1423,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1847/143942.webp','ona','2022-04-20','finished_airing','Etopirika: A Bird that Spins Thoughts is a animated film created based on the testimonies of former residents of the Northern Territories.\n\nThe film was produced with the aim of helping many people, especially young people, learn more about what happened in the Northern Territories at the end of the war and the harsh experiences of the former islanders who were forced to leave their homes, and to raise momentum for the return of the Northern Territories.\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(59204,'Magic Knight Rayearth (Shin Anime)',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1984/143950.jpg','unknown','','not_yet_aired','New anime project for Magic Knight Rayearth to celebrate the anime\'s 30th anniversary.'),(59205,'Clevatess: Majuu no Ou to Akago to Shikabane no Yuusha',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1353/146697.jpg','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Alicia, who had dreamed of becoming a hero since childhood, is chosen by the king as one of the thirteen heroes. Armed with a legendary sword, the heroes set out to defeat the Demon King Clevatess. However, their recklessness triggers a terrible crisis that could wipe out all of humanity on the continent of Edsea. Now, the world\'s only hope lies with a baby entrusted to the Demon King.\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(59207,'Mikadono Sanshimai wa Angai, Choroi.',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1513/145509.webp','tv','2025-07-10','not_yet_aired','As the son of the late legendary actress Subaru Ayase, Yuu has had many expectations placed upon him after he transferred to Saika Academy, a highly prestigious school where students can hone their personal talents. However, in contrast to his mother, Yuu is completely talentless. Being seen as completely mediocre, he would have no chance of standing side by side with the three emperors of Saika Academy: the Mikadono sisters, Miwa, Niko, and Kazuki, who are each prodigies in shogi, martial arts, and performing arts, respectively.\n\nWith Subaru\'s friend agreeing to take her son in, Yuu aims to fulfill his mother\'s last wish to him, which is to build a happy family, after never being able to form a proper mother-son relationship due to their difference in talent. As it turns out, his mother\'s friend is actually the father of the Mikadono sisters! Keeping his mother\'s wish in mind, Yuu aims to build familial bonds with the siblings. However, due to their extreme focus on their respective specializations, they show little interest in opening themselves up not only to him, but to each other as well. Nonetheless, Yuu strives to continuously support the three prodigies, as his kindness and care restores the bond between the sisters.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59208,'GR86 x Initial D',90,66.8,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1437/143987.jpg','cm','2022-08-26','finished_airing','A commercial from Toyota China collaborating with Initial D to promote the latest model of the Toyota GR86.'),(59224,'SINoALICE: Ichiban Saigo no Monogatari',3870,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1163/144050.jpg','movie','2024-02-23','finished_airing','Alice\'s life has been miserable ever since she started playing SINoALICE. In despair at the world, she takes her own life, but wakes up and finds herself within the game, interacting with the game\'s navigator characters Parrah and Noya, who throw every despair of her previous life at her. As Parrah and Noya take Alice away, the game\'s characters plan to face the two.\n\n(Source: ANN)'),(59225,'Shi Wangzhe A?: Youqiubiying Xingzhi Dui',526,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1451/144056.jpg','ona','2024-06-13','finished_airing',''),(59226,'Ao no Exorcist: Yosuga-hen',1425,80,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1390/147040.webp','tv','2025-01-05','finished_airing','Unlike his twin brother, Yukio, Rin Okumura never wished to know about their parents and the circumstances surrounding his own birth. Yet the master of time, Mephisto Pheles, gives Rin a key that transports him 40 years into the past when his late mother, Yuri Frederick Egin, was merely a child. With Mephisto\'s guidance, Rin leaps through the years of Yuri\'s childhood and her adolescence as an exorcist-in-training.\n\nEarly on, Yuri meets Shirou Fujimoto, Rin and Yukio\'s adoptive father. As Rin follows Yuri and Shirou\'s lives, he witnesses firsthand the initial appearances of Satan, his true father, and the horrors unfolding at the True Cross Order\'s special Section 13. Yuri\'s unique connection to Satan eventually leads Rin to the truth behind the most horrific event in exorcist history and the day he and Yukio were born—the Blue Night.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59228,'Kuroshitsuji: Midori no Majo-hen',1420,82.8,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1517/148292.jpg','tv','2025-04-05','currently_airing','By the Queen\'s orders, Sebastian and Ciel head to Germany to investigate mysterious deaths that have been occurring. As the two investigate the truth behind the \"Werewolf Forest,\" where anyone who steps foot inside is cursed to death, a terrible curse falls upon them.\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(59229,'Enen no Shouboutai: San no Shou Part 2',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1668/144076.webp','tv','2026-01','not_yet_aired','Second part of Enen no Shouboutai: San no Shou.'),(59230,'Zenchi-teki na Dokusha no Shiten kara',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1549/144140.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Kim Dokja does not consider himself the protagonist of his own life. Befitting the name his parents gave him, he is a solitary person whose sole hobby is reading web novels. For over a decade, he has lived vicariously through Yoo Joonghyuk, the main character of the web novel Three Ways to Survive the Apocalypse (TWSA). Through Joonghyuk, Dokja has experienced secondhand the trials of repeatedly regressing in time, in search of an end to life-threatening \"scenarios\" that force people to act out narratives for the amusement of god-like \"Constellations.\"\n\nAfter reading 3,149 chapters—long after all other readers lost interest—Dokja finally resigns himself to the story ending. However, he receives an enigmatic message from the author, stating that the story will soon be monetized, before his surroundings suddenly go dark. He swiftly realizes that fiction has become reality and he is now living through TWSA. Although he is the singular omniscient reader of the events yet to come, his success in the scenarios is not guaranteed—but perhaps his advantage will empower him to step into the protagonist role that never suited him before. \n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59231,'First Line',540,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1445/144080.jpg','movie','2024-06-28','finished_airing','Young animator Mito feels trapped between the demands of a difficult sequence, a tight deadline, debilitating self-doubt, and a seemingly deranged director. Sometimes the only way to get to the other side is to charge right through.\n\n(Source: Fantasia Film Festival)'),(59235,'Minami-ke (Shin Series)',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1026/144103.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','New Minami-ke anime.'),(59236,'San Shaonu',5700,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1589/144093.jpg','movie','2024-07-06','finished_airing','Qingdai, a royal umbrella\'s fairy, embarks on a journey with a young craftsman to prevent war after failing to guard a vengeful sword\'s fairy who escapes the royal pavilion.\n\n(Source: IMDB)'),(59237,'Luo Fanchen (Movie)',7080,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1143/144094.jpg','movie','2024-07-12','finished_airing',''),(59241,'Luo Fanchen',360,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1787/144095.webp','ona','2020-06-18','finished_airing',''),(59242,'Xi Yangyang Yu Hui Tailang Zhi Shouhu',5880,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1373/144096.webp','movie','2024-07-19','finished_airing',''),(59243,'Mayi Chuanqi: Shenmu Qi Yuan',5400,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1465/144097.jpg','movie','2023-12-16','finished_airing',''),(59244,'Mayi Chuanqi: Liehuo Chongsheng',5640,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1628/144098.jpg','movie','2024-06-29','finished_airing',''),(59245,'Cang Yuan Tu: Dongning Fu Fanwai Pian',1412,76.7,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1747/144105.webp','ona','2024-07-13','finished_airing',''),(59246,'Shaonian Bai Ma Zui Chun Feng 2nd Season',0,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1324/150026.jpg','ona','2024-07-17','finished_airing','The second season of Shaonian Bai Ma Zui Chun Feng.'),(59251,'Shinkalion: Change the World - Ushinawareta Kioku',1424,59.699999999999996,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1820/144131.webp','tv_special','2024-07-07','finished_airing','\"How did it end up like this... Where did I end up, and what did I do...?\"\n\nAs the driver of the Phantom Shinkalion, Ina stood in front of Taisei and the others. What was Ina doing behind the scenes of the battle with Taisei and the others?\n\nA special edition looking back on the past from Ina\'s perspective.\n\n(Source: Shinkalion Wiki)'),(59256,'Moga CMs',22,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1984/144144.webp','cm','2015','finished_airing','Advertising of the application for motels \"moga\".'),(59259,'Uribo',110,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1253/144149.jpg','ona','2016-01-07','finished_airing','A couple short films by Sovat Theatre used as workshop demonstrations and posted to Sovat Theater\'s YouTube channel for public play.'),(59262,'Baiyun Cang Gou',2104,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1595/144156.jpg','movie','2023','finished_airing','In a city like an abyss, the four children who have just graduated from school grow up in the journey and embark on their own lives in the journey. They are separated and reunited. Perhaps the reunion is joy, while the separation has become numb, they drift with the tide and fight against time.\n\n(Source: Official Site)'),(59265,'Magic Maker: Isekai Mahou no Tsukurikata',1420,68.3,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1802/146725.webp','tv','2025-01-09','finished_airing','A 30-year-old man who dreams of becoming a wizard suddenly loses his life. Reincarnated in another world as a young child named Shion, he grows up alongside Marie, his dependable older sister who adores him. Shion eagerly anticipates using magical powers, but he discovers that the new world seemingly does not have any magic. He spends the ensuing years as a gloomy and dejected child until a mystical phenomenon at a nearby lake catches the siblings\' attention and breathes life back into his magical dream.\n\nWhile experimenting on the peculiar light emanating from the water, Shion finally confirms that magical energy really exists. It may not be convenient for anything just yet, but Shion devotes his time to studying the anomaly, determined to uncover all the existing wonders in his quest to make magic.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59266,'Wataridori to Katatsumuri',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1919/144161.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Unpei Mochizuki, a second-year employee at a machine part wholesaler, makes a mistake that causes problems for his clients. Feeling upset, he thinks about running away to a place where no one knows him. That\'s when he meets Tsugumi Nagisa, a picture book author with a youthful face and glasses, who travels around with her dog in her car, which they use as their home. They spend their days on the road, living in the car and enjoying a new way of traveling, free from any schedule.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(59267,'Sanda',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1490/147156.jpg','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','The story starts with Sanda, a second year middle school student, getting attacked with a kitchen knife by his classmate Fuyumura. While Sanda couldn\'t make sense of the situation at first, he gradually came to believe that Fuyumura\'s actions were just mean acts stemming off from the latter having a peculiar puberty phase.\n\nBut that was all actually a misunderstanding. Fuyumura is seriously questioning if Sanda is actually the descendant of a certain family...\n\n(Source: MU)'),(59271,'Marine Snow',1320,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1887/144175.jpg','movie','1960-11-26','finished_airing','An animated film by Hiroshi Manabe released at the first screening from the Animation Sannin no Kai collective of which he was a founding member.'),(59272,'Electone Vostok',88,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1286/144178.jpg','movie','','finished_airing',''),(59273,'Zero no Hakken',1252,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1209/144179.jpg','movie','1963','finished_airing',''),(59274,'T.P BON Season 2',1652,69.1,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1779/144181.webp','ona','2024-07-17','finished_airing','Second season of T.P BON.'),(59275,'King of Prism: Dramatic Prism.1',3600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1942/144184.jpg','movie','2024-08-16','finished_airing','Movie version of King of Prism: Shiny Seven Stars with new content.'),(59276,'Seitokai ni mo Ana wa Aru! PV',21,72.4,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1485/144185.jpg','pv','2024-07-09','finished_airing','A promotional video advertising the Seitokai ni mo Ana wa Aru! manga.'),(59277,'Kanojo, Okarishimasu 4th Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1765/147511.webp','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Fourth season of Kanojo, Okarishimasu.'),(59278,'Trip',298,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1323/144190.jpg','movie','2005','finished_airing','A collaborative film from Keiichi Tanaami and Nobuhiro Aihara.'),(59279,'Akai Inei',403,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1749/144191.jpg','movie','2021','finished_airing','A convergence of childhood memories of World War II with the images of western Pop introduced to Japan in the years of reconstruction.\n\n(Source: Widewalls)'),(59280,'Youshi Kei (Joshou)',672,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1375/144192.jpg','movie','1978','finished_airing','A short film by Keiichi Tanaami.'),(59290,'Naoe-kun wa Yasesasetai.',660,54.2,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1795/144366.webp','tv','2024-07-07','finished_airing','Naoe-kun wa Yasesasetai. is a weekly mini anime shown with each Elf-san wa Yaserarenai. episode exclusively on the AT-X broadcast of the TV anime. They are also released separately from the series on streaming services.'),(59291,'Huyao Xiao Hongniang: Jing Hua Yuan',1099,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1747/144208.jpg','ona','2024-08-03','finished_airing',''),(59301,'Yuanshen: Yin Ran PV - Yi Fan Liao Zhu Ming',224,68.2,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1806/144265.webp','pv','2024-07-12','finished_airing','Promotional video showcasing the Natlan cast of characters in Genshin Impact.'),(59306,'Zhan Shen: Fanchen Shenyu',1511,80.9,15,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1514/144274.jpg','ona','2024-07-31','finished_airing','It follows the journey of Lin Qiye, a blind high school student who unexpectedly becomes a night watchman, tasked with protecting the nation from \"mystical\" invasions as the mist descends and gods reawaken. Leading his team, he tirelessly eliminates mythical creatures that emerge in modern society and eventually sets out on the path of god-slaying, evolving from guarding his small family to defending the nation.\n\n(Source: WeTV)'),(59308,'Aikatsu Academy!',82,61.8,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1484/144278.webp','pv','2024-07-16','finished_airing','The series will follow three new idols in training: Himeno Mieru, Mamimu Meh and Wao Parin. But since they\'re currently unknown, they decide to do their own advertising and gather a fanbase. Together, they form the Aikatsu Academy! Streaming Club to record and broadcast their idol activities.'),(59320,'Sinbi Apartment: Cheolgungiwa Cheolwon Hieolojeu Hantangangui Jeonseol',717,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1383/144293.jpg','tv_special','2023-12-21','finished_airing',''),(59321,'Sinbi Apartment: Bulgeunnunui Sasin',4620,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1561/144294.jpg','movie','2024-08-14','finished_airing','Recap of the plot of Sinbi\'s Apartment: Phantom Ball: Zero - Du Beonjjae Iyagi.'),(59322,'Shirobuta Kizoku desu ga Zense no Kioku ga Haeta node Hiyoko na Otouto Sodatemasu',1420,61.3,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1231/149888.jpg','tv','2025-04-20','currently_airing','In a world where Western and Asian cultures mix together, the only son of Count Kikunoi from the Kiryuu Empire, is Ageha. His life was already over at the age of 5. He, who was born in a corner of the country, has zero allies or useful skills in addition to being overweight. What\'s more, it seems that his brother Regulus, who suddenly appeared on his life and was presented for the Count as his brother, will kill him in the future for his right to succeed...\n\nHis only weapons, are the abilities of \"cooking and sewing,\" that he suddenly acquired along with the memories of his previous Japanese life. In the midst of all this, Ageha ends up raising his younger brother, but... \"My brother is super cute?\" And before he knows it, he becomes a full-blown doting older brother?!\n\nMaking handmade educational toys for his cute little brother and delicious chawanmushi (steamed egg custard)... With the help of his previous life\'s skills and my power as a housekeeper, he\'s able to improve the rough life of the people living in his territory. A fantasy of two young brothers managing their territory, where a single step gets even the gods involved in changing their country!\n\n(Source: Shousetsuka ni Narou, translated)'),(59324,'Green Mix',60,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1982/144304.jpg','pv','2002','finished_airing','A preview for B-DASH\'s album Po, featuring the song Green Mix.'),(59325,'Kehin Kazoku',300,0,30,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1932/144305.jpg','ona','2009-01-14','finished_airing','Satoshi Totsugawa, a 39-year-old man working at a small advertising agency in the city, is proud, vain, and full of complexes. He laments his own situation, which is far below his wife\'s annual income, is manipulated by a poor junior at work, and cannot hide his infidelity from a fellow designer. He is a middle-aged man who is on the path to a life of complaints. But then Satoshi is appointed head of the apartment building association, and is manipulated by the eccentric residents! Set in the ultra-futuristic tower apartment building \"Keihin Grand Solenase\" that towers into the sky above Keihin, this is a realistic, yet comical and loving portrayal of modern people\'s communication patterns.\n\n(Source: Wikipedia, translated)'),(59326,'Kehin Kazoku Specials',300,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1130/144306.jpg','special','2010-04-09','finished_airing','Special episodes of Kehin Kazoku.'),(59327,'Shen Wu Tianzun (2024)',1055,67,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1354/144307.webp','ona','2024-07-27','finished_airing','The only body cultivator in the nine realms was betrayed by his close friend Li Yunfei, and his body and soul disappeared. By chance, his soul remained immortal, and unexpectedly happened to Xiao Chen, a dying disciple of Qingyun Sect. After rebirth, Xiao Chen not only resurrected, but also awakened his supreme magical power. He also vowed to take back everything that belonged to him, and walked out on his own magical path as the \"Venerable God\".\n\n(Source: Iqiyi, Google translated)'),(59328,'Incha Couple ga You Gal-tachi to Sex Training Suru Hanashi',960,76,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1315/150094.webp','ova','2024-09-27','currently_airing','Unstoppable gals get out of control! The sex life of an otaku student couple develops rapidly due to the influence of gal schoolgirls.\n\n(Source: TMDB)'),(59342,'Jigoku Sensei Nube (2025)',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1637/148197.jpg','tv','2025-07-02','not_yet_aired','A number of inexplicable phenomena have been plaguing the town of Domori. In order to protect the town\'s children, a new homeroom teacher known as \"Nube\" arrives.\nNormally gentle and a bit outgoing, Nube has a secret side: he is, in fact, the only psychic teacher in Japan. Rumor also has it his left hand is possessed by a demon! Hell\'s messenger of justice is here to take on the school\'s seven mysteries, ghosts, and evil spirits attacking his students. This occultist action story starts now!\n\n(Source: Official Website)'),(59345,'Akarui Sekai',2520,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1306/144346.jpg','ova','2008-12-17','finished_airing',''),(59349,'Salaryman ga Isekai ni Ittara Shitennou ni Natta Hanashi',1430,66,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1668/144352.jpg','tv','2025-01-06','finished_airing','Dennosuke Uchimura is your normal, everyday salaryman trying to climb the corporate ladder. But then he’s summoned to a terrifying fantasy world by the Demon Overlord, who offers him a new job—as one of the Heavenly Kings in his army, with full benefits! Uchimura may not have muscles or magic, but he does have an office worker’s skills and savvy. Will they be enough to keep him alive?\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)'),(59351,'Wo De San Ti',1164,0,11,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1999/144354.jpg','ona','2014-02-27','finished_airing',''),(59352,'Wo De San Ti: Luo Ji Zhuan',978,0,11,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1801/144355.jpg','ona','2016-06-09','finished_airing',''),(59353,'Wo De San Ti 4th Season',1464,0,9,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1302/144356.jpg','ona','2024-07-14','finished_airing',''),(59354,'Shi Dao Zhe',901,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1252/144358.jpg','ona','2024-04-27','finished_airing','Theresa was assassinated and the Tower of Babel fell. After the nameless soldiers involved in the core assassination mission were eliminated, W\'s anger was not extinguished yet. Next on the revenge list is a team of Sarkaz mercenaries who provided assistance outside the assassination operation. They were escorting \"something\" and fleeing to the border...\n\nThis is a memory that W has never mentioned.\n\nIt is the epitome of the Sakazi\'s struggle to survive the long war - the victim will pick up the dagger of the victimizer, and the cycle of destiny will continue.\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(59356,'-Socket-',185,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1043/144360.jpg','movie','2010','finished_airing','A girl with a cord growing out of her back wanders around hungry and searching for electricity.\n\n(Source: YouTube, translated)'),(59357,'Turning the Tera Tide',80,58.2,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1337/144361.webp','ona','2024-07-15','finished_airing','Our glistening hero quartet lands in hot water in Turning the Tera Tide! Watch Piplup, Greninja, Quaxly, and Palafin as they encounter a Dondozo with a mucky attitude!'),(59358,'Net Miracle Shopping',210,0,23,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1547/144363.jpg','tv','2008-10-03','finished_airing','Net Miracle Shopping is a mail-order program that introduces groundbreaking products that have never existed before. The presenters, Yamada and Sota, introduce special products every time.\n\n(Source: Wikipedia, translated)'),(59359,'Net Miracle Shopping 2nd Season',210,0,22,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1116/144364.jpg','tv','2010-01-08','finished_airing','Second season of Net Miracle Shopping.'),(59360,'Rock wa Lady no Tashinami deshite',1429,76.5,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1781/150071.jpg','tv','2025-04-03','currently_airing','At an elite all-girls\' academy where refined young ladies gather, Lilisa Suzunomiya, now the daughter of a real estate tycoon after her mother remarried, is forced to abandon her guitar and rock music to fit in. However, her passion is reignited by sounds from the old school building, where she meets a skilled drummer who shares her love for rock. Together, they embrace their inner rockstars, elegantly clashing and shouting their way through the academy in this captivating tale of grace and rebellion.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(59361,'Kono Kaisha ni Suki na Hito ga Imasu',1430,75.4,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1123/146384.jpg','tv','2025-01-06','finished_airing','Coworkers Yui Mitsuya and Masugu Tateishi are the last people anyone would expect to get along—especially with their constant office quarrels. However, looks can be deceiving: they are actually dating! Afraid to lose the peace of their professional lives, Yui and Masugu play up their discord even more to ensure nobody discovers their secret.\n\nAs awkward situations and close calls pile up, the risk of Yui and Masugu\'s coworkers catching on increases. Keeping up the pretense is not easy, but with each new day, their relationship only grows stronger.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59363,'Mayonaka Punch Short Anime',269,66.6,5,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1646/148159.webp','ona','2024-07-15','finished_airing','Original anime capturing MayoPan members\' solo projects that cannot be seen in the main story of Mayonaka Punch!\n\n(Source: Official Site, translated)'),(59366,'Denglong Dao',1469,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1754/144383.webp','ona','2024-07-14','finished_airing',''),(59367,'Fengyu Lang Qiao: Kunlun Mo Lei',1619,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1666/144387.jpg','ona','2024-07-21','finished_airing',''),(59368,'Fengyu Lang Qiao: Bishamonten',1305,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1909/144388.jpg','ona','2024-07-21','finished_airing',''),(59369,'Lycoris Recoil: Friends Are Thieves of Time.',216,77.6,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1314/147593.webp','ona','2025-04-16','finished_airing','Six short movies featuring the daily lives of Chisato, Takina, and their friends. Each movie will have a different director and storyboard.'),(59371,'May',226,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1088/144392.jpg','movie','2013-05','finished_airing','Animated a little hope in everyday life. The story of \"I wish I had something like this\" for my usual place and my usual lunch.\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(59372,'Pokemon Unite 3-shuunen PV',30,56.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1317/144393.webp','pv','2024-07-17','finished_airing','PV for the 3rd anniversary event of Pokemon UNITE.'),(59376,'Super Oneechan',255,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1115/144435.webp','movie','2012','finished_airing','The story of a sister who fights against her little brother\'s nightmare.\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(59379,'Qingnian Daoyan Xilie',1078,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1941/144441.jpg','ona','2024-07-27','finished_airing',''),(59380,'Jiu Wo',300,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1074/144442.webp','ona','2024-07-14','finished_airing','A man found a strange bottle in an empty public restroom toilet.\n\n(Source: Fantasia Festival)'),(59381,'Cha A Er Zhong 5th Season',1435,0,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1872/144444.jpg','ona','2024-07-21','finished_airing',''),(59382,'Horangi Deureowayo',577,0,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1735/144446.jpg','ona','2024-07-25','finished_airing','The fun and mysterious daily life of a young couple in a forest and strange children who come to them one day.\n\n(Source: Naver Corporation, translated)'),(59383,'Bu Bai Chi Gu Shici Man Youji',120,0,45,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1616/144447.jpg','ona','2024-01-14','finished_airing',''),(59384,'Bu Bai Chi Gu Shici Man Youji 2nd Season',120,0,45,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1152/144448.webp','ona','2024-07-05','finished_airing',''),(59385,'You Shou Yan 4th Season',408,75.3,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1805/144449.webp','ona','2024-08-02','finished_airing',''),(59386,'Xia Ming Kezhan',392,0,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1967/144450.jpg','ona','2024-07-20','finished_airing',''),(59387,'Hello Carbot Season 15',680,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1333/144451.jpg','tv','2024-06-30','currently_airing',''),(59388,'Golani Aidolgwa Na',1020,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1318/144452.jpg','movie','2024-07-06','finished_airing',''),(59389,'Jian Lai',1504,76.7,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1740/144466.jpg','ona','2024-08-15','finished_airing','There are all kinds of things in the world. A poor boy in Lizhu Cave Heaven who should have great luck was unable to seize the opportunity because his natal porcelain was broken. Based on this, many bigwigs focused on the boy and made arrangements, so that the boy\'s friends got great opportunities, but the boy was at the center of the storm... \n\n(Source: Tencent, Google translated)'),(59390,'Terminator 0',1645,71,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1655/144863.jpg','ona','2024-08-29','finished_airing','Decades after the sentient artificial intelligence Skynet took control of the planet in 2022, the resistance is still fighting against the machines. Following a fierce battle, Eiko, a guerilla soldier in Japan, manages to corner a Terminator—Skynet\'s elite killing cyborg. Eiko extracts crucial details of its plan, allowing the resistance to send her back in time and secure a different future.\n\nIn August 1997, days before Skynet\'s looming nuclear attack known as Judgment Day, Malcolm Lee works on launching Kokoro, a new AI model designed to fight for humanity. As Judgement Day approaches, a Terminator arrives in Japan to hunt Malcolm and his children before Kokoro becomes self-aware. Malcolm must prevent his creation from getting misaligned and coming to the same conclusion as Skynet: the extinction of humans.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59391,'Feng Ling Yu Xiu 2nd Season: Tebie Pian',2373,71.39999999999999,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1016/144469.webp','ona','2024-08-07','finished_airing',''),(59393,'Niwatori Fighter',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1410/144477.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','The neighborhood cock of the walk is more than just an ordinary rooster—he\'s humanity\'s greatest defender! His opponents may be ten stories tall, but nothing is bigger than his stout heart and his fearsome battle cry—cock-a-doodle-doo!\n\n(Source: VIZ Media)'),(59398,'Yong Sheng: Hai Shi Xian Ling',1238,73.4,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1286/144485.webp','ona','2024-07-26','finished_airing','Fourth season of Yong Sheng.'),(59402,'Kakkou no Iinazuke Season 2',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1933/149056.webp','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Second season of Kakkou no Iinazuke.'),(59403,'Kyokugen Chikan Tokuiten 3 The Animation',1036,58.6,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1041/144489.webp','ova','2024-10-25','finished_airing','In a crowded train where desire flows, a hooded man, Kiichi Kusakabe, stands in silence. His piercing eyes see through fantasies and his exceptional hand skills lead women to pleasure.\n\nIori Fudo, a student at Reimeikan University, doubts the existence of sexual abusers (chikan). \"How can something like that exist? That\'s just an urban legend,\" she said. While researching their existence, she herself became a victim of a sexual abuser, but was saved by Kiichi Kusakabe, who is also one of them.'),(59404,'Mecha Gishi Resta no Daibouken',990,57,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1814/144490.webp','ova','2024-10-25','currently_airing','A mechanical engineer finds herself forced to fight some evil robots across the city controlled by an enemy she doesn\'t even know.'),(59406,'Binan Koukou Chikyuu Bouei-bu Eternal Love!',4860,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1633/146274.jpg','movie','2025-01-24','finished_airing','Movie commemorating the franchise\'s tenth anniversary.'),(59407,'Iribitari Gal ni Ma〇ko Tsukawasete Morau Hanashi',960,75.1,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1049/150095.webp','ona','2024-10-04','currently_airing',''),(59408,'Mononoke Movie: Dai Ni Shou - Hinezumi',4440,73.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1593/147889.webp','movie','2025-03-14','finished_airing','Second installment of the Mononoke movie.'),(59409,'Ohayou! Unko-sensei',120,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1244/144510.jpg','tv','2024-07-26','currently_airing',''),(59410,'Ling Wu Dalu',600,68.5,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1671/144511.webp','ona','2024-07-26','currently_airing','Lingwu Continent is a world where spiritual power and martial spirit coexist. A spiritual cultivator can move mountains and rivers with a thought, and a martial artist can tear the world apart with bare hands. Chen Tian, ​​a former genius in Xingchen Town, lost his martial spirit and dried up his spiritual sea after he turned ten.\n\nSince then, he has become a waste of his family and has been looked down upon by others. In a life-and-death struggle, Chen Tian fell off a cliff and mistakenly entered the formation arranged by the ancient sword emperor. Under the influence of the power of the heavenly book, he awakened his spiritual and martial dual cultivation physique. At the same time, he also obtained a strange memory and a mysterious storage ring. \n\nFrom then on, he rose from adversity, broke through the reincarnation of the Heavenly Dao Palm, and finally crossed the shackles of the emperor\'s calamity and aspired to become the champion of Lingwu Continent!\n\n(Source: iQIYI)'),(59412,'Dixia Cheng Yu Yongshi: Nizhuan Zhi Lun Episode 0',1440,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1958/144513.jpg','ona','2020-04-23','finished_airing','Episode 0 of Dixia Cheng Yu Yongshi: Nizhuan Zhi Lun.'),(59413,'Dixia Cheng Yu Yongshi: Nizhuan Zhi Lun - Tebie Pian',1260,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1463/144514.jpg','ona','2020-05-28','finished_airing',''),(59415,'Dark Machine: The Animation',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1450/144524.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired',''),(59418,'Time Slip Shima Kousaku Episode 0',152,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1022/144525.webp','ona','2023-07-21','finished_airing','Episode 0 of Time Slip Shima Kousaku.'),(59419,'Project Sekai Movie: Kowareta Sekai to Utaenai Miku',6300,76.6,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1883/144526.jpg','movie','2025-01-17','finished_airing','At a CD store, Ichika Hoshino hears a song by Miku that she has never heard before. On the monitor, she sees a \"Hatsune Miku\" in a form she has never seen before, and couldn\'t help say it out loud, \"Miku!?\" Miku was surprised at the voice, her eyes meet Ichika\'s, but she disappears shortly after.\n\nLater, after a live performance on the street, the Miku that Ichika saw before appears on her smartphone. Miku looks sad and downcast, and when Ichika quietly asks Miku about her story, she tells Ichika that there are people to whom she wants to deliver her songs, but no matter how much she sings, her songs are not reaching them.\n\nMiku, who saw Ichika singing to the hearts of many people at her live performances, thought that if she learns more about Ichika, she can do the same, and came to Ichika. Ichika smiles at Miku and says, \"If it\'s all right with me.\"\n\nAnd a new story of Hatsune Miku and the boys and girls begins—.\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)'),(59420,'Sailor Zombie',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1278/144527.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Two months have passed since a zombie epidemic began. Despite the chaos around, three high school students in sailor suits live ordinary school lives.\n\nMaiko is a transfer student. She hopes to become an idol. Even though Maiko goes through various incidents, her friendship with Momoka and Mutsumi deepens.\n\nOne day, zombies attack people. Music comes out from the radio and the zombies stop their attack to dance. With this type of music, humans are protected from the zombies, but they can\'t find the music source. Since then, Maiko, Momoka and Mutsumi are threatened by the zombies.\n\n(Source: Asian Wiki)'),(59421,'Zutaboro Reijou wa Ane no Moto Konyakusha ni Dekiai sareru',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1518/149900.jpg','tv','2025-07-05','not_yet_aired','A poor baron daughter has lived under her sister\'s shadow, where she always had nothing. Her hair is full or hairballs, she doesn\'t have a single dress, and all she has are tattered clothes for work. Her sister receives the attention of a high rich noble, but she dies on the way to her marriage.\n\nMarie is sent as a substitute bride for her sister because the baron cannot repay the already sold dowry to the earl. But... that\'s impossible? In the first place, the proposal was a misunderstanding? A beautiful and happy story of love about a fallen baron\'s daughter and an eloquent earl.\n\n(Source: Shousetsuka ni Narou, translated)\n\n'),(59424,'Yuusha Party wo Tsuihou sareta Shiromadoushi, S-Rank Boukensha ni Hirowareru: Kono Shiromadoushi ga Kikakugai Sugiru',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1072/149889.jpg','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','One day, Lloyd, a white mage, is banished from the hero\'s party. Lloyd, who has lost his job, happens to accompany an S-rank party on a quest by chance. At that time, no one knew that the hero\'s party would collapse and Lloyd would gain fame... yet. This is the story of an extraordinary support magic user who thinks he is normal and becomes an adventurer, while he is unaware of how he eventually becomes peerless.\n\n(Source: Futabasha, translated)'),(59425,'NegaPosi Angler',1420,73.60000000000001,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1537/145325.jpg','tv','2024-10-03','finished_airing','For blasé college dropout Tsunehiro Sasaki, life has become hopeless. After failing to enter a top university, he has lost all his money trading on financial markets and is now critically indebted. To add to his misery, he learns that he only has at most two years left to live due to an incurable disease.\n\nThe trajectory of Tsunehiro\'s life suddenly changes after a group of amateur fishermen saves him from drowning as he was trying to escape from a trio of creditors. While Takaaki Tsutsujimori pushes Tsunehiro to work at the group\'s workplace—a convenience store that doubles as a fishing shop—Hana Ayukawa tries to share her love for fishing.\n\nAlthough the attempts of the joyful group of anglers initially prove unsuccessful, Takaaki urges Tsunehiro to take a fresh start in life, and the young man eventually accepts the fishing enthusiast\'s assistance to pay off his debts. As work, friendships, and an unfamiliar hobby all suddenly find their way into his life, Tsunehiro must find the strength to change his ways if he wants to make the best of his remaining time.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59433,'Nian Wushuang',1200,68.1,14,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1253/144554.jpg','ona','2024-08-07','finished_airing','The Goddess of the Machine God descended to earth to retrieve the hand of God, broke the rules and changed her fate against the will of heaven, and experienced an unparalleled love affair, achieving a double harvest in career and love. Let\'s see how the heroine who got the script of the hot-blooded boy comic uses the machine skills to counterattack all the way, which is exciting and full of laughter.\n\n(Source: Iqiyi, Google translated)'),(59434,'Shen Mu 2nd Season',1247,69.1,27,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1527/144555.jpg','ona','2024-08-10','finished_airing','The second season of Shen Mu.'),(59435,'Undead Unluck (Special)',3600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1964/144558.jpg','special','2025','not_yet_aired','A one-hour sequel anime special that is scheduled to broadcast in Winter 2025.'),(59443,'Reincarnation no Kaben',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1783/144569.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','Striving for talent, Senji Touya tries everything he can so he can find it. Kendou, dancing, swimming, basketball, soccer, chess,... anything he tries, he fails to exceed it. One day, his classmate, Haito, came to school for once in a long time. Senji refers her as someone who \"has it\" or someone who has talent. Later on, he found out that she isn\'t just someone who has talent, but someone who \"took\" the talent of herself in her past life. And, those who \"took\" the talent from their past lives, are also known as \"Returners\"... \n\n(Source: MU)'),(59450,'Xiong Chumo: Xiongxiong Bang Bang Tuan',800,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1205/144578.jpg','tv','2021-12-10','finished_airing',''),(59451,'Xiong Chumo: Xiongxiong Bang Bang Tuan 2',800,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1413/144579.jpg','tv','2023-07-14','finished_airing',''),(59452,'Katainaka no Ossan, Kensei ni Naru',1416,70.5,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1069/148148.webp','tv','2025-04-05','currently_airing','Beryl Gardinant, a self-proclaimed \"humble old man,\" is a sword instructor at his dojo in a rural, backwater village. In his younger years, he dreamed of glory as a master swordsman, but those days are long behind him. Out of the blue, he receives a visit from a famous former pupil who brings him world-shattering news—he\'s been appointed as a special instructor for the knights of the Liberion Order! With his life now turned upside down, Beryl travels to the capital and reunites with some of his former students: elite knights, an ace wizard, and even an adventurer who\'s attained the highest guild rank possible. But why do they all want his tutelage?! As far as he\'s concerned, they clearly don\'t need him anymore. Can Beryl live up to his new position? And will he ever get a moment\'s peace away from his adoring students?!\n\n(Source: J-Novel Club)'),(59457,'Haite Kudasai, Takamine-san',1420,59.900000000000006,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1521/148809.jpg','tv','2025-04-02','currently_airing','Takane Takamine is great at everything she does, and her magnetic personality makes her the envy of everyone. She gets good grades, excels at sports, and even manages to become student council president during her first year of high school. But Takamine has a secret—she possesses an ability called \"Eternal Virgin Road,\" allowing her to redo past actions and achieve a different result.\n\nWhile this might seem like a decent skill to have, Takamine must pay a price to activate it: she has to strip off a piece of her lingerie. After getting an imperfect score on a test, Takamine begins to remove her underwear during class and is spotted by her average and weak-willed classmate Koushi Shirota, who is bewildered by the sight. However, the very next instant, things reset and Takamine\'s test is now perfect.\n\nWhen Shirota decides to confront Takamine about her previous test score, she reveals her ability to him and blackmails him into becoming her \"closet,\" making him carry around extra lingerie and put them on her. Her goal is to be able to use Eternal Virgin Road as much as possible in order to stay at the top of the school hierarchy. Left with little choice in the matter, Shirota accepts, starting an oddly intimate type of relationship with the most popular girl at school.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59458,'Duel Masters LOST: Gekka no Shinigami',1380,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1654/150086.webp','ona','2024-12-21','finished_airing','Sequel to Duel Masters LOST: Tsuioku no Suishou.'),(59459,'Silent Witch: Chinmoku no Majo no Kakushigoto',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1669/149732.webp','tv','2025-07-05','not_yet_aired','Monica Everett, the Silent Witch, is the only mage in the world who can use unchanted magecraft, a true hero who singlehandedly defeated a legendary black dragon. However, this young genius is actually...super-duper shy! That\'s right: She learned to cast spells silently just to avoid speaking in public, and despite her power, she has zero self-confidence. Now Monica has been tasked with secretly guarding the second prince. Can she keep it together as she faces both the evil forces targeting the prince and the terrors of social interaction?\n\n(Source: Yen Press)'),(59463,'Majo no Furo Life',92,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1002/144616.jpg','pv','2024-07-31','finished_airing','An animated PV for Majo no Furo Life, with a collaboration between the music creator unit \"ZiNG\" and the singer \"Lia\". '),(59465,'Fate/Grand Order: Fujimaru Ritsuka wa Wakaranai Season 2',120,67.5,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1412/144623.jpg','ona','2024-08-03','finished_airing','Second season of Fate/Grand Order: Fujimaru Ritsuka wa Wakaranai.'),(59466,'Aharen-san wa Hakarenai Season 2',1435,74.80000000000001,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1501/148355.jpg','tv','2025-04-07','currently_airing','Ever since the quiet and timid Reina Aharen enrolled in high school, she has made new friends and even started dating her classmate Matsuboshi Raidou. When the two begin their second year, everything seems to be going well, as they are seatmates once more.\n\nSoon after, a transfer student named Riku Tamanaha joins their class. Unbeknownst to Reina, the outgoing and stylish girl is actually a childhood friend she separated from years ago. With Raidou\'s support, Reina is able to rekindle their friendship.\n\nAlthough they have grown closer, Raidou and Reina still struggle to communicate due to his overactive imagination and her difficulty with expressing herself. Nevertheless, the eccentric couple continues to brighten up the lives of people around them as they enjoy each other\'s company to the fullest.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59467,'Chiyu Mahou no Machigatta Tsukaikata 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1737/144634.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Chiyu Mahou no Machigatta Tsukaikata.'),(59468,'Menghuan Shuyuan 8th Season',201,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1061/144629.jpg','ona','2023-03-27','finished_airing',''),(59469,'Menghuan Shuyuan: Guojia Anquan Pian',180,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1644/144630.jpg','ona','2022-11-01','finished_airing',''),(59470,'Menghuan Shuyuan: Haiyang Gongyi Pian',180,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1770/144631.jpg','ona','2023-04-19','finished_airing',''),(59479,'Jjangttung-ine Ttonghwangto',1560,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1416/144638.jpg','movie','2023','finished_airing',''),(59484,'Kikaijikake no Marie',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1520/149409.webp','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','Wealthy, handsome, and successful, Arthur Louis Zetes is no stranger to the greed of people. Constantly doubting those around him, he has no faith in humanity; thus, he makes a request for the perfect maid—a robot maid. However, his butler is unable to acquire such a servant due to technological limitations, so he finds the next best substitute.\n\nMarie Evans is a former child prodigy in martial arts known for her lack of expression. Drowning in debt, she readily accepts the offer to be a maid that acts like a robot. While Arthur is often blunt towards humans, he cannot help but dote on his personal robot; in turn, Marie is moved by his drive and consideration toward her.\n\nKikaijikake no Marie follows the comedic everyday life of a rich heir and his mechanical (human) maid.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59485,'Shibuya♡Hachi Part 2',120,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1515/144659.jpg','tv','2024-10-05','finished_airing','Part two of Shibuya♡Hachi.'),(59489,'Kaijuu 8-gou Movie',5400,69.4,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1127/146604.webp','movie','2025-03-28','finished_airing','In a Kaiju-filled Japan, Kafka Hibino works in monster disposal. After reuniting with his childhood friend Mina Ashiro, a rising star in the anti-Kaiju Defense Force, he decides to pursue his abandoned dream of joining the Force... when he suddenly transforms into the powerful \"Kaiju No. 8.\" With help from his junior colleague Reno Ichikawa, Kafka hides his identity while striving towards his life-long dream of passing the Defense Force exam and standing at Mina\'s side. But when mysterious intelligent Kaiju attack a Defense Force base, Kafka faces a crucial decision in a desperate situation...\n\n(Source: Official site)'),(59490,'Kaijuu 8-gou: Hoshina no Kyuujitsu',1200,69.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1262/146724.jpg','special','2025-03-28','finished_airing','A day off... After spending so long training, Reno has forgotten what he\'s supposed to do with free time. But when he sees that Hoshina is up to something, he goes on a mission to tail him with Iharu!\n\n(Source: Official site)'),(59493,'Tensei shitara Slime Datta Ken: Kanwa - Luminous Memories',1469,65.19999999999999,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1465/144664.jpg','tv_special','2024-08-10','finished_airing','Recap of Tensei shitara Slime Datta Ken 3rd Season.\n\nRimuru and Hinata, despite both holding similar values, fought fiercely. What happened behind the scenes of this complicated situation? From the perspective of Luminous Valentine, the one and only God of the Holy Empire of Lubelius and one of the Octagram Demon Lords. The details of the \"Holy Demon Battle\" are told, as well as some secret that she has never told anyone.'),(59497,'Rising Impact Season 2',1472,79.6,14,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1161/144669.webp','ona','2024-08-06','finished_airing','Second season of Rising Impact.'),(59499,'Asatir 2: Mirai no Mukashi Banashi',1547,63.2,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1717/144671.jpg','tv','2024-11-03','finished_airing','Sequel to Asatir: Mirai no Mukashi Banashi.'),(59504,'DenDekaDen PV',116,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1663/144680.jpg','pv','2024-08-06','finished_airing','Passing through the Torii gates of a shrine in Kyoto, seven souls with unwavering conviction, were reborn in the DenDenGarden. Now they must fight epic duels to become gods.\n\n(Source: Official Website)'),(59505,'Kankin Kuiki Level X',780,64.1,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1509/144685.jpg','tv','2024-09-07','finished_airing','After waking up in her room on Christmas Eve, high school student Ryouka Tsurumi makes a series of chilling discoveries. Her mother informs her that her mansion has been evacuated and the area placed on lockdown due to the presence of an unknown and dangerous entity named X. The only other person left in the building is Shuuhei Murosaka, Ryouka\'s childhood friend. To add to the horror, Ryouka learns that X can brainwash people for its gruesome goal: feeding itself of human blood to reproduce.\n\nHowever, Shuuhei comes to Ryouka\'s rescue and manages to save her from one of X\'s brutal attacks. As the two friends try to escape from the lockdown area, they are captured by hypnotized humans and subsequently devoured by the giant beast. But for Ryouka, the nightmare has just started: she wakes up for the second time in her room, only to find out that a different X is now threatening her life. Realizing that she is stuck in a time loop, Ryouka decides to team up with Shuuhei to find a safe future away from the threat of X.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59512,'Punirunes: Puni 2',720,0,25,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1387/144697.jpg','tv','2024-10-06','finished_airing','Second season of Punirunes.'),(59514,'Sentai Red Isekai de Boukensha ni Naru',1440,68.2,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1390/146918.webp','tv','2025-01-12','finished_airing','The Red Ranger, Tougo Asagaki, finds himself transported to another world in the middle of a fierce battle against forces of evil. Upon arriving, he quickly makes a name for himself as an adventurer and takes on a job from a young mage named Yihdra Arvoln. With his eccentric powers and frenzied personality, Tougo blazes through the mission with her.\n\nAfter the quest, Tougo and Yihdra begin adventuring together with their respective goals. Tougo strives to help as many as possible in the new world and find a way back home, while Yihdra desires to redeem her family lineage of mages and make magic accessible to everyone. Along their journey, the duo discover the limitations yet endless potential of the bonds they forge as they overcome adversities to achieve their aspirations.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59515,'Time Tides',100,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1539/144708.webp','ona','2023-11-30','finished_airing','The waves of the sea gently ebb and flow, while the mountains silently observe the passing of time. The short life of a bee and the long transformation of continents, both are merely illusions. The flow of time shines eternally in each fleeting moment. Perhaps there are neither beginnings nor ends, nor haste nor delay, not even existence or cessation, in its true essence.\n\n(Source: Vimeo)'),(59517,'Chitose-kun wa Ramune Bin no Naka',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1317/149628.jpg','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','Insults aimed at Saku Chitose are a dime a dozen. Nicknamed \"Class 5\'s womanizing scumbag,\" he is constantly slandered online by those jealous of his popularity. Luckily, that barely makes a dent in Saku\'s confidence. Outside niche internet forums, he is the reputable figure his schoolmates admire and a model student his teachers trust.\n\nAs his second year of high school commences, Saku reunites with his old friends and befriends new ones, all belonging to the school\'s social elite. However, the fun is cut short when Saku\'s homeroom teacher instructs him to convince his shut-in classmate, Kenta Yamazaki, to return to school. Wishing to wrap things up quickly, Saku visits Kenta\'s house the very next day. But the task proves more challenging than he expected when he discovers that Kenta is firmly and fully on the Saku hate train. If he wants to preserve his impeccable image, Saku must find a way to win over Kenta and bring him back to school. \n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59523,'Mazome Soap de Aimashou!',1220,61.900000000000006,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1117/144729.webp','ova','2024-11-15','finished_airing','Mitsurugi and Nagihara, the new employees at the company, are working diligently and are appreciated for their professional qualities. Mitsurugi is responsible, while Nagihara is admired for her refined behavior. However, secretly, both women work at a masochistic soapland, showing a completely different personality from what they display at work.\n\n(Source: TMDB)'),(59543,'New Jersey and Enterprise\'s Beach Vacation',83,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1425/144780.jpg','ona','2024-08-12','finished_airing','Commanders, join the shipgirls for a seaside getaway!\n\n(Source: YouTube)\n\n'),(59550,'Wonderer',240,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1438/144793.webp','movie','2018','finished_airing','An arrow appears in front of a \"WONDERER\" who is curious about something. \"What on earth is at the end of that arrow?\" This curiosity leads one man to an unknown place. He continues to move forward toward his goal, feeling nervous and excited about the adventures that await him at each destination.\n\n(Source: U-NEXT, translated)'),(59551,'Ganbare! Nakamura-kun!!',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1164/146135.webp','tv','2025','not_yet_aired','Okuto Nakamura is a timid and gloomy-looking student who cherishes only two things in this world: his pet octopus and his kind-hearted classmate, Aiki Hirose. Ever since the school entrance ceremony, Nakamura has admired his jovial classmate, albeit from a distance due to his poor social skills. After mustering up all the courage within him, he finally decides to talk to Hirose.\n\nDuring this first attempt to make contact, an instinctive mistake turns the idea of friendship into a distant dream, as he creates a hilarious impression on his crush. At school, students are expected to cooperate on numerous activities together, meaning Nakamura gets to spend extra time with Hirose. Given these opportunities, can he successfully redeem himself and accomplish his goal of becoming good friends with Hirose?\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59557,'Wo de Wei Xin Tong Longgong',660,0,60,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1594/144804.jpg','ona','2024-08-13','finished_airing','Luo Yun, an orphan boy, has a mysterious background. When he became an adult, he was accidentally pulled into the \"East China Sea Dragon Palace Chat Group\". After exchanging cultivation secrets from the immortal friends in the group, his cultivation level increased greatly. Since then, he has transformed into \"Luo Yuan Shangxian\" and started his journey of cultivating immortals between the human and immortal worlds. \n\nRelying on the information gap and witty planning of the immortal friends in the WeChat group, Luo Yun exchanged spicy strips for immortal pills and cola for spiritual treasures, constantly improving himself, helping the weak and upholding justice in the real world. As the Overlord Seafood Company rose all the way in the two worlds, Luo Yun was involved in the great dispute between Peach Blossom Spring and Chaos Star Sea because of the mystery of his life experience.\n\n(Source: iQIYI)'),(59558,'Kanpai',1571,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1602/144806.webp','ona','2015-06-10','finished_airing','Space-born Edward meets Sakura at a spaceship bar where she introduces him to her country\'s national drink: Japanese sake. She uses her expertise growing up at a sake brewery to educate Edward on how sake is made, the different types of sake, and sake drinking customs. Edward visits her family brewery and learns the sake brewing process firsthand and how important sake is to Japanese culture.\n\n(Source: JapanSakeOfficial YouTube channel)'),(59560,'Hazurewaku no \"Joutai Ijou Skill\" de Saikyou ni Natta Ore ga Subete wo Juurin suru made Recap',1450,60.099999999999994,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1177/144808.jpg','tv_special','2024-08-16','finished_airing','Recap of the first six episodes of Hazurewaku no \"Joutai Ijou Skill\" de Saikyou ni Natta Ore ga Subete wo Juurin suru made.'),(59561,'Around 40 Otoko no Isekai Tsuuhan',1420,63.6,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1887/146512.webp','tv','2025-01-09','finished_airing','From nowhere, middle-aged illustrator Kenichi Hamada finds himself summoned to another world. Despite arriving in an unfamiliar land, he realizes he can still connect to an online shop named Shangri-La, which he frequented back in Japan, to order almost anything. Not long after, Kenichi comes across a town and, using Shangri-La, decides to become a merchant in the settlement.\n\nBy selling products from Earth, he is quickly able to make a living for himself while gaining acquaintances and the attention of local companies. However, the man just wants to live a quiet life without nuisances and leaves the town to build a cabin in a nearby forest. Though interrupted from time to time, there is nothing that can stop Kenichi from having his peaceful days.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59562,'NieR:Automata Ver1.1a Part 2: Chapter. 13-18 Chousa Report',1420,65,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1922/144810.webp','tv_special','2024-08-16','finished_airing','Recap of the first six episodes of NieR:Automata Ver1.1a Part 2.'),(59564,'Midnight Vampire',450,62.599999999999994,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1330/144813.jpg','ona','2024-08-17','finished_airing','At midnight, she wanders for blood....'),(59571,'Shingeki no Kyojin Movie: Kanketsu-hen - The Last Attack',8649,88.2,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1379/145452.webp','movie','2024-11-08','finished_airing','A compilation movie for Shingeki no Kyojin: The Final Season - Kanketsu-hen.'),(59572,'Chogokin Gundam★Hello Kitty',80,54.900000000000006,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1459/144864.webp','ona','2020-01-30','finished_airing','\"Mobile Suit Gundam\" and \"Hello Kitty\" are \"superalloy\" and have a dream encounter. See for yourself the story of the birth of \"Chogokin Gundam★Hello Kitty.\"\n\n(Source: BANDAI OFFICIAL, translated)'),(59576,'Meitantei GJ8man: Kieta Shamisen',288,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1436/144829.webp','ona','2020-08-08','finished_airing','A special two-part detective spinoff of GJ8man.'),(59577,'Bad Mood Episode 0',130,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1316/144830.jpg','ona','2020-03-05','finished_airing','Episode 0 of Bad Mood.'),(59579,'Kensaku to Enjin no Christmas (2019)',105,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1267/144858.webp','ona','2019-11-27','finished_airing','In Kensaku\'s bedroom, where he sleeps peacefully, the shadow of Enjin stands suspiciously...\nA heart-warming Christmas animation featuring Yahoo\'s official character \"Enjin\" and friends.\n\n(Source: Kensaku to Enjin Official YouTube Channel, translated)'),(59581,'Ppyojogma-eul-ui Susanghan Iusdeul',150,0,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1131/144834.jpg','ona','2019-03-16','finished_airing','A spin-off series for Ppyojogppyojog Pokeugajog.'),(59582,'Ponkotsu Quest x Momoume',294,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1031/145121.jpg','ona','2020-12-01','finished_airing','A collaboration between Ponkotsu Quest and Momoume.'),(59583,'Shasha and Milo Part 2',1340,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1419/144837.jpg','tv','2024-05-31','finished_airing',''),(59584,'Jyulagi Cops',680,0,30,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1213/144838.jpg','tv','2018-05-05','finished_airing',''),(59585,'Jyulagi Cops: Jura King',680,0,22,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1799/144839.jpg','tv','2019-07-13','finished_airing',''),(59586,'Jyulagi Cops 3rd Season',680,0,27,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1221/144841.jpg','tv','2021-09-08','finished_airing',''),(59587,'Jyulagi Cops: Jeonseolui Godaesaengmuleul Chajala',4500,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1304/144842.jpg','movie','2024-08-15','finished_airing',''),(59588,'Jyulagi Cops: Gonglyongsidae Daemoheom',3840,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1605/150132.jpg','movie','2022-09-07','finished_airing',''),(59589,'Toy Cop',320,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1017/144844.jpg','tv','2017-09-14','finished_airing',''),(59590,'Toy Cop Season 2',320,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1516/144845.jpg','tv','2018-04-12','finished_airing',''),(59593,'Wujin Shenyu',780,0,80,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1455/150034.jpg','ona','2024-08-18','finished_airing','Seven years ago, the family of the mortal prince Li Han was killed by seven immortals. When he was dying, he and his sister Li Yao were saved by the legendary Endless God Realm. Seven years later, Li Han returned. In order to wake up his sister, he must constantly improve his cultivation according to the requirements of the God Realm to protect the people. At the same time, he also vowed to find the murderer of that year and take revenge! But things are more complicated than he imagined. As the truth is revealed bit by bit, Li Han must make a choice between revenge and gratitude...\n\n(Source: Iqiyi, Google translated)'),(59596,'One Piece: Araburu Henkaku no Log: Anyaku Suru Kakumeigun!',1430,64.1,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1031/144856.jpg','tv_special','2024-08-25','finished_airing','The fourth recap special of the Egghead arc. It follows the actions of the Revolutionary Army.'),(59597,'Witch Watch',1451,74.9,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1988/148017.webp','tv','2025-04-06','currently_airing','Nico Wakatsuki has finished her six years of witch training and is moving back to town by herself. As a new witch, she must choose a familiar to accompany her. However, unlike the other witches, she wishes to pick a non-animal familiar. There\'s no better companion than Morihito \"Moi\" Otogi—her childhood friend who happens to be an ogre. Morihito is vehemently opposed to being her servant, but he reluctantly accepts his fate after learning that a curse would revert him into a strange cow-tiger hybrid were he to disobey a witch\'s order.\n\nDue to Morihito\'s father leaving for a business trip and Nico\'s mother remaining behind in the Witches\' Holy Land, the two teens find themselves living together under the same roof. While Nico is ecstatic to be living with her crush, Morihito finds that her magical antics and overall clumsiness create more problems than solutions. With a prophesied disaster to befall Nico within the year, Morihito must do everything he can to protect her as her bodyguard while also upholding his duties as her familiar.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59602,'Brown & Kensaku',19,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1768/144945.jpg','ona','2021-02-28','finished_airing','Yahoo\'s Kensaku to Enjin and LINE\'s collaboration.'),(59605,'Koeda-chan',140,0,7,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1105/144925.webp','ona','2011-10-20','finished_airing','Animated Koeda-chan videos based on the Takara Tomy toy line.'),(59606,'Norasco: The Stray Scottish Fold',93,0,7,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1692/144926.jpg','ona','2020-05-30','finished_airing','A short story depicting the daily life of Kotarou, a stray Scottish Fold who lives in Tateishi, Katsushika, Tokyo, and the townspeople.\n\n(Source: YouTube, translated)'),(59607,'Blue Archive April Fools\' CMs',15,56.8,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1598/144927.jpg','cm','2023-04-01','finished_airing','An April Fools\' Day prank for Blue Archive toys. Due to popular demand, a KAITEN FX Mk.0 was later produced.'),(59612,'Monogatari Series: Off & Monster Season - Zankoku Douwa: Utsukushi-hime',750,77.4,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1887/144936.webp','ona','2024-08-17','finished_airing','Episode 6.5 of Monogatari Series: Off & Monster Season, adapting the short story A Cruel Fairy Tale: The Beautiful Princess.\n\nOnce upon a time, there was a true story that happened about 600 years ago. It\'s a story of a very beautiful girl who lived in a country that no longer exists.\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)'),(59614,'Kojin Senshi Oredam',133,58.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1869/144939.jpg','special','2010-03-03','finished_airing','An exclusive music video special released with the Blu-Ray Box Set of Seto no Hanayome.'),(59615,'Pokemon Card Game PV: Trainer\'s Pokemon',148,62.199999999999996,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1920/144941.webp','pv','2024-08-19','finished_airing','A PV for the Trainer\'s Pokemon cards releasing in 2025.'),(59616,'PokeMinutes',15,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1209/144942.jpg','ona','2024-07-19','currently_airing','A series of videos showcasing snapshots of time spent with different Pokemon.'),(59619,'Ame to Kimi to',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1506/147604.webp','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','During a rainy day, a woman comes across a strange animal waiting by the side of the road. Pleading to be taken in, the creature offers the woman an umbrella in an attempt to show off its appeal. Intrigued by its clever nature, she brings the dog-like creature home and thus begins their life together.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59620,'Bao Ke Meng Donghua Tujian: Xiaoqi Dao Zhong',90,60.5,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1053/144969.jpg','ona','2024-08-05','finished_airing','In the hot summer, which Pokemon will take a rest on the island? Come here and experience the relaxing Pokemon ecosystem!\n\n(Source: Weibo, translated)'),(59621,'Bao Ke Meng Donghua Tujian: Yi Bu Pian',75,60.7,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1926/144970.jpg','ona','2024-04-28','finished_airing','What kind of sparks will the cute Eevee create with its many \"possibilities\"?!\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(59622,'Kabigon to Nani Shite Kutsurogu?',34,62,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1111/144971.webp','ona','2023-09-28','finished_airing','A series of vignettes depicting the everyday scenes of people and Snorlax spending happy times together!\n\n(Source: YouTube, translated)'),(59623,'Wandance',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1959/149411.webp','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','Kaboku Kotani is starting high school, and he plans to do what he\'s always done: go along with his friends, keep quiet, and not draw too much attention to himself. After all, it\'s hard enough to get by with a stutter like his—why make things worse by standing out from the crowd? But then he sees another first-year, Hikari Wanda, dancing like no one is watching—or like she doesn\'t care who sees her. It makes Kaboku wonder: Could he reach that same freedom? To find his way to Wanda, he does something he never thought he could: He joins the dance club. After all, every routine begins with a single step, right? Join Kaboku and Wanda as they freestyle their way to life and love!\n\n(Source: Kodansha USA)'),(59624,'Xi Xing Ji: Da Yuan Hun Tebie Pian',1336,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1927/144974.jpg','ona','2024-08-21','finished_airing','An independent story of Sun Wukong. It tells the adventure of the great demon Wukong, who dominated the demon road in his previous life, and formed a direct bond with the human girl Guozi. \n\n(Source: DonghuaStream)'),(59627,'Rich Mountain Toyama',90,0,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1374/144990.jpg','ona','2022-09-29','finished_airing','Follow Perorich as he visits various people and places across Toyama City.'),(59628,'Spookiz Cookie',120,0,25,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1242/144991.webp','ona','2019-10-05','finished_airing','A special season of Spookiz.'),(59629,'Liselotte no Wakuwaku Magical Shoukai',99,59.5,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1289/144992.jpg','ona','2024-08-22','finished_airing','Liselotte will invite guest characters to introduce the highlights of the series.\n\n(Source: Official YouTube Channel)'),(59631,'Juan Siliang 3rd Season',1200,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1457/145028.webp','ona','','not_yet_aired',''),(59632,'Mattaku Saikin no Tantei to Kitara',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1323/149460.webp','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Nagumo Keeichirou was a genius high-school detective. No case was complex enough for him. But what happens to genius detectives when they get older?\n\nNow 35, with bad hips, running a failing detective agency with no cases to solve and struggling to pay the rent, he\'s at a dead end.\n\nIn comes a high school girl in his office who says she wants to work with him. With her help, will the out-of-touch, old-fashioned Nagumo get back the fire of his youth?\n\n(Source: MU)'),(59634,'Zhanshen Lianmeng',480,0,48,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1919/145052.jpg','ona','2024-08-20','finished_airing','After a magnetic storm strikes the Blue Star Continent, spiritual energy is revived, transforming both humans and animals. This triggers a battle for survival between spirit beasts and humans. Ling Tian, a young prodigy with an ancient divine bloodline and a treasure called the \'God Brain,\' discovers that in three years, the continent will face a disaster that will lead to his heroic death. Guided by Yan Ling, his assistant from the future, he embarks on a mission to attain ultimate power and change the continent\'s fate.\n\n(Source: SIMLK)'),(59636,'Uma Musume: Cinderella Gray',1420,83.10000000000001,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1626/148097.webp','tv','2025-04-06','currently_airing','A spin-off title of the Uma Musume project by Cygames. It follows Oguri Cap through her time at Kasamatsu Training Center Academy and on her journey of becoming a legendary horse girl.\n\n(Source: MU)'),(59640,'Hoshi X kara no Rakko',210,0,15,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1049/145045.webp','ona','2024-03-27','finished_airing','Currently, there are only three sea otters in Japan. In fact, one of them is an alien who was stranded on Earth and disguised himself to hide. Various marine creatures come to consult with this highly intelligent sea otter-like alien every day.\n\n(Source: YouTube, translated)'),(59644,'Yasei no Last Boss ga Arawareta!',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1026/148556.webp','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','Ruphas Mafahl, the black-winged overlord and leader of the Twelves Stars of Heaven, has been vanquished.\n\nA man wakes up in the body of the Exgate game character Ruphas, two hundred years after her defeat at the hands of the seven heroes. The game world of Exgate he knew is no longer ruled by humans—and it is no longer just a game. Exgate is a world of its own where the characters think, feel, and live just like he does. Ruphas journeys through Exgate, looking for the long-disbanded Twelve Stars of Heaven.\n\nRuphas is without country, army, or allies. A question remains: what is the real reason an ordinary man was reincarnated into Exgate as Ruphas?\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59647,'Eunbikkabiui Yesnal Yesjeog-e',1140,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1361/145058.jpg','tv','1991-04-05','finished_airing','A sequel to Yesnal Yesjeog-e.'),(59648,'Eunbikkabiui Yesnal Yesjeog-e 2nd Season',1140,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1436/145059.jpg','tv','1992-04-17','finished_airing','Second season of Eunbikkabiui Yesnal Yesjeog-e.'),(59649,'Nanashi Kaidan 3rd Season',360,0,5,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1475/145060.webp','tv','2024-08-26','finished_airing','Third season of Nanashi Kaidan.'),(59653,'Ruguo Lishi Shi Yiqun Miao 11th Season',560,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1407/145064.jpg','ona','2024-08-17','finished_airing',''),(59654,'Jujutsu Kaisen: Kaigyoku/Gyokusetsu',6660,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1999/147023.webp','movie','2025-05-30','not_yet_aired','A compilation movie of Jujutsu Kaisen\'s Hidden Inventory and Premature Death arc.'),(59655,'Omocha Bako Series Dai 2-wa: Kuroneko Banzai',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1869/145083.jpg','movie','1933-12-22','finished_airing',''),(59656,'Pokemon Masters EX: 5-shuunen Tokubetsu Eizou wo Koukai!',125,59,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1942/145081.webp','pv','2024-08-25','finished_airing','A promotional video to celebrate 5 years of Pokemon Masters EX.'),(59662,'Long Zu II: Daowangzhe Zhi Tong',0,0,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1577/147273.webp','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','Second season of Long Zu (Dragon Raja).'),(59666,'Bananya: Around the World',180,66.8,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1195/147502.webp','ona','2024-10-21','finished_airing','Third season of Bananya.'),(59675,'Apocalypse Hotel',1380,75,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1511/148642.jpg','tv','2025-04-09','currently_airing','Many years have passed since humanity vanished from Earth, yet the Galaxy Tower hotel in Ginza, Tokyo, continues to operate. At the center of its staff is Yachiyo, a dedicated hotelier robot, along with other employee robots working tirelessly in various departments. Together, they spend what feels like an eternity maintaining the hotel, despite having no guests. As they await the return of their owner and the day humanity reappears.\n\nNow, a small miracle is about to change everything for Yachiyo and her robotic colleagues.\n\n(Source: Official YouTube)'),(59678,'Momoume',120,0,229,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1365/145113.webp','ona','2018-05-24','finished_airing','The story revolves around Momo-chan, a 24-year-old rookie office worker, and Ume, a 40-year-old veteran office worker, and depicts office life in a slapstick, laid-back atmosphere that happens with their bosses and colleagues.\n\n(Source: YouTube, translated)'),(59679,'Momoume x Kaunet Collab',120,0,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1527/145115.jpg','cm','2019-11-05','finished_airing','A collaboration between Momoume and the mail order shop Kaunet.'),(59680,'Momoume Specials',120,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1834/145116.webp','special','2021-06-30','finished_airing','Specials included in the Blu-ray release of Momoume.'),(59685,'Yongisanda',720,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1894/145130.webp','tv','2024-08-27','finished_airing','Meet my neighbor—a typical fantasy novelist, more than a little scatterbrained, likes to gossip, borrow things without asking, and play MMORPGs. Oh, and by the way, he\'s a dragon in disguise named Dragon Kim.\n\n(Source: MU)'),(59688,'Gintama on Theater 2D: Kintama-hen',5820,68.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1185/145136.webp','movie','2024-11-22','finished_airing','A compilation film of the Kintama Arc, episodes 1–4 in the third season, featuring additional footage. The movie is a part of the \"Gintama 20th Anniversary Project.\"'),(59689,'Game Center Shoujo to Ibunka Kouryuu',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1943/149719.webp','tv','2025-07-06','not_yet_aired','Renji Kusakabe, an arcade employee, one day notices a small foreign girl struggling to win a stuffed toy called \"Manly Koala\" from a crane game. Three hours later, after finishing his shift, Renji sees the girl still at the game, but the toy remains unmoved.\n\nFeeling sorry for her, he decides to help. He inserts a 100-yen coin and, with one skillful try, wins the toy, which he then hands to the girl. Startled by this unexpected gesture, the girl looks at Renji with suspicion. Flustered, Renji hastily tells her it\'s a Valentine\'s Day gift. Little does he know, in her home country of England, Valentine\'s Day is traditionally when men give women gifts along with a confession of love.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(59691,'Crevice',360,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1810/145145.webp','movie','2024','finished_airing','A native island girl finds a man who\'s washed ashore. She welcomes him in their village, and the two get to know each other. Meanwhile, the man becomes fascinated with the island\'s magical stone.\n\n(Source: U-NEXT, edited)'),(59692,'Saba Ningen',1020,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1053/145147.webp','movie','2024','finished_airing','Momo, a postman, receives a letter every time she delivers a package to Sabao\'s house. One day, while continuing to exchange letters and packages, Momo discovers Sabao running an ice cream stand on the roadside.\n\n(Source: U-NEXT, translated)'),(59693,'Chengyu Zhong Guo',200,0,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1844/145148.jpg','ona','2024-08-16','finished_airing',''),(59694,'Ali',5580,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1372/145149.jpg','movie','2024-08-17','finished_airing',''),(59695,'He Li Zongdongyuan',3920,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1216/145150.jpg','ona','2024-08-03','finished_airing',''),(59696,'Jinling Yu Mao',5820,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1519/145151.jpg','movie','2024-08-24','finished_airing',''),(59697,'Bishoku-ke no Rule',1320,60.099999999999994,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1314/145163.jpg','ova','2024-11-29','currently_airing','Serious and responsible, Reyna wants to financially help her single mother. She signs up for a dating app to earn extra money on paid dates. Full of worries and worries, the girl goes on a first date, where she tries to negotiate like an adult, but quickly succumbs to the promise of good money. The man turns out to be her uncle, businessman Yuma. After the conversation, he grabs the confused niece by the hand and for some reason leads her to a public toilet.'),(59698,'Taishou Itsuwari Bridal: Migawari Hanayome to Gunpuku no Mouai',390,63.6,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1367/145264.jpg','ona','2024-10-07','finished_airing','Asako, despite her status as a viscount\'s daughter, is shunned in high society. One day, a marriage proposal arrives for her younger sister with Captain Kido, a renowned soldier known for his ice-cold demeanor. Rumor says he seeks a bride solely for the purpose of bearing children... To protect her precious younger sister, Asako volunteers as a substitute bride.\n\n(Source: TVDB)'),(59703,'Niwatori Hajimete Toya ni Tsuku',948,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1828/145172.webp','movie','2024','finished_airing','In the year 200x, the world was struck by an unknown disaster in which all living things stopped being born or dying. In a world where life is a life sentence, a man and a girl meet.\n\n(Source: YouTube, translated)'),(59704,'Imomushi',720,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1493/145173.jpg','movie','2024','finished_airing','Mr. Sunaga, a former army lieutenant who lost his limbs and voice in World War II, lives a secluded life with his wife, Tokiko, in a small villa.\n\n(Source: Tougakusai, translated)'),(59706,'Elf ni Inmon wo Tsukeru Hon The Animation',1230,62.699999999999996,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1847/145179.jpg','ova','2024-11-29','currently_airing',''),(59707,'Bakutsuri Hunters',170,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1250/145317.webp','pv','2019-11-15','finished_airing','Special animated PV for the Bakutsuri Hunters Nintendo Switch game, which serves as a sequel to both the Bakutsuri Bar Hunter game and anime.'),(59708,'Youkoso Jitsuryoku Shijou Shugi no Kyoushitsu e 4th Season: 2-nensei-hen 1 Gakki',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1585/145193.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','As Ayanokouji and his classmates begin their second year at the Advanced Nurturing High School, they\'re greeted by a fresh gauntlet of exams and a fresh batch of rather unique first-year students. They\'ll have to get to know each other quickly, because the first special exam pairs the first-years with the second-years on a written test—with only the second-years facing expulsion if their team performs poorly! Worse yet? It seems one of the new first-years is also from the White Room. Can Ayanokouji avoid expulsion while sussing out the identity of this hidden foe?\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)'),(59709,'Inazuma Eleven: Soushuuhen Densetsu no Kickoff',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1986/145194.webp','movie','2024-12-27','finished_airing','This is a compilation of the matches from Inazuma Eleven Football Frontier, the first game in the Inazuma Eleven series.\nThe Raimon Junior High soccer team, led by the protagonist Endou Mamoru, aims to win the national tournament, Football Frontier.\nThanks to the efforts of legendary striker Gouenji Shuya, who joins the team, they beat strong schools and make it through the regional qualifiers despite fierce battles. With their former rival, Teikoku Gakuen\'s genius game maker Kidou Arihito, now on board, Raimon Junior High School advances to the finals, but they are faced with the overwhelming strength of Zeus Junior High!\n\n(Source: Official Website)'),(59710,'Inazuma Eleven: Aratanaru Eiyuu-tachi no Joshou',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1453/145195.webp','movie','2024-12-27','finished_airing','The protagonist, Sasanami Unmei, transfers to Nagumohara Junior High School in Nagasaki in search of a soccer-free environment, wishing that soccer would disappear. Meanwhile, Endou Haru, who has demonstrated his natural talent and reigns at the top of his generation, also has complicated feelings about soccer. The unexpected encounter between these two opens the door to new heroes.\n\n(Source: Official Website)'),(59711,'Shibou Yuugi de Meshi wo Kuu.',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1850/145199.webp','tv','2026-01','not_yet_aired','Yuki wakes up to find herself in an unfamiliar manor, wearing a maid uniform and lying on a luxurious bed. Soon, she discovers five more girls, all dressed the same as her. This is the Ghost House, and the only way they can survive is to make it through the traps that lie in wait—deadly games full of blowguns, buzz saws, locked rooms, and weapons. It\'s a hopeless, terrifying situation for everyone there...well, everyone except Yuki. After all, this is her career at seventeen. Do you think that\'s odd? She would agree. But that\'s how some people are—they earn their living playing death games.\n\n(Source: Yen Press)'),(59712,'Herlock Saga: Nibelung no Yubiwa Pilot',240,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1759/145208.jpg','ova','1999','finished_airing','A pilot version of Harlock Saga.'),(59713,'Planetarium Doraemon: Uchuu no Mokei',2400,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1414/145206.webp','movie','2024-07-19','finished_airing',''),(59714,'Bunchou Colors',361,61.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1917/145207.webp','ona','2024-08-27','finished_airing','Five finches meet everyday in a club to help other birds.'),(59718,'Kidou Senshi Gundam: The Origin - Movie Edition',7540,70,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1647/145265.webp','movie','2024-09-13','finished_airing','In the year 0068 of the Universal Century, Casval Rem Deikun\'s life is thrown into chaotic disarray after the assassination of his father, a prolific figure in the crusade towards civil rights for people who live away from the Earth\'s surface. Casval and his sister Artesia receive aid from soldiers who were loyal to their father, and the siblings are whisked away from their home, separated, and thrown into a twisted fate that sees them come into their own as soldiers and adults.\n\nYears before stealing the name Char Aznable or his \"Red Comet\" moniker, Casval must contend with the rise of a militarized version of his father\'s ideology and his own vengeful nature as intergalactic war molds him into a legendary mobile suit pilot. \n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59722,'Kuroko',490,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1607/145215.jpg','movie','2023','finished_airing','A humanoid crocodile appeared at the only bus stop in the village. The crocodile\'s name is Kuroko, and she had a special reason for coming to the bus stop: to make friends with humans.\n\n(Source: U-NEXT, translated)'),(59723,'Watashi wa, Watashi to, Watashi ga, Watashi wo,',484,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1763/145216.webp','movie','2024','finished_airing','One day, \"I\" suddenly found myself transformed into something strange. \"I\" tried many times to peel off my skin and return to my original form, but was unsuccessful.\n\n(Source: Filmarks, translated)'),(59728,'Sealook',90,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1477/145236.jpg','ona','2022-12-01','currently_airing','Centering on the tagged seals observed in a wildlife sanctuary, each episode spotlights different seals navigating life\'s silly challenges through fun and heartwarming ways.\n\n(Source: WelCon)'),(59729,'Shinran: Jinsei no Mokuteki',6240,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1719/145238.jpg','movie','2025-02-28','finished_airing','A historical entertainment film that depicts the life of Saint Shinran, focusing on his youth. The story is set about 850 years ago, in the turbulent times from the end of the Heian period to the Kamakura period.\n\n(Source: MU, translated)'),(59730,'A-Rank Party wo Ridatsu shita Ore wa, Moto Oshiego-tachi to Meikyuu Shinbu wo Mezasu.',1370,65.7,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1897/149800.webp','tv','2025-01-12','currently_airing','\"I can\'t do this anymore!\" Yuke Feldio, a red mage, just left his adventurer A-Rank party. After being mistreated as a handyman and ridiculed for five years, he finally snapped! And so began his desolate, unemployed life... or so he thought! Through a stroke of luck, Yuke is welcomed into an all-female adventurer party comprised of his former students!! As they defeat dungeons one after another, Yuke\'s true strength is gradually revealed! As it turns out, this red mage wields extraordinary magic and skills?!\n\n(Source: Kodansha USA)'),(59732,'Pochars',60,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1155/145243.jpg','tv','2024-10-09','currently_airing',''),(59738,'Pinkfong Wonder Star Teugbyeolpyeon: Hogiwa Dodugjadongcha',2520,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1504/145261.jpg','movie','2023-12-08','finished_airing','Magical cars have arrived in the peaceful town of Wonderville. Pinkfong and his friends enjoy the magic show, but Hogi is suspicious of the sudden arrival of the cars! What are they really up to? Hogi sets out on his own to save his friends from danger. Will he be able to save them all? Hogi\'s adventure to find his inner courage begins!\n\n(Source: Pinkfong Wiki)'),(59739,'Pinkfong Cinema Concert 3: Gingerbread Man-eul Jab-ala',3926,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1683/145263.jpg','movie','2023-09-09','finished_airing','Get ready for some sing-along fun with Pinkfong and Hogi as they go on a musical adventure to find a tasty treat and make the best ice cream ever!\n\n(Source: Netflix)'),(59740,'Pinkfong-gwa Hogi: Sae Chingu Ninimo',780,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1552/145268.jpg','tv','2024-09-21','finished_airing',''),(59741,'Tsuihou sareta Tensei Juukishi wa Game Chishiki de Musou suru',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1502/145271.jpg','tv','2026','not_yet_aired','\"You useless son of mine! You were supposed to pull master swordsman, but I never thought it would be this tragic!\"\n\nThe day a child turns fifteen, they undergo the Ritual of Divine Blessing. Already descended from a line of master swordsman, Elymas was supposed to succeed his father. However, he pulls the defective class, the Heavy Knight, and not only loses his status as future head of the household, but he\'s also exiled. With their unbalanced stats and seemingly useless skills, Heavy Knights are spoked of as a class for cowards and the lazy. However, Elymas knows the truth. The world he lives in is the same as the one of the game he used to play... It is the Heavy Knight that is the most powerful class of them all. Using memories from his past life, Elymas has set out to effectively conquer this entire world.\n\n(Source: Kodansha USA)'),(59744,'Maebashi Witches',1438,62,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1907/148540.jpg','tv','2025-04-06','currently_airing','Yuina Akagi is an ordinary high school freshman in Maebashi City, Gunma Prefecture—until a talking frog named Keroppe appears and throws an unexpected proposal her way:\n\n\"Why don\'t you become a witch?\"\n\nBefore she knows it, Yuina\'s closet becomes a gateway to a mysterious world, where she meets four other girls—each with their own quirks and magical potential. There\'s the fiery Azu Niisato, the level-headed Kyouka Kitahara, the ever-optimistic Choco Mitsumata, and the carefree Mai Kamiizumi.\n\nTogether, they form the Maebashi Witches, a group dedicated to granting people\'s wishes through magic, music, and a bit of mayhem. Their base of operation? A charming little flower shop in the heart of the shopping district—where the flowers of the heart can finally bloom.\n\nWith a little magic and a lot of heart, their new life as witches is about to begin.\n\n(Source: MAL News)\n'),(59745,'Chotto dake Ai ga Omoi Dark Elf ga Isekai kara Oikaketekita',720,57.1,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1192/148314.jpg','tv','2025-04-07','currently_airing','Hinata did it. He got reincarnated into another world, took up the mantle of Hero, and slew the dreaded Demon Lord alongside his party of fellow adventurers. As his reward, he\'s returned to Earth to resume a normal life. Or it would be if it wasn\'t for the fact that his dark elf companion Mariabelle decided to travel to Earth to come and live with him! Now she uses her arcane talents to ward off any potential romantic rivals and capture Hinata\'s affection.\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)'),(59752,'Warau Red List',300,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1437/145327.jpg','tv','2024-08-14','currently_airing','Endangered animals complain about humans! The animals\' complaints reveal the relationship between nature and humans!\n\n(Source: NHK, translated)'),(59753,'Taisu Xilie',1502,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1757/145330.jpg','ona','2024-08-10','finished_airing','An animation anthology film project telling four interlinked tales of animated sci-fi and fantasy by directors from Japan, China and the USA that talks about war, life, love and what we are as human.\n\n(Source: IMDB)'),(59754,'Pihotek',140,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1715/145331.jpg','ona','2024-09-06','finished_airing','Informed by his relationships with Inuit friends and 20 years of mostly solo expeditions, Yasunaga Ogita pens a poetic account of a walk in the Arctic. He observes animals in their natural habitat, and falls asleep with a sense of oneness with nature mediated by the wind. Then when the new dawn arrives with energy for the world, he sets off walking again. An essay in the back of the book discusses the seriousness of climate change.\n\n(Source: Kodansha)'),(59762,'Tian Ying',877,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1147/145347.jpg','ona','2024-09-21','finished_airing','Lu Chen, the \"Shadow\" undercover agent of Fuyun Division, was cursed by black fire for destroying the demon sect\'s divine spell, and his cultivation was completely destroyed. After ten years of living in exile and seclusion, Master Tian Lan appeared again and gave Lu Chen the task of going to the Kunlun Sect to find the undercover demon sect. In order to repair the damaged Five Elements God Disk, Lu Chen was ordered to become a hundred of the Kunlun Sect. A handyman disciple in the thatched cottage. In the process of carrying out the mission, he met many friends and the love of his life Yi Xin, and gradually felt the warmth of the world. At the same time, he touched on the secrets behind Kunlun from various clues, and discovered that the black dragon sealed in the Kunlun Forbidden Land was not an evil monster, but had always claimed to be for The righteous Tian Lan actually had other plans. After realizing the facts, Lu Chen was confused for a while. With Yi Xin\'s encouragement, he decided to face the past and no longer stick to the so-called distinction between good and evil, but to follow his heart and do the right thing.\n\n(Source: Tencent, Google translated)'),(59765,'Yishi Du Zun 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1488/150005.jpg','ona','2024-09-14','currently_airing',''),(59766,'Auto Panther',90,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1628/145351.jpg','cm','2016-09-19','finished_airing','Animated commercial for a car dealership Auto Panther.'),(59768,'Dekiru Koto Kara Hajimeyou',90,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1759/145354.jpg','cm','2024-07-29','finished_airing','A stop-motion commercial promoting Zespri Kiwifruit in connection with the Nutrition Reform Project by Japan\'s Ministry of Health, Labour and Welfare.'),(59770,'Nige Jouzu no Wakagimi: Makuai (1333-nen - 1334-nen) \"Rekishi\"',1420,62.1,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1710/145356.jpg','tv_special','2024-09-07','finished_airing','Recap of the first nine episodes of Nige Jouzu no Wakagimi.'),(59773,'Shishigari',1017,69.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1232/145361.jpg','movie','2019-11-03','finished_airing','Deep in the northern mountains, there are people who have been living with the blessings of the mountains. A boy, who is coming of age, journeys into the mountains for his first hunt. The mountain is a world where life and death are divided by a paper-thin line. Sometimes, nature will show its fangs...\n\n(Source: Official Website)'),(59774,'Tokyo Montage',662,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1309/145362.jpg','movie','2006','finished_airing','A short film by Tomoyasu Murata.'),(59779,'Dororonpa! Komachi no Oyakoukou',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1458/145370.jpg','tv_special','1992-04-05','finished_airing','An additional episode of Dororonpa! which first aired with the rebroadcast of the series.'),(59783,'Meigui Gongyu',525,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1387/145374.webp','ona','2017-03-03','finished_airing','Xiaoxue, a female photographer who likes traveling, comes to a manor full of red roses for vacation and is attracted by the beautiful scenery. Later, she meets Xun, the handsome and silent owner of the manor. Xun takes good care of Xiaoxue, but he seems to be hiding some secrets.\n\n(Source: Official Site)'),(59784,'Oshiri Tantei: Cosmic Front',1500,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1651/145377.jpg','tv_special','2023-03-18','finished_airing','Educational collaboration specials between Oshiri Tantei and the documentary show Cosmic Front.\n\nMikku will help the Butt Detective solve a case, while also teaching the newest facts about dinosaur research and space rockets.\n\n(Source: ANN)'),(59787,'Romelia Senki',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1462/145387.jpg','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Rising from the ashes, a fallen noblewoman stands to save humanity!\n\nAfter the Demon King\'s defeat, Countess Romelia\'s world is shattered when Prince Henri, her fiancé, publicly breaks off their engagement, dismissing her as \"useless\" alongside his new allies: Saint Elizabeth, the sage Ekaterina, and the swordswoman Lu Hime. What they don\'t realize is that Romelia possesses a secret power called \"Grace,\" which brings her extraordinary luck. Left abandoned and humiliated, Romelia refuses to give up. With her homeland still under siege by the remnants of the demon army and her people enslaved, she embarks on a desperate mission to save them.\n\nFacing overwhelming challenges—no army, no healers, no funds, and only inexperienced recruits—Romelia uses her wit and determination to turn the odds in her favor. She seizes fortresses from local lords to build her forces, negotiates with the church for healing, secures funds from merchants, and has her soldiers gain experience through monster hunting. Against all expectations, Romelia rises from the ashes, leading her loyal followers in a daring campaign to rescue her people and prove her worth.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(59790,'Osomatsu-san Shinsaku Short Anime',84,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1769/145400.jpg','ona','2024-09-11','currently_airing',''),(59791,'Ruri no Houseki',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1431/148742.webp','tv','2025','not_yet_aired','The story of Ruri, a girl who likes jewelry and accessories, diving into the world of mineralogy.'),(59793,'Ninja Meshi no Uta',20,0,7,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1256/145414.jpg','cm','2024-04-26','finished_airing','Once a ninja was on a mission, he would sometimes go without food or drink, so he needed emergency food called \"ninja food.\" We are modern ninjas too, and we are always under a lot of stress. \"Ninja Meshi,\" a modern version of ninja food, is a gummy candy with a hard texture that locks in the flavor of the ingredients. Chew it to your heart\'s content and satisfy your hunger!\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(59794,'Ice Rink',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1043/145415.jpg','movie','2024','finished_airing','Two young people are chatting away while waiting for the ice rink to open. A gentle daydream in which colorful, eccentric animals and insects fly about, endlessly overflowing with mysterious, offbeat conversation.\n\n(Source: PIA Film Festival, translated)'),(59795,'Into a Landscape',120,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1144/145416.webp','movie','2024','finished_airing','Today, somewhere, a landscape is born on paper. Eventually, it will become immobile. But the landscape within us never ceases to flow and expand. The colors and shapes push and pull -- not even a moment of preservation.\n\n(Source: Geidai Animation)'),(59801,'UHA Mikakutou x One Piece',15,54.699999999999996,7,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1095/145431.jpg','cm','2012','finished_airing','Collaboration commercials between UHA Mikakutou and One Piece to promote their candy products.'),(59802,'Tulip-chan',1080,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1495/145432.jpg','movie','2024','finished_airing','Tulip-chan, a slightly unusual fifth grade elementary school student, dreams of having her grandchild celebrate her 60th birthday.\n\n(Source: Pia Film Festival, translated)'),(59803,'Aki no Kaze Fuku',3780,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1106/145433.jpg','movie','2024','finished_airing','A mysterious collection of seven short stories colored by a consistent sense of helplessness.\n\n(Source: Pia Film Festival)'),(59804,'Oni Chichi Harem',1140,57.199999999999996,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1237/145434.jpg','ova','2024-12-13','currently_airing','Disillusioned with life and lost in thought, Noboru walks through a deep forest. Suddenly a woman of indescribable beauty appears before his eyes. She was so beautiful and sexy that the stunned guy could not keep his balance and fell off the cliff. But don\'t worry. Coming to his senses, Noboru discovers that he has found himself in a real man\'s paradise. And the local inhabitants, under the leadership of Daka, have already begun to rid the guy of despondency.\n'),(59806,'Bocchi the Rock!: Gotou Futari no Onee-chan Kansatsu Nikki',1406,67.1,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1589/145448.webp','tv_special','2022-12-24','finished_airing','This is a special program where we look back on the recent daily life of the main character, Hitori Gotou, from the observation of her younger sister, Futari Gotou.\n\n(Source: Bocchi the Rock! Wiki)'),(59807,'Transformers 40th Anniversary Special Movie',229,77.4,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1351/145437.webp','pv','2024-09-12','finished_airing','A video uploaded to the Takara Tomy YouTube channel in order to celebrate the 40th anniversary of the franchise.'),(59811,'Yowaki Hakanaki Mono-tachi Pilot Movie',289,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1360/146524.webp','ona','2022-08-09','finished_airing',''),(59812,'Itoshii Itoshii Itoshi no Pan-hen',59,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1903/146523.jpg','ona','2022-12-16','finished_airing','Introducing the \"Bread Thief\'\', a great thief who searches for delicious bread!\n\n(Source: KADOKAWA Children\'s Book Channel, translated)'),(59817,'Girls Band Cry Movie',0,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1287/149287.jpg','movie','2025-10-03','not_yet_aired','Theatrical compilation of Girls Band Cry.'),(59819,'Bye Bye, Earth 2nd Season',1420,62.800000000000004,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1538/147930.jpg','tv','2025-04-04','currently_airing','Second season of Bye Bye, Earth.'),(59820,'Elf-san wa Yaserarenai.: Hami Niku no Shima/Calorie Lovers',720,58.2,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1567/147223.webp','ona','2024-10-05','finished_airing','Episodes 13 and 14 of Elf-san wa Yaserarenai. that aired on the web and were later included with the Blu-ray release of the series.'),(59822,'Star Wars x One Piece',30,61.2,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1546/145460.jpg','cm','2015-12-19','finished_airing','A special video shown before the Japanese screenings of Star Wars: The Force Awakens at select TOHO Cinemas and T-Joy theaters to promote the then upcoming One Piece: Gold. It features the Straw Hat Crew cosplaying Star Wars characters as they prepare to watch the film.'),(59824,'Baolie Feiche 4: Shou Shen Chuji',1320,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1867/145465.jpg','ona','2021-09-16','finished_airing','Fourth season of Baolie Feiche.'),(59828,'Shoushimin Series 2nd Season',1368,78.1,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1224/148321.jpg','tv','2025-04-06','currently_airing','\"I just wanted to know... what love really is.\"\n\nHaving ended their mutually beneficial reciprocal relationship, second-year high schoolers Jougorou Kobato and Yuki Osanai go their separate ways.\n\nOsanai begins dating first-year newspaper club member Urino, who throws himself into covering a series of arson incidents happening around town in hopes of leaving a mark on the school and impressing Osanai. Meanwhile, Kobato starts a relationship with his classmate, Nakamaru, and settles into a peaceful daily life—until he happens to witness an arson scene by the riverside...\n\nWhat awaits Kobato and Osanai as they embark on a new chapter of their lives as \"ordinary citizens\"?\n\n(Source: Official website, translated)'),(59829,'Doraemon: Ken-chan no Bouken',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1299/145476.jpg','movie','1981-07','finished_airing',''),(59830,'Go Go! Majimun',230,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1255/145483.webp','tv','2010-08','finished_airing','The evil Majimun army of Ryujin Mabuya introduce Okinawa\'s lunar calendar events.\n\n(Source: U-NEXT, translated)'),(59831,'Matsuo no Anime',180,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1940/145484.jpg','ona','2019-09-29','currently_airing',''),(59832,'Annecy Festival 60th Anniversary PVs',20,57.1,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1717/145485.jpg','pv','2021-06-16','finished_airing','Contributions by Toei Animation to celebrate the 60th anniversary of the Annecy International Animation Film Festival.'),(59833,'Kono Subarashii Sekai ni Shukufuku wo! 3: Bonus Stage',1537,81.89999999999999,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1482/146928.webp','ova','2025-04-25','finished_airing','Original video anime episodes of Kono Subarashii Sekai ni Shukufuku wo!.'),(59835,'Kirio Fanclub',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1134/145490.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Miyoshi Aimi and Nami Sometani are two high school girls who often find themselves talking about a boy in their class, Kirio. This lighthearted romantic comedy follows the daily lives of these two friends and rivals on a journey that, for now, seems to be heading everywhere but love.\n\n(Source: Comic Ruelle, translated)\n'),(59836,'Doraemon 3D Short Movie',35,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1847/145555.webp','ona','2008-03-21','finished_airing','A collection of Doraemon short movies that were viewable for free on the Doraemon website.\n\nPrologue (プロローグ)\nThis short film shows Doraemon walking, then stopping, pulling the Take-copter out of his pocket, putting it on his head, and flying away.\n\nDorayaki factory (どら焼き工場)\nDoraemon is watching conveyor belts transport dorayaki. When he tries to take one, an alarm activates, triggering a mechanical claw to pick up and drop Doraemon into a vat of dough. After being baked in the oven, Doraemon falls into a pipe and ends up being made into a dorayaki himself.\n\nQuietly (お静かに)\nDoraemon tries to sneak past a sleeping cat to get some dorayaki. As he opens the cupboard, loads of items fall out, though he is able to successfully balance them until a cat food can falls on his head, causing him to fall and wake the cat up.\n\n(Source: Doraemon Wiki)'),(59840,'Yumemiru Otome',977,66.6,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1248/145500.webp','ova','2024-11-29','currently_airing','Beautiful sisters Manaka and Mizuki Miyama study at a girls\' school and live a carefree life. Strict Mizuki is absorbed in her studies, while cheerful Manaka dreams of a happy relationship and begins dating a handsome teacher. Having trusted, the girl comes to his house in the hope of having a romantic time. However, her naive dreams were not destined to come true.'),(59841,'Ore dake Level Up na Ken: ReAwakening',6960,81.6,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1983/146190.webp','movie','2024-11-29','finished_airing','Movie compilation of season one of Ore dake Level Up na Ken, with the addition of the first two episodes of the second season.'),(59843,'Aldnoah.Zero: Ame no Danshou - The Penultimate Truth',1398,64.1,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1566/145506.webp','special','2025-03-26','finished_airing','Episode 24.5 released with the Blu-ray Box.'),(59844,'F-Chara All Stars Daishuugou: Doraemon & Perman - Kikiippatsu!?',480,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1744/145510.jpg','movie','2011-09','finished_airing',''),(59845,'Kaoru Hana wa Rin to Saku',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1013/148711.webp','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Despite being adjacent to one another, Chidori Public High School and the all-girls Kikyo Private Academy seem to exist in two different worlds. While the latter boasts an immaculate reputation and favors students from wealthy backgrounds, the former is a nest for dim-witted delinquents. Everyone at Kikyo harbors a deep hatred for their Chidori neighbors.\n\nSixteen-year-old Rintarou Tsumugi is a student at Chidori whose intimidating face leads people to avoid him. Rintarou pays no mind to this, as he is content with his group of friends. However, there is something he has not told them yet: sometimes, he helps out at his family\'s cake shop.\n\nOne day at work, Rintarou sees a customer at a table, but she runs off before he can talk to her. The next day, he receives an apology from the girl, Kaoruko Waguri, who explains that she did not run away because of his appearance and that she believes Rintarou is a kind-hearted person. Although he is not used to Kaoruko\'s bright personality, Rintarou looks forward to forming a friendship with her. There is just one obstacle that stands in his way: Kaoruko is a Kikyo student!\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59846,'Saigo ni Hitotsu dake Onegai shitemo Yoroshii deshou ka',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1725/148741.webp','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','In the middle of a ball, Scarlet\'s fiancé, Kyle, suddenly calls off their engagement. She\'s falsely accused of being a bully and people unfairly call her a \"Villainess.\" The aristocrats and noble families all denounce her. For years, she had to put up with his abuse and idiocy, but she can\'t take anymore of it! At her wit\'s end, she asks for one last favor; to give him a good fist in the face. So begins Scarlet\'s story of revenge against Kyle and his cronies! A fantasy about an elegant yet rebellious fighter, who doesn\'t let anyone take advantage of her!!\n\n(Source: Alpha Manga)'),(59847,'21 Emon & Doraemon: Youkoso!! Hotel Tsuzureya e',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1618/145513.jpg','movie','2012-10-03','finished_airing',''),(59848,'Virgin Punk',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1320/148690.jpg','movie','2025-06-27','not_yet_aired','The story follows Ubu, a young woman who finds herself living the dangerous life of a bounty hunter. As she grapples with her inner turmoil, she becomes entangled in a world filled with chaos and the desires of the powerful and eccentric individuals around her.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(59849,'Susume Roboket & Doraemon: Kessen! Kumo no Ue no Tatsumakijou',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1184/145515.jpg','movie','2013-08-28','finished_airing',''),(59850,'Doraemon & Chinpui: Eri-sama Ai no Present Daisakusen',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1553/145517.webp','movie','2014-09-03','finished_airing',''),(59851,'Kiteretsu Daihyakka & Doraemon: Korosuke no Hajimete no Otsukai',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1996/145519.jpg','movie','2015-09-03','finished_airing',''),(59852,'Pokonyan & Doraemon: Ponpoko-nyan de Koko Hore Nyan Nyan!?',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1103/145521.jpg','movie','2016-09-03','finished_airing',''),(59853,'Dark Moon: Tsuki no Saidan',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1763/145522.jpg','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Ever since she was a young girl, Sooha was told to hide her superhuman abilities to avoid getting mistaken for a vampire. Having been accused of being one and blamed for her childhood friend\'s death, Sooha enrolls in Decelis Academy—a night school where supernatural beings, such as vampires and werewolves, allegedly cannot enter.\n\nAt the academy, Sooha soon encounters Heli, a student who offers friendship despite discovering her secret. Heli introduces Sooha to his close friends—Jaan, Jino, Shion, Jakah, Noa, and Solon—who all have different powers as well. But their connection seems to run deeper than just that; they are curiously drawn to her, feeling as if they would do anything she wishes.\n\nIn light of a recent murder that is said to be the work of a vampire, Heli and his friends\' unsettling history slowly unravels. While the seven boys try to shield Sooha from the world of the supernatural, she inevitably gets entangled in the centuries-old rivalry between vampires and werewolves. As tensions intensify, Sooha realizes that she may be closer than ever to the creatures she hates the most.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(59854,'Umeboshi Denka & Doraemon: Panparopan no Suppappa!',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1922/145524.jpg','movie','2017-09-01','finished_airing',''),(59855,'Doraemon & F-Chara All Stars: Getsumen Race de Dai-Pinch!?',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1660/145525.webp','movie','2019-03-09','finished_airing',''),(59856,'Doraemon Tanjou',540,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1397/145526.webp','movie','2020-02-08','finished_airing',''),(59857,'Doraemon & F-Chara All Stars: Sukoshi Fushigi Express',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1283/145527.webp','movie','2021-09-01','finished_airing',''),(59858,'Doraemon & SF Tanpen: Sora kara no Otoshidama',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1794/145528.webp','movie','2023-02-09','finished_airing',''),(59859,'Doraemon & F-Chara All Stars: Yume no Machi, F Land',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1506/145529.jpg','movie','2024-02-21','finished_airing',''),(59865,'Shinobanai! Crypto Ninja Sakuya 3rd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1122/145554.jpg','tv','2025','not_yet_aired','Third season of Shinobanai! Crypto Ninja Sakuya.'),(59868,'Jibi Eopseo',360,67.2,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1091/146411.webp','ona','2024-11-01','finished_airing','Go Hae-jun, who ran away from home, and Baek Eun-young, a troublemaker who lives in a tent without a home. The two people who met through bad luck end up living together in an old, abandoned dormitory. \n\nA difficult coming-of-age story of two people who dislike both the dormitory and each other but have nowhere else to go.\n\n(Source: Laftel)'),(59873,'Tokidoki Bosotto Russia-go de Dereru Tonari no Alya-san Season 2',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1649/145575.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Tokidoki Bosotto Russia-go de Dereru Tonari no Alya-san.'),(59874,'Salangui Hachyuping',5160,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1863/145576.jpg','movie','2024-08-07','finished_airing',''),(59875,'Dan Yuan Meng Changjiu',196,63.4,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1685/145577.jpg','ona','2024-09-14','finished_airing','On a full moon day, Pikachu meets many Pokemon. The Pokemon who gather and dance also make an appearance!\n\n(Source: Official YouTube Channel)'),(59876,'Senlin Fei Xia',4860,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1668/145578.jpg','movie','2024-09-15','finished_airing',''),(59877,'Da Sheng Jiang Yao',5400,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1948/145579.jpg','movie','2024-09-15','finished_airing',''),(59878,'Agami',6240,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1151/150084.webp','movie','','not_yet_aired',''),(59879,'32 Beon Daewangingeo',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1127/145581.jpg','movie','2024-09-05','finished_airing',''),(59881,'Wish Cat',680,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1850/145583.webp','tv','2024-09-12','finished_airing',''),(59882,'Geugjangpan Beuledeu Movie: Ppangseutaui Tansaeng',4620,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1674/145584.jpg','movie','2024-09-12','finished_airing',''),(59883,'Metal Cardbot S',680,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1685/145585.jpg','tv','2024-08-26','finished_airing',''),(59884,'Carrie! Haggyogaja',800,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1242/150082.jpg','tv','2024-05-04','finished_airing',''),(59885,'Hello Carbot Allstar Special',4040,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1220/145587.jpg','tv_special','2024-07-31','finished_airing',''),(59886,'Freestyle Shin-chan: Kasukabe no Rapper',420,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1561/145589.jpg','tv_special','2022-01-08','currently_airing','Shinnosuke arrives to Kasukabe City, a devastated town where kids battle each other with freestyle raps, searching for his missing sister Himawari.'),(59887,'Koudai Tanxian Dui',780,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1924/145591.webp','tv','2023','finished_airing','Koudai Tanxian Dui continues the stop-motion animation Koudai Senlin, telling the fantasy adventure story of four pocket bears: Brulee, Cheese, Caramel, and Earl. The storybook slowly opens, guiding them to start a fantasy adventure. Here children and pocket bears adventure together, learn together, and grow together.\n\n(Source: Official Site)'),(59888,'On-chan no Kyou wa Donna Kanji?',76,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1505/145592.webp','tv','2021-05-08','finished_airing','On-chan no Kyou wa Donna Kanji? selects kanji related to Hokkaido that are compulsory for elementary school students in the lower grades, and aims to help with local education. On-chan, a popular mascot character of Hokkaido Television Broadcasting (HTB) that is loved by all generations, takes a single kanji character as a theme and freely imagines its meaning and shape, and performs a cute dance according to the stroke order.\n\n(Source: Taiyo Kikaku, translated)'),(59889,'Kidou Keisatsu Patlabor: EZY',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1155/145600.webp','unknown','2026','not_yet_aired','A new animation in the Kidou Keisatsu Patlabor series.'),(59891,'Yao Shen Ji 6th Season',480,72.69999999999999,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1631/145609.jpg','ona','2022-04-23','finished_airing','Sixth season of Yao Shen Ji.'),(59892,'Murder Mystery of the Dead',1421,57,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1582/145611.webp','tv','2024-11-14','finished_airing','In a world devastated by a zombie pandemic, the protagonist, Mikoto Amano, wakes up in an unfamiliar place with no memory. She is taken in by six girls: Ranna, Lili, Yuu, Fumika, Murumuru, and Rumina. However, their peaceful days are suddenly shattered when a shocking event occurs—the man who was rescued alongside Mikoto is brutally murdered. The killer is among them, and the next target could be anyone...\n\nSet in the Tokyu Kabukicho Tower, the story unfolds in this now sealed-off high-rise, where mysteries and secrets attack one after another. As bonds of friendship start to form among the girls, will they be able to uncover the truth behind the incident?\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(59893,'WBB Short Short Animation',87,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1437/146470.jpg','ona','2024-09-02','currently_airing','Spin-off series of the original short animation Wander Burabura Bakkamu.'),(59894,'Shooting Star Catch! Tiniping',660,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1583/145688.jpg','tv','2024-10-10','finished_airing',''),(59895,'Danbi wa Kkaebi',660,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1008/145673.jpg','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Danbi and Kebi is a stop-motion series for preschoolers, featuring a four-year-old girl named Danbi and her magical fairy friend Kebi who often unfold a world of imagination. They are free spirited with silly sense of humour and depend on each other through thick and thin, and turn anything ordinary into a fun, fantastical playground of imagination. \n\n(Source: Official page)'),(59896,'Goyang-iga Doeeossda',309,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1300/145675.jpg','movie','2024','finished_airing','A guy, heartbroken from losing his cat, Haru, wakes up one day to find himself transformed into a cat. While navigating this bizarre new life, he stumbles upon the Dog Man and his dog, also named Haru, who surprisingly recognize him in his feline form. \n\n(Source: Official site)'),(59897,'Kobayashi-san Chi no Maid Dragon: Samishigariya no Ryuu',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1134/148744.webp','movie','2025-06-27','not_yet_aired',''),(59898,'City The Animation',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1981/149640.jpg','tv','2025-07-07','not_yet_aired','Midori is in a bit of a bind. She is in debt, and her landlady is trying to shake her down for unpaid rent. Her best friend refuses to loan her cash since she\'s wised up to her tricks. Maybe some bullying would help. Or a bit of petty theft? Neither is sustainable. Maybe getting a job would settle things... But working means less time for fun adventures in the big city...\n\n(Source: Vertical)'),(59899,'Arawi Keiichi Tanpen',146,59.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1666/145680.webp','ona','2020-05-28','finished_airing','Short animation by Arawi Keiichi, featuring characters from Nichijou.\n\n'),(59901,'Ai no Yakusoku',966,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1321/145689.webp','ona','2024-09-21','finished_airing',''),(59908,'One Piece: Yuruganu Seigi! Kaigun no Hokoritakaki Log!',1430,64.80000000000001,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1754/145686.jpg','tv_special','2024-09-29','finished_airing','The fifth recap special of the Egghead arc.'),(59914,'Kinnikuman: Kanpeki Chоujin Shiso-hen Season 2',1426,68.89999999999999,11,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1228/146704.jpg','tv','2025-01-12','finished_airing','Second season of Kinnikuman: Kanpeki Chоujin Shiso-hen.'),(59915,'Shendao Dizun',420,69.2,48,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1052/150128.webp','ona','2024-10-22','finished_airing','The young man Qin Yang was very talented and possessed the enviable cultivation artifact \"Star Gate\". However, this luck was taken away overnight. When he was about to die, Qin Yang opened the dust-covered treasure \"God Bead\" in his body. Since then, he has restored the memory of his previous nine lives and gained a new life. At the same time, the family fell into an unprecedented crisis. Faced with many tests, Qin Yang took charge of his own affairs and relied on the experience accumulated in his nine previous lives to break through the difficulties again and again. Unexpectedly, the conspirators are still pressing forward step by step. In order to protect the people he cherishes, Qin Yang chooses to fight to the end.\n\n(Source: Bilibili, Google translated)'),(59916,'Dadao Chaotian',1191,75.1,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1887/145696.webp','ona','2024-10-10','finished_airing','A person who has traveled all over the green mountains is still young, but when he suddenly looks back, the sword is just between his eyebrows, but in his heart. Jing Jiu, who lives in a mountain village in Chaotian Continent, unexpectedly receives Liu Shisui, who is born with Taoism, as a book boy. The two came to the Qingshan Sect by chance, but they were criticized because the \"mediocre\" Jing Jiu actually took the \"extraordinary genius\" Liu Shisui as his servant. At the sword inheritance conference, Jing Jiu also met Zhao Layue, a Sanwu girl from Shenmo Peak. Jing Jiu, who is surprisingly \"lazy\", just wants to practice quietly, but little does he know that fate will involve the three of them in a huge river and lake dispute... Under the Taixu, are the green mountains far away? Not far.\n\n(Source: Bilibili, Google translated)'),(59924,'Nuno Sanpo',100,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1709/145710.webp','pv','2024-09-23','finished_airing','A PV to commemorate the start of the serialization of the manga.'),(59925,'Kaguya-hime (1972)',1080,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1586/145711.jpg','movie','1972','finished_airing','A short puppet animation version of Princess Kaguya, also known as The Tale of the Bamboo Cutter, a 10th century folk tale.'),(59927,'Wan Yu Feng Shen 2nd Season',740,0,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1320/145717.jpg','ona','2024-07-15','finished_airing',''),(59928,'Ookami to Koushinryou: Merchant Meets the Wise Wolf 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1924/145718.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Ookami to Koushinryou: Merchant Meets the Wise Wolf.'),(59930,'Kaguya-hime',1560,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1881/145720.jpg','movie','1942-02-24','finished_airing','A silhouette animation version of Princess Kaguya, also known as The Tale of the Bamboo Cutter, a 10th century folk tale.'),(59934,'FNS 27-Jikan TV: Nihon no Rekishi Anime',1560,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1976/145726.jpg','tv_special','2017-09-09','finished_airing','Special animated corners part of FNS 27-Jikan TV: Nihon no Rekishi that aired on Fuji TV. The corners feature characters from Chibi Maruko-chan, Dragon Ball Super, Kochira Katsushikaku Kameari Kouenmae Hashutsujo, and One Piece as they explore the history of Japan\'s from the Paleolithic to Heisei period.'),(59935,'Gorilla no Kami kara Kago sareta Reijou wa Ouritsu Kishidan de Kawaigarareru',1420,66.39999999999999,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1714/148317.jpg','tv','2025-04-06','currently_airing','In a world where individuals receive blessings from various animal gods at the age of sixteen, Sophia Riller, a timid count\'s daughter, unexpectedly receives the blessing of the \"Gorilla God\"—said to be the strongest in combat. Though she longs for a peaceful school life, her rare and powerful ability attracts the attention of the Royal Knights, who scout her as an apprentice knight. Despite her efforts to hide her overwhelming strength, she can\'t help but stand out. Meanwhile, the promising young knights around her watch over her with kindness.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(59938,'Zongmen Li Chule Wo Dou Shi Wodi',420,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1029/150138.jpg','ona','2024-10-14','currently_airing','The legendary hacker was chased to death by the system\'s AI in order to save humanity, and unexpectedly became the leader of the first sect in another world. However, in order to deal with the situation of all undercover agents in the sect and the system crisis that came with it, Chen Ning just wanted to keep a low profile and wait and see, have a look. But like a cone in the bag, even though he was cold-faced and unparalleled and cared about the world, he was still among thousands of flowers, and each one was touched. Finally, with the help of the system agent Jiang Que, Chen Ning\'s domineering body shook, and both the enemy and ourselves just bow down and bow! The secrets of the world rushed to be opened to him, and he finally solved the crisis of annihilation.\n\n(Source: Bilibili, Google translated)'),(59939,'Tunshi Xingkong Movie: Xueluo Dalu',5616,79.1,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1695/145740.jpg','ona','2024-12-07','finished_airing',''),(59940,'Decapolice',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1380/145742.jpg','tv','2026','not_yet_aired','DECASIM, a virtual world created from a perfect copy of reality. More than just a simulation, it\'s a complete copy of a real city, a forbidden place where memories of every past crime lie dormant. \"Clues\" found in DECASIM can help unravel the riddles of the real world.\n\n(Source: Official site)'),(59944,'Poketoon (2024)',550,71.39999999999999,9,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1617/145745.jpg','ona','2024-09-18','finished_airing','The second installation of the POKÉTOON series. '),(59945,'Sengoku Youko: Senma Konton-hen Recap',1430,61.4,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1964/145747.jpg','tv_special','2024-09-26','finished_airing','Recap of the first ten episodes of Sengoku Youko: Senma Konton-hen.'),(59948,'Biklonz 2nd Season',480,0,21,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1236/145756.jpg','tv','2014-10-08','finished_airing',''),(59949,'Biklonz 3rd Season',600,0,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1431/145760.jpg','tv','2015-04-01','finished_airing',''),(59950,'Jeil Pap',60,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1806/145761.jpg','cm','2024-07-15','finished_airing','A stop-motion commercial for Jeil Pharmaceuticals to commemorate the 40th anniversary of the Jeil Pap pain relief patch, featuring the penguin mascot used to advertise the product in the 80s.'),(59951,'Man Huang Xian Jie',420,0,48,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1137/150129.jpg','ona','2024-09-25','finished_airing','In the vast and wild fairyland, the culture of cultivating immortals prevails, and mortals are proud to become cultivators. College student, Lu Hangzhi,  transmigrated from the modern times and became a mortal servant in Ziyun Town. \n\nHe lived a life of treading on thin ice every day, but he refused to accept his fate and worked hard to get rid of his status quo and strived to get ahead. Later, because of a good deed, he was appreciated by Zhu Fuqin, the eldest lady of the Zhu Mansion, and his senior brother Leng Wuya. \n\nWith unremitting efforts, he passed many tests and joined the Xuanxin Sect. He was promoted from an outer disciple to an inner disciple, and was even favored by the deputy head Chen Ji and took him in. He cut his way through obstacles and moved forward on the road of cultivating immortals. \n\n(source: Qiyi)'),(59953,'Mushen Ji',1200,79.80000000000001,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1324/150012.jpg','ona','2024-10-27','currently_airing','In the Disabled Elderly Village, there live nine elderly people with unpredictable origins and the young man Qin Mu they raised. One day, the cows that Qin Mu was responsible for grazing began to speak human words. From then on, Qin Mu became more aware of the dangers and beauty of Daxu, a land abandoned by gods: demons descended with darkness, divine bones danced in the ruins, and dragon bones protected their young, a giant ship that drags the sun... No matter what kind of danger he faces, Qin Mu is fearless. He has integrated the skills passed down by the Nine Elders and vowed to carve out a world with his unparalleled hegemony. \n\n(Source: Bilibili, Google translated)'),(59957,'Senpai wa Otokonoko Movie: Ame Nochi Hare',4920,65.7,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1469/146852.jpg','movie','2025-02-14','finished_airing','Movie sequel to Senpai wa Otokonoko.'),(59959,'Schick x One Piece',15,56.1,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1864/145777.jpg','cm','2010-06-01','finished_airing','Collaboration commercials between Schick and One Piece to promote their razors.'),(59961,'Kizu darake Seijo yori Houfuku wo Komete',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1546/145782.webp','tv','2025-07-10','not_yet_aired','Lua is a saintess candidate who possesses the power of healing. But her ability had one flaw: she could only heal others by transferring their wounds onto herself. Because of this, others bullied her, calling her the \"Fallen Saintess.\" But it didn\'t bother Lua because her best friend Arianne always stood up for her.\n\nOne day, Lua\'s crush, Commander Garrett, was on the brink of death from a beast attack. Lua healed him, which left her on the verge of death. When she woke up, she learned that all the credit was given to Arianne, and she finally saw her best friend\'s true color. Devastated, Lua is lost and helpless when the second prince appears in front of her with a tempting offer. What would happen to Lua as she begins her new life as a villainess?\n\n(Source: NHN comico Corp.)'),(59962,'Bebefinn',210,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1590/145779.jpg','ona','2022-05-16','currently_airing','Meet Bebefinn who loves Baby Shark and sing nursery rhymes with catchy tunes together.\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(59964,'Biklonz 4th Season',600,0,28,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1672/145781.jpg','tv','2015-09-17','finished_airing',''),(59965,'Biklonz: Barbarian King Special',600,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1070/145786.jpg','tv_special','2015-12-10','finished_airing',''),(59966,'Biklonz 5th Season',600,0,14,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1871/145785.jpg','tv','2016-09-23','finished_airing',''),(59967,'Du Shi Gu Xian Yi',690,0,150,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1461/150190.jpg','ona','2024-10-02','currently_airing','Ye Bufan, a junior student, tried to scam a car to raise medical expenses for his mother. Unexpectedly, he encountered a female driver who did not play by the rules. After being hit, Ye Bufan accidentally traveled to a fantasy world and obtained the inheritance of ancient medicine. From then on, he mastered medical skills, practiced martial arts, and won the favor of countless beautiful women.\n\n(Source: iQIYI, translated)'),(59968,'Sword Art Online Alternative: Gun Gale Online II - Gala',1420,60.8,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1882/145784.jpg','ona','2024-09-27','finished_airing','To commemorate the broadcast of the second season, we will be releasing episode 12.5. Please enjoy the narration by Eva, Sophie, and Tanya, as well as the ending song \"Replica\".\n\n(Source: Official Website)'),(59969,'Zhen Hun Jie 4th Season',1200,73.60000000000001,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1615/150033.webp','ona','2024-11-22','finished_airing','The fourth season of Zhen Hun Jie.'),(59970,'Tensei shitara Slime Datta Ken 4th Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1276/145790.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','Fourth season of Tensei shitara Slime Datta Ken.'),(59971,'Tensei shitara Slime Datta Ken Movie 2: Soukai no Namida-hen',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1440/147868.webp','movie','2026-02','not_yet_aired','Second movie for Tensei shitara Slime Datta Ken.'),(59977,'Hu He Yao Shi Lu',1202,69.80000000000001,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1717/145797.webp','ona','2024-10-05','finished_airing','In a world where humans and demons coexist and compete, people who practice magic and kill demons as their own mission are called demon masters. Qi Xiaoxuan, the captain of the national demon master, met the prodigal Huzi by accident, and the two embarked on a journey to slay demons and protect the Tao together. Now, the world has experienced five hundred years of peace, and the demons are already ready to move, casting a haze on their future...\n\n(Source: Bilibili, Google translated)'),(59978,'Sousou no Frieren 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1089/148301.webp','tv','2026-01','not_yet_aired','Second season of Sousou no Frieren.'),(59980,'Doraemon Movie 44: Nobita no E Sekai Monogatari',6300,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1143/146877.jpg','movie','2025-03-07','finished_airing',''),(59981,'Taiyou wo Nakushita Hi',840,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1323/145817.jpg','movie','2002','finished_airing',''),(59983,'Tsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1879/145809.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Tsue to Tsurugi no Wistoria.'),(59985,'Boku no Kokoro no Yabai Yatsu Movie',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1794/145812.webp','movie','','not_yet_aired','A re-edit of both anime seasons featuring newly added footage and will depict the story of Ichikawa and Yamada after the events of the TV series.'),(59986,'Grand Blue Season 2',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1278/145814.webp','tv','2025-07-08','not_yet_aired','Second season of Grand Blue.'),(59989,'Kami no Tou: Koubou-sen',1434,69,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1877/145819.webp','tv','2024-10-06','finished_airing','Second part of Tower of God Season 2.'),(59990,'Sengoku Youko: Yonaoshi Kyoudai-hen Recap',1430,61.6,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1919/145820.webp','tv_special','2024-07-04','finished_airing','Recap of the events of Sengoku Youko: Yonaoshi Kyoudai-hen that was broadcast before the airing of the second season. It was also included with the BD release of the series.'),(59991,'High Score Specials',180,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1774/145821.jpg','special','2012-03-15','finished_airing','Special episodes of High Score that were included with the DVD release of the series.'),(59993,'Wuhang Zhanshen 2nd Season',622,0,30,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1956/145865.jpg','ona','2024-09-28','finished_airing',''),(59998,'Shu Shan Qi Xian Lu 2nd season',952,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1699/145831.jpg','ona','2024-09-30','finished_airing',''),(60007,'Kamigami Rairai',626,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1271/145850.jpg','movie','2024','finished_airing','The man who had been walking only on the white lines could no longer move forward. He turned his attention to his smartphone and saw a video titled \"The Gods Come.\" The story began, and he turned around and started walking again.\n\n(Source: Geidai Animation)'),(60009,'Chuuzenji-sensei Mononoke Kougiroku: Sensei ga Nazo wo Hodoite Shimau kara.',1430,63.6,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1770/148195.jpg','tv','2025-04-07','currently_airing','School x Supernatural x Mystery. This story takes place before the exorcist Kyougokudou opened up a used bookstore...\n\nOur setting is in Tokyo in 1948, just right after the war. Kanna Kusakabe had just become a second-year at a high school when she meets the new language teacher, Akihiko Chuuzenji. Mysterious supernatural things keep happening around Kanna. Once again today, Kanna is going to open the doors to the library prep room to seek help from the surly Chuuzenji-sensei who is waiting inside.\n\nA high school supernatural mystery featuring the unlikely duo between a teacher and a high school girl is about to begin!\n\n(Source: Pony Canyon, edited)'),(60011,'Saero Gumidyeon: San 257',380,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1868/145862.jpg','ona','2024-09-29','finished_airing',''),(60012,'Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Break Time 3rd Season',150,71.2,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1349/145863.webp','special','2024-10-03','finished_airing','The third season of Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Kyuukei Jikan Break Time.\n\n'),(60014,'Happyakuyachou Hyouri Kewaishi Specials',817,0,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1256/145869.jpg','special','1991-05-24','finished_airing','Unaired episodes of Happyakuyachou Hyouri Kewaishi.'),(60017,'Holeonaicheu',980,0,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1469/145872.jpg','ona','2024-02-16','finished_airing',''),(60018,'Slime Boukenki',907,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1292/145887.jpg','special','1995-08-01','finished_airing','A short anime directed by Itsuro Kawasaki and produced by Production I.G, which was shown at the V Jump Festival \'95. The special is based on the manga of the same name by Osamu Kaneko.'),(60019,'Slime Boukenki: Wolf-kun Ganbaru no Maki',1099,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1226/145874.jpg','special','1998-07-26','finished_airing','A short anime directed by Mizuho Nishikubo and produced by Production I.G, which was shown at the V Jump Festival \'98. The special is based on the Slime Boukenki manga by Osamu Kaneko.'),(60020,'Yeon-ui Pyeonji',6000,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1262/145875.webp','movie','','not_yet_aired','Lee Sori, a polite and righteous girl, attends a middle school plagued with bullying. Enraged by the tragic effects it has had on her friend Kim Julie, she decides to take a stand against the bullying. Unfortunately, this only leads the bullies to switch their target to Sori.\n\nBelieving a new environment would rid her of the hopeless situation, Sori returns to the city she used to live in and transfers schools. However, the traumatizing experiences that constantly haunt Sori\'s memory cause her to alienate herself from everyone else.\n\nJust as the grim reality of Sori\'s circumstances begin to set in, she discovers a mysterious letter taped under her desk. While the contents of the letter intrigue her, they only lead her to another letter. Now following a seemingly endless trail of messages, Sori is on a scavenger hunt to find the true purpose of these letters and the anonymous person behind it all.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(60022,'One Piece Fan Letter',1495,90.39999999999999,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1455/146229.jpg','tv_special','2024-10-20','finished_airing','Although the golden age of piracy is about to reach new heights, most people do not seek the glory of finding the elusive One Piece—a treasure signifying a new conqueror of all seas that was once embodied by the legendary King of the Pirates, Gol D. Roger. However, even if civilians generally despise pirates, they secretly cheer for at least one of them. \n\nOne red-headed girl from Sabaody Archipelago is no exception: She reveres Nami, the ingenious female navigator of Monkey D. Luffy\'s Straw Hat crew. Determined to deliver a fan letter to her idol, the Sabaody child is prepared to challenge forces of authority who strive to prevent Luffy and his friends from departing for their next destination: the New World. But to succeed, Nami\'s fan may need to risk her life and interfere with the Marines\' plans, potentially causing devastating consequences for the wider world.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(60023,'Ore no Imouto ga Konnani Kawaii Wake ga Nai x Toaru Majutsu no Index Movie: Endymion no Kiseki - Kokuchi Eizou',30,55.4,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1039/145882.jpg','cm','2013-03','finished_airing','A special video shown at screenings of Toaru Majutsu no Index Movie: Endymion no Kiseki to promote the then upcoming second seasons of Ore no Imouto ga Konnani Kawaii Wake ga Nai and Toaru Kagaku no Railgun.'),(60028,'Himekishi wa Barbaroi no Yome',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1801/148621.webp','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','\"Just kill me!\" These are the words of Serafina de Lavillant, the strongest female knight in the West. After being defeated in a war with the East, she has become a prisoner of the barbarians! What awaits the captive Serafina is a life of revenge, torture, and humiliation... or so she thought! What she is offered instead is a marriage to the barbarian king?! An intriguing tale of otherworldly marriage is about to begin!\n\n(Source: Kodansha USA)'),(60029,'5-Okunen Button (TV Special)',1320,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1147/145898.jpg','tv_special','2024-09-30','finished_airing','Episodes 13 and 14 of 5-Okunen Button.'),(60030,'Ana no Naka',300,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1846/145899.jpg','tv_special','2024-10-09','finished_airing','\"I\" dug a hole in the garden and noticed a faint glow on the wall of the hole. Wondering what it could be, I gently touched the wall, and where I touched it, the boundary between the layers of rock lifted up! Behind it was a \"fragment\" of something that emitted light... As soon as I grabbed the fragment, I was pulled by a strong force and fell into a crack in the earth\'s layers...\n\n(Source: NHK, translated)'),(60034,'Toemarok',5100,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1917/147874.jpg','movie','2025-02-21','finished_airing','A doctor-turned-priest, Father Park was excommunicated for performing exorcisms by a church that refused to believe in the supernatural beings preying on the innocent. When his long-time friend, a monk from a secretive and magic-wielding temple, calls upon him to protect a naïve yet powerful child from his corrupt master.\n\n(Source: Annecy Festival)\n'),(60035,'Garbage Time PV',26,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1732/145906.jpg','pv','2024-10-03','finished_airing',''),(60036,'Yugsiggo PV',99,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1104/145908.jpg','pv','2024-09-10','finished_airing',''),(60037,'Jagdu PV',235,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1491/145909.jpg','pv','2024-07-11','finished_airing',''),(60041,'Pibugwa Manlebnam PV',66,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1737/145914.jpg','pv','2024-03-28','finished_airing',''),(60044,'Shinsei Kourin Dacryon Luna',1674,56.5,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1795/150000.webp','ova','2024-12-06','currently_airing','Cute friends Runa, Raina and Miyu study at the prestigious private school Etoile and spend a lot of time together doing a variety of teenage activities. As members of a journalism club, the girls downloaded an app called Angel Maker, which proved challenging. It was cursed by fallen angels, and the girlfriends received magical powers. As they say, with new power comes new responsibility. Ugly monsters sensed the newfound magic, and from that moment began the tireless struggle of brave magical girls for goodness and justice.'),(60045,'The iDOLM@STER Shiny Colors 2nd Season: SHHis',1200,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1680/145924.webp','ova','2025-03-28','finished_airing','A special episode included as a bonus in the ASOBI STORE special edition Blu-ray box released on March 28, 2025.'),(60046,'Mahou Shoujo ni Akogarete 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1389/145933.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Mahou Shoujo ni Akogarete.'),(60048,'Bleach 20th PV',122,81.1,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1357/145984.jpg','pv','2024-10-05','finished_airing','In celebration of 20 years of Bleach, the PV is a compilation of newly reworked scenes from Bleach containing new animation.'),(60052,'Sylvanian Families: Freya no Piece of Secret',660,0,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1856/145941.jpg','tv','2024-11-21','finished_airing',''),(60055,'Yozakura-san Chi no Daisakusen 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1040/147111.jpg','tv','2026','not_yet_aired','Second season of Yozakura-san Chi no Daisakusen.'),(60057,'Chao Neng Lifang: Chaofan Pian',1206,72.9,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1759/145944.jpg','ona','2025-03-21','finished_airing','In an accident, an ordinary boy, Wang Xiaoxiu, obtains a space system called \"Superpower Cube\" from a high-latitude cosmic civilization and gains extraordinary powers. When the school belle, Shen Yao, Wang Xiaoxiu’s longtime crush, confesses her love to him, the delinquent Sun Jun, who also has a crush on her, is provoked. \n\nWang Xiaoxiu resolves the crisis with his wit and extraordinary powers, but it also brings more disasters as a result. Shen Yao is taken to the world of extraordinary beings by a mysterious person, and Wang Xiaoxiu embarks on a journey to rescue her. Fighting in the bizarre universe, he finds the meaning of fairness and justice on the path to becoming a peerless powerhouse.\n\n(Source: iQIYI International)'),(60058,'[Oshi no Ko] 3rd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1091/145945.webp','tv','2026','not_yet_aired','Third season of [Oshi no Ko].'),(60059,'Nige Jouzu no Wakagimi 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1437/145947.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Nige Jouzu no Wakagimi.'),(60063,'Fairy Tail: 100-nen Quest - Kanwa - Lucy\'s Diary',1430,63,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1563/145960.webp','tv_special','2024-10-06','finished_airing','A recap of the first thirteen episodes of Fairy Tail: 100-nen Quest.'),(60066,'Xian Ji Xun Zong',420,0,48,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1659/145972.jpg','ona','2024-09-13','finished_airing',''),(60067,'Kyoushi no K',30,0,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1291/145973.webp','ona','2024-10-06','finished_airing','Mini anime for Touhai: Ura Rate Mahjong Touhai Roku.'),(60070,'Kaijuu Sekai Seifuku (TV)',120,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1582/150123.jpg','tv','2025-04-05','currently_airing','Following the chaotic and heartwarming daily lives of Kaijuu who have come to Earth to conquer the world and live with their human masters.'),(60071,'Odayaka Kizoku no Kyuuka no Susume.',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1455/149174.jpg','tv','2026-01','not_yet_aired','When Lizel mysteriously finds himself in a city that bears odd similarities to his own but clearly isn\'t, he quickly comes to terms with the unlikely truth: this is an entirely different world. Even so, laid-back Lizel isn\'t the type to panic. He immediately sets out to learn more about this strange place, and to help him do so, hires a seasoned adventurer named Gil as his tour guide and protector.\n\nUntil he\'s able to find a way home, Lizel figures this is a perfect opportunity to explore a new way of life adventuring as part of a guild. After all, he\'s sure he\'ll go home eventually... might as well enjoy the otherworldly vacation for now!\n\n(Source: Tokyopop)'),(60076,'Blue Lock: Episode Nagi - Additional Time!',90,68,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1006/146003.webp','movie','2024-04-19','finished_airing','A series of shorts which aired along with the release of Blue Lock: Episode Nagi. A different short was shown each week during the film\'s theatrical run and they were all included with the BD release.'),(60080,'Nui Story 2',120,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1060/149983.jpg','ona','2024-10-19','currently_airing','Second season of Nui Story.'),(60083,'Kowloon Generic Romance',1520,76.2,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1719/150050.jpg','tv','2025-04-05','currently_airing','In the distant future, individuals who adore the old way of life live in Kowloon Walled City—a slum city that serves as a refuge for those who long for the Hong Kong of the past. Realtor Reiko Kujirai, however, craves for the new and exciting places in the area. In contrast, her only coworker, Hajime Kudou, enjoys the nostalgia the city invokes and is put off by anything modern that seeps past its walls. But despite their differing views and constant bickering on the most mundane of things, the two often find themselves enjoying each other\'s company.\n\nOne day, a prank gone wrong leads Hajime to make an unexpected advance toward Reiko, after which he swiftly apologizes for. Baffled by his actions, Reiko starts investigating for possible explanations, only to discover a past that she has no memory of.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(60084,'Delico\'s Nursery: Ikuji Nisshi',1420,62.300000000000004,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1424/146559.jpg','tv_special','2024-10-10','finished_airing','From the pages of Dali\'s child-rearing journal, as reported on by Henrique, it\'s a summary of the first six episodes of Delico\'s Nursery.\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)'),(60089,'Chang Sheng Jie',1369,73.5,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1757/146039.jpg','ona','2024-10-29','finished_airing','The World of Immortals, it is the world every mortals long for. For many, it is an eternal glory to distort the dimension and enter the World of Immortals. But the vicissitude of time is simply merciless, the legends regarding immortality had long been forgotten. However, a miracle shall rise once more! An immortal was about to distort the dimension with martial arts and cut all ties with the mortal world. The protagonist, Xiao Chen, was caught up in it and accidentally brought to the World of Immortals. What will they find in the vast world beyond the rift?\n\n(Source: MU)'),(60091,'Taka no Tsume Gaiden \"Himitsu Kyuusha: Uma no Hizume\"',166,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1646/146041.jpg','tv','2023-05-04','finished_airing',''),(60092,'Taka no Tsume Gaiden \"Himitsu Kyuusha: Uma no Hizume - Grand Prix\"',166,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1892/146042.jpg','tv','2023-11-30','finished_airing',''),(60093,'Taka no Tsume Gaiden \"Himitsu Kyuusha: Uma no Hizume - Derby Conquest\"',166,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1984/146043.jpg','tv','2024-05-02','finished_airing',''),(60094,'Kankin Kuiki Level X 2nd Season',780,65.8,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1511/146045.webp','tv','2025-02-22','finished_airing','Second season of Kankin Kuiki Level X.'),(60098,'Boku no Hero Academia: Final Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1441/148713.webp','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','Final season of Boku no Hero Academia.'),(60108,'One Piece: Gyojin Tou-hen',1430,79.3,21,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1928/146063.jpg','tv','2024-11-03','finished_airing','Two years after the Summit War, Monkey D. Luffy plans to reunite with the Straw Hat Pirates in the Sabaody Archipelago. However, the Marines obstruct Luffy\'s path with overwhelming force. Meanwhile, the Straw Hats must also foil the schemes of a group of impersonators acting in their likenesses.\n\nWith two years of intensive training with allies old and new, Luffy regroups with his friends aboard the Thousand Sunny to set sail for the New World. As the Straw Hat Crew departs for Fish-Man Island, new threats creep up from the abyss. But more determined than ever to become the King of the Pirates, Luffy is prepared to defeat any enemy that may stand between him and his dream.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(60116,'Arnold He Ta Ke Ai de Muomen',240,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1455/148957.jpg','ona','2024-04-02','finished_airing','As the night falls, the curtains of the Kraevif Theater rise slowly, and the talented host Arnold Krebreg steps onto the stage, ready to present a self made puppet show. On the theater\'s grand stage sits a small stage for the puppets. As soon as Arnold places the puppets within, they spontaneously come to life, beginning their improvisational performances. What might the fan letters from the puppets contain? Why does a fragrant signature dish lead to chaos? In an unusually intense soccer match, the score difference reaches...?! More exciting stories await at the Krakow Theater! The capricious and lively Joker, the narcissistic and grumpy Leo, and the self-absorbed and clueless Bane, along with other residents of the manor, will join hands to showcase a series of fantastic and joyful daily routines for the audience.\n\n(Source: Official Site)'),(60127,'Insect Land (ONA)',300,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1162/146099.jpg','ona','2024-04-26','finished_airing','Episodes 23-26 of the Insect Land anime, released on the TMS Anime YouTube channel for a limited time on April 26th, 2024.'),(60130,'Muchuu sa, Kimi ni.',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1314/146112.jpg','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Hayashi\'s frank, guileless demeanor quietly draws the attention of classmates and strangers as he counts all the stairs in school, photographs street signs, and dries sweet potatoes on the classroom balcony. In a world shaped by conformity, Hayashi is refreshingly and unapologetically true to himself. Conversely, Nikaidou has worked very hard to perfect a gloomy, dour façade that keeps his classmates far, far away. While much of the school regards Nikaidou as a bad omen, one student catches a glimpse behind the mask and-undeterred by rumors of bad luck and supernatural powers-begins to pick away Nikaidou\'s carefully crafted persona…\n\n(Source: Yen Press)'),(60131,'Karaoke Iko!',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1584/146111.jpg','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Nothing worries Satomi Oka more than the upcoming final choir competition of his middle school career—right up until he is accosted by a stranger from the shadows who demands, \"Let\'s go karaoke!\" As a yakuza, Kyouji Narita doesn\'t scare easily, but a terrifying prospect has driven him to seek Satomi\'s help. The boss is holding a karaoke contest, with the loser forced to get a tattoo to be selected and torturously applied by the boss himself! Oka has been to many vocal rehearsals over the years, but never one-on-one karaoke sessions with a gangster!!\n\n(Source: Yen Press)'),(60137,'Tudi Ge Ge Shi Da Lao',720,67.8,40,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1222/150037.jpg','ona','2024-10-28','finished_airing','The story follows the aloof supreme lord of the myriad realms. He handpicks young girls, each with the potential to ascend as future deities, and embarks on a treacherous quest to reshape the destiny of the realms. Confronting formidable challenges and obstacles, will these fledgling girls triumph in their trials and forge a new world from the ashes of the old?\n\n(Source: Youku)'),(60140,'Kanchigai no Atelier Meister: Eiyuu Party no Moto Zatsuyougakari ga, Jitsu wa Sentou Igai ga SSS Rank Datta to Iu Yoku Aru Hanashi',1420,66,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1743/148272.jpg','tv','2025-04-06','currently_airing','Despite having no real combat talent, kind 15-year-old Kurt Rockhans belongs to the famous party Flaming Dragon Fang. He is perfectly satisfied as the party\'s helper—until the other members kick him out and replace him with a stronger ally. Left without a way to provide for himself, Kurt begins searching for a job.\n\nWith his job prospects limited by his lack of combat ability, Kurt gladly accepts any work that comes his way. During one such job, he meets Yulishia, an adventurer formerly employed by the royal family. Surprised by Kurt\'s impressive work, Yulishia discovers that he is no ordinary boy: Kurt possesses an astonishingly high aptitude in a variety of non-combat fields. Due to these talents, a court official tells Yulishia to offer Kurt a high status in the kingdom that would allow him to live in peace for the rest of his life.\n\nWhen Yulishia informs Kurt about his potential rank, he brushes off the offer, refusing to think of himself as above other people. Still unaware of his real power, Kurt continues taking as many odd jobs as possible, which might just make him a pivotal part of the kingdom before he even notices it.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(60143,'Wo Neng Wuxian Dunwu',720,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1389/150039.jpg','ona','2024-10-26','finished_airing','With determination and courage, Xiao Yun, a mortal boy, joins the battle for the qualification of the emperor with the help of the epiphany system. But why did the emperor know him a million years ago? Why did he leave notes in the future? What is the true origin of the epiphany system? All parallel worlds will face a huge crisis, and the only savior is the boy from Earth summoned by the gods!\n\n(Source: Iqiyi, Google translated)'),(60146,'Saikyou no Ousama, Nidome no Jinsei wa Nani wo Suru?',1370,52.199999999999996,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1712/148299.webp','tv','2025-04-02','currently_airing','The story follows the strongest king in history, Grey. Although he possesses unparalleled power, wealth, and fame, there is no one who stands by his side…and he trusts no one. One day, Grey suddenly meets his death and is reincarnated as a powerless infant named Arthur in a world of magic. Surrounded by a loving family and companions, Arthur starts to experience joys in this new life that he never knew in his previous one. However, during a journey, his family is attacked by bandits...\n\nThus begins his second life, filled with love and adventure!\n\n(Source: Official site)'),(60147,'Ikusei',930,53.099999999999994,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1523/146646.webp','ova','2024-12-27','currently_airing',''),(60151,'Eris no Seihai',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1558/148652.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','It is common knowledge that nobles will do anything for power; lying, manipulation, and extortion are the usual tactics. However, one family is exempt from this generalization: House Grail, whose main tenets are truth and integrity. The youngest daughter, Constance Grail, is just as moral as the rest of her family, believing in always doing the right thing and helping those in need.\n\nHowever, these ideals do not help her when her fiancé cheats on her with another woman. Framed by his lover in the hope of her downfall, Constance\'s pleas for justice are ignored. Everyone turns a blind eye, save for one—the spirit of the infamous Scarlet Castiel—who possesses Constance and turns the tables on her accuser. However, this aid doesn\'t come without a price.\n\nTen years ago, Scarlet was executed for the attempted murder of Princess Cecilia. But this was actually a setup; as blunt and harsh as Scarlet could be, she would never stoop so low as to use poison. She has no idea who orchestrated her incrimination, but Scarlet demands that Constance—as the only one who can see her—help her exact revenge on all those who wronged her!\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(60152,'Blade & Bastard',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1246/146159.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Deep in the unexplored reaches of the dungeon, a corpse is discovered—one that shouldn\'t exist. After Iarumas is resurrected, his memories of life before death are gone, and he spends his days delving into the dungeon to retrieve the bodies of dead adventurers. Can they be revived as well? Or will God reduce them to piles of ash on the altar? Either way, Iarumas collects his finder\'s fee. And though his skills earn him some grudging respect, he\'s also scorned for this cold, utilitarian attitude. The living keep their distance—Iarumas consorts primarily with the dead. That is, until he meets Garbage, a feral young swordswoman who\'s the sole survivor of a massacred party. With Garbage by his side, Iarumas ventures deeper, scouring the dungeon for clues to his past, avoiding monsters, traps, and the inevitability of a permanent ashen demise.\n\n(Source: J-Novel Club)'),(60153,'Rilakkuma',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1327/146160.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired',''),(60154,'Ore wa Seikan Kokka no Akutoku Ryoushu!',1420,66.10000000000001,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1703/148600.jpg','tv','2025-04-06','currently_airing','In his last life, Liam lived as a moral, responsible person...but died deep in debt and betrayed by his wife. Reborn into the ruling family of a vast interstellar empire, Liam knows that life is divided between the downtrodden and the ones who do the stomping, so this time he\'s going to take what he wants and live for himself. But somehow, things refuse to work out that way. Despite doing his best to become a tyrant, Liam\'s decisions lead to nothing but peace and prosperity for the empire under his rule, and he just gets more and more popular!\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)'),(60157,'Kanpekisugite Kawaige ga Nai to Konyaku Haki sareta Seijo wa Ringoku ni Urareru',1420,74.80000000000001,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1263/148318.jpg','tv','2025-04-10','currently_airing','Philia hails from a family renowned for producing generations of saints, and she is no exception. In fact, she is known as the most powerful saint of all time, so extraordinarily gifted that many people find her insufferable. When even her fiancé decides he can\'t stand her, he suddenly calls off their engagement. He\'s so eager to never see her again that he sells her off to a neighboring country in dire need of a saint of their own. Now, Philia readies herself to face the unknown, fully expecting more miserable treatment. After all, she\'d be a fool to expect anyone to welcome her with open arms...right?\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)'),(60159,'Love Live! Nijigasaki Gakuen School Idol Doukoukai: Kanketsu-hen Part 2',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1324/149857.webp','movie','2025-11-07','not_yet_aired','Second part of Love Live! Nijigasaki Gakuen School Idol Doukoukai Kanketsu-hen.'),(60160,'Love Live! Nijigasaki Gakuen School Idol Doukoukai: Kanketsu-hen Part 3',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1093/146168.webp','movie','','not_yet_aired','Third part of Love Live! Nijigasaki Gakuen School Idol Doukoukai Kanketsu-hen.'),(60162,'Akujiki Reijou to Kyouketsu Koushaku',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1104/146172.webp','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','Like any proper noble lady, one must have certain acquired tastes. For Melphiera Marchalrayd, she just happens to crave a rather exotic protein—monsters! But do not judge! Despite its bad reputation, monster meat can be used in exquisite cuisine and Melphiera is determined to change the kingdom\'s opinion of it! Unfortunately, since debuting in society, Melphiera has been struggling to find her perfect match...until she meets the fearless \"Blood-Mad Duke\" of Galbraith!\n\n(Source: Kodansha USA)'),(60163,'Naoe-kun wa Yasesasetai. (ONA)',660,57,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1636/146177.webp','ona','2024-10-06','finished_airing','Web exclusive episodes 13 and 14 of Naoe-kun wa Yasesasetai.'),(60168,'Watashi wo Tabetai, Hitodenashi',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1175/146183.jpg','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','\"I\'ve come to eat you,\" so softly utters the mermaid Shiori as she emerges from the sea and takes high school girl Hinako by the hand. Hinako lives alone in a town by the sea and possesses an unusually delicious body that is irresistible to nearby monsters. To ensure that she matures to the best condition, Shiori seeks to protect Hinako—all so that someday, she can devour every piece of her. What will become of Hinako\'s feelings as this looming unjust death closes in on her...?\n\n(Source: Yen Press)'),(60170,'Origami',175,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1189/146192.webp','movie','2024','finished_airing','Origami is a Japanese traditional art form of paper folding. This film explores the infinite possibilities of origami to bring life and wonder to the simplest material. Every aspect of the film is based on the skills and techniques used in actual origami art.\n\n(Source: Official video)'),(60171,'Wo Shi Da Shenxian 3rd Season',1174,0,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1397/146193.webp','ona','2024-10-28','finished_airing','The third season of Wo Shi Da Shenxian.'),(60177,'Parking Area no Yoru',694,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1975/146439.jpg','movie','2024','finished_airing','At a midnight highway rest area, the weary travelers each quietly relax their minds. A brief moment spent with complete strangers is lonely yet somehow comforting.\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(60182,'Tsuma Netori Rei: Boku no Ayamachi Kanojo no Sentaku',1631,63.4,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1610/146467.webp','ona','2024-10-18','finished_airing','Takafumi is preparing breakfast. His wife Makoto, who was eating, checks the time and hurries off to work. She seems to be busy helping her senior teacher, Yasuno, recently.\n\nThat afternoon, Takafumi is called to the president\'s office. Takafumi\'s dream was to open his own store, but a few days ago, he found a store through Yasuno\'s intermediation, and the school\'s president, Shiraishi, even said he would invest in it. In the Chairwoman\'s office, he is told to go to the store this weekend and prepare for the opening.\n\nThen, on the morning of the weekend. Takafumi says he will be away from home for a few days, and Makoto is worried about staying at the school late that day to help Yasuno-sensei. Still, Takafumi persuades her, saying, \"I\'m sure Yasuno-sensei will be fine.\"\n\nThat night, while Makoto was working in the staff room, she received a LINE message from Takafumi. \"This should be finished soon. The other party is also feeling good. I\'ll tell you more when I get back tomorrow.\"\n\nMakoto replies to the LINE message when Yasuno appears with a cup of coffee. Makoto drinks the coffee that Yasuno hands her, but collapses a little later. Yasuno looks at Makoto\'s body on the floor with a nasty smile...\n\n(Source: ZIZ Entertainment)'),(60184,'Hanei',394,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1053/146236.jpg','movie','2024','finished_airing','After her grandmother passed away, she tried to gain a deeper understanding of her life by interviewing relatives and friends. At the same time, she read many books about death, and her understanding of death gradually expanded, and her own thoughts changed. She expressed his deep feelings for her grandmother and offered a sincere eulogy.\n\n(Source: U-NEXT, translated)'),(60185,'Kuromi\'s Pretty Journey: Hacha Mecha! Multiverse Daidasshutsu!',120,65.5,19,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1586/146238.webp','ona','2024-10-31','finished_airing','Kuromi\'s new journey into multiverse and met Niko.'),(60186,'VSPO!',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1888/146246.jpg','unknown','','not_yet_aired','A feature-length animation for VSPO!. There will be two versions of the anime, one voiced by VSPO! VTubers and the other voiced by professional voice actors.'),(60190,'Kusari',1266,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1495/146251.jpg','movie','2024','finished_airing','The film explores the state of marriage, childbirth, and homosexuality in a provincial city in China where male superiority over women remains strong.\n\n(Source: PIA Film Festival, translated)'),(60191,'Cheng He Titong 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1470/149664.webp','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','Second season of Cheng He Titong.'),(60200,'Terra Live',420,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1060/149836.jpg','ona','2025-05-16','currently_airing',''),(60202,'Momoneko Ondo',188,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1253/146278.webp','pv','2012-07-20','finished_airing','Momoneko Ondo promotional video meant as a choreography guide to teach fans the dance moves for the \"Momoneko Ondo: Minna de Odorou!\" event at the Momoneko-sama Matsuri (Momoneko Festival).'),(60203,'Mirai kara Yattekita Mori',1064,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1446/146279.webp','ona','2024-09-01','finished_airing','This is the story of Wales-born C. W. Nicol who restored Japan\'s desolate forests. Nicol was involved with nature all over the world, including Arctic exploration and the creation of national parks in Ethiopia. He came to Japan, fascinated by the biodiversity of the country, with its drift ice to the north and coral reefs to the south. However, what he saw there were virgin forests being cut down one after another for economic reasons, and rivers being hardened with concrete. After learning that the Afan Argoed Forest Park in Wales had been restored by human hands, Nicol decided to create forests with his own hands to restore nature in Japan. He dreamed of the forests 100 years from now, which he would never be able to see.\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(60204,'Takkun Kurashi no Tax Note',1500,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1193/146280.jpg','ova','1991-03','finished_airing','Through the eyes of the family\'s pet cat, Takkun, it explains how the taxes we pay are useful in a variety of ways.\n\n(Source: Osaka City Lifelong Learning Information System, translated)'),(60207,'Shaonian Jia Guo Meng',800,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1475/146285.webp','tv','2024-10-01','finished_airing',''),(60208,'Changzheng Xianfeng: Xingguo Zhi Jian',800,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1047/146286.jpg','tv','2021-10-18','finished_airing',''),(60214,'Isekai Kenou Seizon-ki',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1064/146315.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','After being recently discharged from military service and just drifting through life, Hanbin Ryu is suddenly transported to another world. However, his \"guide line,\" the system bestowed upon him to help with his survival and growth, was filled with errors, causing him to be stuck in the tutorial stage for over 20 years. When he is finally released from this personal hell, he finds everyone has turned against otherworlders like him. Just how will this low-level, super-tutorial newbie survive?\n\n(Source: Tapas Media)'),(60216,'Kanojo Face The Animation',955,66.3,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1360/146318.webp','ova','2025-01-31','finished_airing','Konishi, a high school student, and his girlfriend Sanae regularly attend drama club. The boy has long fallen for the beauty for her sincerity, hard work, and other feminine advantages, and they began dating. Weeks and months passed, and the relationship did not move a step. One day, while doing another rehearsal for a drama club, Sanae finds condoms in the guy\'s room. Konishi thought there might be trouble. However, the girl\'s face was already frozen in anticipation.'),(60221,'Elemon',660,0,30,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1477/146331.webp','ona','2023-09-28','finished_airing','Leo is a boy genius inventor. Aquro is a water type Elemon (H2O) created by Leo. Elemon are creatures born from the Elemon Blender. They are mysterious beings with the power of the elements! \"ELEMON\" opens up an exciting world of science and adventure, anchored by the friendship of Leo and Aquro as they explore an entire universe of unique Elemon!\n\n(Source: Toei Animation)'),(60223,'Kaya-chan wa Kowakunai',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1944/146343.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','Kaya-chan is infamous at kindergarten for being a troublemaker. But Ms. Chie, who\'s been assigned to look after her, soon discovers Kaya\'s hidden abilities. Get ready for the ultimate horror-action adventure set in kindergarten!\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(60226,'Isekai no Sata wa Shachiku Shidai',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1411/146347.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Already at his wit\'s end, 29-year-old corporate slave Seiichirou Kondou suddenly witnesses the ground opening up and swallowing a woman. Amid his efforts to save her, the two are transported to another world. He soon learns that the people in this world summoned a saint to save their kingdom from a plague. As compensation for dragging Kondou into the mess, the kingdom assures him that they will provide him with a comfortable life and fulfill any of his desires. To everyone\'s surprise, Kondou asks for a job.\n\nAfter successfully becoming an accountant at the Royal Palace, Kondou devotes himself to his new post. His accurate and thorough work catches the attention of various high-ranking officials and knights, especially Aresh Indolark, the cold-hearted Knight Captain. As Kondou adjusts to his new exhausting and dangerous environment, he begins to find solace in the company of Aresh, whose icy demeanor may be just a facade.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(60229,'Pokantotan',30,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1190/146356.webp','ona','2022-10-03','finished_airing','Pokantotan is a slightly forgetful rabbit who is missing something.\n\n(Source: San-X Official Site; translated)'),(60230,'Kidou Senshi Gundam SEED Freedom Zero',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1486/146354.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Prequel project for Kidou Senshi Gundam SEED Freedom.'),(60231,'Wanko to Piroshi',35,0,7,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1618/146371.jpg','ona','2022-10-06','finished_airing','Introducing a dog with a gaping hole in the heart! The slightly sad and warm daily life with the solitary chick \"Piroshi\" may gently and firmly snuggle into your heart...\n\n(Source: San-X Official Site; translated)'),(60232,'Katakoi Meteor Shower',42,0,7,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1928/146373.webp','ona','2022-10-06','finished_airing','Katakoi Meteor Shower. It is a shooting star whose unrequited love will come true if you wish for it. Seira hoped that she would fall in love with Hikaru from the class next door, but she ended up turning into a cat. It looks like Hikaru has also turned into a cat...? What will happen to the two of them in the future?\n\n(Source: San-X Official Site; translated)'),(60233,'Wanjie Zhuzai',900,0,32,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1457/146357.webp','ona','2024-10-28','finished_airing',''),(60234,'Fuji Lieren',905,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1715/146358.jpg','ona','2024-09-04','finished_airing',''),(60235,'Wu Ni',635,0,30,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1664/146359.jpg','ona','2024-11-07','finished_airing','On the Tianwu Continent, the powerful dominated the weak. Feng Hao, the young master of the Feng family, possessed a rare physique but was wrongly labeled as talentless and worthless. As a result, he was frequently mocked and belittled. However, a fateful encounter altered the course of his life and destiny. Through an extraordinary process, he infused his body with rare gemstones, eventually attaining unmatched strength. This transformation set him on a journey to master the void and explore the far reaches of the universe.'),(60246,'He Zhong Zhi Hai',7740,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1050/146376.jpg','ona','2024-10-03','finished_airing','Four participants playtest a virtual reality game that is still under development. The game uses AI simulated NPCs and system dynamics to generate a world with features not created by the developers, and perhaps beyond human understanding.'),(60247,'Benghuai: Xing Qiong Tiedao - Yinhe Renfa Tie Luan Wu Qu Mo Poxie Zhan Yue Zhi Juan',166,65.19999999999999,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1479/146381.jpg','ona','2024-10-18','finished_airing','The vast expanse of the boundless silver sea conceals countless fiendlings beneath its surface. Border villages fall under the onslaught of these fiendlings, and even the once-bright moon above has turned into a tyrant.\n\n\"Whomst defends the world\'s justice? Whomst sees through the deceit of vice and indulgence? Whomst will wipe out these evildoers? Whomst will protect the light of ten thousand homes?\"\n\nThe weak are silenced by sinister laughter, leaving only a sorrowful sigh. But when the people raise their heads to the sky, the falling stars beyond the heavens have already answered—\n\nA dazzling blaze of otherworldly fire will soon obliterate the calamities of this realm. This is the divine retribution of the Mappou Age of the Dharma, delivered by the Ninja Heroes patrolling the sea of stars.\n\n(Source: Youtube)'),(60248,'Shanhai Fu Mo Lu',1260,0,7,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1198/146382.jpg','ona','2024-11-11','finished_airing','A civilization that disappeared in the dust, the ancient bosses sought their own way to become emperors. Jiang Hao, a modern young man who was originally a chess piece, stepped into the prehistoric wilderness in order to find the whereabouts of his father. With his incomplete \"power bank\" totem, he fought with people, from primitive tribes to the mysterious ancient city, he fought his way out; he fought with the earth, crossed the wilderness, hunted ancient beasts, and learned the ancient and mysterious totem witchcraft from the beasts; he fought with the sky, and the magic light from the sky suddenly appeared, wanting to devour this magnificent six wastelands. He went upstream, ignited himself, turned into the sun, and fought with the devil! He was shaking the world, but he didn\'t know that the shackles of fate had already trapped him, and his father\'s smile was still lingering.\n\n(Source: Youku, Google translated)'),(60249,'Wangu Zui Qiang Zong',720,0,36,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1800/146383.jpg','ona','2024-11-06','finished_airing','A special scientific experiment, a wonderful adventure in different time and space. Jun Changxiao came to Xingyun Continent with the system and inherited an unknown small sect. He must build the sect into the No. 1 in Xingyun Continent within a hundred years, and recruit 100,000 disciples. If he fails to complete it, the system will explode and he will be finished. In order to survive and return to the original time and space safely. He actively \"established a sect\" and taught disciples. The gang grew from a \"lone commander\" to a hundred people. Under the leadership of Jun Changxiao, everyone built houses and planted crops, caught chickens and found dogs, and maintained peace and helped the weak anytime and anywhere. The disciples in the sect have different personalities. The funny Jun Changxiao gets along well with everyone, and there is unlimited joy in the warm big family. In a lively and positive atmosphere, everyone supports each other and grows rapidly. The cultivation of the sect is a long and arduous task, and Jun Changxiao leads the disciples to explore up and down...\n\n(Source: Tencent, Google translated)'),(60253,'Isekai Munchkin: HP1 no Mama de Saikyou Saisoku Dungeon Kouryaku',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1430/149884.webp','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','16-year-old Yukito Kirihara lives with his 14-year-old sister Sana, who he treasures more than anyone else. But when an ogre shows up outside of his window looking for Sana (a shocking event in its own right), Yukito leaps to save her—and is killed. He\'s offered the promise of reincarnation by a mysterious woman, who gives him a character sheet in a mysterious book. But when Yukito sees Sana in there, too, he sets off to find her, and save them both—even if he only has 1 hp with which to do it!\n\n(Source: Kodansha USA)'),(60254,'Yano-kun no Futsuu no Hibi',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1859/148430.webp','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','Always reliable and kind-hearted, Kiyoko Yoshida is named the president of Class 2-1. On the first day of school, a boy named Yano Tsuyoshi arrives late, covered in injuries. Due to her caring nature, in addition to Yano being seated right next to her, Kiyoko cannot help but worry about him and how he got those injuries to begin with. After cautiously following him home one day, she learns the truth—he is just extremely clumsy.\n\nKiyoko soon finds herself constantly worrying about Yano, both at school and at home, not realizing that she is falling in love with him. Armed with a first aid kit, Kiyoko makes it her mission to care for Yano\'s mishap-related injuries as a romance between the two begins to blossom.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(60255,'Arne no Jikenbo',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1289/146396.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Arne Neuntöte is a vampire detective who manipulates supernatural powers. Lynn Reinweiß is a nobleman\'s daughter who loves vampires. Their worlds should never have crossed, but they join hands to solve a bloody mystery. In the darkest of nights, Lynn finds herself in desperate need of help. Then she wanders into the mysterious city of \"Lügenberg,\" where non-humans live.\n\nLynn\'s world changes drastically when she encounters \"Arne,\" a vampire who is called \"the worst\" in the city. And tonight, a new \"murder case\" has occurred. What is the truth behind the bizarre incidents that take place in a world where humanity and the bizarre intersect?\n\n\"Come on, human. You may dance merrily under the crimson moon.\" \n\n(Source: Steam, edited)'),(60257,'Biaozhun Guige Zhanshi',1127,0,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1601/146409.jpg','ona','2024-11-03','finished_airing',''),(60260,'Hotel Inhumans',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1634/148186.jpg','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','At this hotel, \"Our esteemed guests are assassins.\" A premier hotel offers more than luxury; it meets unique requirements: \"Exquisite dining,\" \"Ultimate relaxation,\" \"Enthralling entertainment\"...and even \"The latest in weapon procurement,\" \"Guaranteed identity concealment,\" and \"Seamless corpse disposal\"!?\n\nOn the line between life and death, two concierges, Namuro and Sara, who never say \"no,\" are ready to grant every assassin\'s wish. Get ready for the striking drama of the Killing Hotel!\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(60263,'Agent Blue',68,55.8,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1054/150235.jpg','ona','2024-11-10','finished_airing',''),(60264,'Metamorphose.',128,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1172/146434.webp','movie','1974','finished_airing','Short film by Kiyoshi Nishimoto.'),(60267,'Yuru Camp△ Season 4',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1259/146435.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','The Outdoor Exploration Club has a new member—Mei, and she\'s joining them on a club camping trip to Karisaka in Yamanashi. She and Aoi head there by bike, while Chiaki and Toba-sensei travel by car. Rin has plans of her own, and appears to be going solo to Saitama...?\n\n(Source: Yuru Camp Wiki)'),(60272,'Xiangle Huayuan',240,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1115/146440.jpg','movie','2004','finished_airing','The male and female protagonists are like the physical incarnations of Adam and Eve in Bosch’s masterpiece \"The Garden of Pleasure\". The film has become a living record of life and death.\n\n(Source: Taichung International Animation Festival)'),(60273,'Hypnosis Mic: Division Rap Battle Movie',6360,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1278/146441.webp','movie','2025-02-21','finished_airing','Movie for Hypnosis Mic: Division Rap Battle.'),(60275,'Boukyaku Battery (TV) 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1096/146443.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Boukyaku Battery.'),(60277,'Erotic Blade Runner',1730,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1283/146444.jpg','ova','2002-06-21','finished_airing','In 2016, Replicants, human clones developed to replace the human workforce, rebel in a space colony and infiltrate Earth, and Agent Recur, a Blade Runner, is deployed to eliminate them...'),(60279,'Xian Ni: Shenlin Zhi Zhan',0,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1177/146446.jpg','ona','2025-05-30','not_yet_aired',''),(60280,'Zenryoku Usagi (2023) 2nd Season',300,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1297/150031.jpg','tv','2025-04-09','currently_airing','Second season of Zenryoku Usagi (2023).'),(60284,'Tousouchuu: Great Mission - Maika to Rabbi no Souryoku Shuzai - Tsuki Sekaiichi no Tousousha wa Dare da!',1380,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1680/146457.jpg','tv_special','2024-11-10','finished_airing','Recap episode of Tousouchuu: Great Mission.'),(60285,'Sakamoto Days Part 2',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1758/148719.webp','tv','2025-07-15','not_yet_aired','Second part of Sakamoto Days.'),(60289,'Shan Shantian Tianjian',680,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1840/146491.webp','ona','2024-10-17','finished_airing',''),(60293,'Ballpark de Tsukamaete!',1420,69.1,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1065/148659.jpg','tv','2025-04-02','currently_airing','To escape his tiring job, weary Murata finds escape at a nearby baseball stadium. While the games are thrilling, it’s Ruriko, the gyaru as cold as the beer she serves but secretly a sweetheart, who keeps him coming back. As her first regular, Murata discovers the warmth behind her frosty demeanor, and their hilarious, heartwarming encounters light up the ballpark and maybe even their hearts.\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)'),(60294,'Tensui no Sakuna-hime (Zoku-hen)',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1519/146498.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Sequel to Tensui no Sakuna-hime.'),(60295,'Nihon e Youkoso Elf-san Mini Anime',163,60.7,9,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1274/146501.jpg','ona','2024-11-14','finished_airing','Mini anime featuring chibi characters from Nihon e Youkoso Elf-san, streamed on the official X account and Toei Video Youtube channel.'),(60297,'Zanting! Zhi Xu Chongzu',1212,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1652/146507.jpg','ona','2024-11-14','finished_airing','On an unknown continent, there is a city called Satellite City No. 9. In this city, a screw straightening worker named Rui Li at the screw factory gradually realizes the unreality of the city in her monotonous daily work. With the help of a mysterious character named \"Anull\", Rui Li gains the superpower of \"transformation\" and becomes the thief \"Sirius\", secretly taking action to escape from here. When the truth of the world finally unfolds before her eyes, Rui Li discovers that her real battle has just begun.\n\n(Source: Bilibili)'),(60301,'Amayo no Tsuki',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1503/146516.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','One day, while rushing to a piano lesson, a girl named Saki collides with someone on the street. As Saki collects herself, the stranger picks up the sheet music Saki dropped, hands it to Saki together with a band-aid, and continues on her way—all without saying a word. Saki is left wondering about the identity of the tall, lovely stranger, only to discover the next day that she is one of her classmates at her new high school. The girl\'s name is Kanon, and though she is hearing impaired, she refuses any kind of support or \"special treatment\" from her teachers or classmates. Over the course of the year, Saki slowly grows closer to Kanon and begins to chip away at her cold exterior.\n\n(Source: Kodansha USA)'),(60302,'Natsume Yuujinchou Shichi Special',1380,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1058/150011.jpg','special','2025-04-23','finished_airing','Thirteenth episode of Natsume Yuujinchou Shichi bundled with the physical release.'),(60303,'Shinjiteita Nakama-tachi ni Dungeon Okuchi de Korosarekaketa ga Gift \"Mugen Gacha\" de Level 9999 no Nakama-tachi wo Te ni Irete Moto Party Member to Sekai ni Fukushuu & \"Zamaa!\" Shimasu!',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1256/149294.webp','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','When Light is kicked out of the Concord of the Tribes, his former comrades instantly turn on him. Light escapes this diabolical act of betrayal by the skin of his teeth...only to find himself in the deepest part of the Abyss, the most dangerous dungeon in the realm! To avoid being eaten by carnivorous monsters, he uses the Unlimited Gacha, his sole magical skill. But where it previously only produced junk items, this time Mei—a gorgeous Level 9999 fighter in a maid outfit—springs forth! Fast forward three years and Light has carved out his own kingdom in this backwater dungeon, summoning more beautiful Level 9999 warriors who swear absolute fealty to him. Now a powerful Level 9999 Overlord himself, Light plans to ascend to the surface and take revenge on his betrayers one by one!\n\n(Source: J-Novel Club)'),(60308,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Anpanman to Black Christmas',2700,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1054/146529.jpg','tv_special','1996-12-13','finished_airing',''),(60309,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Meringue Sisters no Christmas',2700,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1660/146530.jpg','tv_special','1997-12-25','finished_airing',''),(60310,'Mairimashita! Iruma-kun 4th Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1918/146534.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','Fourth season of Mairimashita! Iruma-kun.'),(60311,'Qia Tongxue Shaonian',1324,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1248/146535.jpg','ona','2024-11-17','finished_airing',''),(60313,'Naruheso-kun Pilot',150,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1901/146537.webp','special','1999-11-21','finished_airing','A pilot film for the manga Naruheso-kun by Aooni Yamane. It was included with the Eiken TV Anime Shudaika Taizenshuu LD and DVD.'),(60314,'Bikkuri-kun Pilot',98,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1453/146538.jpg','special','1999-11-21','finished_airing','A pilot film included with the Eiken TV Anime Shudaika Taizenshuu LD and DVD.'),(60315,'Dekin no Mogura',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1154/149311.jpg','tv','2025-07-07','not_yet_aired','Mogura, a mysterious \"self-proclaimed sage\" also known as Hyakuan Momoyumi, has been banned from the afterlife. To return, he roams the world, collecting the \"lamps\" of ghosts in his lantern.\n\nHowever, crossing paths with him brings an unusual consequence: the ability to see strange phenomena...\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(60316,'Busamen Gachi Fighter',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1034/146540.jpg','tv','2025-07-06','not_yet_aired','Wrongly convicted of a crime, 34-year-old Shigeru Yoshioka loses everything, including his trust in women, and withdraws from society as an unemployed recluse.\n\nOne day, he stumbles upon a way to travel to another world. When a mysterious status screen appears on his computer, Shigeru sacrifices his looks to gain an overwhelming 100 trillion and 5,100 parameters. Now reborn as an \"Absolute God,\" he begins his second life in another world.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(60321,'Kuroi Rayquaza Kourin',84,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1525/146552.webp','pv','2024-11-18','finished_airing','A promotional video to announce the arrival of Black Rayquaza in the Pokemon Scarlet Violet Terra Raid Battle. It\'s part of a larger campaign with Black Rayquaza who will make appearances across various Pokemon media.'),(60322,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Bokura no Christmas Concert',2700,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1795/146553.jpg','tv_special','1998-12-18','finished_airing',''),(60323,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Anpanman to Merry Christmas',2880,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1542/146554.jpg','tv_special','1999-12-17','finished_airing',''),(60326,'Watashi ga Koibito ni Nareru Wake Nai jan, Muri Muri! (※Muri ja Nakatta!?)',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1152/146560.jpg','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Renako Amaori is leaving her awkward and lonely junior high school life behind, determined to become a normal girl with normal friends in high school. Glamorous, confident Mai Ouzuka is Renako\'s total opposite: wealthy, outgoing, and a literal fashion model. Against the odds, the two girls form an immediate connection. Renako thinks she may have found the best friend of her dreams...until Mai\'s romantic confession sends her into a tailspin. Renako wants to prove to Mai that being BFFs is better than being girlfriends, but Mai is dead set on convincing Renako that they\'re destined to be lovers. Let the love games begin!\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)'),(60328,'Fudanshi Shoukan: Isekai de Shinjuu ni Hameraremashita 7th Season',120,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1876/146562.webp','ona','2024-06-10','finished_airing','Seventh season of Fudanshi Shoukan: Isekai de Shinjuu ni Hameraremashita.'),(60334,'Anne Shirley',1440,78.1,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1564/150049.webp','tv','2025-04-05','currently_airing','Life is not easy for Anne Shirley, an 11-year-old orphan with a vast imagination and a short temper. In a twist of fate, she gets taken into the Cuthbert house in Avonlea. The elderly occupants Marilla and Matthew Cuthbert were looking for a young boy to help in the fields, but they\'re in for quite a shock when they realize Anne is a girl.\n\nAdapted from the acclaimed classic by L. M. Montgomery, Akage no Anne portrays Anne\'s upbringing from 11 to 17 years of age and her encounters and separations with various people. Only time will tell what major decision Anne has to make that will change her life forever.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(60336,'Star Wars: Visions Volume 3',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1692/146571.jpg','ona','2025-10-29','not_yet_aired','Third volume of Star Wars: Visions.'),(60339,'Hitchcock-ui Eotteonhalu',420,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1376/146575.jpg','movie','1998','finished_airing','Debut work of Ahn Jae-Hunn.'),(60340,'Neogs',180,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1136/146576.jpg','movie','1995','finished_airing',''),(60341,'Du Gaeui Bang',180,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1472/146577.jpg','movie','1995','finished_airing',''),(60342,'Usan',780,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1043/146578.webp','movie','1997','finished_airing',''),(60343,'Ocean',300,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1314/146579.jpg','movie','1997','finished_airing',''),(60344,'Deombul Sogui Jae',900,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1087/146580.jpg','movie','1998','finished_airing',''),(60347,'Cat\'s♥Eye',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1836/148551.jpg','ona','2025-09','not_yet_aired','The protagonists of the series are the three Kisugi sisters—Hitomi, Rui and Ai—who run a café called Cat\'s Eye. The sisters lead a double life as a trio of highly skilled art thieves, leaving cards with the name \"Cat\'s Eye\" at the scene of their crimes. They steal works of art that belonged to their long-missing father, Heinz who was a famous art collector during the Nazi regime, in the hopes of him contacting them. Toshio, the police officer investigating this case is the fiancé of Hitomi. He also swears to capture and bring down the Cat\'s Eye Gang.'),(60348,'Disney: Twisted-Wonderland The Animation - Episode of Savanaclaw',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1428/146593.webp','ona','','not_yet_aired','One day, high school student Yuuka \"Yuu\" Hirasaka finds herself transported to the world of Twisted Wonderland after a black carriage crashes into her. Though she hopes to return home to Tochigi in Japan, the magicless judo practitioner ends up enrolling in the prestigious magic academy Night Raven College.\n\nAs Yuu acclimates to her new life, the annual interdorm Spelldrive tournament at the school is set to begin. The team-based game tests the physical and magical strength of each dorm\'s seven best athletes, all while being broadcast throughout the magical world. For the past two years, the Diasomnia dorm has crushed the competition thanks solely to their powerful housewarden, Malleus Draconia.\n\nAmidst the excitement, a series of incidents across campus befalling the top Spelldrive players from all dorms is rendering them unable to compete. Concerned that these are no mere accidents, the headmage of the academy tasks Yuu and her dormmate Grim to investigate. While the pair dives deeper into the matter, one housewarden in particular is determined to defeat Diasomnia—even if he must use underhanded methods to do so.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(60349,'Disney: Twisted-Wonderland The Animation - Episode of Octavinelle',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1411/146594.webp','ona','','not_yet_aired','Three months ago, Yuuta \"Yuu\" Mito was a part-time worker at a Chinese restaurant in Wakayama, Japan. Now, the teenager has been stranded in the magical realm of Twisted Wonderland after a black horse-drawn carriage ran into him while he was delivering a customer\'s order. Unable to return to his original world, the magicless Yuu found himself enrolled at the prestigious Night Raven College in the meantime.\n\nA strange happening around the campus emerges following the exam season, with several students sprouting sea anemones from the top of their heads—including Yuu\'s friends Grim, Ace Trappola, and Deuce Spade. Matters only worsen when those affected are told that they have become indentured servants to Octavinelle\'s housewarden, Azul Ashengrotto, as a result of magical contracts they had previously signed with him.\n\nUnaffected since he never entered a deal with Azul, Yuu must find a way to break the contracts and save his friends. But completing this task without any magic of his own may prove more daunting than he realizes, as the odds begin to stack against him.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(60351,'Ikuiku Succubus Saikyouiku',970,65,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1958/146600.webp','ova','2025-01-31','currently_airing','Being an experienced teacher, Busujima fills students\' heads with high-quality knowledge. One day, exchange students from the succubus kingdom come to study with him. These insidious and ugly creatures completely refuse to learn, and the quiet life of a man is turned upside down. But he wouldn\'t be called Busujima for nothing. Raised according to samurai traditions, he intends to walk his path to the very end and fulfill his teaching duty – to drum into the disobedient succubi the desire to learn, one way or another.'),(60355,'Custom Robo The Animation',420,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1328/146602.jpg','ova','1999-12-08','finished_airing','This is an animation made to promote the video game Custom Robo (1999, Nintendo 64). This video was given away as a gift to readers of Shogakukan\'s manga magazine, Korokoro Comic.\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(60357,'Maarui Kanojo to Zannen na Kareshi 2nd Season',690,0,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1050/146614.jpg','tv','2024-11-16','finished_airing','Second season of Maarui Kanojo to Zannen na Kareshi.'),(60363,'Onaka ga Guuguu Island',240,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1746/146631.jpg','ona','2024-09-25','currently_airing','This is Guuguu Island, a magical island where the Yakiniku King menu items live. Meat, vegetables, mulberries, sweets... there\'s all kinds of delicious food! Calvin the apprentice galbi has a dream to become \"Yakiniku King\'s most popular menu item\"! To achieve that, he is happily flying around the universe with his adorable friends. Will Calvin and his friends be able to become Yakiniku King\'s most popular menu items? Aim for a delicious serving! Aim for a delicious Yakiniku King!\n\n(Source: YouTube, translated)'),(60364,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Anpanman no Christmas Show',2880,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1034/146632.jpg','tv_special','2000-12-22','finished_airing',''),(60365,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Anpanman to Chiisana Santa no Christmas',2880,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1665/146633.jpg','tv_special','2001-12-21','finished_airing',''),(60369,'Liang Bu Yi Small Theater',50,0,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1268/146644.jpg','ona','2021-04','finished_airing',''),(60370,'Liang Bu Yi 2nd Season Small Theater',45,0,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1786/146660.jpg','ona','2022-10','finished_airing',''),(60371,'Seihantai na Kimi to Boku',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1766/148275.webp','tv','2026-01','not_yet_aired','Next to Miyu Suzuki, a trendy and bubbly high school girl, sits Yuusuke Tani, a quiet and frank boy. Their interactions are brief, limited to Suzuki\'s unprompted random questions and Tani\'s succinct answers. Yet, beneath these simple exchanges, feelings of love are quietly blossoming.\n\nSuzuki sees Tani for who he is: a straightforward boy who respects everyone equally, completely unconcerned about fitting in. Unlike Tani, she is too hung up on what everyone else thinks, desperate to keep her crush a secret. However, a slight misunderstanding leads to Suzuki confessing her feelings—and to her delight, Tani feels the same. Jittery with excitement, the young couple starts dating, embarking on a wonderful journey of friendship and love.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(60374,'Wo Qi Ku Le Baiwan Xiulian Zhe 2nd Season',660,0,30,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1480/146639.webp','ona','2024-12-15','finished_airing',''),(60377,'Nazotoki wa Dinner no Ato de',1375,62.599999999999994,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1118/149222.webp','tv','2025-04-04','currently_airing','Set in Kunitachi City, Tokyo. Reiko Houshou, a rookie detective at the Kunitachi Police Department, is also the heiress of the globally renowned \"Houshou Group.\" She tackles challenging cases alongside Inspector Kazamatsuri, heir to the \"Kazamatsuri Motors\" family business, and Kageyama, her sharp-tongued butler and driver.\n\nWith biting remarks like, \"Are your eyes merely decorative, my lady?\" Kageyama not only critiques Reiko\'s lack of deductive skills but also brilliantly solves the mysteries at hand. A sharp-tongued butler meets classic detective fiction in this unique mystery series.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(60378,'Shabake',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1871/146645.webp','tv','2025','not_yet_aired','It is the Edo period. Ichitarou, the young master of Nagasakiya, one of the largest stores in Nihonbashi, has been in poor health since birth and is unable to go out. However, Ichitarou is always protected by demons such as Shirasawa and Inugami, who serve him. One night, Ichitarou goes out secretly and witnesses a murder. From that day on, bizarre murders begin to occur one after another in Edo... With the help of the demons, Ichitarou\'s search for the culprit begins!\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(60380,'MARO17: Mada, Akirametenai Daro?',143,63.8,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1301/146648.webp','cm','2024-11-25','finished_airing',''),(60383,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Black Santa to Suteki na Present',2880,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1194/146658.jpg','tv_special','2003-12-19','finished_airing',''),(60384,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Ganbare Cream Panda! Christmas no Bouken',2820,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1349/146659.jpg','tv_special','2009-12-25','finished_airing',''),(60390,'Shiranai Koto Shiritai no? The Animation',1010,67.9,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1474/146993.webp','ova','2025-02-28','finished_airing',''),(60392,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Akahana Chappie Yuuki no Christmas',3000,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1002/146670.jpg','tv_special','2010-12-24','finished_airing',''),(60393,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Anpanman to Gomira no Shiro no Christmas',1430,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1439/146671.jpg','tv_special','2011-12-23','finished_airing',''),(60394,'Dragon',40,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1038/146672.jpg','pv','1999','finished_airing','A fast food restaurant manager sexually harasses a young girl who works there. He looks like an ugly monster. Enraged, the girl grows super-sized and crushes him.\n\n(Source: Keita Kurosaka, translated)'),(60395,'Toumei Otoko to Ningen Onna: Sonouchi Fuufu ni Naru Futari',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1754/146673.webp','tv','2025','not_yet_aired','Yakou, a gentle human woman, works at a detective agency. Tounome is a smart and gentle invisible man. The invisible man\'s ability is perfect for detective work. However, the blind Yakou can still figure out where Tounome is, even if he disappears. Before they know it, the two become attracted to each other...?\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)'),(60401,'Uchuujin MuuMuu',1419,61.8,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1979/148096.jpg','tv','2025-04-10','currently_airing','A cat-like alien from a distant galaxy, MuuMuu, arrives on Earth. His goal is to learn about home appliance technology on Earth to recover the technology his species has lost. The protagonist, Sakurako, has a typical university life, but everything changes with MuuMuu\'s arrival! What begins as an unexpected cohabitation quickly turns into a whirlwind of chaotic events. The chemistry between Sakurako and MuuMuu leads to a super-spectacular, appliance-filled, and cat comedy adventure. \n\n(Source: Pony Canyon)'),(60404,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Doremifa Shima no Christmas',1440,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1023/146716.jpg','tv_special','2012-12-21','finished_airing','After receiving an invitation from Princess Doremi to the Christmas concert on Doremifa Island, Anpanman and his friends immediately set off for Doremifa Island. They decide to sing Christmas songs together by ringing the beautiful bell fruits that Princess Doremi has collected. However, Baikinman appears there dressed as Santa. Baikinman releases sticky buns from his crackers, which soil Doremifa Island, the musical instrument buns, and Anpanman and his friends. Will Christmas be without songs like this? Go for it, Anpanman!\n\n(Source: Amazon, translated)'),(60405,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Kagayake! Burikid no Christmas Tree',1440,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1322/146717.jpg','tv_special','2013-12-20','finished_airing','Burikid is heading to Christmas Valley with a tin tree in his spaceship to help Santa. When the tin tree lights up, Santa and Rudolph can deliver presents to children without getting lost. However, on the way, they encounter a snowstorm, and the tree and Burikid are thrown out of the spaceship in their container. Anpanman and his friends find Burikid\'s spaceship, where no one is on board, and they split up to search for Burikid. Meanwhile, Baikinman, who mistakes Burikid for a tin toy, appears in his Baikin Buri Robot to ruin Christmas Eve...\n\nWill Anpanman and his friends be able to deliver the tin tree to Santa and distribute presents to children...?\n\n(Source: Amazon, translated)'),(60407,'Kimi to Idol Precure♪',1440,74.3,49,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1277/147358.jpg','tv','2025-02-02','currently_airing','Uta Sakura is a lively and energetic middle school student who loves singing.\nOne day, while walking her dog, she encounters a cute, peach-like fairy named Purirun, who is searching for the Legendary Protectors \"Idol Precure.\" Purirun\'s hometown, KirakiLand, was a peaceful, sparkly place but has been forced into darkness by the villainous Darkine, leader of the Chokkiri Gang. Uta decides to help Purirun search for cheerful and happy people to become the Precure so KirakiLand can become bright again.\nSuddenly, the Chokkiri gang arrive in Hanamichi Town, Uta\'s hometown, and steal the sparkles from the townspeople. Uta decides to illuminate the darkness with sparkles from her song and is granted the power to transform into the Legendary Protector, Cure Idol.'),(60408,'Lupin the IIIrd the Movie: Fujimi no Ketsuzoku',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1374/149826.jpg','movie','2025-06-27','not_yet_aired',''),(60409,'Watashi no Yokotawaru Naizou',665,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1125/146721.jpg','movie','2024-06-23','finished_airing','Based on the Japanese folk belief of Womb Diving (Tainai Kuguri) or the \"unknown hollow spiritual world\". In Japanese, the word for womb, \"tainai\", not only refers to the female organ of the uterus, but also refers to the animistic spiritual hollow space inside a Buddhist statue. This is a space of connection, between life and afterlife, death and life. There, the boundaries between organism and matter dissolve, and outer and inner worlds are continually inverted. \n\n(Source: Official Site)'),(60410,'Yami Shibai 14',240,58,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1811/146726.jpg','tv','2025-01-06','finished_airing','Fourteenth season of Yami Shibai.'),(60411,'Pui Pui Molcar (Zoku-hen)',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1449/146727.jpg','movie','','not_yet_aired','Sequel to Pui Pui Molcar the Movie: MOLMAX.'),(60415,'Zuoshou Shanglan 2nd Season',1531,72.4,9,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1386/146745.jpg','ona','2024-12-20','finished_airing','The second season of Zuoshou Shanglan.'),(60416,'Wu Lian Dianfeng',822,70.19999999999999,48,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1447/146747.jpg','ona','2024-12-05','finished_airing','Yang Kai, a trial disciple and floor sweeper at Zhongdu Lingxiao Pavilion, was demoted to a trial disciple due to his poor qualifications. If he did not achieve anything within three years, he would be expelled from the sect. Yang Kai accidentally obtained a mysterious stone pillow, which opened up mysterious skills such as the Proud Golden Body. After that, he continued to practice, breaking through his own limits with his tenacious character as a young man, and finally stood at the top of the inheritance cave. Yang Kai and Su Yan inherited the mysterious skills together, and continued to start his story of becoming a legend and reaching the peak of martial arts.\n\n(Source: Tencent, translated)'),(60417,'Tenohira no Haru',254,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1240/146748.jpg','movie','2013','finished_airing','Deep in the white mist, there was a table where the dishes floated. Three little girls lived there, playing together happily, but they all seemed a little bored. One day, a peacock appeared, and the girls were deeply shocked by their encounter.\n\nWhat you have seen is only a small part of the world. The \"curiosity,\" \"anxiety,\" and \"emotion\" that are born from encountering something new are depicted in vivid colors. Imagine yourself reading a picture book and try to get a little taste of this relaxing world.\n\n(Source: JDN, translated)'),(60418,'Wan Jie Du Zun 3rd Season',540,0,112,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1472/146749.webp','ona','2024-11-30','currently_airing',''),(60420,'Cang Yuan Tu 2nd Season',1320,78.1,36,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1609/150081.jpg','ona','2024-12-06','currently_airing','The second season of Cang Yuan Tu.'),(60422,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Anpanman to Santa-san e no Tegami',1440,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1969/146759.jpg','tv_special','2014-12-19','finished_airing','On Christmas Eve, the children are writing letters to Santa with their wishes. However, Melonpanna is alone and looks gloomy. She wants to spend Christmas with her big sister Rollpanna. Meanwhile, Baikinman is plotting some evil scheme to get all the presents for himself. Will Anpanman be able to protect the children\'s letters? Will Melonpanna\'s wish come true?\n\n(Source: Amazon, translated)'),(60423,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Baikinman to Suteki na Christmas Cake',1440,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1572/146760.jpg','tv_special','2015-12-18','finished_airing','Dokin-chan gets into a fight with Baikinman on Christmas Eve. Then Kokin-chan comes to invite Dokin-chan to a Christmas cake class. Meanwhile, Baikinman sulks and leaves, but heads to the venue where the cake class is being held to wreak havoc in the city... Will Anpanman be able to stop Baikinman\'s rampage? Will Baikinman and Dokin-chan be able to make up and have a fun Christmas Eve?\n\n(Source: Amazon, translated)'),(60425,'0-saiji Start Dash Monogatari Season 2',240,56.5,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1635/148561.jpg','tv','2025-01-05','finished_airing','After reincarnating from her previous life as an office worker and avid gamer, Lilia Carol grew and gained friends in her new world. During her fifth birthday, she met the handsome Elk von Luxel, who left her entranced. She normally has no issue maintaining her composure, but his presence manages to distract Lilia from her usual magic practice. As their paths continue to cross, a friendship blooms between them.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(60426,'Huyao Xiao Hongniang: Huang Feng Ling Pian',0,0,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1049/146765.webp','ona','2025','not_yet_aired',''),(60427,'Gnosia',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1347/148507.jpg','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','Let\'s walk and talk. Can you get up?\n\nThe Gnosia lie. Pretending to be human, they\'ll get in close, trick and deceive, and then eradicate each person in the vicinity from the universe, one victim at a time.\n\nThe crew of a drifting spaceship, facing off against a mysterious and deadly threat known as the \"Gnosia\" and having no idea who among them is really the enemy, formulate a desperate plan for survival. The most suspicious among them will be put into \"cold sleep\" one by one, in an effort to completely rid the ship of Gnosia.\n\nHowever, it is almost impossible to tell whether each person put into cold sleep was really Gnosia—or simply a poor, unfortunate scapegoat, sacrificed by the Gnosia for their own survival. Can the humans emerge victorious? Or is mankind doomed...?\n\n(Source: Playism)'),(60430,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Poppo-chan no Kirakira Christmas',1440,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1979/146780.jpg','tv_special','2016-12-23','finished_airing','Poppo finds a \"star\" in the snow! She meets Anpanman and his friends, who are preparing for Christmas, and together they head off to help Santa. But then Baikinman, disguised as Steam Locomotive Man, arrives, steals the presents, and starts wreaking havoc in the town...! Meanwhile, Poppo, who has fallen asleep after drinking milk, notices the mysterious power of the \"star\"...\n\n(Source: Amazon, translated)'),(60431,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Kokin-chan to Christmas no Okurimono',1440,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1017/146781.jpg','tv_special','2017-12-22','finished_airing','Today is the fun, once-a-year Christmas concert! Dokin-chan, disguised, is practicing a song with Shokupanman and the others. When Kokin-chan sees this, she says, \"I want to sing with you too!\", but Dokin-chan just says, \"No!\". Kokin-chan becomes sad and starts crying as she usually does, but for some reason she seems different than usual. At first Dokin-chan was angry, but then she becomes worried and goes to look for Kokin-chan, who has run out...\n\n(Source: Amazon, translated)'),(60434,'Juedai Shuang Jiao: Tian Wai You Tian',5040,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1038/146785.webp','ona','2024-12-01','finished_airing',''),(60435,'Zhao Lin de Tanxian Riji',800,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1978/146786.jpg','ona','2023-10-20','finished_airing',''),(60436,'Renjian Zui Deyi 2nd Season',720,0,14,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1652/146789.webp','ona','2024-12-01','finished_airing',''),(60438,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Anpanman to Hajimete no Christmas Night',1440,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1822/146797.jpg','tv_special','2018-12-21','finished_airing','Anpanman and his friends decorate the town and prepare for Christmas night. Then Smoke Dog, who can transform into anything, arrives. Smoke Dog has never spent Christmas night because he turns into smoke and disappears in the evening, so everyone decides to head to Christmas Valley together. Smoke Dog transforms into a basket carrying presents and helps Santa, but Baikinman, who wants to defeat Anpanman today, is up to some evil plan with Dr. Hiyari...\n\n(Source: Amazon, translated)'),(60439,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Santa ni Natta Chibi wo Ookami-kun',1440,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1502/146798.jpg','tv_special','2019-12-20','finished_airing','On a full moon night, the Little Wolf turns into a ghost wolf and goes on a rampage. The next day, he is found lying in the snow and is saved by Santa and his reindeer Rudolf. Rudolf flies through the sky with the lonely-looking Little Wolf on his back. Today is Christmas Eve. Christmas preparations are underway in the town, and the Little Wolf looks like he\'s having a lot of fun. The Little Wolf helps Santa deliver presents to everyone. The Little Wolf, who admires Santa, receives a wonderful present.\n\n(Source: Amazon, translated)'),(60442,'Jiaonang Jihua: Yingxiong',1048,0,11,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1864/150121.jpg','ona','2024-12-17','finished_airing',''),(60443,'Oniisan Ohitori desu ka?',960,66.7,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1227/147204.webp','ona','2024-11-29','finished_airing',''),(60444,'Yowayowa Sensei',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1186/146806.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','When the new term starts, second-year student Abikura discovers that his homeroom teacher is none other than Hiyori Hiwamura, infamously known as \"Scary-Scary Sensei,\" a woman rumored to curse anyone who crosses her.\n\nBut one day, Abikura accidentally witnesses a completely unexpected side of his fearsome teacher after school. The striking contrast between her fearsome image and her hidden personality is utterly irresistible!\n\nBrace yourself for Gap Moe overload in this tender romantic comedy that\'s sure to ignite your protective instincts!\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(60445,'Meitantei Conan Movie 28: Sekigan no Flashback',6600,72.9,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1036/148145.webp','movie','2025-04-18','finished_airing','Twenty-eighth Meitantei Conan movie.'),(60446,'Masuda Kousuke Gekijou: Gag Manga Biyori Go',240,61.1,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1086/150043.webp','tv','2025-04-05','currently_airing','Fifth season of Masuda Kousuke Gekijou: Gag Manga Biyori.'),(60449,'Kidou Senshi Gundam: GQuuuuuuX',1470,74.80000000000001,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1052/148743.jpg','tv','2025-04-09','currently_airing','Amate Yuzuriha is a high-school student living peacefully in a space colony floating in outer space.\n\nWhen she meets a war refugee named Nyaan, Amate is drawn into the illegal mobile suit dueling sport known as Clan Battle.\n\nUnder the entry name \"Machu,\" she throws herself into fierce battle day after day, piloting the GQuuuuuuX. Then an unidentified Gundam mobile suit pursued by both the space force and the police appears before her, along with its pilot, a boy named Shuji.\n\nNow their world is about to enter a new era.\n\n(Source: Official site)'),(60450,'Meirenyu de Xiatian',5155,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1889/149934.jpg','movie','2024-11-22','finished_airing',''),(60451,'Xiaoqian',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1698/146815.jpg','movie','2024-12-06','finished_airing',''),(60452,'Xiong Shi Shaonian 2',7980,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1161/146816.webp','movie','2024-12-14','finished_airing',''),(60453,'Xiong Chumo: Chongqi Weilai',6480,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1364/146817.jpg','movie','2025-01-29','finished_airing',''),(60454,'Pipilu He Lu Xixi: 309 Anshi',5160,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1858/146818.jpg','movie','2024-10-01','finished_airing',''),(60455,'Xin Datou Er Zi He Xiao Tou Baba 4: Wanmei Baba',4820,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1071/146819.jpg','movie','2021-07-09','finished_airing',''),(60456,'Xin Datou Er Zi He Xiao Tou Baba 5: Wo de Wai Xing Pengyou',4860,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1489/146820.jpg','movie','2022-10-01','finished_airing',''),(60457,'Xin Datou Er Zi He Xiao Tou Baba 6: Mini da Maoxian',5460,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1254/146821.jpg','movie','2024-10-01','finished_airing',''),(60459,'Jungle Taxi',464,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1494/146828.webp','movie','2016-11-04','finished_airing','The taxi driver picks up an unwelcome fare in the jungle. He does as he\'s told and takes his customer to fetch the man close to death on the beach. Arrived at the destination, the cabbie reaches inside his jacket for a gun.\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(60460,'Hell Mode: Yarikomizuki no Gamer wa Hai Settei no Isekai de Musou suru',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1820/146830.webp','tv','2025','not_yet_aired','\"Level up even while offline?! That\'s not a game on \'easy mode\'—that\'s just an AFK game!\" The online game Kenichi Yamada had been playing religiously is shutting down its servers, leaving him with a void in his heart. He looks for a new game to fill it, but everything he finds is way too easy. The kind of game he likes—the kind punishing enough to make players want to spend thousands of hours on it—just isn\'t around anymore.\n\n\"What\'s this? \'You are invited to a game that will never end.\'\" Kenichi stumbles upon an untitled game, one promising incomparable challenge with unprecedented potential. Without hesitation, he selects the \"Hell Mode\" difficulty. Lo and behold, he finds himself reincarnated in another world as a serf! Now called Allen, he sets out to unlock the secrets of his mystery-laden Summoner class; without the convenience of walkthroughs, game guides, or online forums, he must grope his way to the top of his new world!\n\n(Source: J-Novel Club)'),(60462,'SUI to Utaeba',51,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1129/146833.jpg','cm','2024-12-04','finished_airing','Web commercial promoting Suntory gin SUI.'),(60465,'Desk Bugs',192,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1763/146845.jpg','movie','2024-07-18','finished_airing','A bright red desk and a blue pencil. Skulls, cups, and a modular synthesizer. When you sit at the desk, they appear. With fluffy purple bodies, they\'re called \"Desk Bugs.\"\n\n(Source: Fantasia Film Festival)'),(60470,'Nikuen',1170,62.5,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1896/149989.webp','ova','2025-02-21','currently_airing',''),(60471,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Santa-san wo Sukue! Koori no Shiro no Christmas',1440,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1645/146860.jpg','tv_special','2020-12-25','finished_airing','Today is Christmas Eve. The town is very lively as people prepare for the Christmas party! Everyone is looking forward to Santa\'s arrival. However, Baikinman doesn\'t seem to like the fact that everyone is having fun... Santa is busy preparing presents in Christmas Valley. But then Baikinman shows up and attacks Santa! Santa gets on Rudolph and escapes. Then the Snow Wolf appears...?\n\n(Source: Amazon, translated)'),(60472,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Tetsu no Hoshi no Iron Christmas',1440,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1567/146861.jpg','tv_special','2021-12-24','finished_airing','Today is the long-awaited Christmas Eve! An Iron Christmas party is being held on Iron Planet. Kokin-chan is having a blast since it\'s her first time on Iron Planet. She makes friends with Kotetsu-chan and they play together at the Iron amusement park. But then the Iron\'s precious Christmas tree gets transformed into Baikinman\'s robot! Everyone is turned into a tree, and they\'re in big trouble. They all have to protect their precious Christmas before Santa arrives!\n\n(Source: Amazon, translated)'),(60478,'Kidou Senshi Gundam: ALC Encounter',323,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1356/147882.jpg','special','2024-11-24','finished_airing','A special animation in commemoration of the 45th anniversary of the Gundam franchise, that was screened at Mitsui Shopping Park LaLaport Fukuoka.'),(60480,'Minute! Kaijuu 8-gou',120,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1987/147122.jpg','ona','2024-12-06','currently_airing',''),(60485,'Hello Kitty to Asobou! Manabou!',420,0,21,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1418/146885.webp','tv','2017-07-28','finished_airing','Hello Kitty and her sister Mimmy love exploring and learning new stuff, especially when they can share them with friends! It\'s fun to learn the world around us: from learning how to take care of flowers, dancing or even learning good manneers.\n\n(Source: Pluto TV)'),(60486,'520',337,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1984/146886.jpg','movie','2023','finished_airing','A day in the life of people who cannot be honest because of their small pride getting in the way.\n\n(Source: Tokyo Anime Award Festival)'),(60487,'Red Table',442,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1516/146887.jpg','movie','2021','finished_airing','A boy hiding his eyes with sunglasses takes a cautious step towards the red table and puts a toy train on a rail set by someone. The boy turns on the switch soon after, then their play begins with the toy train running on the rail. \n\n(Source: Indie AniFest)'),(60489,'Takopii no Genzai',0,0,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1182/149879.jpg','ona','2025-06-28','not_yet_aired','A squid-like creature, known as a Happian, leaves his home planet with the desire to spread happiness across the universe. He lands on Earth, but quickly finds himself in danger of captivity by its inhabitants. Fortunately, he is found by an unsmiling little girl named Shizuka Kuze, who feeds him and names him Takopii. Feeling indebted, Takopii decides to do everything in his power to bring a smile to her face.\n\nThe task is easier said than done, however. Shizuka is bullied by her classmates, she does not have a father, and her mother is never home—though the gravity of these issues flies over the naive Takopii\'s head. Even so, Shizuka does have one source of happiness: her dog Chappy. The connection Shizuka and Chappy share only increases Takopii\'s desire to make the girl smile.\n\nWhile Takopii\'s attempts to lift Shizuka\'s spirits lead to unintended consequences, he is determined to take things into his own tentacles, test his understanding of human beings, and achieve his goal of spreading happiness.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(60490,'Moana to Densetsu no Umi 2 PVs',48,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1178/146920.jpg','pv','2024-12-07','finished_airing','Four promotional animations created by Genshou Yasuda and studio Xenotoon to promote the Japanese theatrical release of Disney\'s Moana 2 movie.'),(60491,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Chibikko Santa no Niconico Christmas',1440,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1766/146896.jpg','tv_special','2022-12-23','finished_airing','Today is the long-awaited Christmas! In Christmas Valley, there are plenty of gift-bearing fruits again this year! An apprentice Santa named Nicola arrives. She\'s training to become a great Santa Claus! But then Baikinman captures Santa and Rudolph! At this rate, Christmas will be ruined! We have to hurry and rescue the Santas!\n\n(Source: Amazon, translated)'),(60492,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Akachanman to Baikin Santa',1440,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1292/146898.jpg','tv_special','2023-12-22','finished_airing','Finally, the long-awaited Christmas has arrived! Together with Akachanman, we will help Santa in Christmas Valley! However, Akachanman gets sleepy in the middle of the trip. When she wakes up from her nap, she finds a different Santa than usual...\n\n(Source: U-NEXT, translated)'),(60493,'Geulium',186,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1376/146899.jpg','movie','2011','finished_airing','\"Geulium\" is a Korean expression of how someone misses or longs for their loved ones. All the characters you will encounter are missing someone or someplace.\n\n(Source: CaRTe bLaNChe)'),(60494,'Immoral Routine The Animation',0,72.6,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1413/150093.jpg','ova','2025-03-28','currently_airing',''),(60495,'Kanochi x Netorare Kazoku The Animation',0,63,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1098/150103.jpg','ova','2025-03-21','currently_airing',''),(60502,'R',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1901/146913.jpg','ona','2006-02','finished_airing','Tells the story of a battle between a tailor\'s daughter who protects a pair of legendary rose jeans that are endowed with magical powers when worn, and a witch who wants to obtain those powers.\n\n(Source: PHILE WEB, translated)'),(60505,'Necronomico no Cosmic Horror Show',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1957/148738.webp','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','We all need a chance to change our lives!\n\nThe story follows Miko Kurono, who began her dream career as a livestreamer under the name \"Necronomico\" after graduating middle school.\n\nAmidst spending her days with childhood friend Mayu Mayusaka and rival Kanna Kagurazaka, she\'s introduced to a new VR game project!?\n\nUpon encountering the game, the girls start pursuing the \'irreplacable now\'.\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(60506,'Araiguma Calcal-dan',120,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1016/149942.jpg','tv','2025-04-04','currently_airing',''),(60508,'Food Court de, Mata Ashita.',0,0,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1189/149492.jpg','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','To their classmates, Wada is a quiet rich girl while Yamamoto is an intimidating lone wolf…but what they don’t know is that Wada is a mobile game addict in a passionate love-hate relationship (with a 2D character) and Yamamoto has a penchant for urban legends with eyes only for her favorite YouTuber. And their biggest not-so-secret secret—these unlikely friends meet at the food court every day after school to rant, rave, and learn what makes each other tick!\n\n(Source: Yen Press)'),(60509,'Champignon no Majo',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1791/146948.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','Deep within the Black Forest teeming with poisonous mushrooms, a witch named Luna lives alone. With skin that is poisonous to the touch and a breath that will kill if close enough, she is forced to stay secluded from nearby civilization. Even with these conditions, Luna still visits a nearby city to deliver medicine and buy new books to read.\n\nDespite Luna having never done harm to any of the city’s residents, many are scared to associate with her, as she is a black witch in a kingdom ruled by white witches. Only able to watch from a distance while people receive her medicine and freely converse with one another, Luna is drawn toward their lives, even if it sometimes means putting herself in danger.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(60510,'2.5-jigen no Ririsa 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1833/146951.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of 2.5-jigen no Ririsa.'),(60512,'Gomu wo Tsukete to Iimashita yo ne...',995,68.8,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1013/147633.webp','ona','2024-12-13','finished_airing',''),(60513,'Quanzhi Gaoshou: Rongyao Xiao Juchang',200,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1442/147053.webp','ona','2024-12-14','finished_airing',''),(60515,'Bawang Long Lei Qi',380,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1580/146958.jpg','tv','2023-08-24','finished_airing',''),(60516,'Bawang Long Lei Qi 2nd Season',380,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1053/146959.jpg','tv','2024-12-04','finished_airing',''),(60517,'Wo Jiao MT 7th Season',1414,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1642/146960.jpg','ona','2024-07-10','finished_airing',''),(60521,'Twins Hinahima',1430,51.2,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1808/148205.jpg','tv_special','2025-03-28','finished_airing','Two high school girls Himari and Hinana dream of going viral. As they film all sorts of topics that could become a hot topic, they notice something weird and enter a strange world.'),(60522,'Gaikotsu Kishi-sama, Tadaima Isekai e Odekakechuu II',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1013/146963.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Gaikotsu Kishi-sama, Tadaima Isekai e Odekakechuu.'),(60523,'Tsuihousha Shokudou e Youkoso!',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1313/149355.jpg','tv','2025-07-03','not_yet_aired','Backstabbed by those he considered friends, Dennis has been exiled from one of the strongest guilds around: the Silver Wings Battalion. He doesn\'t think much of it, though, as he was dying to use his level 99 cooking skills anyway. That\'s why he decides to leave the city behind and open up a diner in the countryside.\n\nWhile pursuing his dream, Dennis meets Atrielle, a girl exiled from her noble household and relegated to slavery until he saves her.\n\nThe pair open the diner together, and their first client is... an exiled knight from a different guild? How peculiar. But she is not the only customer; a cocky mage and a drastically overworked yet underpaid sage become regulars as well.\n\nThe knight brings trouble to the diner at times, but Dennis\'s cooking skills and beloved butcher knives cut through trouble and hunger alike!\n\nThus begins the legend of Dennis and his diner, the talk of the town!\n\n(Source: Tentai Books)'),(60525,'Nozomanu Fushi no Boukensha 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1569/146966.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Nozomanu Fushi no Boukensha.'),(60526,'Quanqiu Gao Wu',1149,70.4,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1217/146967.webp','ona','2024-12-21','finished_airing','The 28-year-old Fang Ping was accidentally reborn in a parallel world in 2008, returning to his 18-year-old high school self. This is a world composed of a warrior system, where warriors have extremely high social status and rights. Due to the coincidence of fate with Emperor Zhan Tian in his previous life, a martial arts system was generated in Fang Ping\'s body after his rebirth. He can convert rare props of any value into martial arts value by touching them, and improve a series of abilities such as bones, tendons, flesh, blood, and mental strength at a speed beyond ordinary people. Through the system\'s golden finger and his own mind, Fang Ping successfully entered Modu Wuke University for further studies, and in the years to come, he continued to complete his self-growth. Faced with unknown difficulties, he gradually realized the responsibilities that warriors need to bear and the mission of protecting family, friendship, and love.\n\n(Source: Tencent, Google translated)'),(60529,'Yongheng Jian Zu',600,0,40,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1967/146969.jpg','ona','2024-12-19','finished_airing','A generation of Sword Emperor, entered the cycle of reincarnation and was reborn, practiced the ancient methods, forged the flesh and earth, broke the shackles of the gods, and smashed the conspiracy to deceive the world!\n\n(Source: Youku, Google translated)'),(60531,'Bukiyou na Senpai.',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1295/149080.webp','tv','2025','not_yet_aired','Kannawa-senpai is considered many things, but smooth is definitely not one of them. Then she meets Kamegawa, her new Kouhai. He\'s cute, a little nerdy, and easy to talk to. How will this awkward Senpai be able to handle these new feelings?!\n\n(Source: Comikey Media)'),(60534,'Koupen-chan',60,65.8,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1533/146981.webp','tv','2025-04-06','currently_airing','Follows the everyday adventures of Koupen-chan and their friends as they enjoy the little things in life.\n\n(Source: Crunchyroll)'),(60535,'Everyday Host',210,62.9,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1634/146982.jpg','tv','2025-04-05','currently_airing','The story follows Hajime Sekiguchi, a former life insurance salesman who, in a moment of desperation, makes the unexpected leap into the world of hosts.\n\nAt Club One, Hajime finds himself surrounded by a cast of eccentric personalities: a \"younger brother\" type host with 20 years of experience, a former idol specializing in romantic sales tactics, and a hyper-aggressive host obsessed with mobile games. Despite thinking, \"This isn\'t a job for anyone with a sane mind,\" Hajime uses his polished insurance sales skills to attract clients and carve out a surprising niche for himself.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(60536,'Awaiting',210,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1299/146988.jpg','movie','2012','finished_airing','A man is waiting for someone in a small boat. In loneliness he keeps waiting for someone. For whom or why he is waiting is not very important. He wishes to see the sight of formless \"happiness,\" which can vanish in a blink of an eye as long as possible.\n\n(Source: Geidai Animation)'),(60537,'Monpoke',300,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1064/146989.webp','ona','2025-02-19','finished_airing',''),(60541,'Wu Dong Qian Kun 5th Season',1320,78.5,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1315/146994.jpg','ona','2025-01-01','finished_airing','The fifth season of Wu Dong Qian Kun.'),(60542,'Maze King',422,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1569/146997.webp','movie','2013','finished_airing','We cannot stay here any longer. We must leave tomorrow morning. A clown convinces and hurries the residents of an amusement park — a girl, a gay man, a soldier, a dog — to be in time for the merry-go-round. \n\n(Source: Geidai Animation)'),(60543,'Dandadan 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1721/149001.webp','tv','2025-07-04','not_yet_aired','Second season of Dandadan.'),(60544,'Nezha Zhi Mo Tong Nao Hai',8700,84.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1616/147002.jpg','movie','2025-01-29','finished_airing','After the heavenly lightning, although Ne Zha and Ao Bing survived by becoming Spirits, they would soon dissipate completely. Taiyi plans to rebuild Ne Zha and Ao Bing\'s mortal bodies with the Seven-colored Precious Lotus. However, during the process of reconstruction, numerous obstacles arise. What will become of the fate of Ne Zha and Ao Bing? \n\n(Source: AMC)'),(60545,'Xue Wang Zhi Qihuan Sha Zhou',648,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1455/147003.jpg','ona','2024-12-21','finished_airing',''),(60546,'Momose Akira no Hatsukoi Hatanchuu. PV',52,64.2,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1700/147005.jpg','pv','2024-12-18','finished_airing','Promotional video commemorating the release of the first volume of the Momose Akira no Hatsukoi Hatanchuu. manga.'),(60547,'Tteotda Keunyeo!! Another Step',735,67.6,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1686/147006.jpg','ona','2024-03-30','finished_airing',''),(60548,'Skip to Loafer 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1800/148268.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Skip to Loafer.'),(60551,'Hyakushou Kizoku 3rd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1279/148760.webp','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','Third season of Hyakushou Kizoku.'),(60552,'Kabushikigaisha Magi-Lumière 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1944/147019.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Kabushikigaisha Magi-Lumière.'),(60553,'Nonohara Yuzuka no Himitsu no Haishin',960,69.3,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1606/150008.webp','ova','2025-02-28','currently_airing',''),(60554,'Bao Ke Meng Donghua Tujian: Qian Ling Bai Li',90,0,9,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1641/147022.webp','ona','2024-11-27','finished_airing','Second season of Bao Ke Meng Donghua Tujian.'),(60555,'Ramen Akaneko 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1533/147025.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Ramen Akaneko.'),(60556,'Practice for Henteko',165,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1401/147028.jpg','movie','2009','finished_airing','A short film by Hakhyun Kim.'),(60557,'Fanren Xiu Xian Chuan: Waihai Fengyun',1200,80.1,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1388/149196.jpg','ona','2025-01-18','currently_airing','Fourth season of Fanren Xiu Xian Chuan.'),(60558,'Huo Feng Liao Yuan 2nd Season',1581,0,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1707/150166.jpg','ona','2025-01-16','finished_airing','Second season of Huo Feng Liao Yuan.'),(60560,'Xian Wang de Richang Shenghuo 5',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1348/150032.webp','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','Fifth season of Xian Wang de Richang Shenghuo.'),(60561,'Shaonian Ge Xing: Xue Ran Tianqi Pian',900,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1465/149969.jpg','ona','2025-01-08','currently_airing','The fourth season of Shaonian Ge Xing.'),(60562,'Bai Yao Pu 5th Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1015/149994.jpg','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','Fifth season of Bai Yao Pu.'),(60563,'Ye de Mingming Shu',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1328/149948.webp','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','Qingchen\'s parents divorced when he was young. In order not to cause trouble to his mother, he voluntarily lived with his gambling-addicted father. One day, with the appearance of a mysterious countdown on his arm, Qingchen\'s life changed. It connected two completely different worlds, and the moment the countdown reached zero, time stopped and space shattered. Qingchen traveled through time and space to the dangerous Prison No. 18 in the other world. Under the dense steel sky, he relied on courage and wisdom to forge ahead, overcame many tests, and was appreciated by the demigod Li Shutong. In the end, Qingchen was able to worship Li Shutong as his master, and Li Shutong will take Qingchen on the longest road among all the shortcuts in this world.\n\n(Source: Bilibili, Google translated)'),(60564,'Ranma ½ (2024) 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1181/147042.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Ranma ½ (2024).'),(60565,'Junzi Wu Ji',1152,0,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1077/149908.jpg','ona','2025-02-12','finished_airing','The down-and-out fairy Yao Ji who traveled through time and space! The young Liu Ling who needed to see himself found the magic stone. The two reached a cooperation and found the concubines with special skills to teach them. Liu Ling successfully started his journey to the East Palace. As they spent time together day and night, he suddenly found that he had different feelings for Yao Ji...\n\n(Source: Bilibili, Google translated)'),(60566,'Nan Hong',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1304/147056.webp','ona','','not_yet_aired','When Wen Yifan returned to her hometown for work, she unexpectedly ran into the rumored \"First-Class Handsome Guy\" at a bar. However, she soon discovered that he was Sang Yan, someone she had hurt and rejected in high school. In a twist of fate, these two individuals who could never get along found themselves constantly crossing paths. They even ended up renting the same unit by chance and becoming housemates. With unspoken feelings buried deep within, strong emotions begin to stir...\n\nLet\'s see how Sang Yan, the \"Peak Ideal Boyfriend,\" interprets and expresses his profound affection and sweet love!\n\n(Source: INKR)'),(60567,'Chang Ge Xing',1080,0,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1427/147055.jpg','ona','2025-02-23','currently_airing','Shortly after astrology predicts destruction to befall the Tang Dynasty, a coup d\'état led by the crown prince Li\'s very own brother kills him and his wife and sons. Li\'s daughter, princess Yongning, manages to escape, but is soon declared dead alongside her family. Full of wrath, the princess swears to avenge them as she takes on the identity of a young man, Li Chang Ge, and moves to the Shou province to advance her goals.\n\nLi Chang Ge uses her wits to gain the trust of the Shou emperor and swiftly climbs the military ranks as a brilliant strategist. Captivatingly drawn, Song of the Long March portrays the feisty girl\'s adolescent journey toward countless unknown adventures, faithful comradeship, as well as formidable enmity awaiting her along the way.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(60568,'Jiyi Guanli Ju (2025)',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1288/147047.webp','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','In order to go back to the past, Guan Chao tries hard to find the \"burning stone\" that activates the time gun, but accidentally falls into the Memory Management Bureau. Only by conquering the BUG people in the memory layer can he return to reality. With the help of administrators such as Fangtang and Baizhong, can Guan Chao successfully complete the task? What kind of challenges are awaiting Guan Chao in each memory layer...\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(60569,'Zhongguo Qi Tan 2',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1536/147048.jpg','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','The animated short film collection \"Chinese Tales 2\" is jointly produced by Shanghai Animation Film Studio, Shanghai Film Studio, Bilibili, and Chen Liaoyu Studio. Chen Liaoyu is the chief director. The work brings together 12 directors to create 9 short films with different styles. The second part of the story will enter the world of fireworks. On the basis of continuing \"telling Chinese stories in a Chinese way\", it will focus more on the thinking and discussion of people\'s self-identity, family relationships, and social relationships, while continuing to show the fantasy imagination in the local context.\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(60570,'Ling Long 2nd Season',1500,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1980/150040.jpg','ona','2025-05-23','currently_airing','Second season of Ling Long.'),(60571,'Jiang Ye',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1846/147052.jpg','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','The protagonist Ning Que travels to a seemingly real Tang Dynasty world, only to find that it is a dangerous world of cultivation. He originally thought that he could live a life of luxury and become superior, but he finds that he had no talent for cultivation. Additionally, he witnessed the massacre of his entire family at the age of four and was hunted for thousands of miles. While escaping death, he picked up a black umbrella in a sea of ​​blood and corpses and found the infant Sangsang. In despair, he found the motivation to live. Unwilling to bow to fate, he takes the big black umbrella and Sangsang, and begins a thrilling counterattack.\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(60572,'Kun Tun Tianxia Zhi Zhang Men Guilai',1200,78.89999999999999,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1956/147054.jpg','ona','2025-05-01','currently_airing','Fan Lingxiao, a gifted spirit pet master, was ambushed in the A-level sect promotion competition and devoured by his own spirit pet whale, Kun. When he woke up, he found himself reincarnated into a young man named \"Liu Fengmang\" who is imprisoned in the White Mansion. \n\nHis sect, Lingxiao Pavilion, was also in dire straits. In order to find out the truth about the backlash of the spirit Kun and revive his sect, Fan Lingxiao takes his existing spirit pets and embarks on a new adventure with Gu Ling, Cheng Xi, and Yue Tong.\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(60574,'Shen Kong Bian',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1132/147058.jpg','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','The new art of cultivating immortals with technology is rising, while the old art of cultivating immortals that has been passed down for thousands of years is gradually declining. Wang Xuan, a genius boy of the old art, accidentally joins the mysterious organization Secret Road. He seizes treasures, fights new art, fights immortals, and in a series of thrilling adventures, he peeks into the big secrets hidden in the old art. In order to cope with the huge crisis that is about to come, Wang Xuan does not hesitate to go deep into the universe and challenge the limits of his growth.\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(60575,'Gag Mensou',168,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1861/147059.webp','movie','1981','finished_airing','A short film by Shinichi Suzuki.'),(60576,'Qing Chi Hong Xiaodou Ba! Shiwu Shijie',480,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1244/147060.jpg','ona','2025-01-10','finished_airing','Have you ever wondered where uneaten food goes? Wasted food actually goes to a world that belongs only to food, which is simply called the \"Food City.\" Food is cleaned, disinfected and repaired here, and then returns to the human world to \"go to work\" and reappear in human bowls! Red Bean is just a red bean that is not eaten day after day... But one day, an accident happened! While Red Bean was working diligently, a human diner suddenly got food poisoning, and Red Bean became the object of suspicion by the Food Inspection Bureau...\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(60577,'Tong Ling Fei 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1292/147061.webp','ona','','not_yet_aired','Qian Yunxi, the eldest daughter of the prime minister of Guyu Kingdom, has supernatural powers. She has been considered an unlucky person since she was a child and is forced to marry into the Ye Palace. Seeing her sincerity and kindness, the prince Ye Youming uses thousands of tricks to show his kindness. Qian Yunxi thinks that the prince has bad intentions, so she fights with him. A chaotic cohabitation life begins.\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(60578,'Bai Ri Cheng Cai',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1051/147062.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','In the high tower world where money is paramount, follow the grassroots male protagonist to climb to the top of the tower and realize his counterattack plan of becoming rich in 100 days!\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(60579,'Jian Wang 3: Shen Jianxin de 365 Tian',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1125/147071.jpg','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','After Shen Jianxin returns to Daoxiang Village again, strange tales, unsolved cases, and outrageous inventions constantly appear... He and his partners embark on a new adventure.\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(60580,'Xuan Jie Zhi Men',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1586/147072.jpg','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','In a world where warriors are respected, Shi Mu\'s fate seems destined to be different. As the adopted son of an aristocratic family, he is forced to embark on the road of a warrior to find the truth and redeem himself. From the four halls of Fengcheng to the struggle between sects, interests are entangled, and powerful enemies lurk. Every challenge makes Shi Mu more determined. In the end, Shi Mu realizes the power of his bloodline, which not only changes his own destiny, but also affects the future of many people.\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(60581,'Xin Yichang Shengwu Jianwen Lu: Xu',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1345/147073.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','Hao Ren was originally a young man who lived in a fourth-tier city and lived on the meager rent of an old house. When he went out to work, he accidentally became a \"universe police officer.\" While he was still struggling to accommodate a group of abnormal creature tenants arranged by his superiors, his jurisdiction, the Dream Plane Universe, had already brewed a cosmic crisis. The mystery of the origin of abnormal creatures on Earth and the ruins of civilization in the Dream Plane Universe seem to be connected in some way. \n\nAs Hao Ren\'s investigation deepened, the eldest son\'s world-destroying natural disaster, the goddess of creation fell, and one after another of the dusty and terrifying cases that had been buried for thousands of years bombarded his already useless brain circuit. Hao Ren gradually realized that he might not be able to slack off...\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(60582,'Cengjing You Yongshi',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1518/147074.jpg','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','The contrastingly cute dragon, Al, the first king-killer in the demon world, who has a full combat score but is ready to die and longs for a happy retirement, bumps into the cunning human magician Le Fei, and accidentally becomes a super dad who raises Le Fei\'s son Dino. Will Dino be an ordinary and happy child, or will he bravely pick up the Warrior\'s Holy Sword and face his own destiny...\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(60583,'Xian Di Guilai',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1699/147075.jpg','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','The young warrior Yun Qingyan disappeared from the world three years ago, but he was actually drawn into the fairy world for three thousand years! With his extraordinary talent, he became the Yun Emperor, one of the ten great fairy emperors. However, because he was tired of the intrigues in the fairy world and missed his family, he decided to return to the human world at all costs. Upon return to the human world, his parents and sister strangely disappeared, and due to an incident whilst traveling from the fairy world to the human world, he lost his magic weapon and his cultivation became almost zero. Major forces took this opportunity to hunt him down. The fairy emperor became the target of public criticism, and his family was in danger! Yun Qingyan relied on his extraordinary fairy emperor talent to refine pills and array formations, study and practice, and overwhelm his enemies. He embarked on an adventure to revive his family, find his relatives, and rectify the mortal world. \n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(60586,'Kaiju Ditan Mai Dali',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1751/147078.webp','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','Twenty years ago, numerous \"Spiritual Ruins Gates\" suddenly appeared all over the world. The spiritual energy gushing out of them would awaken the supernatural powers of those who came into contact with them. These people who awakened supernatural powers were called \"Spirit Warriors\". Among them, the \"Space series\" Spirit Warriors became the strongest because of their outstanding performance in the \"Beast Tide Disaster\" and the scarcity of their awakening. Jiang Nan grew up in an orphanage in Jiangcheng, Lingzhou. He aspired to become the top spiritual warrior since he was a child. At the age of sixteen, he awakened the strongest and rarest space-based supernatural power, becoming the second space-based supernatural power in Lingzhou. Our story begins here...\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(60587,'Yu Ling Shi',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1187/147079.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','This tells the story of a popular cartoonist who became famous for his comic book .B.King. However, he ran out of ideas after many years and could only rely on constantly abandoning his characters to attract attention. One day, he received a mysterious phone call and was absorbed into the world of B.King as a character named Wang Xiaoming. Thus, the Wang Xiaoming who now has the thoughts of the \"creator,\" along with the characters he created, embarks on a fantasy adventure that could be described as, \"God\'s shortcut, one step to heaven.\"\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(60588,'Kai Pai La! Guaishou Da Dianying',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1050/147080.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','Following a decline in the amount of monster movies created, Meng Qi, a director who is obsessed with the monster movie genre, becomes unsure about his persistence—he never expected that one day an actual monster would appear in front of him! In order to fulfill his dream, Meng Qi decides to cooperate with the demon girl Liya and help her shoot a demon themed movie. However, as the shooting progresses, Meng Qi discovers that things in the other world are closely related to him...\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(60589,'Da Xia Qing Shang Gong',720,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1134/147081.jpg','ona','2025-05-13','currently_airing','Fifty years ago, the martial arts world was suddenly invaded by \"chaos.\" Murong Qiong formed a demon sect to fight against it, but they could not win despite the hard battle. The messenger of God Yi Zhihua came and taught everyone the demonization skills to successfully defeat the chaos. But the messenger of God left, and the demonization skills were introduced into the martial arts world and got out of control. Murong Qiong was disappointed and retired. His subordinate Yu Huabing took the opportunity to take over, improved the demonization skills, and created the punk invigoration era, making the martial arts world prosperous, but the price was that the martial artists all became \"superior martial arts monsters.\" Dongfang Sheng, a young man with a pure heart, found Murong Qiong who had retired to the Xiangxi Hotel, hoping to rely on him to restore the former glory of the martial arts world. Thus this ridiculous story begins...\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(60590,'Lao Ma Yu Xiao Bai',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1383/147082.webp','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','Lao Ma, whose full name is Ma Lei and whose online name is \"Ma Mou Ren\", is a well-known game planner. Many of his mobile games have dominated the top of the \"Lemon Best-selling\" TOP list for many years. Lao Ma\'s production style is actually not well received in the game circle, but big companies are still flocking to him, and the core lies in the word traffic. Lao Ma\'s games have no breakthroughs in mechanism, and most of the games he planned are just reskins, but Lao Ma has a deep grasp of people\'s hearts, and often a simple small change can make players enjoy krypton gold. On an ordinary and easy-going morning in 2021, this well-known planner was fatefully transported into the mobile game world he designed himself. At first, he went smoothly with his understanding of the game, but gradually things began to collapse more and more. The bad design he made in order to cheat produced all kinds of amazing and strange changes. In addition to Lao Ma himself \"enjoying\" all this, there is also a new finger named \"Xiao Bai\" beside him...\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(60591,'Wei Miao Rensheng',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1871/147084.webp','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','Orphaned at birth and bullied at work, Myohee has been through countless trials in life. But when she gets scammed by her only friend and ends up bankrupt, Myohee feels as though she\'ll never find the silver lining to her cloud. She decides to end her own life by jumping from a building, but mid-air, the grim reaper halts her descent, saying her time isn\'t up yet. She\'s ordered to live for 100 more days...as a cat! Before she knows it, she\'s taken to the home of her handsome, aloof boss, Mr. Cha. It seems like the perfect chance to receive the love and care she never had in life...if only Myohee can remain a cat!\n\n(Source: Lezhin Entertainment)'),(60592,'Dadao Duxing Zhi Die Long Bian',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1180/147085.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','Luo Li has been trapped in the soulless Yinzhou Continent since he was a child and became the number one killer of Tianjue Killing Hall. His father, Master Ciyun, sacrificed himself to buy Luo Li a chance to escape from Yinzhou and go to Zhongtian Main World to find the true way to cultivate immortality.\n\n(Source: Bilibili, translated)'),(60593,'Vigilante: Boku no Hero Academia Illegals',1422,75.4,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1538/148604.webp','tv','2025-04-07','currently_airing','Living in a superhuman society, it is hard to feel special. Even more so when the spotlight only shines on professional heroes, those legally authorized to use their special powers known as Quirks in public for the greater good.\n\nKouichi Haimawari grew up aspiring to be a hero, but with a mediocre Quirk like \"sliding\" that ties him to the ground, he soon came to the conclusion that he could only ever admire them from below. Despite this, Kouichi finds contentment in using his Quirk to carry out day-to-day good deeds, such as returning lost items and helping the elderly cross the street.\n\nHowever, Kouichi\'s tame life takes a swing into the turbulent when he is rescued from a back alley brawl by Vigilante, or illegal hero, Knuckleduster. Seeing hero potential in Kouichi, Knuckleduster enlists his help in tracking down the source of a dangerous drug known as Trigger that boosts the user\'s Quirk at the expense of their rationality.\n\nSet in a time before the events of the original story, Vigilante: Boku no Hero Academia Illegals follows Kouichi as he chooses to don the reputation of a villain and become a Vigilante, operating in the shadow of the law to prevent crimes from taking to the surface.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(60595,'Hyakushou Kizoku 2nd Season Specials',300,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1806/150091.jpg','special','2025-04-23','finished_airing','Specials included with the DVD release of the second season of Hyakushou Kizoku bundled with volume 8.1 of the manga.'),(60596,'Sai-Kyo-Oh! Zukan: The Ultimate Tournament',660,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1531/150143.jpg','tv','2025-04-06','currently_airing','Second season of Sai-Kyo-Oh! Zukan: The Ultimate Battles.'),(60601,'Tensei Kizoku, Kantei Skill de Nariagaru 3rd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1754/147116.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Third season of Tensei Kizoku, Kantei Skill de Nariagaru.'),(60602,'MF Ghost 3rd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1395/147121.webp','tv','2026','not_yet_aired','Third season of MF Ghost.'),(60603,'Puniru wa Kawaii Slime 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1542/147119.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Puniru wa Kawaii Slime.'),(60610,'Hateshinaki Scarlet',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1062/149500.webp','movie','2025-11-21','not_yet_aired','After failing to avenge her father\'s murder, Princess Scarlett wakes up in the \"Land of the Dead.\" In this world full of madness, she must take revenge on her sworn enemy. If she does not avenge her nemesis and reach the \"Endless Place,\" she will become \"nothingness\" and cease to exist.\n\n(Source: Official YouTube, translated)'),(60611,'2024 Arknights Yinlu Lian Jue: Bumi Langchen Xiandao Yugao',116,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1128/147141.jpg','pv','2024-03-29','finished_airing','Promotional video for the 2024 Arknights Ambience Synesthesia concert.'),(60612,'Shibuya♡Hachi Part 3',120,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1804/148377.jpg','tv','2025-04-05','currently_airing','Part 3 of Shibuya♡Hachi.'),(60613,'Oshiri Tantei Movie 6: Star and Moon',4560,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1703/147146.jpg','movie','2025-03-20','finished_airing','Koala asks Butt Detective to find a missing relative who disappeared from an idol contest. The case takes Butt Detective to Stardust Island, the site of the contest, and also the home of the international criminal organization Phantom Thief Academy, headed by Phantom Thief G. Here, the organization advances its secret conspiracy, codenamed the Dark Age Plan. Butt Detective enters Stardust Island under the guise of an idol. At the same time, he joins forces with Phantom Thief U, who is out to steal back the valuable Moonlight Stone from Phantom Thief G.\n\n(Source: Anime News Network)'),(60619,'Nageki no Bourei wa Intai shitai Part 2',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1526/147157.webp','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','Second season of Nageki no Bourei wa Intai shitai.'),(60620,'Kabita Mikan no Santa Claus',126,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1744/147167.jpg','ona','2009-12-26','finished_airing','A Christmas short film by Tarafu Otani about a moldy mandarin.'),(60623,'YouTuNya: Christmas tte Mita',160,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1571/147174.jpg','tv_special','2024-12-24','finished_airing','Nya and her sister are going to spend a fun Christmas together again this year. However, Nya has forgotten something. Something that will make Santa and the reindeer go crazy...\n\n(Source: YouTube, translated)'),(60624,'Yuanshen: Huanghun',644,72.4,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1409/147182.webp','ona','2024-12-23','finished_airing','Animated short film about the backstory of Mavuika from Genshin Impact.\n'),(60627,'Bokura no Motte Iru Mono',30,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1485/147183.jpg','cm','2024-12-26','finished_airing',''),(60629,'\"1-punkan dake Furete mo Ii yo...\" Share House no Himitsu Rule.',360,57.5,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1602/147203.jpg','ona','2025-01-05','finished_airing','After moving into a new share house, Ryota Ochi meets two beautiful housemates…who order him to do housework day in and day out! He\'s soon had enough, and is just about to move out when the two girls offer him a deal—for every minute of housework he does, they allow him to \"have fun\" with them for one minute!\n\n(Source: Suiseisha)'),(60632,'Ganbare! Chrome',133,62,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1972/147207.webp','pv','2024-11-28','finished_airing','A series of short videos from Google Japan to promote the Chrome web browser. It features the Chrome mascot explaining various features of the browser that are based upon the winning artwork submissions from a competition they held earlier in the year.'),(60636,'Bleach: Sennen Kessen-hen - Kashin-tan',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1905/147227.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','Final part of Bleach: Sennen Kessen-hen.'),(60637,'Mahou Shoujo Lyrical Nanoha EXCEEDS: Gun Blaze Vengeance',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1712/148695.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','A brand new TV anime project for Mahou Shoujo Lyrical Nanoha.'),(60642,'Yuusha-chan no Bouken wa Owatteshimatta!',900,59.699999999999996,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1171/147233.jpg','ova','2025-02-28','currently_airing',''),(60643,'Issho ni Utau Kero ♪ Kekechama Wanwan to Poupo Fantane! no Uta Ippai',2262,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1649/147235.jpg','ona','2024-04-02','finished_airing',''),(60644,'Love Live! Superstar!! 3rd Season (TV Special)',70,0,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1607/147236.jpg','tv_special','2024-10-20','finished_airing','Segments shown with episodes 3-8 of Love Live! Superstar!! 3rd Season exclusively on the NHK Educational TV (NHK E) broadcast of the TV anime.'),(60645,'Boku no Hero Academia the Movie 4: You\'re Next - A Piece of Cake',204,61.900000000000006,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1177/148265.webp','special','2025-02-19','finished_airing','Adaptation of \"A Piece of Cake\" side-chapter in the Vol.Next manga which was a special present for movie attendees in Japan. Included in the \"Plus Ultra\" version of the film\'s Blu-ray and DVD release in Japan.'),(60651,'Yu-Gi-Oh! Card Game: The Chronicles',240,60.300000000000004,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1653/147242.jpg','ona','2025-04-21','currently_airing','The stories that lie within the cards come to life...'),(60653,'Fudanshi Shoukan: Isekai de Shinjuu ni Hameraremashita 8th Season',150,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1539/147244.jpg','ona','2024-12-10','finished_airing','Eighth season of Fudanshi Shoukan: Isekai de Shinjuu ni Hameraremashita.'),(60658,'Hibi wa Sugiredo Meshi Umashi',1440,76.3,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1221/148863.jpg','tv','2025-04-13','currently_airing','An original animation about the daily life of five girls who just became university students. They love delicious food, want to have lots of fun with everyone, and study a little harder to enjoy university life to the fullest!\n\n(Source: Official Site)'),(60660,'SFBC \"Fake\" Commercial Film',50,61.900000000000006,5,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1669/147262.webp','ona','2024-12-31','finished_airing','A series of \"fake\" commercials featuring characters from the Fate franchise.'),(60662,'Neko ni Naritai Tamagawa-kun',1040,70.5,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1528/147265.webp','tv_special','2025-01-05','finished_airing','For Tamagawa, volunteering at a cat café is the only relief from his stressful job. The manager tells him to, \"relax and learn to be spoiled,\" but he doesn\'t know what that means until a new customer, Rai Shindou, comes to the café and tells Tamagawa he wants to keep him as a cat! Enter their strange, but fateful relationship. A pure-hearted and soothing romantic comedy.\n\n(Source: Kodansha, translated)'),(60665,'Futari Solo Camp',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1449/147268.jpg','tv','2025-07-11','not_yet_aired','The story centers on Gen Kinokura, a devoted solo camper who treasures his solitude. During one of his usual camping trips, he unexpectedly crosses paths with Shizuku Kusano, a total camping novice. What starts as an accidental encounter evolves into an unusual partnership, as the two embark on what can only be described as \"solo camping for two.\"\n\n(Source: Pony Canyon)'),(60666,'Aldnoah.Zero (Re+)',7200,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1090/148437.webp','movie','2025-02-28','finished_airing','Compilation movie for Aldnoah.Zero.'),(60669,'\"Mahouka Koukou no Rettousei\" Yori Shinnen no Goaisatsu 2025',37,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1553/147281.jpg','pv','2025-01-01','finished_airing','A New Year\'s greetings to promote the release of Mahouka Koukou no Rettousei Movie: Yotsuba Keishou-hen.'),(60674,'Pokemon Card Game PV: 9-tsu no Bouken',175,62.400000000000006,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1319/147295.webp','pv','2024-11-21','finished_airing','Promotional video made to advertise the Pokémon Card Game: Starter Deck Generations.'),(60677,'Minimini Minini',270,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1753/148560.jpg','tv','2025-01-04','currently_airing','The anime centers on the LINE FRIENDS \"minini\" non-verbal palm-sized characters surviving in the human world.\n\n(Source: ANN)'),(60684,'Yeosin Gangnim 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1745/147328.webp','ona','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Yeosin Gangnim.'),(60689,'Rainbow Bubblegem 2: Secret',660,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1137/149979.jpg','tv','2025-04-09','currently_airing',''),(60690,'Mao Xing Dongfang',840,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1272/147341.jpg','ona','2025-01-13','finished_airing',''),(60691,'Guangying Tian Yan Zhan Jia',800,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1124/147365.jpg','ona','2024-12-13','finished_airing',''),(60692,'Kizoku Tensei: Megumareta Umare kara Saikyou no Chikara wo Eru',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1261/147345.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','Noa, the world\'s strongest six-year-old, holds the fortunate position of being the Thirteenth Prince of the emperor. Born with an infinite level cap and a cheat skill that allows him to add the abilities of those he commands to his own, he is unmatched. Reincarnated into a noble family, Noa thrives in an environment enriched with exceptional education and abundant resources, allowing his talents to blossom. However, behind the glamorous facade of aristocratic society lurks a world of conspiracies and power struggles.\n\n(Source: Pony Canyon)'),(60697,'Fermat no Ryouri',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1862/148422.jpg','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Kitada Gaku, a young man who once aspired to uncover the world\'s truths through mathematics, finds himself at a crossroads after failing to achieve his dream of competing in the Math Olympiad. With his scholarship revoked, he spends his days working at a school cafeteria, struggling with a sense of aimlessness.\n\nEverything changes when he meets a brilliant chef who introduces him to the fascinating intersection of mathematics and cooking. As Gaku embarks on this unexpected journey, he is drawn into a culinary world that\'s as complex and precise as mathematics itself.\n\nA unique and inspiring story where numbers and flavors blend to reveal the beauty of discovery, Mathematics Meets Cuisine opens the door to a new world of gourmet adventure.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(60700,'Yuanshen: Juese Yiwen',90,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1459/147372.jpg','pv','2024-09-06','currently_airing','Animated character anecdotes for the game Genshin Impact.'),(60705,'Xiong Chumo: Xiongxiong Bang Bang Tuan 3',800,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1115/147383.jpg','tv','2024-12-20','finished_airing',''),(60706,'Xiong Chumo: Xiongxiong Huanle Song 2',200,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1465/147384.jpg','tv','2022-12-23','finished_airing',''),(60707,'Xi Yangyang Yu Hui Tailang: Qimiao da Yingjiu',920,0,60,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1235/147387.jpg','tv','2022-07-15','finished_airing',''),(60708,'Xi Yangyang Yu Hui Tailang: Yong Chuang Siji Cheng',920,0,60,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1133/147388.jpg','tv','2023-01-06','finished_airing',''),(60709,'Xi Yangyang Yu Hui Tailang: Aoyou Shenmi Yang',920,0,60,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1210/147389.jpg','tv','2023-07-06','finished_airing',''),(60710,'Xi Yangyang Yu Hui Tailang: Xin Shijie Qiyu',920,0,60,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1933/147390.jpg','tv','2024-01-19','finished_airing',''),(60711,'Xi Yangyang Yu Hui Tailang: Fengkuang Chao Neng Ying',920,0,60,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1689/147391.jpg','tv','2024-07-05','finished_airing',''),(60712,'Xi Yangyang Yu Hui Tailang: Qi Xia da Yingjiu',920,0,60,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1480/147392.jpg','tv','2025-01-10','finished_airing',''),(60713,'Xi Yangyang Yu Hui Tailang: Yangyang Qu Maoxian 2',800,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1371/147393.jpg','ona','2022-11-26','finished_airing',''),(60720,'Ajin ga Osuki nan desu ne',1200,64,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1774/147421.webp','ova','2025-03-28','currently_airing','In the near future, humans and animals live in harmony. The result is the emergence of half-humans who live like normal people, but with their own characteristics.\n\nEpisode 1: The decent and clean goat Maya periodically shaves her fur on the lower part of her body, which she is very embarrassed about, because many people would dislike it. One day, right while shaving, her owner Christophe catches her. The girl has already managed to get upset, but in vain. What is natural is wonderful. And the young lord was eager to help her.\n\nEpisode 2: Little Meguru unexpectedly met a big dog Mokka in an alley and got scared and wet himself. The dog calmed the boy down and invited him over to dry his clothes and take a shower. But as soon as the husky took off her clothes to help him in the bath, the boy could no longer think about anything but her.'),(60725,'Yuanshen: Ci Shi Zhi Yi',109,71.39999999999999,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1236/147426.webp','ona','2025-01-09','finished_airing','Animated short film about the backstory of Il Capitano from Genshin Impact.\n'),(60726,'My Melody & Kuromi',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1079/150023.jpg','ona','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Get ready for a delightful adventure as My Melody & Kuromi brings the beloved Sanrio characters to life in a charming stop-motion animation series. Celebrating the 50th anniversary of My Melody and the 20th anniversary of Kuromi, the series takes viewers on an adventure in Mariland, their whimsical home.\n\n(Source: Netflix)'),(60727,'Arknights 5th Anniversary Special Video',470,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1656/147429.jpg','pv','2025-01-09','finished_airing','This is a special video celebrating the 5th anniversary of the popular app game \"Arknights\" from Yostar. \"Don\'t get the date wrong like Eureka!!\"\n\n(Source: YouTube, translated)'),(60729,'Babanbabanban Vampire Mini Anime',60,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1986/147456.jpg','ona','2025-01-06','finished_airing',''),(60732,'Mizu Zokusei no Mahoutsukai',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1224/147443.webp','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Ryou is delighted to be reincarnated into the fantastical world of Phi, where he thinks he\'ll get to live a quiet life learning to use his newfound water magic. Going with the flow here, however, means something very different. Ryou is immediately pitted against the wild lands he winds up in and the slew of deadly monsters that call the remote subcontinent home. You\'d think he\'d forget about taking it easy when he\'s stuck fighting for his life, but lucky for Ryou, he\'s naturally optimistic, clever, and blessed with the hidden \"Eternal Youth\" trait. Twenty years pass in the blink of an eye, and each encounter along the way pushes him one step closer to the pinnacle of human magic. Little does he realize that\'s only the opening chapter of his tale. A fateful meeting soon thrusts Ryou to the forefront of history, forever changing the course of his life... Thus begins the adventures of the strongest water magician the world has ever seen—who also likes to do things at his own pace!\n\n(Source: J-Novel Club)'),(60733,'Tamagotchi Short Anime 2nd Season',60,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1490/147446.jpg','ona','2024-10-18','currently_airing','The second season of Tamagotchi Short Anime.'),(60735,'Benghuai: Xing Qiong Tiedao - The Herta De Mofa Chufang',177,71.39999999999999,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1001/147451.webp','ona','2025-01-10','finished_airing','At the edge of the universe beyond the limits for most to reach, a genius began to think...\n\"If 42 types of magic cannot make a piece of cake that makes one explode with joy from the smell alone and suffer a most unwilling smile...\"\n\"Then, that proves that this is a scientific theory that has yet to be studied fully.\"\n\n(Source: Youtube)'),(60737,'Shinkalion: Change the World - Present the World',1424,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1008/147455.jpg','tv_special','2025-01-05','finished_airing','Ganma gathers the drivers together for a Presentation Tournament. The topic? Regional Shinkansen and their Shinkalion forms! The team reminisces about their experiences over the past year and the time they\'ve spent together. \n\n(Source: Weeaboo-Shogun)'),(60739,'Otome Game no Heroine de Saikyou Survival',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1639/147459.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Orphaned by a monster attack on her village, young Alicia spends three horrid years in an orphanage before finally running away. When she flees, however, Alicia has a violent encounter with an older woman hell-bent on killing her. During their tussle, she comes into contact with a strange crystal that bestows upon her a wealth of knowledge, transforming her from an innocent child into a cool and calculated planner. Now aware that she was meant to be the protagonist of an otome game and disgusted with her supposed fate, Alicia decides to take matters into her own hands and become strong—by any means necessary. Using her newfound knowledge, and with some help from a stranger she meets in the woods, she learns to survive by herself in a world far too harsh and unforgiving for a girl her age. Ready or not, she\'s determined to carve her own path.\n\n(Source: J-Novel Club)'),(60749,'Maomao no Hitorigoto 2nd Season',114,66.3,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1946/147490.jpg','ona','2025-01-13','currently_airing','Mini anime for Kusuriya no Hitorigoto 2nd Season released on YouTube.'),(60756,'Copihan Special',369,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1457/147658.webp','special','','finished_airing','Special episode of Copihan that focuses on Omoto Kumogiri.'),(60757,'Good Smile Company Shin Character Image PV',46,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1661/147499.webp','pv','2013-07-29','finished_airing','A PV for Good Smile Company\'s mascot character Sumaco which was announced at Wonder Festival 2013.'),(60758,'Baolie Feiche 5: Jing Ma Mi Zong',780,0,30,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1521/147500.jpg','ona','2024-09-15','finished_airing','Fifth season of Baolie Feiche.'),(60759,'Kaijuu Sakaba Kanpai! × Yamasa Soy Sauce: Genki Kaijuu Chikarakonbu-kun Genru',80,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1708/147528.jpg','ona','2016-04-30','finished_airing',''),(60762,'Kaijuu Step Short Anime',80,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1830/147529.jpg','ona','2018-10-31','finished_airing',''),(60765,'Kimi to Koete Koi ni Naru',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1850/147507.webp','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','When high schooler Mari bumps into a fellow tardy student, she\'s surprised to find out he\'s a beastfolk who\'s to attend her school! After all, it\'s not rare for beastfolk to coexist alongside humans, but it\'s still uncommon, with the prejudice and all. Nervous to meet one at first, Mari soon learns there\'s more to him than his furry exterior. In fact, the more she gets to know him, the more she finds herself drawn to him, his steadfastness, his kindheartedness, and... his body...\n\n(Source: Yen Press)'),(60766,'Tianming Da Zhuzai',420,0,40,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1968/147508.jpg','ona','2025-01-15','finished_airing','Since ancient times, Dahe Shenzhou has been a land where virtue and evil have been at odds. Numerous justice-related sects have banded together to combat the evil\'s twelve irresponsible sects. The justice Jinyi Sect\'s low-level supernatural power is Li Wannian, who possesses ordinary cultivation. He wants to live a life of peace and quiet, lying flat in the Jinyi Sect and receiving a salary.\n\nHe unexpectedly learned, however, that he possessed the eternal capacity to instantly resurrect at the point of life-or-death crisis while completing a task to deal with the transfer. More significantly, he can improve his cultivation after each resurrection by receiving incentives in the form of points based on his overall performance at the time of his beheading. To put it another way, Li Wannian has to make a valiant sacrifice, and in a way that inspires and motivates others if he hopes to advance his cultivation.\n\n(Source: bilibili)'),(60770,'Seikatsu wa Psychopath no Shi no You ni',336,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1294/147534.webp','movie','2024-02-16','finished_airing','One rainy night, a man is murdered in a park and the protagonist witnesses it. He immediately calls the police, but his cell phone battery runs out. As he waits for the battery to recharge, his memory changes…\n\n(Source: Ionian Contemporary Animation Festival)'),(60772,'Xiang Huo Er Sheng',1053,0,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1115/147537.jpg','ona','2025-01-17','finished_airing',''),(60773,'Kimi to Idol Precure♪ Movie',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1159/149351.jpg','movie','2025-09-12','not_yet_aired','Kimi to Idol Precure♪ Movie to be released in fall 2025.\n'),(60774,'ChaO',5400,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1288/148819.jpg','movie','2025-08-15','not_yet_aired','A future society where humans and mermaids coexist. Stephen, an office worker, is suddenly asked to be married by Chao, a princess of the mermaid kingdom! A 100% pure love story!\n\n(Source: Official Twitter, edited)'),(60775,'Blue Lock Additional Time',120,66.9,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1871/147543.jpg','ona','2024-10-06','finished_airing','A mini anime episode which was only shown on EMOTION Label Channel (YouTube Channel). This is not a part of episode 24, and is not with BD release.'),(60776,'Cassis to Arles no Monogatari',30,0,20,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1212/147544.webp','cm','2007','finished_airing','Cassis is the only daughter of a bakery in the small town of Fran. Her daily routine is to deliver freshly baked bread to the people of the town every morning. One day, a blonde young man named Arles comes to Cassis\'s shop. She is gradually drawn to him for his refreshing and gentle gaze. However, there is a reason why the young man has come to this town.\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(60777,'Francois CMs',30,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1258/147545.jpg','cm','2005-01-22','finished_airing','Animated commercials for the Japanese bread and confectionary business Francois.'),(60778,'Fushigi no Kuni de Alice to: Dive in Wonderland',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1807/148457.webp','movie','2025-08-29','not_yet_aired',''),(60780,'Kingyo no Ohirune',425,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1736/147552.webp','movie','2023','finished_airing','Three ironic stories about goldfish.\n\n(Source: International Students Creative Award)'),(60781,'Alma-chan wa Kazoku ni Naritai',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1256/149306.webp','tv','2025','not_yet_aired','Alma, an autonomous self-learning robot with advanced combat capabilities, was created by two genius scientists, Enji Kamisato and Suzume Yobane, who developed Alma\'s artificial intelligence and robotics, respectively. After being mocked by their former acquaintances, the duo have worked together in order to show the world their true talents. But even though they cooperate in their work, the two scientists cannot seem to get along in their personal lives.\n\nHowever, despite their constant bickering, Enji and Suzume develop a glint of mutual affection—feelings that do not go unnoticed by their adorable robotic creation. Now curious, Alma starts to question the true nature of her creators\' relationship. As she learns more about humanity from those around her, Alma\'s bonds with Enji and Suzume only grow stronger.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(60782,'Itsuka no Watashi Yori',120,64.9,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1357/147584.jpg','cm','2025-01-17','finished_airing','A short directed by loundraw. Made as a collaboration between Z-Kai Group, loundraw, and FLAT STUDIO.\n'),(60783,'Verbara Mini!',14,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1530/147585.jpg','pv','2025-01-31','finished_airing','Oskar, Marie Antoinette, Andre, Fersen and others, portrayed as mini characters, visit a modern movie theater! It\'s all new to them and they are all in turmoil...?\n\n(Source: verbara-movie Youtube)'),(60784,'Yuugao',0,69.9,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1045/149945.webp','ova','2025-03-28','currently_airing','Tomoe, a strict and disciplined teacher, starts every working day with a genuine desire to teach students to be smart. Soon, she was respected and appreciated in the educational institution. It would seem that everything will continue like this, but lately, in the moonlight, the woman has been troubled by strange dreams. It started to make it difficult to focus on work, especially if there were male students nearby.'),(60787,'Xingchen Bian 6th Season',1500,74.1,28,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1662/150035.jpg','ona','2025-01-30','currently_airing','Sixth season of Xingchen Bian.'),(60790,'Luffy, Law',317,64.4,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1629/147603.jpg','movie','2025-01-19','finished_airing','It is the Great Age of Pirates. This is an unknown event that took place after the battle of Wano Country.\n\n(Source: YouTube, translated)'),(60794,'Wo Xiu Xianjie De Gongdi',420,0,40,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1352/147610.jpg','ona','2024-07-28','finished_airing',''),(60797,'Douzhan Tianxia',600,0,48,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1190/150133.webp','ona','2025-01-21','currently_airing','The mysterious young man Dafeng rescued Li Huamei, who was seriously ill after being plotted against. Dafeng wanted to go to Kyoto to find his senior sister and happened to be on the same road with Li Huamei. On the way, Li Huamei was shocked to find that her senior sister was the Queen Qin Zhao, and the Queen repeatedly sent assassins to kill her. In order to find out the reason, Dafeng and Li Huamei entrusted their lives to each other and fought against the enemy together. Disputes arose in the rivers and lakes, and the court struggles became more intense. The two were unknowingly involved in a treacherous conspiracy, and Dafeng was the key to solving all the mysteries...'),(60799,'Discover Paldea',74,60.7,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1860/147638.jpg','ona','2025-01-17','finished_airing','The shorts center on four Paldean Trainers as well as their Pokemon, being Pikachu, Paldean Wooper, Milotic and Hydrapple, taking part in activities from Pokemon Scarlet and Violet.\n\n(Source: Bulbapedia)'),(60800,'Who Done It?',170,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1378/147639.jpg','movie','1984','finished_airing',''),(60801,'Hiru no Yume',120,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1975/147640.webp','movie','1984','finished_airing',''),(60804,'Juroring Dongmultanjeong Geukjangpan',4459,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1986/147642.webp','movie','2014-12-18','finished_airing',''),(60805,'Amedama',1260,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1957/147647.jpg','movie','2024-03-02','finished_airing','The other kids at the park never ask Dong-Dong to play. That\'s ok. He\'s fine just playing marbles on his own. One day, he buys a bag of colorful candies instead of new marbles. The first time he pops one of them into his mouth, his old sofa starts talking to him! The two share an unexpected conversation before the sweet melts away. As it happens, the people, animals, and objects in Dong-Dong\'s life have a lot to say.\n\n(Source: Official Site)'),(60807,'Fukusuke (1984)',240,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1454/147650.jpg','movie','1984','finished_airing',''),(60808,'Profiles',180,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1552/147651.webp','movie','1985','finished_airing',''),(60809,'Yoru Neko',538,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1182/147653.jpg','movie','2023','finished_airing','In the mysterious realm of the Cat Planet, cats of diverse forms roam, and amidst them prowls a lonely Fire Cat. A twist of fate unfolds when a Water Cat materializes one day, sparking a fleeting camaraderie that tragically results in the inadvertent vaporization of the Water Cat by the heat of flames. The crestfallen Fire Cat, therefore, endeavors to reclaim the essence of the Water Cat and embarks on a brave journey…\n\n(Source: Tokyo Anime Award Festival)'),(60810,'Majutsushi Kunon wa Mieteiru',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1138/148408.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','Born blind, Kunon aims to be the first person to use water magic to create new eyes for himself. After five months of study, he has already surpassed his teacher, and continues to grow his talents. Not only can his magic help him sense color, but he can also use it to make handy items and even conjure a whole cat! Word of his skills and ingenuity soon reach the court and earn him a spot as disciple to the most powerful magician in the land. But is his ultimate goal even attainable?\n\n(Source: Yen Press)'),(60814,'Prime Time',120,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1566/147666.jpg','movie','1985','finished_airing',''),(60815,'Blue Lament',180,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1893/147667.jpg','movie','1986','finished_airing',''),(60816,'Vision',438,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1095/147668.webp','movie','2023','finished_airing','Eyes are magical spheres that make up dreams and retain memories. In our eyes, the visions of the within and of the beyond overlap. New worlds come to be when our gazes meet.\n\n(Source: Geidai Animation)'),(60818,'Fengwu Yao Chu',960,0,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1068/147695.jpg','ona','2025-01-25','finished_airing','The Foodie Universe based on the Classic of 