finished_airing',''),(60942,'Lion no Koushin',120,0,1,'','movie','1996','finished_airing',''),(60943,'Enkan no Suigyo',80,0,1,'','movie','1998','finished_airing',''),(60946,'Kairyuu to Yuubinyasan',845,75.9,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1884/148063.webp','ona','2025-02-27','finished_airing','Hana, a young girl from the Paldea region who admires the postman Dragonite and aspires to become an ace mail carrier, one day receives a letter with no address. Determined to find the sender, she embarks on a frantic search alongside her partner, Hogator. After running around town, she finally tracks down the sender—a boy named Rio. Upon hearing his story, Hana learns that Rio wrote the letter to celebrate his father\'s birthday, who is stationed alone in the Kanto region. However, the day of his father\'s birthday has already arrived...\n\n(Source: Official YouTube, translated)'),(60947,'Nmeneko',60,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1989/149978.jpg','tv','2025-04-04','currently_airing','Follows the funny and amusing daily lives of two cats who want to live life doing only fun things.\n\n(Source: ANN)'),(60948,'Mezametara Saikyou Soubi to Uchuusenmochi Datta node, Ikkodate Mezashite Youhei toshite Jiyuu ni Ikitai',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1287/147886.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Sato Takahiro was an ordinary office worker and hobbyist gamer until the day he woke up on a spaceship–one that strangely resembled a craft from a favorite space-shooter game. With a decked-out ship, a crew full of babes, and a fantastic universe to explore, he\'s going to make the most of his good luck and create the life he\'s always dreamed of!\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)'),(60951,'Kizetsu Yuusha to Ansatsu Hime',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1393/147895.webp','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Hero Toto possesses great skills, but his extreme shyness has left him unable to form a party, causing him to remain stuck in the town where his journey began.\n\nOne day, he is suddenly invited to join a party by three beautiful women—Ciel, Anemone, and Gore. Overjoyed at finally setting off on an adventure, Toto is filled with excitement... but little does he know, these women are dead set on killing him!\n\nA deathly harem romcom unfolds as the socially anxious hero, who faints from mere flustered excitement around women, finds himself the target of three deadly companions, each with their own reasons for wanting him gone!\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(60952,'Mizu no Enkan',140,0,1,'','movie','1999','finished_airing',''),(60953,'Mizu no Enkan (2003)',140,0,1,'','movie','2003','finished_airing',''),(60955,'Zegapain: 2013-ka Ending 8.3.1',314,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1999/147901.webp','special','2013-08-31','finished_airing','A special screened on Sunrise Festival 2013 Hoshisai. Also included in the Zegapain 10th Anniversary BD-Box on the 5th disc.'),(60962,'Sore Ike! Anpanman: Chapon no Hero!',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1706/148366.jpg','movie','2025-06-27','not_yet_aired','Centers on Chapon, a mysterious boy who falls from the sky without any knowledge of where he came from. Staying with Anpanman, he one day helps someone out and gets to know the joy of making someone smile, and dreams of becoming a hero like Anpanman. But when Baikinman arrives, and reveals the secret of Chapon\'s origins, Chapon must figure out if his origins or his dreams define who he is.\n\n(Source: ANN)'),(60966,'Chi Ji Da Zuozhan 4th Season',340,0,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1825/147927.webp','ona','2021-07-03','finished_airing',''),(60969,'Taiyou yori mo Mabushii Hoshi',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1971/149410.jpg','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','Sae and Koki have been friends since childhood. One fateful day at the end of middle school, she has a revelation: Koki has grown up! Now they\'re in high school, and she has another revelation: she has feelings for Koki! But Sae isn\'t the only girl who does... The question is, who does Koki have feelings for?!\n\n(Source: VIZ Media)'),(60970,'Do/Ou x Kinnikuman CM',25,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1877/147932.webp','cm','2023-06-28','finished_airing','A commercial for an official collaboration between De/Ou soap and the anime/manga series Kinnikuman.'),(60972,'Yamazaki Kaidou',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1848/147948.jpg','movie','1926','finished_airing',''),(60973,'Sankaku no Dance',60,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1664/147951.webp','movie','2023','finished_airing','The first animation I made in 1983 was an 8mm film with a triangle as the main focus. 40 years have passed since then. What can we do by going back to the basics in this digital age?\n\n(Source: Into Animation 8)'),(60979,'Secret Jouju: Byeol-ui Boseog',720,0,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1407/147962.jpg','ona','2023-11-03','finished_airing','Jouju is tasked with finding the hidden Joubijou, balancing good and evil in the celestial world with her dear friends Cindy, Stella, and the mysterious \'Rosa\'. While getting back Joubijou from Lucy \'the treasure hunter\', Jouju protects her family and friends from witches and navigates through a magical journey in order to become a true guardian of stars.\n\n(Source: Prime Video)'),(60980,'Kuro Gal à la Carte',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1332/150107.jpg','ova','2025-06-06','not_yet_aired',''),(60983,'Kagaku x Bouken Survival! 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1898/148525.jpg','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','Second season of Kagaku x Bouken Survival!.'),(60984,'Sorairo Utility x Birdie Wing: Golf Girls\' Story Mini Anime',120,60.099999999999994,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1299/147965.jpg','ona','2025-02-12','finished_airing',''),(60985,'Na Nian Na Tu Naxie Shi Er 7th Season',420,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1181/