fairies were recognized by the Radiant Stars and made the new Guardians of the Radiant Stars.\n\nThey passed the trial awakening the power of the Radiant Stars, and forged friendship with Aiden and Connie as well. Together they fought against Nightfall, but they didn\'t expect to fall into his trap, accidentally lifting the seal and releasing him. The Fantasy Night Realm is about to face a greater crisis...\n\n(Source: Balala the Fairies Wiki)'),(60998,'Caihong Huwei Dui',780,0,26,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1338/147986.jpg','ona','2024-10-25','finished_airing','The Rainbow Crew consists of four girls; Rainbow, the captain, a smart and kind rabbit, Tali, a brave horse, Nelly, a gentle sheep and Aurora, a fiery hamster. Together they resolve crises in their town by turning negativity into positivity.\n\n(Source: Meta Media)'),(61000,'Bunbuku Chagama (1932)',360,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1471/147993.webp','movie','1932','finished_airing','An adaptation of Bunbuku Chagama by Ikuo Ooishi.'),(61004,'Shita-kiri Suzume (1928)',836,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1999/148000.webp','movie','1928','finished_airing','An adaptation of Shita-kiri Suzume by Kiichirou Kanai and Sanae Yamamoto.'),(61006,'Bocchi the Rock! 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1142/148003.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Bocchi the Rock!.'),(61012,'Toaru Kagaku no Railgun 4th Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1261/148015.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','Fourth season of  Toaru Kagaku no Railgun.'),(61013,'Replica datte, Koi wo Suru.',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1185/148016.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','On days when Sunao is sick, or not feeling like going to school, she is called to take her place. She was born to this world when Sunao wished to have a substitute. No one knows that she exists, but she tries to do her best for Sunao whenever she is called. One day she talks with Sanada, one of her classmates. They become friends, but soon he notices that she is different from the original Sunao...he was the first one who did. She tells him to talk with her only when she has her hair half-up. Sanada does like she told him, and they enjoy their time together. As they become closer, she realizes that she has special feelings toward Sanada. But she doesn\'t know what will happen to her...if she, a replica, falls in love.\n\n(Source: Kadokawa)'),(61014,'Toaru Anbu no Item',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1333/148019.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','This is a story of four girls living in the \"Dark Side\" of Academy City.\n\nIn Academy City where \"ESP\" has been recognized as a general science. Behind the peace, there is a Dark Side organization that undertakes missions that cannot be made public.\n\n\"ITEM\" is an elite unit consisting of four girls. Takitsubo Rikou is able to read and track the AIM fields emitted by those with abilities. Frenda Seivelun, who excels in combat using explosives and traps.\n\nKinuhata Saiai, who can manipulate nitrogen at will and plays a defensive role. And one of the 7 Espers that Academy City is proud of: Mugino Shizuri. They live freely in the darkness of the Academy City, and quietly set their sights on their target...!\n\nThis is a story of encounter, friendship, and darkness that eventually leads to a terrible incident!\n\n(Source: Kadokawa, translated)'),(61015,'Himekishi-sama no Himo',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1870/148020.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','The Dungeon City is a wicked place filled with crime, debauchery, and death. Its one shining light is Arwin, the beautiful Crimson Princess Knight. She and her brave party of adventurers descend into the dungeon at the city\'s center, seeking a legendary treasure with the power to rebuild the princess\'s fallen kingdom. Many yearn to be by her side, but that spot is already taken by Matthew, a man despised by all in town as a cowardly weakling. Everyone thinks he is scum who just spends her hard-earned money on booze, women, and gambling. No one in the city—not even the princess knight— knows what Matthew is truly capable of.\n\n(Source: Yen Press)'),(61016,'Alps no Roujin Heidi no Ojii-san',60,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1042/148095.webp','ona','2024-12-18','finished_airing','Alm-Onji is the protagonist as he and Heidi act like a comedy duo and talk in a Kansai dialect.\n\n(Source: ANN)'),(61017,'Yesu',4920,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1511/148022.jpg','movie','1998-02-14','finished_airing','Covers the life of Jesus\' birth to resurrection and ascension, centered on the Gospels.\n\n(Source: KMDb)'),(61020,'Wanghu Esther',4080,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1988/148025.jpg','movie','1996-07-20','finished_airing','2,500 years ago, the Jewish people were under the rule of the powerful Medo-Persia. Many Jews settled in this country and lived freely believing in their God, Jehovah, with the permission of King Ahasuerus. Mordecai, a virtuous Jew who worked at the palace gate, had a pretty cousin named Esther who had lost her parents at an early age. Esther, who had a gentle and wise personality, later became the queen of the great empire of Medo-Persia. Meanwhile, Haman, who had a cruel personality, plotted with the king that Mordecai was disobeying the king\'s law and committing anti-national acts, and the king, enraged, ordered all the Jews to be killed. Queen Esther risked her life to save her people.\n\n(Source: KMDb)'),(61023,'Hitozuma no Kuchibiru wa Kan Chuuhai no Aji ga Shite',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1961/149183.webp','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Tsuyoshi, a 22-year-old third-year university student, spends his days juggling classes and his food delivery job, with a can of strong chuuhai always within reach. Living alone in a small apartment, his mundane routine takes an unexpected turn when he finds himself entangled with Yui Koriyama, a married woman he has admired since childhood. What begins as an innocent connection soon escalates into something far more intimate, blurring the lines between longing, desire, and morality.\n\nSet against a backdrop of quiet nights and stolen moments, this risqué yet comedic tale explores the thrill and complications of an illicit romance—where every encounter is both intoxicating and dangerous.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(61026,'Ansatsusha de Aru Ore no Status ga Yuusha yori mo Akiraka ni Tsuyoi no da ga',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1029/148034.webp','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','Oda Akira is the kind of guy who people forget is even there. His unassuming nature pays off, though, when his entire class is swept away to a fantasy world, and he slips easily into his new role as a silent assassin. Between his suspiciously high starting stats and too many details that don\'t fit, Akira is sure something is wrong. But digging into royal secrets is a dangerous game, and when Akira uncovers an evil scheme, he also makes a powerful enemy—the very king who brought him to this world! With the help of the elven spirit medium Amelia, can he find the power to set things right, and get his revenge?\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)'),(61029,'Arifureta Shokugyou de Sekai Saikyou 3rd Season Picture Drama',90,62.1,16,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1074/148037.jpg','ona','2024-10-15','finished_airing','An online motion graphic spin-off series that provides a comedic interpretation of events that have occurred in conjunction with the Anime. These episodes were originally posted on the official Twitter page on a weekly basis that coincided with the debut of each of the anime\'s episodes, and were later included in the Blu-ray BOX sets. The voice cast for the Picture Dramas is the same as the Anime cast.\n\n(Source: Arifureta Wiki)'),(61030,'Xiang Huo Er Sheng: Xiaofang Xiao Juchang',108,0,6,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1890/148042.jpg','ona','2025-01-17','finished_airing',''),(61031,'Han Seisaku Sakuhin',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1852/148043.jpg','movie','1978','finished_airing',''),(61032,'In Dark Trees',140,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1954/148044.jpg','movie','1978','finished_airing',''),(61035,'Kininatteru Hito ga Otoko ja Nakatta',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1896/148061.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','The black-clad boy that Aya Oosawa likes is perfect: he is effortlessly nonchalant, has a sharp sense of style, and listens to the best music. Ever since the trendy Aya stumbled upon a small CD store to enjoy the rock classics her friends are not familiar with, the mysterious employee behind the counter has been on her mind. Meanwhile, the quiet and aloof Mitsuki Koga listens to her popular classmate Aya rave about her crush, tormented by a nagging thought: how to tell Aya that the guy she is interested in is not a guy at all!\n\nIn reality, when Mitsuki sheds her plain high school uniform, she is the one manning the counter at her uncle Joe\'s CD shop. She wrestles with how to reveal her identity, but flirting with the stunning and clueless Aya is just too tempting. As music becomes their shared passion, it seems that Aya\'s feelings will remain unchanged—even when Mitsuki\'s secret comes to light.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(61038,'Galaxy Apartment☆Cosmo Hills',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1824/148064.webp','movie','2025-03-09','finished_airing',''),(61039,'Hoshi no Kodomo to Hajimari no Ki',540,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1421/148065.jpg','movie','2025-03-09','finished_airing',''),(61040,'Trust (Movie)',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1701/148066.jpg','movie','2025-03-09','finished_airing',''),(61041,'Dive In!',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1104/148067.jpg','movie','2025-03-09','finished_airing',''),(61042,'Zao Wang 