—and discovers they have common interests, the obvious assumption is that nothing good can come of it. But can it be that one burgeoning bromance will shake up a 300-year grudge?\n\nWho will win the struggle for real ultimate power?\n\n(Source: Kodansha USA)'),(61068,'Berizanna',160,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1091/148117.jpg','movie','1981','finished_airing',''),(61069,'Sei Elmo no Hi',130,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1215/148118.jpg','movie','1985','finished_airing',''),(61072,'Shuumatsu Touring',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1484/150257.webp','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','All alone after the end of days, two girls bike through the empty ruins of Japan—and they\'re not about to let the collapse of civilization get in the way of sightseeing! Even when the world ends, their journey goes on.\n\n(Source: Yen Press)'),(61073,'Utahime Dream',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1644/148123.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired',''),(61074,'Ikari no Daichi',5520,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1039/148207.jpg','ova','1987','finished_airing','This is a full-fledged 90-minute documentary about environmentalism, consumerism, and how Japanese agriculture has been gradually dying out since the 1950s in favor of Western consumer culture and imposed imports. Everything is based on documents, as befits a scientific work.'),(61075,'Never Give Up',2400,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1534/148208.jpg','ova','','finished_airing','An educational animation about raising awareness of human rights. A boy who grew up in a burakumin neighborhood vows to live a positive life, and changes the hearts of those around him. '),(61077,'Dragon Heart: Reikai Tanbouki',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1103/148127.jpg','movie','2025-05-23','finished_airing','Ryusuke is a junior high school student living in Tokyo. During his summer vacation, he visits Tokushima and reunites with his teenage cousin, Tomomi. Ryusuke and Tomomi go outing to the Anabuki River where they get swept away by the rushing current.\n\nAs they sink to the bottom of the river, a dragon appears, rescues them, and takes them to a mysterious old man. The old man tells Ryusuke and Tomomi that they are already dead, but that he can send them back to life if they explore the spirit world and find their mission in life. Although perplexed with the situation, Ryusuke and Tomomi decide to begin their journey to the spirit world. First, they arrive in a gloomy town that looks like it’s from the 1960’s. Soon after, they are assailed by terrible things one after another. They see fear-ridden rogues killing one another and doctors mutilating patients. People die and rise. They get killed and rise again. Ryusuke and Tomomi realize that they are in hell. But their journey doesn’t end there. The adventure beyond this world continues into the unknown. Will they be able to find their mission in life?\n\n(Source: dragonheart-movie.com)'),(61084,'Hikuidori: Ushuu Boro Tobi-gumi',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1887/148147.webp','tv','2026-01','not_yet_aired',''),(61090,'Zui Qiang Shengji',630,0,40,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1333/148162.jpg','ona','2025-02-26','currently_airing','Zhao Fang brought the game system to another world and found himself a useless young master with no martial arts skills, and only a maid by his side. Faced with difficulties, Zhao Fang felt that it was time to show himself. Zhao Fang, who has extensive game experience, successfully found the system BUG, ​​worked hard to level up, went through hardships, entered countless secret realms, and completed various tasks arranged by the system.\n\n(Source: Tencent, Google translated)'),(61092,'Himitsu no AiPri: Ring-hen',1460,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1799/148164.jpg','tv','2025-04-06','currently_airing','Second season of Himitsu no AiPri.'),(61097,'Hitori no Yoru to Sekiryoku',33,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1266/148174.jpg','cm','2025-02-06','finished_airing','\"I feel relieved when the soup is delicious.\"'),(61098,'Zubaaan Kenkyuukai Katsudou Kiroku',38,0,3,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1600/148198.jpg','cm','2025-01-16','finished_airing','I tried my first outdoor ASMR shooting under the cold weather while eating \"ZUBAAAN!\"\n\n(Source: Official YouTube, translated)'),(61099,'Sekai Qtta',41,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1875/148181.jpg','cm','2024-11-18','finished_airing','If QTTA existed in another world...\n'),(61103,'Hito no Kurashi no Hyakuman-nen: Manimani March',1080,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1380/148188.webp','movie','1968-12-19','finished_airing','In ancient times, humans caught prey only when needed, but eventually people found it more convenient to store their prey. As the time went on, bartering evolved into the birth of currency.\n\n(Source: Wikipedia, translated)'),(61107,'Ganzo! Bandori-chan',0,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1992/150237.jpg','unknown','2025-10','not_yet_aired','New mini Anime series for BanG Dream!.'),(61108,'Mumei no Jinsei',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1624/148558.jpg','movie','2025-05-16','finished_airing','A lonely bullied boy who follows in his father\'s footsteps and aims to become an idol.'),(61111,'Fukuji to Yumihiko: Umi wo Watatte Kita Ushikai Shounen',1200,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1189/148210.jpg','movie','1990','finished_airing','The culture of using milk, along with Buddhism, was brought to Japan by people who crossed the sea from China and the Korean Peninsula. Set in Tenpyoi period Japan, this animated film follows the story of how a friendship blossoms between Fukuji, a boy from a village that raises cows that crossed the sea, and Yumihiko, a boy from a Japanese village that grows rice, after their village is attacked by bandits, and how this leads to cooperation and exchange between people of different cultures.\n\n(Source: Sakura Motion Pictures Co., translated)'),(61112,'Gavv-tto Anime! Sweety Days: Okashi na Nichijou',300,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1967/148211.jpg','ona','2025-03-02','currently_airing','Kamen Rider Gavv shorts released on the Toei Tokusatsu Fan Club (TTFC) app.'),(61114,'Beastars Final Season Part 2',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1393/148219.webp','ona','','not_yet_aired','Second part of Beastars Final Season.'),(61115,'Gochuumon wa Usagi desu ka? (Shinsaku Anime)',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1393/148220.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','A new anime project for Gochuumon wa Usagi desu ka?.'),(61119,'Duel Masters LOST: Boukyaku no Taiyou',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1250/148232.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Sequel to Duel Masters LOST: Gekka no Shinigami.'),(61120,'King of Prism: Your Endless Call - Mi~nna Kirameki! Prism☆Tours',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1641/149435.jpg','movie','2025-06-27','not_yet_aired','New King of Prism film.'),(61122,'Okashina Okashina Hoshi no Kuni',1200,0,1,'','ova','1968','finished_airing','It\'s the 21st century, an era when free space travel is possible. A spaceship for school trips is traveling in space, when suddenly, it is surrounded by unidentified flying objects and taken to an unknown planet.\n\n(Source: Wikipedia, translated)'),(61125,'Haikyuu!! Bakemono-tachi no Iku Tokoro',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1540/148249.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Short Anime depicting the match between Fukuroudani Academy and Mujinazaka High School.'),(61126,'Kimi ga Shinu made Koi wo Shitai',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1051/148250.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','The death of Sheena Totsuki\'s roommate is casually announced at the start of class, and the day carries on as usual. In an orphanage that raises children as soldiers, death is nothing new to the residents. With their home country embroiled in a war that has dragged on for too many years and shows no signs of stopping, the institution\'s children are sent off to die in battle every day. In contrast to the other orphans, Sheena is deeply disturbed by the ongoing conflict and wishes for it to end.\n\nOn the night of her roommate\'s death, Sheena met a blood-covered girl who remained jubilant despite the condition she was in. The next day, the girl appears as a new student in Sheena\'s class and introduces herself as Mimi Kagari. Initially thought to be a school myth, Mimi is said to be the secret weapon of the orphanage—a girl who cannot die. Assigned as Sheena\'s new roommate, Mimi hopes to get along with her and get accustomed to school life.\n\nHowever, unsettled by Mimi\'s carefree attitude toward the war, Sheena struggles to accept the world they live in, all while their unusual friendship flourishes amid the bleak situation.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(61128,'Yuusha Party wo Oidasareta Kiyoubinbou',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1857/148252.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','\"Orn Doula, today will be your last day in the party.\"\n\nOrn, once a skilled Swordsman, had adapted to the role of Enchanter to fill a crucial gap in the Hero Party. However, one day, the party leader abruptly dismisses him, claiming his skills are lacking. Brander a \"weakling\" and a \"jack of all trades, master of none,\" by his former comrades, Orn is cast out without a second thought.\n\nDetermined to start anew, he returns to adventuring—this time as a Swordsman, the role he originally excelled in. But his time as an Enchanter was far from wasted. The experience, knowledge, and countless original spells he developed in the Hero Party have forged him into a warrior unlike any other. Now, armed with an unconventional set of skills, Orn is ready to carve his own path—one that will prove his true strength to the world.\n\n(Source: MAL News)\n\n'),(61130,'Ruri Dragon PV',113,71.9,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1997/148256.webp','pv','2025-03-03','finished_airing','Promotional video in collaboration with ZUTOMAYO and coalowl to commemorate the release of the third manga volume.'),(61134,'Kimi ga Shinu made Koi wo Shitai Pilot',118,75.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1183/148262.webp','pv','2025-03-02','finished_airing','Pilot video for Kimi ga Shinu made Koi wo Shitai.'),(61135,'Giant Ojousama',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1639/148263.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Oriko Fujidou, the daughter of the powerful Fujidou conglomerate—the world\'s leading force in vending machine development and distribution—was gifted an entire city by her father at the age of four. Over the past ten years, she has devoted herself to its growth and prosperity.\n\nHowever, the city\'s peaceful days come to an abrupt end when an enormous, unidentified invader attacks. In a desperate attempt to fight back, her loyal butler, Dr. Sebastian gives Oriko a newly developed energy drink. The moment she drinks it, her body grows to a towering size, surpassing even skyscrapers. Though struggling at first, she ultimately manages to repel the invader.\n\nBut the attacks don\'t stop. Each time a new threat emerges, Oriko transforms into a giant once more, standing to protect the city she has nurtured with her own hands.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(61139,'As One',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1061/148282.jpg','movie','2025-08-22','not_yet_aired','The movie follows You, a high school student in modern-day Japan who dreams of becoming a musician but struggles with family opposition and conflicts within his band. One day, while walking through Shibuya, he hears a desperate voice calling for help, and a blinding white light engulfs him.\n\nMeanwhile, far across the cosmos, the celestial body Meguriboshi is on the brink of war over the energy source known as \"Hoshichi\" (Star Blood). Just as a ceasefire is about to be negotiated between the warring nations, a massive orbital debris field descends, threatening disaster. Laco, a young mechanic, rushes to aid the planet\'s defense force but finds herself in grave danger. As she falls into unconsciousness, her mind connects with You\'s, marking the beginning of their intertwined fates.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(61140,'Gensou Suikoden',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1971/148283.jpg','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Anime adaptation of the game Gensou Suikoden II.'),(61142,'Sawaranaide Kotesashi-kun',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1328/148287.webp','tv','2025','not_yet_aired','Kouyou Kotesashi, possesses exceptional massage skills and dreams of becoming a sports doctor. To secure a scholarship to medical school, he enrolls at Seiwa University Affiliated High School, a powerhouse in athletics.\n\nComing from a poor family, Kouyou takes up a live-in job at the school\'s dormitory to cover his expenses. However, he soon finds himself surrounded by a group of highly talented yet quirky female athletes. His role? Managing the dorm while also tending to their physical and mental well-being.\n\nWith a mix of intense training, close-quarters dorm life, and massage therapy, an unpredictable and daring new chapter begins!\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(61146,'Tamaranai no wa Koi nano ka',829,71.10000000000001,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1055/148349.webp','tv_special','2025-04-06','finished_airing','Misuzu was branded a delinquent when a small incident left him isolated. But one day, he sees the top student, Kitahara, get surrounded by bullies and decides to help him out. That sparked Kitahara\'s interest in the lonely boy, but Misuzu pushes Kitahara away. \"If you get involved with me, you\'ll get ostracized by everyone else too.\" But it won\'t take long for Misuzu\'s resolve to falter...\n\n(Source: Kodansha USA)'),(61149,'Boku no Hero Academia Original Eiga Manner Kouza',43,58.8,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1141/148311.jpg','movie','2024-04-12','finished_airing','It features comical interactions that make use of the usual characters, such as Bakugou getting angry over a phone call during the screening between the current No.1 hero Endeavor and his son Shouto, and Deku getting flustered when Bakugou starts eating snacks!\n\n(Source: Toho Official Website)'),(61150,'Onmyou Kaiten Re:Birth',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1100/148312.jpg','tv','2025-07-03','not_yet_aired','Takeru Narihira is a lone wolf delinquent who spends his days getting into fights, avoiding friendships, and being captivated by a mysterious girl named Tsukimiya—someone he\'s only ever seen in his dreams.\n\nOne day, a sudden accident sends him tumbling off a cliff. When he regains consciousness, he finds himself in Denji Heian-kyou, a futuristic version of the ancient capital, where advanced technology and mysticism coexist. This world is under the protection of the legendary onmyouji, Abe no Seimei—and to Takeru\'s shock, Tsukimiya is real and living in this very place.\n\nJust as he begins to revel in this fated encounter, a deadly black mist known as Yamikaoru descends, bringing forth monstrous beings called Oni. In the chaos, both he and Tsukimiya are killed—only for Takeru to awaken once again in Denji Heian-kyou.\n\nRealizing he has somehow slipped through time, Takeru resolves to defy fate. To protect Tsukimiya from her doomed future, he turns to Abe no Seimei to train in the art of onmyou-jutsu. Now, as an onmyouji himself, he must fight to rewrite destiny and uncover the truth behind this strange new world.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(61151,'Let\'s Roll, Cinnamoroll!',220,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1550/148313.jpg','ona','2025-03-06','finished_airing','A new stop motion animation about Cinnamoroll and his friends\' daily life in Shukuru Town.'),(61153,'Tensei shita Daiseijo wa, Seijo de Aru Koto wo Hitakakusu',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1667/148703.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Fia always dreamed of becoming a knight. Born into a family of knights, she\'s the least talented among them, but she still clutches to her hope and trains with everything she has. When the day comes for her to slay a small demon and prove her worth, she ends up face to face with a dragon instead! A deadly injury makes her life flash before her eyes... and she suddenly remembers her former life, when she was a powerful Saint in a bygone era who defeated the Demon King. That life ended in pain because of who she was, making her fear ever becoming a Saint again. Now that the magic from her previous life has been rekindled, she may become a more powerful knight than she ever dreamed–if only she can survive long enough!\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)'),(61154,'Otome Game no Hametsu Flag shika Nai Akuyaku Reijou ni Tensei shiteshimatta... Movie Honpen Mae Special Eizou',168,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1209/148344.jpg','ona','2023-11-15','finished_airing','In the special pre-movie footage released, we see Bullish Katarina, Weak Katarina, Happy Katarina, and Chairman Katarina, who often hold meetings in Katarina\'s head in the TV series, quickly heading to the movie theater. The girls arrived on time for the screening, grabbed some popcorn, put their cell phones and smartphones on silent mode, and were all set to watch the movie, when a serious Katarina appeared on the screen and said, \"Your seats are over here!!\" Of course, it was revealed that the meeting will continue to take place in Katarina\'s head in this movie version as well.\n\n(Source: Official Website)'),(61156,'The iDOLM@STER Million Live! OVA',1800,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1053/148346.webp','ova','','not_yet_aired','OVA for The iDOLM@STER Million Live!'),(61159,'Toujima Tanzaburou wa Kamen Rider ni Naritai',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1933/148739.webp','tv','2025','not_yet_aired','Toujima Tanzaburou has spent his entire life chasing a dream: to become Kamen Rider. Now, at 40, reality has nearly caught up with him, and he\'s on the verge of letting go of his childhood fantasy.\n\nThat is, until he gets caught up in a crime wave led by the \"Fake Shocker\" gang—turning his long-time dream into something far more dangerous.\n\nWhat starts as a pretend hero\'s journey quickly becomes something real. The ultimate Kamen Rider fantasy is about to begin!\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(61162,'Chinpui: Eri-sama no Good Luck',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1732/149936.jpg','movie','2025-05-21','finished_airing','Movie shown at the Fujiko F. Museum in Kawasaki, Kanagawa to celebrate the 40th anniversary of the franchise.'),(61164,'Inshoku Ou Demar',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1670/148371.jpg','ova','2025-05-30','not_yet_aired',''),(61165,'Amai Ijiwaru',0,62.5,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1830/148384.webp','ova','2025-04-25','currently_airing',''),(61166,'Akogare no Onna Joushi ga, Aibeya Shucchou no Tonari no Bed de Zetsurin Otoko ni Netorarete Iru',900,59.5,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1449/149995.jpg','ova','2025-04-04','currently_airing',''),(61167,'Fate/Grand Order: Fujimaru Ritsuka wa Wakaranai Season 2 Specials',120,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1544/148383.jpg','special','2025-03-19','finished_airing','Specials included in the BD/DVD release of Fate/Grand Order: Fujimaru Ritsuka wa Wakaranai Season 2.'),(61169,'Black Torch',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1238/148379.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Seventeen-year-old Jirou Azuma lives a quiet life with his grandfather, utilizing his supernatural ability to speak with animals to befriend and protect them. Both Jirou and his grandfather are descendants of a long-standing shinobi clan, training in combat to keep the art of battle alive within their family. Jirou\'s life is thrown into upheaval after rescuing a seemingly normal black cat, Ragou, only to discover that the cat is actually a mononoke—a demonic spirit that has long been at war with mankind. When a hostile mononoke comes looking for Ragou, Jirou uses his shinobi training to jump to the cat\'s defense, but immediately suffers a mortal wound.\n\nFaced with the decision of whether or not to devour Jirou\'s fading energy and restore himself to full power, Ragou instead chooses to give his remaining energy to Jirou. Reviving the boy, the transfer also grants him great supernatural powers that complement his own shinobi fighting style. This act is witnessed by Ryousuke Shiba, an officer in the Bureau of Espionage whose job revolves around dispatching aggressive mononoke. Shiba extends Jirou and his grandfather an offer: to join the Bureau\'s new squad, Black Torch, and help them battle powerful mononoke who seek to devour innocent people.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(61174,'Sozai Saishuka no Isekai Ryokouki',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1295/148396.webp','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','Takeru Kamishiro is a normal guy with an ordinary office job but finds himself summoned to another world. Takeru starts his new life in \"Madeus,\" a world with swords and magic, fully equipped with multiple skills! Not only does he have enhanced physical and amazing magic abilities, but also the power to \"search\" for valuable items. With the cheat skills he\'s been provided, Takeru starts his new adventure in the new isekai!!\n\n(Source: Alpha Manga)'),(61179,'Kimetsu no Yaiba x MLB',135,62.599999999999994,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1881/148416.webp','ona','2025-03-06','finished_airing','To commemorate the \"MLB Tokyo Series presented by Guggenheim,\" a collaboration movie between the anime Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba and MLB, has been released! This special video depicts one of the major themes of Demon Slayer: Kimetsu no Yaiba, \"the inheritance of feelings,\" from the perspective of Japanese baseball history. \n\n(Source: Official Website)'),(61180,'Pokemon to Ohayou Pokemon to Oyasumi',34,0,5,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1601/148420.webp','ona','2025-03-06','finished_airing','A series of vignettes depicting the morning and evening routines of various Pokemon.\n\n(Source: YouTube, translated)'),(61183,'Futsuu no Seikatsu',587,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1795/148428.jpg','movie','2025-02-16','finished_airing','Ordinary life repeats itself every day. The succession of moments that we repeat over and over again is never the same, and everything changes and wavers. The moment we touch something, our consciousness can go to a place that does not exist anywhere in the past, nor in the future. In an uncertain and fluctuating world, only the feeling of the body touching something, which exists only in this present reality, can be recognized as \"now\". That moment is lovely.\n\n(Source: Berlin International Film Festival)'),(61184,'Nohara Hiroshi: Hiru Meshi no Ryuugi',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1736/148429.webp','unknown','2025-10','not_yet_aired','This series follows Hiroshi Nohara\'s ultimate lunchtime philosophy, as he carefully selects and enjoys his midday meals within the constraints of a limited budget and break time.\n\nBut it\'s not just about savoring food—Hiroshi delves into cooking trivia, preparation methods, and the everyday dilemmas of a salaryman. From debating whether to treat his juniors to lunch, to finding quick meals between sales meetings, and even venting about his boss, the series is packed with relatable moments for working professionals.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(61186,'Kamiina Botan, Yoeru Sugata wa Yuri no Hana',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1706/148432.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Kamiina Botan is a 20-year-old college student. At the welcome party for the dorm she was assigned to, the dorm leader Ibuki gives her a highball to drink and she becomes tipsy, leading to her involvement with Ibuki from now on. A tipsy teasing girl\'s comedy.\n\n(Source: Baka-Updates)'),(61187,'Nezurite: Nezumi Oyako to Manabu Net Literacy',300,0,7,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1189/148442.jpg','tv','2023-11-01','finished_airing','A family of mice navigate the treacherous world of online information. The father can\'t help but believe information he finds on his smartphone, and each time, his daughter must step in and teach him about the traps of the internet and social media. This five-minute educational comedy helps viewers learn the essentials of internet literacy through a quirky and lovable father-daughter duo.\n\n(Source: NHK WORLD-JAPAN)'),(61192,'All You Need Is Kill',4920,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1538/148447.jpg','movie','','not_yet_aired','After an unidentified plant from outer space invasion, Rita finds herself trapped in a time loop, forced to relive the same day over and over again. With each loop, she learns. She fights. Her memories and experiences sharpen her skills, turning her into a formidable warrior. Yet, the endless cycle of death and solitude begins to wear her down. Then, she meets Keiji. \"I\'ve been repeating this day too,\" he says. Two lost souls, trapped in an endless war. Could their meeting change fate?\n\n(Source: Warner Bros. Japan)'),(61196,'Dead Account',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1250/148452.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Always ready for a fight! Destruction for destruction\'s sake! The online streamer Aoringo is a troll, making the worst of the worst of boundary-pushing flamebait content and raking in the revenue from the hate-watchers. You may think he\'s nothing more than a bottom feeder and a drain on society, but in reality, he\'s high school dropout Soji Enishiro, a caring older brother with a sweet tooth who loves nothing more than his little sister. His viral videos? Just a way to pay his sister\'s medical bills. And even if all of humanity hates him, he doesn\'t care, so long as his little sister gets better. But then, something very strange begins to happen...  Don\'t miss the debut of this modern-day occult exorcism battle manga!\n\n(Source: Kodansha USA)'),(61197,'Haai! Myakumyaku desu',120,0,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1553/148454.jpg','tv','2025-03-03','finished_airing','Myakumyaku is a mysterious creature born 3.5 billion years ago who wants to talk to someone about life and the future. And that\'s when he meets a lazy old man! Does the old man and Myakumyaku seem to get along? Or maybe not? A heartwarming comedy with conversations that will make you chuckle.\n\n(Source: NHK, translated)'),(61198,'Tabekko Doubutsu The Movie',5400,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1197/149638.jpg','movie','2025-05-01','finished_airing','It begins in Sweetsland: The home of the Dream Animals that has been taken over by cotton candy. The Tabekko Doubutsu find themselves being chased by the cotton candy army of King Gotton, who has banned all other sweets as part of his plan to take over the world. In their rush to escape, Pegasus ends up caught by the sticky soldiers!\n\nThe animals make sparkly eyes at Profession Macaron begging him to help, but their lack of battle strength paired with not knowing how to do anything but be cute to solve all of their problems, the stress of being on the run from King Gotton strains the bonds of their friendship.\n\nLion is discouraged by the seemingly impossible mission to rescue Pegasus, but some advice from Elephant gives him the courage he needs to act! But will it be enough to defeat King Gotton and his cotton candy army and save Pegasus — and the world?!\n\n(Source: Marza Animation Planet, edited)'),(61199,'Houkago Kitaku Biyori',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1523/148458.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Shun Satou was once a promising soccer player, but an injury shattered his dreams. Now a high school freshman, he drifts through his days without direction—until he meets Naoki Satou, a girl whose catchphrase is \"I just want to go home.\"\n\nNicknamed \"Naoki-chan,\" she\'s the eccentric leader of the so-called \"Hyper Going-Home Club,\" a group that doesn\'t officially exist but somehow ropes Shun into its mysterious activities. Though he never intended to join, he soon finds himself caught up in Naoki\'s unpredictable antics. As he spends more time with her, Shun begins to realize that his once-gray world is slowly regaining color.\n\nA lighthearted and heartfelt after-school rom-com about a girl who loves taking detours and a boy learning to move forward again.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(61200,'Shuumatsu no Walküre III',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1169/148460.webp','ona','','not_yet_aired','Third season of Shuumatsu no Walküre.'),(61202,'Mononoke Movie: Dai San Shou - Hebigami',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1379/148467.webp','movie','2026','not_yet_aired','Third installment of the Mononoke movie.'),(61203,'Kono Subarashii Sekai ni Shukufuku wo! (Zoku-hen)',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1276/148468.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Sequel to Kono Subarashii Sekai ni Shukufuku wo! 3.'),(61204,'Ochibi-san SMT Gekijou Manner CM',29,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1001/148469.webp','cm','2023-12-08','finished_airing','An Ochibi-san manner movie shown at Shochiku Multiplex Theaters from December 8, 2023 to March 28, 2024.'),(61206,'Oide yo Mahou Shoujo Mura (Fuhou Senkyo)',60,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1027/148475.jpg','tv','2025-04-04','currently_airing','The absurd gag manga follows a 43-year-old company employee named Tomakomai who becomes a magical girl, and with her friends she starts a new life at the \"Magical Girl Village,\" a village full of madness and despair.\n\n(Source: ANN)'),(61207,'Tensei shitara Dragon no Tamago datta',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1683/148476.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','Our hero wakes up one day in a brand new world…but his new life doesn’t come with fighting skills or magic powers, or even arms and legs! He’s reborn as a helpless egg, stuck in an unfamiliar forest surrounded by terrifying, hungry beasts. But eggs hatch, hatchlings grow up, and humble beginnings can lead to something great. He’ll do his best to become the strongest dragon ever, and no measly shell will get in his way!\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)'),(61209,'Kao ni Denai Kashiwada-san to Kao ni Deru Oota-kun',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1491/148479.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','With a smirk, Oota disregards his single-digit test scores and searches for a new source of amusement. He is soon captivated by his classmate Kashiwada, a mysterious student who consistently wears a blank face. Oota conspires to break her placid demeanor through scares and mischievous schemes, though his tactics always seem to backfire.\n\nOota is known as the class clown and is constantly disciplined by his teacher, who claims \"his face gives it away.\" To no fault of his own, he lacks control of his emotions and facial expressions. Kashiwada, on the other hand, seems perpetually emotionless and unreadable—no one knows what she is thinking!\n\nOota and Kashiwada are complete opposites, but that does not stop a unique relationship from developing between them. As they realize their feelings for each other, it raises an important question: do opposites really attract?\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(61211,'Mayonaka Heart Tune',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1884/148481.webp','tv','2026','not_yet_aired','When Arisu Yamabuki was all alone in bed at night, he was able to find solace in the voice of a radio host who went by \"Apollo.\" However, one day, she simply stopped broadcasting without any explanation. Years then passed, and Arisu is now a second-year high-schooler. He makes it his mission to search for Apollo, as there is something he wants to tell her. He doesn\'t know what she looks like, or even what her real name is, but he manages to get some leads on her in his school\'s broadcasting club. That\'s where he meets four girls who all dream to get a job where they can make full use of their voices! Just who is Apollo, and how will those four\'s dreams pan out?\n\n(Source: Kodansha USA)'),(61212,'Wo de Shixiong Tai Qiang Le',420,0,48,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1950/150139.jpg','ona','2025-04-01','currently_airing','Due to the cultivator Lu Shaoqing accidentally obtained the immortal treasure \"Spring and Autumn Ring\", he was listed as a world-destroying demon by the righteous immortal alliance and was hunted to death. He accidentally traveled through time and space back to a thousand years ago and shared a body with the enemy who killed him. In order to survive, Lu Shaoqing, who was deep in the enemy\'s nest, fought wits and courage with his body to snatch the body, and anticipated the enemy\'s moves to collect rare treasures. In the end, under his wits and courage, Lu Shaoqing became the first playboy of the righteous path who was hated by everyone! The secrets of the world of cultivation gradually surfaced. Lu Shaoqing counted with his fingers, and the history had already changed!\n\n(Source: Bilibili, Google translated)'),(61214,'AOTU Shijie Reborn',1500,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1919/148484.jpg','ona','2025-03-14','currently_airing','The Creator of Aotu World is a reckless God who created a universe full of inequality, but also gave the people a chance to change their destiny- Just participate in the \"Aotu Tournament\" and utilize the \"Special Abilities\" granted by the system. Pass rounds of cruel tests and strive for the ultimate victory! Now, the tournament, which has been suspended for 100 years, has been reopened.\n\nOur protagonist, King, decides to enter the tournament in order to change the fate of his planet, Dengru, and find his sister...'),(61216,'Nintama Rantarou Movie: Dokutake Ninja-tai Saikyou no Gunshi - Gekijou Manner CM',29,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1679/148486.webp','cm','2024-07-10','finished_airing','A Nintama Rantarou manner movie shown at SMT and Aeon Cinema starting July 19, 2024 in preparation for the screening of Nintama Rantarou Movie: Dokutake Ninja Tai Saikyou no Gunshi.'),(61217,'Yuusha no Kuzu',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1893/148487.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','By the mid-21st century, Tokyo\'s criminal underworld is ruled by Demon Lords—crime bosses who have undergone ether enhancement surgery, granting them terrifying superpowers. The only ones who can take them down are Heroes, bounty hunters who boost their own ether powers using the drug E3 (E-Three). With legalized killing as part of the job, being a Hero is less about justice and more about survival.\n\nYashiro, known as the Reaper, is one such Hero—an independent enforcer who works alone. That is, until Jougamine, a high school girl and self-proclaimed \"apprentice,\" forces her way into his life. Reluctantly taking her under his wing, Yashiro soon finds himself caught in a whirlwind of deadly conflicts.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(61220,'Christmas no Otsukai',30,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1720/148490.jpg','cm','2024-12-01','finished_airing',''),(61221,'Motoyama Seisakusho 100-shuunen Animation',80,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1130/148491.jpg','ona','2024-07-01','finished_airing','Special animation commemorating Motoyama Seisakusho\'s 100th anniversary.'),(61222,'Iyemon no Shasou Nite',45,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1922/149141.jpg','cm','2024-12-16','finished_airing',''),(61224,'A-Rank Party wo Ridatsu shita Ore wa, Moto Oshiego-tachi to Meikyuu Shinbu wo Mezasu.: Party Tokushuu! Clover',1380,61,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1595/148494.jpg','tv_special','2025-03-16','finished_airing','Recap of the first nine episodes of A-Rank Party wo Ridatsu shita Ore wa, Moto Oshiego-tachi to Meikyuu Shinbu wo Mezasu..'),(61227,'Girls & Panzer: Motto Love Love Sakusen desu!',0,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1990/148503.jpg','movie','','not_yet_aired','Girls & Panzer: Motto Love Love Sakusen desu! takes a deep dive into the unseen daily lives of the passionate students dedicated to sensha-dou (tankery life). From the girls of Ooarai to their rivals and allies, this series explores their friendships, school interactions, and unexpected moments beyond the battlefield—all with plenty of humor and heart!\n\n(Source: MAL News)\n'),(61230,'Saishuu Gakushou Hibike! Euphonium',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1913/148510.webp','movie','2026','not_yet_aired',''),(61232,'Fuuki Iin to Fuuzoku Katsudou',0,71.39999999999999,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1369/150016.webp','ova','2025-04-25','currently_airing',''),(61236,'Ohiru no Shocker-san: Eiga wo Miru Toki no Onegai',30,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1971/148520.jpg','cm','2021-12-17','finished_airing','An Ohiru no Shocker-san manner movie shown at T-JOY theaters before Kamen Rider: Beyond Generations, which also served as an advertisement for the series.'),(61238,'Chikuwa Senki: Ore no Kawaii de Chikyuu Shinryaku',150,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1617/149999.jpg','tv','2025-04-08','currently_airing',''),(61239,'Binan Koukou Chikyuu Bouei-bu Haikara!',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1265/148526.webp','tv','2025-07-07','not_yet_aired','It\'s the Taisho era - a time filled with the scent of romance, and people\'s hearts are still filled with compassion.\n\nUnzen, Sukayu, Unohana, Oshamanbe, and Aso are all ordinary (?) male students at Mayunan High School, who spend their days lazing around in the clubroom of the \"do-nothing club\" Earth Defense Club, and live together in the Kurodama dormitory.\n\nOne day, while the five are taking a morning bath at the Kurodama dormitory, they notice something slimy moving in the bathtub. When they finally manage to catch it, it turns out to be a talking Pallas\'s cat named Nuru!\n\nNuru has come from the distant future with a serious mission to inform them that the Earth is facing an impending threat of destruction. While he says he wants to protect the Earth, he says he\'s only come to warn them of the crisis, and that it\'s up to the five of them to decide whether or not they want to fight for the Earth...\n\nIsn\'t this just an attempt to dodge responsibility? The Defense Club members are suspicious. \"If either is fine with you, I\'ll do it! That\'s more fashionable!\" Unzen enthusiastically said. The five decided to fight with free will, and Nuru transformed them into the Fashionable Romantic Troupe using cat science. \n\nMeanwhile, a mysterious trio called the Bankara New Elite Squad are scheming in the shadows. They are plotting to take over the Earth.\n\n(Source: Official site, translated and edited)'),(61240,'Futsutsuka na Akujo dewa Gozaimasu ga: Suuguu Chouso Torikae Den',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1177/148527.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Within the Kingdom of Ei\'s opulent inner court is the thriving Maiden Court, where the empress and the four imperial consorts are chosen from five prominent clans. Among them, one pristine consort-in-training, Reirin Kou, stands out as the perfect candidate for the future empress. Her virtue and elegance are unrivaled, and she is flawless—save for her extremely sickly constitution. Compared to the court\'s gentle butterfly, the boorish Keigetsu Shu is like a sewer rat. Always staring at Reirin with bitter envy, Keigetsu is a disgrace to the Maiden Court.\n\nDuring the night of a rare comet sighting, Keigetsu\'s jealousy reaches its peak, and she attempts to murder Reirin by pushing her off a balcony. Reirin is quickly saved from death, and Keigetsu is imprisoned to await her execution. Unbeknownst to all, Keigetsu has cast a spell to swap bodies with Reirin in order to steal all that belongs to her. But while Keigetsu is hindered by Reirin\'s frail body, Reirin fully embraces freedom and physical strength for the first time in her life, determined to live—no matter whose face she wears.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(61247,'Danryoku Saiteki Kai',30,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1750/148537.webp','cm','2024-07-08','finished_airing','Web commercial animated by coalowl for Kanro\'s Marosh candy line.'),(61248,'Gorogura Gorogoro Gu ga Dekkai-hen',30,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1087/148538.jpg','cm','2025-03-08','finished_airing','A TV commercial animated by coalowl for Nissin Cisco\'s Gorugura granola.\n\nThe original version of the song featured in this commercial serves as the opening song in the anime Shikanoko Nokonoko Koshitantan.\n'),(61253,'Chimimo SMT Gekijou Manner CM',29,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1397/148547.jpg','cm','2022-07-29','finished_airing','A Chimimo manner movie shown at Shochiku Multiplex Theaters from July 29 to September 29, 2022.'),(61254,'Ugoku! Neko Mukashibanashi',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1210/148548.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','The cute comedy manga and anime take children\'s stories and folktales from all around the world and asks, \"what if a cat appeared in this story?\"\n\n(Source: ANN)'),(61258,'Transformers: Wild King',210,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1254/148557.jpg','ona','2025-03-26','currently_airing',''),(61260,'Jochum Specials',60,0,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1819/148579.jpg','ona','2024-12-21','finished_airing','Web episodes 25 and 26, streamed exclusively on FOD.'),(61261,'Okaimono Panda! (ONA)',180,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1146/148583.webp','ona','2024-12-20','finished_airing','Web exclusive episodes of Okaimono Panda!.'),(61263,'Riku wa Yowakunai Manner Movie',43,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1067/148586.webp','cm','2021-08-13','finished_airing','A manner movie for Riku wa Yowakunai.'),(61267,'Kinnikuman x Cup Noodles: Power Up shita Pro-hen',30,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1553/148610.jpg','cm','2025-03-04','finished_airing','No matter how superhuman they may be, Kinnikuman and Terryman cannot resist getting older, so together with PRO, they will fight against the wall of age it which is more formidable than any other rival.'),(61269,'Digimon Beatbreak',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1945/148620.jpg','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','New Digimon TV series.'),(61271,'NEET Kunoichi to Nazeka Dousei Hajimemashita: Nazeka Beach de Dogimagi Shimashita/Nazeka Moto Koutou Youma to Nakayoku Narimashita',720,62.9,2,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1112/148636.jpg','ona','2025-03-29','finished_airing','Special episodes of NEET Kunoichi to Nazeka Dousei Hajimemashita that aired on the web, and were later included on the series Blu-ray volumes.'),(61272,'PetitCure: Precure Fairies',94,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1463/148638.jpg','ona','2025-04-03','currently_airing','Short anime spinoff about the mascots of the franchise.'),(61273,'Tsurezure PoPiPa',48,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1708/148639.jpg','ona','2025-04-28','currently_airing','Short anime about Poppin\'Party\'s daily life released for the band\'s 10th anniversary.\n\n(Source: Official BanG Dream! X Account)\n'),(61274,'Ginga Tokkyuu Milky☆Subway',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1243/148640.jpg','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Arrested for reckless space driving, super human Chiharu and cyborg Makina are sentenced to clean the Milky☆Subway—an old interplanetary train.\n\nEasy enough, right? Wrong. When the train suddenly takes off, they are thrown into a high-speed space-train spectacle packed with chaos, no plans, and zero strategy.\nJust pure momentum!\n\n(Source: Official website, translated)'),(61276,'Mikata ga Yowasugite Hojo Mahou ni Tesshiteita Kyuutei Mahoushi, Tsuihou sarete Saikyou wo Mezashimasu',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1411/148643.jpg','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','\"This party doesn\'t need an incompetent magician who can only use supportive magic. You\'re fired, Alec Ygret.\"\n\nSuddenly, Alec, a court magician who had joined the crown prince\'s party to help him conquer dungeons—was banished from the party. And not just the party, but the crown prince\'s harassment has banished him from the royal palace as well, and a friend from the \"magic academy\" approached Alec, who was at his wit\'s end.\n\n\"Hey, Alec. Do you want to try to conquer the dungeon with us again?\"\n\nAnd so, together with the friends he used to party with, Alec begins his second journey in life. This is the adventure story of a former court magician who had been abandoned.\n\nFour years ago, the \"Lasting Period,\" a party of four that had been called \"legendary,\" has gradually spread its name around the world.\n\n(Source: Kodansha, translated)'),(61278,'Sumikko Gurashi Movie 4',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1764/148645.jpg','movie','2025','not_yet_aired','Fourth Sumikko Gurashi movie.'),(61279,'Go! Go! Vehicle Zoo: Vehicle Star-hen',210,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1889/148647.jpg','tv','2025-04-06','currently_airing',''),(61280,'Kore Kaite Shine',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1910/148648.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Ai Yasumi, a first-year high school student living on Izu-Oshima, loves manga more than anything. When she learns that her long-admired, yet long-inactive, favorite manga artist Hoshi no Rei will be exhibiting at COMITIA, she sets off on a journey to Tokyo.\n\nWhat she doesn\'t expect, however, is that a fateful encounter at the event will change her life forever.\n\n\"How does one become a manga artist?\" Ai steps into the world of manga creation—a path she thought she understood, yet knows so little about. This is the story of a girl taking her first steps down the road to becoming a mangaka.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(61282,'Shota Oni',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1499/148663.jpg','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Elementary schooler Tsubaki is head over heels for his childhood friend, Yuu, a gentle and easygoing high schooler.\n\nThough Yuu always treats him with care, he can\'t help but see Tsubaki as just a kid. But Tsubaki is determined—\"I\'ll grow up fast and make Yuu-nii happy!\"\n\nWith youthful determination and an earnest heart, Tsubaki\'s love story is just beginning—a heartfelt tale of innocence, admiration, and the bonds that grow over time.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(61286,'Digimon Adventure 25-shuunen Kinen PV: Digimon Adventure - Beyond',247,69.80000000000001,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1537/148675.jpg','pv','2025-03-20','finished_airing','A PV to commemorate the 25th anniversary of Digimon Adventure.'),(61289,'Sorotani no Keibatchi',166,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1325/148688.jpg','tv','2024-11-28','finished_airing','Behind the scenes of the serious competition in G1 races, you\'ll see the quirky and hilarious tactics played out by jockeys, horses, spectators, and trainers. Don\'t miss the emotions of the people and horses who, with their complicated circumstances and personal feelings in mind, are determined to win the G1 and make the right predictions!\n\n(Source: Official Site, translated)'),(61290,'Punirunes: Puni 3',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1860/148706.jpg','tv','2025-07-05','not_yet_aired','Third season of Punirunes.'),(61291,'Zetsumetsu Kigu-shun. x Uchuu Nanchara Kotetsu-kun Gekijou Manner Douga',90,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1467/148710.jpg','cm','2020-07-31','finished_airing','A manner movie collaboration between Zetsumetsu Kigu-shun. and Uchuu Nanchara Kotetsu-kun which was shown at EJ Anime Theater.'),(61292,'Rurouni Kenshin: Meiji Kenkaku Romantan 3rd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1391/148722.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Third season of Rurouni Kenshin: Meiji Kenkaku Romantan.'),(61293,'Koisuru One Piece',437,67.6,5,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1304/148725.jpg','ona','2025-04-01','finished_airing','The premise of this gag manga spinoff is about three high school students: a young male student, his girlfriend and a third wheel who is a One Piece fanatic. Their names are similar to the Straw Hat Pirates and the group form a fan club dedicated to One Piece.\n\n(Source: One Piece Wiki)'),(61295,'Kidou Senshi Gundam: GQuuuuuuX - Beginning',4860,77,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1351/150112.jpg','movie','2025-01-17','finished_airing','Amate Yuzuriha is a high-school student living peacefully in a space colony floating in outer space. When she meets a war refugee named Nyaan, Amate is drawn into the illegal mobile suit dueling sport known as Clan Battle.\n\nUnder the entry name \"Machu,\" she throws herself into fierce battle day after day, piloting the GQuuuuuuX. Then an unidentified Gundam mobile suit pursued by both the space force and the police appears before her, along with its pilot, a boy named Shuji.\n\n(Source: Official site)'),(61297,'Gekkan! Nanmono Anime',60,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1581/150017.jpg','ona','2025-04-30','currently_airing','Set in a world where everything is a living thing, from animals and plants to food and objects.'),(61300,'Sumikko Gurashi: Koko ga Ochitsukun desu',60,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1177/149954.jpg','tv','2025-04-04','currently_airing',''),(61301,'Ma no Mono-tachi wa Kuwadateru',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1494/148774.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','People don\'t truly appreciate the amount of R&D that goes into making traps. I mean, you can\'t let the heroes waltz up to the demon lord unscathed, can you? Do you know how much logistical work goes into keeping the traps armed? In coming up with new, innovative ways to scathe, maim, and humiliate the humans? From slime that melts your clothes, to titillating tentacle traps-Follow along with the Demon Lord\'s underlings as they devise, concoct, and scheme up all new ways to strike fear in an adventurer\'s heart.\n\n(Source: Yen Press)'),(61302,'E Shou',4880,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1300/148776.jpg','ona','2025-03-18','finished_airing',''),(61303,'Jixian Chengshi',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1561/150122.jpg','movie','2025-04-04','finished_airing',''),(61304,'Kuroiwa Medaka ni Watashi no Kawaii ga Tsuujinai 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1821/148784.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Kuroiwa Medaka ni Watashi no Kawaii ga Tsuujinai.'),(61310,'Go! Go! Vehicle Zoo (2024)',510,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1523/148812.jpg','ona','2024-06-19','finished_airing','Follow-up to the original Go! Go! Vehicle Zoo. This series is more of the same, but introduces a couple new characters. There\'s the newest Vehicle Zoo pair, a dog named Moko who specializes in tracking, and her partner, a fire truck named Fine. And there\'s also Guutan, a chaotic unidentified creature who\'s the closest thing this show has to a villain. He\'s a lot of fun.'),(61313,'Oshiri Tantei: Yume no Jumbo Sweet Potato Matsuri',1302,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1310/148917.webp','movie','2022-03-18','finished_airing',''),(61314,'Oshiri Tantei: Nandemo Kaiketsu Club vs. Kaitou U',600,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1104/148822.jpg','movie','2024-03-20','finished_airing',''),(61316,'Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu 4th Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1070/148834.jpg','tv','2026','not_yet_aired','Fourth season of Re:Zero kara Hajimeru Isekai Seikatsu.'),(61319,'Sono Keisatsukan, Tokidoki Yajuu!',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1572/148841.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','\"Show me your place.\"\n\nI thought it was okay because he\'s a police officer... but will I be violated if he stays here?\n\nThe ordinary office lady, Hiyori, lives in a peaceful city. She was caught in an accident by chance and fractured her arm. She decided to live with Kumano, a policeman who happened to be there. Hiyori was relieved because he was a police officer, however...\n\n(Source: Ichijinsha, translated)'),(61322,'Dr. Stone: Science Future Part 2',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1335/148849.webp','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Part two of Dr. Stone: Science Future.'),(61323,'Ao no Hako 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1591/148854.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Ao no Hako.'),(61324,'BanG Dream! It\'s MyGO!!!!! / Ave Mujica (Zoku-hen)',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1864/148855.jpg','unknown','','not_yet_aired','Sequel to BanG Dream! Ave Mujica and BanG Dream! It\'s MyGO!!!!!.'),(61325,'Douse, Koishite Shimaunda. Season 2',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1745/148858.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Douse, Koishite Shimaunda.'),(61326,'Dokodemo Makibao',300,0,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1543/148859.jpg','ona','2024-12-16','finished_airing','A spin-off of Midori no Makibao to celebrate the 30th anniversary of the series. It depicts \"everyday races\" such as \"who can pick up the most trash at the beach\" and \"who can get to the basement of the department store first to get the food that is limited to just one person.\"\n\n(Source: ANN)'),(61327,'Nomo no Kuni',2045,66.2,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1949/148864.jpg','ona','2025-03-28','finished_airing','Once upon a time, there was a girl named Sora. She loved to sing, but one day, something happened that made her scared to sing in front of others. As days passed, she forgot how to sing, and even how to laugh. Then, one day, she and her little brother Daichi stumbled upon a mysterious pond.\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(61331,'Petit Forma: Denhan Kyoku Nisshi',66,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1681/148877.jpg','ona','2025-03-28','currently_airing','The anime is a spin-off that follows the everyday lives of SD versions of Echika and friends.\n\n(Source: ANN)'),(61332,'Aka no Kioku',218,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1703/148880.jpg','ona','2025-03-27','finished_airing','Short directed by Kiyotaka Oshiyama in collaboration with Fukushima Prefecture\'s general information magazine Fukushima Map\'s Supporter Association to promote the appeal of the prefecture to more people.\n\n(Source: YouTube description, translated)'),(61333,'Ao no Miburo: Serizawa Ansatsu-hen',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1906/148878.webp','tv','2026-01','not_yet_aired','Second season of Ao no Miburo.'),(61334,'Momentary Lily: Tsuzuiteiku Kappou, Kappou!',1420,62.400000000000006,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1715/148881.jpg','tv_special','2025-03-30','finished_airing','Episode 14 of Momentary Lily. The episode released on AT-X and was later included in the BD volume 4.'),(61335,'Medalist 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1562/148882.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Medalist.'),(61338,'Shangri-La Frontier: Kusoge Hunter, Kamige ni Idoman to su 3rd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1851/148885.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Third season of Shangri-La Frontier: Kusoge Hunter, Kamige ni Idoman to su.'),(61339,'Jibaku Shounen Hanako-kun 2 Part 2',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1896/148886.jpg','tv','2025-07-06','not_yet_aired','Second season of Jibaku Shounen Hanako-kun 2.'),(61345,'Overlord: Sei Oukoku-hen - Manner Movie',120,67.9,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1971/148897.jpg','movie','2024-09-20','finished_airing','A theater manners short bundled with movie.'),(61349,'PlayStation x YOASOBI \"Players\" 30-shuunen Tokubetsu CM',123,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1292/148904.webp','cm','2025-03-31','finished_airing','The 30th anniversary special video using the original song Player by YOASOBI, born from the 30th anniversary project Project: Memory Card for the release of the original PlayStation.\n\n(Source: Youtube, translated)'),(61352,'Chufang Ji Zhanchang!',98,66.3,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1663/148908.jpg','pv','2025-04-01','finished_airing','Raise your glasses and toast to a feast like no other, where the western winds fade into golden revelry.\nOn April 1st, Year 4  1 of the Light Calendar, The Grand Chrysos eagerly awaits your arrival!\n\"Honestly, I think \"the Grand Restaurant\" has a better ring to it.\"\n\"Uh... Your taste in names is certainly... one of a kind.\"\n\n(Source: Youtube)'),(61353,'Hametsu no Yuuwaku',0,63.5,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1986/150088.jpg','ova','2025-03-28','currently_airing',''),(61354,'Benghuai: Xing Qiong Tiedao - Huangjin Shishi PVs',290,67.30000000000001,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1051/148911.jpg','pv','2024-11-22','currently_airing','Animated trailers that are part of the Golden Epic trailers featuring Amphoreus Characters for the game Honkai: Star Rail, the animation is unique and is not present in the game.\n'),(61359,'Osananajimi to wa Love Comedy ni Naranai',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1320/148982.jpg','tv','2026','not_yet_aired','High schooler Eiyuu has a dilemma—his two childhood friends, Shio and Akari, have grown up to be almost too cute! Even though they don\'t seem to think much of it, he can\'t help but see them in a different light. If they ever realized how his feelings had changed, the embarrassment would be overwhelming! However, what Eiyuu doesn\'t know is that Shio and Akari might have feelings of their own.\n\nA slow-burning love triangle where all the heroines are childhood friends—one that\'s as frustrating as it is irresistible!\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(61360,'Gaudiy Mirai no Yokokuhen',131,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1738/148983.jpg','pv','2023-10-11','finished_airing','Every human is capable of innovation, and amplifying everyone\'s feelings of enjoyment can change the world. This human innovation movie features Gaudiy\'s ideology as a trailer.\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(61361,'7Fates: Chakho',685,67.9,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1810/148985.webp','ona','2025-04-03','finished_airing',''),(61363,'YouTuNya 3rd Season',60,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1832/150003.jpg','tv','2025-04-15','currently_airing','The third season of YouTuNya.'),(61364,'The Star Seekers: Hoshi wo Ou Shounen-tachi',658,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1616/149003.jpg','ona','2025-04-03','finished_airing',''),(61366,'Mahouka Koukou no Rettousei 3rd Season Special',101,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1319/150210.webp','special','2024-11-27','finished_airing','The Irregular at Magic High School Ancient Capital Civil War Arc 1 bonus footage includes a hot spring scene with Miyuki and Minami that was not shown on TV. This special footage can only be seen in the Blu-ray & DVD Volume 5.\n\n(Source: Official YouTube Channel)'),(61367,'Tooi-san wa Seishun Shitai! Baka to Smartphone to Romance to',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1135/149006.jpg','movie','2025-07-18','not_yet_aired','Tooi, an ordinary high school girl, was expecting a normal school life—until everything changed on her very first day.\n\nAfter catching the attention of the unpredictable and overly energetic classmate Jel, she\'s suddenly roped into the mysterious \"Youth Romance Club,\" a bizarre school group dedicated to chasing down anything that feels \"youthful\" or \"romantic.\"\n\nWhat should\'ve been a carefree club quickly spirals into chaotic antics, with Tooi constantly playing the straight man to everyone\'s nonsense. To make things even wilder, the club\'s antics start getting streamed online!\n\nBetween laughter, unexpected twists, and even a mysterious incident, this unpredictable school life is just getting started.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(61379,'Yurukawa Mell-chan',180,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1277/149017.jpg','tv','2025-04-03','currently_airing','Mell-chan aims to become a professional \"care doll\" and overcomes various training. What exactly is that training...\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(61381,'Tabekko Doubutsu The Movie Short Clips',110,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1676/149033.jpg','ona','2025-03-29','finished_airing','A series of videos to promote Tabekko Doubutsu The Movie. \"These are special scenes that can\'t be seen in the main movie! If you watch this, you\'ll enjoy the movie 10 times more!\"'),(61393,'One Piece Egghead Arc Recap',4820,72.69999999999999,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1405/149053.jpg','tv_special','2025-04-05','finished_airing','A special edited version which looks back on the episodes 1089-1122 that were broadcast from January to October 2024. \n\n(Source: Official Website)'),(61395,'Suitsuita!',110,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1642/149057.webp','ona','2010-10-26','finished_airing','A story about a girl and a hippopotamus that happened at the zoo.\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(61396,'Hug',188,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1561/149058.webp','movie','2013','finished_airing','Graduate Work 2013 by Saki Iyori, Tama Art University.'),(61398,'Make Heroine ga Oosugiru! 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1031/149060.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Make Heroine ga Oosugiru!.'),(61410,'Chotto dake Ai ga Omoi Dark Elf ga Isekai kara Oikaketekita Mini Anime Gekijou',720,59.400000000000006,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1707/149093.webp','tv','2025-04-07','currently_airing','A weekly mini anime shown with each episode of Chotto dake Ai ga Omoi Dark Elf ga Isekai kara Oikaketekita exclusively on the AT-X broadcast of the TV anime.'),(61411,'Kanchigai no Atelier Meister Mini Anime',120,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1949/149094.jpg','ona','2025-04-06','currently_airing','Mini anime of Kanchigai no Atelier Meister: Eiyuu Party no Moto Zatsuyougakari ga, Jitsu wa Sentou Igai ga SSS Rank Datta to Iu Yoku Aru Hanashi.'),(61420,'Taigu Zhan Hun',0,0,40,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1012/149960.jpg','ona','2025-04-12','currently_airing','A generation of martial arts emperor was killed and fell, and ten thousand years later he was reborn in a young man named Qin Feng. He awakened the supreme spirit and practiced the supreme martial arts. From then on, he fought against countless geniuses. All the heavens and the worlds will tremble because of his return!\n\n(Source: Youku, Google translated)'),(61425,'Ponkotsu Fuuki Iin to Skirt-take ga Futekisetsu na JK no Hanashi',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1771/149123.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','Sakuradaimon takes his role on the school\'s Public Morals Committee very seriously. Every day, he dutifully checks students\' appearances at the school gate—most often scolding Kohinata, a rule-breaking girl with bright hair and a short skirt.\n\nThough she finds his constant lecturing annoying, everything changes when she discovers that Sakuradaimon is actually a bit of a mess himself.\n\nA lighthearted short romantic comedy about a strict committee member, a bold classmate, and the chaotic school life that brings them together.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(61431,'Shimazu Seisakusho Sougyou 150-shuunen Kinen Animation',232,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1521/149132.jpg','ona','2025-03-31','finished_airing','The story takes place in Kyoto in 1877. The atmosphere of the city and people in Kyoto was greatly depressed due to the transfer of the capital to Tokyo. Despite this, Genzo Shimadzu Sr. was busily pursuing his research with the aim of flying a light balloon requested by Kyoto Prefecture. After watching the balloon take off, the protagonist (Shimadzu employee) aspires to connect Genzo\'s passion from the past to the present and into the future.\n\n(Source: Official YouTube channel)'),(61440,'Watashi no Shiawase na Kekkon (Shinsaku Anime)',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1511/149166.jpg','unknown','','not_yet_aired','New anime project of Watashi no Shiawase na Kekkon.'),(61443,'Shunkashuutou Daikousha: Haru no Mai',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1908/149187.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Winter was once the only season in the world-but such an existence was too lonely to bear, and so it created Spring to love. Before long, the earth wished for more time to rest in the cycle, and Summer and Autumn were born. The ones who carry the cycle are called the Agents of the Four Seasons. Hinagiku, the Agent of Spring, disappeared from this land ten years ago, taking the season of spring with her. Now, after incredible hardship, she has returned to restore the cycle to its proper state-and, as in the myth passed down since the dawn of time, she sends her love to Winter.\n\n(Source: Yen Press)'),(61456,'The iDOLM@STER Million Live!: The Backstage',1275,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1736/149207.jpg','special','2024-03-29','finished_airing','Special episode included in volume 3 of the Blu-ray release of The iDOLM@STER Million Live! depicting behind-the-scenes footage of the opening performance.'),(61461,'Tenkaichi',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1849/149220.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','This is not history as we know it. The year is 1600. Ten years have passed since Oda Nobunaga unified the whole of Japan. When Nobunaga realizes he is nearing the end of his life, he announces that he will hand over the reins of power to whoever brings him the strongest warrior. The generals, whose dreams of conquering the country had been crushed, put up their own strongest warriors and aim to become the king of the country!\n\n(Source: Kodansha USA)'),(61462,'Pan no Akachan',244,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1085/149223.jpg','movie','2024-12-06','finished_airing','One night, bakery owner Riku kneads dough, leaves it to rest, and departs for the day. However, a thief sneaks in and attempts to steal the cash from the register. The ruckus soon wakes the cream bread dough in the fridge. Can the \"Baby Bread\" save the day?\n\n(Source: Animation World Network)'),(61463,'Ai to Aiko: Love Can Happen Anywhere',163,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1161/149225.webp','ona','2018-12-07','finished_airing','Love Can Happen Anywhere, or originally titled as \'哀Ai to Ai愛\' is Ai & Aiko\'s first animation film. Done in stop-motion, it reflects life and how in facing problems that stop us, we should keep moving in small steps for every small move propels change.\n\n(Source: Official Youtube channel)'),(61464,'Ai to Aiko no Christmas: Omoide no Tsuri',780,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1196/149226.webp','ona','2024-12-12','finished_airing','Experience the enchantment of a Christmas journey with Ai and his loyal pup Aiko as they embark on a heartwarming adventure to help their feline friend Genki rediscover the true holiday spirit.\n\n(Source: Gala Film)'),(61469,'JoJo no Kimyou na Bouken Part 7: Steel Ball Run',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1179/149231.webp','unknown','','not_yet_aired','In the American Old West, the world\'s greatest race is about to begin. Thousands line up in San Diego to travel over six thousand kilometers for a chance to win the grand prize of fifty million dollars. With the era of the horse reaching its end, contestants are allowed to use any kind of vehicle they wish. Competitors will have to endure grueling conditions, traveling up to a hundred kilometers a day through uncharted wastelands. The Steel Ball Run is truly a one-of-a-kind event.\n\nThe youthful Johnny Joestar, a crippled former horse racer, has come to San Diego to watch the start of the race. There he encounters Gyro Zeppeli, a racer with two steel balls at his waist instead of a gun. Johnny witnesses Gyro using one of his steel balls to unleash a fantastical power, compelling a man to fire his gun at himself during a duel. In the midst of the action, Johnny happens to touch the steel ball and feels a power surging through his legs, allowing him to stand up for the first time in two years. Vowing to find the secret of the steel balls, Johnny decides to compete in the race, and so begins his bizarre adventure across America on the Steel Ball Run.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(61475,'Lanqiu Xuanfeng 2nd Season',1170,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1046/149237.jpg','tv','2024-07-26','finished_airing','Second season of Lanqiu Xuanfeng.'),(61483,'Tenmaku no Jaadugar',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1726/149246.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','In the harem of the Khan, wisdom is beauty. The time: the thirteenth century. The place: Yeke Mongol Ulus, the greatest empire the world has ever known. The woman: Fatima, hailing from Persia, where medical technique and scientific knowledge have been perfected beyond all precedent. Fatima\'s desire for a stage where she can put her knowledge to work has brought her to the palace of the Mongols, where she falls under the wing of Töregene, the sixth wife of Ögedei, the second Great Khan—a mighty woman with complicated feelings about the direction of the empire. These two women are the axel upon which the politics of the palace, and soon the very world, will turn...\n\n(Source: Yen Press)'),(61485,'Jigu-ui Juin-eun Goyangi-da',800,0,13,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1013/149248.jpg','tv','2025-04-12','currently_airing','Though Chichi the cat looks very cute, she has one goal: eradicate humanity and take over the world! She decides to recruit comrades to aid her in her quest, but it looks like world conquest won\'t be that easy?! Follow the adventures of Chichi the tyrant, Dunno the doggo who loves humans, and Kaiser Kang Taeshik, the hard-boiled wild hamster, as they face many hardships on their path to absolute dominion!\n\n(Source: Kakao Entertainment Corp., translated)'),(61491,'Chibizenji-sensei Inokori Kougiroku',107,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1005/149251.jpg','ona','2025-04-07','currently_airing','Mini anime for Chuuzenji-sensei Mononoke Kougiroku: Sensei ga Nazo wo Hodoite Shimau kara. released on YouTube.'),(61492,'Entotsu Machi no Poupelle: Yakusoku no Tokei-dai',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1446/149253.jpg','movie','2026','not_yet_aired','Sequel to Entotsu Machi no Poupelle.'),(61494,'Gold Muscle',300,0,10,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1954/149254.jpg','tv','2002-10-12','finished_airing','A story about a mad scientist named Dr. Carlo Gorgon, who created athletes fused with animal DNA to compete through different sports, and it\'s up to the human athletes, who were the heroes, to challenge and stop Gorgon\'s plan.'),(61496,'Xiao Xian Zhi Yao',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1678/150004.jpg','ona','2025-04-21','currently_airing','He Wan, the leader of the Hidden Clan feared by all three realms, suddenly attacked the Heavenly Palace. The Supreme God Nan Ze came to fight. In order to protect Nan Ze, the jade-growing fairy Yu Zhiyao risked her life to save him. When she and He Wan were about to perish together, she was unexpectedly reborn. By mistake, Yu Zhiyao was reborn into He Wan\'s body. After the rebirth, He Wan\'s Hidden Power was greatly damaged. Ting Zhao, the Hidden Guard of the West Sea, came to help the leader He Wan recover her Hidden Power. Since then, Zhiyao was forced to embark on the road of a two-faced female leader, pretending to be majestic in front of others and being charming in front of the king...\n\n(Source: Iqiyi, Google translated)'),(61501,'Kanan-sama wa Akumade Choroi',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1165/149264.webp','tv','2026','not_yet_aired','Kanan is a demon who descends upon the human world with one goal: to feast on the sweetest delicacy of all—young human souls. Disguised as a high schooler, she sets her sights on her first target, an unassuming boy named Youji Kyougi. But just as she prepares to claim her meal, things take a very unexpected turn.\n\nInstead of devouring him, Kanan ends up forming a \"romantic contract\" with Youji. For someone who\'s lived for millennia without experiencing love, navigating high school romance proves more terrifying than any hunt. Between awkward dates, hand-holding mishaps, and feelings she can\'t quite name, the once-proud demon finds herself flustered at every turn.\n\nA supernatural romcom about a lovestruck demon and the boy who was supposed to be her prey—sweet, chaotic, and full of firsts.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(61508,'Shen Yin Wangzuo Movie: Yi Lai Ke Si Chuanqi',5423,76.6,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1183/149275.jpg','ona','2025-04-30','finished_airing','The legendary epic of Electrolux recreates the glorious journey of the great Holy Necromancer God Electrolux, the Scourge of the Undead.\n\n(Source: Tencent, Google translated)'),(61513,'Nyankamuchu Season 3',154,0,5,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1294/149280.webp','ona','2024-11-08','finished_airing','The third season of Nyankamuchu.'),(61517,'Kingdom 6th Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1265/149299.jpg','tv','2025-10','not_yet_aired','In ancient China, during the Warring States period, a former servant named Xin rises through the ranks with a dream: to become the greatest general under the heavens. Fighting alongside King Ying Zheng of Qin—who seeks to unify China and end the chaos—Xin leads his own unit, the Fei Xin Force, onto the battlefield.\n\nWith power reclaimed from the influential Chancellor Buwei Lü, King Ying Zheng begins laying the groundwork for a new, unified legal state with the support of key allies like strategist Changping Jun and legalist Li Si.\n\nAs Qin launches a campaign to seize new territory from the state of Zhao, their advance is halted by the brilliant strategist, Li Mu. In response, Changping Jun devises a bold plan: to bypass Zhao\'s defenses and strike at the key city of Gyou, near Zhao\'s capital.\n\nTo carry out this risky maneuver, a powerful coalition army is formed—led by the tacticians Ou Sen (Wang Jian), Kan Ki (Huan Yi), and the warrior queen Yo Tan Wa (Yang Duanhe). Joining them are the next generation of Qin commanders: Xin\'s Fei Xin Force, Mou Ten (Meng Tian)\'s Gaku Ka Unit, and Ou Hon (Wang Ben)\'s Gyoku Hou Unit, each operating independently.\n\nThe fierce battle for Gyou begins, as the future of Qin\'s unification hangs in the balance.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(61534,'Hazure Skill \"Kinomi Master\": Skill no Mi (Tabetara Shinu) wo Mugen ni Taberareru You ni Natta Ken ni Tsuite Mini Anime',90,0,14,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1595/149308.jpg','ona','2025-01-06','finished_airing','Mini anime for Hazure Skill \"Kinomi Master\": Skill no Mi (Tabetara Shinu) wo Mugen ni Taberareru You ni Natta Ken ni Tsuite.'),(61535,'Sunny',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1352/149312.jpg','movie','','not_yet_aired','What is Sunny? Sunny is a car. Sunny is a car you take on a drive with your mind. It takes you to the place of your dreams. Sunny is the story of beating the odds, in the ways that count. \n\n(Source: VIZ Media)'),(61538,'Asa made Shiru Daku Haha Musume Donburi!!',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1027/149315.jpg','ova','2025-06-20','not_yet_aired',''),(61539,'Princess Burst!',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1691/149316.webp','ova','2025-06-27','not_yet_aired',''),(61541,'Ouji ni Dekiai saretakunai node Moto no Princess desu ga Dansou Shitsuji ni Narimasu!',50,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1756/149326.jpg','pv','2025-04-18','finished_airing','A special animated video celebrating the completion of Ouji ni Dekiai saretakunai node Moto no Princess desu ga Dansou Shitsuji ni Narimasu! manga.'),(61546,'Star Wars: Visions Presents - The Ninth Jedi',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1234/149352.jpg','unknown','2026','not_yet_aired','A spin-off which will expand upon The Ninth Jedi in a longer format.'),(61547,'Umi no Triton (2000)',1020,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1171/149353.jpg','movie','2000-03-25','finished_airing','Screened at the Glass no Chikyuu wo Sukue: Oyako Forum - Tezuka Osamu kara 21-seiki no Kimitachi e event at Himeji Welcome 21. In addition to the familiar characters from the original work, original characters Marine and the event\'s mascots Kirara and Mirara also make appearances.\n\n(Source: Official site, translated)'),(61549,'Okiraku Ryoushu no Tanoshii Ryouchi Bouei: Seisankei Majutsu de Na mo Naki Mura wo Saikyou no Jousai Toshi ni',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1380/149356.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','Van, the fourth son of a powerful noble, is only two years old when he remembers his past life as a salaryman in Japan. With his adult brain in a young body, he\'s considered a child prodigy...until he displays the \"Production Magic\" skill when he turns eight. In a family that favors offensive magic, this crafting skill is considered useless in battle, and Van is banished to oversee a tiny country town in disgrace. With only his personal maid, the memories of his past life, and his \"worthless\" magic, can Van improve the fortunes of this little village—and himself?\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)'),(61555,'Holoearth Anime PV: \"Saa, Anata no Mou Hitotsu no Sekai e\"',113,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1073/149414.jpg','pv','2025-04-23','finished_airing','Have you ever wanted to visit a place that\'s a world apart? This is the teaser PV for the world envisioned by \"Holoearth.\"\n\nThe Holoearth project aims to utilize virtual platform technology to offer new virtual opportunities to those from all cultures around the world, in the form of various content and experiences set in another realm - an isekai - known as \"Holoearth.\"\n\n(Source: YouTube)'),(61556,'Da Zhu Zai (2023) 2nd Season',1320,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1167/149508.webp','ona','','not_yet_aired','Second season of Da Zhu Zai.'),(61557,'Nitian Xie Shen 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1135/149505.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','The second season of Nitian Xie Shen.'),(61558,'Aikatsu! x PriPara the Movie: Deai no Kiseki!',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1723/149417.jpg','movie','2025','not_yet_aired','Collaboration movie between Aikatsu! and PriPara.'),(61561,'Cang Lan Jue 2',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1784/149998.jpg','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','Second season of Cang Lan Jue.'),(61562,'Ze Tian Ji (2026)',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1602/149539.jpg','ona','2026','not_yet_aired','In a fictional world where humans, demons and monsters coexist, Chen Changsheng comes to the capital of gods with a marriage certificate in order to change his fate. Together with a group of young heroes, he waged a desperate battle against the forces of darkness. At the same time, he also harvested love and started his journey of rising as a powerful man in the capital of gods.\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61563,'Wan Xiang Zhi Wang',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1976/149540.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','Luolan Mansion, one of the five major mansions of Daxia in Shenzhou Continent, has fallen into decline due to the mysterious disappearance of two mansion masters. Although the young mansion master Li Luo is extremely talented and was born with three phase palaces, he has difficulty practicing because of his natural empty phase. \n\nJiang Qinge, with whom he had been engaged since childhood, has a ninth-grade light phase and is extremely talented. Realizing the gap between them, Li Luo wanted to cancel the contract and break off the engagement, but was rejected by Jiang Qinge. \n\nOn his seventeenth birthday, Li Luo took away the secret treasure left by his parents and obtained the water light phase, but the price was that his hair turned white overnight and his life was overdrawn. If he wanted to extend his life, he had to reach the state of a marquis within five years.\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61564,'Shenguo Zhi Shang',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1456/149541.jpg','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','Six days and nights, a strange case, and the boy returning to twelve years ago, can he break the shackles of the Kingdom of God this time?\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61565,'Aoshi Dan Shen',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1847/149543.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','Born with a disability, Shen Xiang risked everything to go to a dangerous place to find medicine in order to open up his spiritual veins. While looking for the medicine, he accidentally saved an injured goddess and demoness, and awakened his divine veins. He guarded his father and family and became a great god of alchemy!\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61566,'Mo Tian Ji',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1888/149545.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','What will happen when a desperate boy who grew up among evil people steps into the world of cultivating immortals? Immortals and demons can be separated by a thought, and life and death are not decided by heaven. Let\'s see how he goes against the current in this world where humans and demons coexist and evil spirits run rampant, and become a legend.\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61567,'Jiu Yang Wushen',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1107/150131.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','In his previous life, Ye Yunfei was gifted, but his martial veins suddenly closed and he could not practice martial arts. He was ridiculed by his family, betrayed by his fiancee, and encircled by various families. The young Ye Yunfei was deserted by his friends, bullied, sadly left by his beloved, and his father died tragically in battle. \n\nFortunately, the Purple Saint True Lord who passed by Yunyou took him in as his disciple. Ye Yuntian grew up to be the youngest emperor in history, but was attacked when he was crossing the calamity. He was reborn when all the martial veins were lost, but it was also a passionate youth. Meeting his old relatives, friends, and lovers again, facing everything familiar, Ye Yunfei, a generation of emperor, chose to start over. \n\nThere is still a trace of the soul of the emperor in his body, so that the memory of the previous life can be preserved intact. There is a dispute over fame and status inside, and the responsibility of honor and disgrace of the family veins outside. The imperial pride gathers, the four major sects are each for their own strength, and the heroes of Tianxuan Continent rise together. \n\nYe Yunfei is familiar with the rules that the strong are respected in this world. With the help of the thousand-year memory of the Emperor of Heaven, Ye Yunfei\'s martial arts progressed amazingly, and he continued to grow in the martial arts world, and led his family and master to grow rapidly. Not long after the stabilization, foreign invaders came and invaded. Ye Yunfei led the people to resist and defend their homeland forever. \n\nIn order to pursue a higher level of martial arts, Ye Yunfei left his hometown and embarked on a new journey, and finally became a generation of Emperor of Heaven. Having experienced too many insults and harassment, this life must be a life of killing gods and Buddhas, and riding a horse with a sword, living up to the youth.\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61568,'Chao Neng Fuke Jing',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1674/150077.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','Gods descended, disasters were rampant! When the gods invaded the earth, the superpowers with the mysterious \"leaf pattern\" became the last sword and shield of mankind. While the two superpower academies in the East and the West, Gou Chen and Adam, were fighting hard, a Chinese boy quietly rose up. He had the ability to replicate superpowers, and with a mortal body, he held the power of the world and would eventually kill the gods. \n\nThis is the carnival of the godslayers!\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61569,'Bei Xue',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1978/149552.webp','ona','','not_yet_aired','Luo Han, a young man from the desert, goes to the Central Plains once every three years just to give a medicine cup to his friend Yi Lian. During this year\'s cup-sending trip, in order to help Yi Lian out of trouble, Luo Han gets involved, which leads to a huge theft of stolen silver, involving gangsters and dignitaries from the court, stirring up the world\'s political situation.\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61572,'Muhou no Ai',1354,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1979/149454.webp','movie','2022-09-24','finished_airing','A short film by Ryuya Suzuki.\n\nMidnight. A construction site. A man with a cone head and a woman with pink hair meet in a powerful encounter. A provocative tale of love, right and wrong over a quarter of a century between two outcasts.'),(61578,'Seitokai ni mo Ana wa Aru!',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1410/149470.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Ume Mizunoe, a first-year student at the prestigious Fujinari Academy, excels in Japanese literature but struggles so badly in science that his chances of advancing are at risk. Hoping to boost his academic record, he joins the student council—only to find himself surrounded by a cast of quirky characters: a charismatic yet secretly shy president, a kind but intimidating treasurer, an adorably cheeky boy, and a tiny, stray-cat-like secretary.\n\nThrown into a whirlwind of chaotic daily life, Ume\'s school days are about to get a lot more unpredictable—and a lot more lively!\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(61579,'Umayuru: Pretty Gray',180,63.5,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1622/149562.jpg','ona','2025-04-30','finished_airing',''),(61582,'Dream Photobooth',42,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1630/149474.jpg','ona','2025-04-22','currently_airing',''),(61583,'Immoral Game Master The Animation',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1611/149475.webp','ova','2025-07-25','not_yet_aired',''),(61584,'Ye Xing Xia Ying: Xianxing Yugao',272,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1938/149495.webp','pv','2019-07-06','finished_airing','Trailer for unreleased animated series Ye Xing Xia Ying.'),(61585,'Peng Ran Xindong PV',90,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1432/149907.webp','pv','2019-09-12','finished_airing','Trailer for unreleased animated series Peng Ran Xindong.'),(61587,'\"Omae Gotoki ga Maou ni Kateru to Omouna\" to Yuusha Party wo Tsuihou sareta node, Outo de Kimama ni Kurashitai',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1728/149490.webp','tv','','not_yet_aired','Flum Apricot was never meant to be a hero. Despite zero stats across the board and a power she can\'t even use, she somehow finds herself included in a party of heroes. But Flum\'s life hits rock bottom when the party\'s renowned sage, Jean Inteige, decides that the useless girl is dead weight, and arranges to have her sold into slavery. Tossed to monsters to be feasted upon for her master\'s entertainment, Flum makes the desperate choice to reach for a cursed weapon... and something new awakens within her. A grimdark tale about one woman\'s blood-soaked quest to reclaim her life!\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)'),(61590,'Huangshen Lu Zhi Linglong Shan',928,0,12,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1440/149569.jpg','ona','2025-05-02','finished_airing',''),(61591,'Kaixin Chaoren: Ni Shi Yingjiu',5940,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1950/149559.jpg','movie','2025-05-01','finished_airing',''),(61592,'Wangzhe Rongyao: Rongyao Zhi Zhang - Mingyun Pian',0,0,4,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1754/149498.jpg','ona','2025-05-31','not_yet_aired',''),(61595,'I Byeol-e Pil-yohan',5760,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1371/149504.webp','ona','2025-05-30','not_yet_aired','Nan-young is a scientist whose astronaut mom failed to return to Earth when things went awry during her Mars probe. Nan-young has always dreamed of exploring space too and longs to go to Mars in hopes of finding a trace of her mom.\n\nHer dream comes true when she is selected as one of the astronauts for a Mars probe project. Before she blasts off though, she meets Jay, a musician who also fixes retro sound instruments. It\'s all thanks to an old turntable that Nan-young inherited from her mom.\n\n(Source: Netflix, edited)'),(61596,'B.A grandluxe Brand Movie',118,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1394/149506.jpg','cm','2024-09-11','finished_airing','Brand movie for the B.A grandluxe lineup of cosmetics by POLA.'),(61597,'Come on Ogaki feat. Ryoff Karma',32,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1497/149507.webp','pv','2023-03-24','finished_airing','A promotional video for the city of Ogaki where rapper Ryoff Karma introduces its charms.'),(61599,'Boku no Risou no Isekai Seikatsu',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1811/149951.jpg','ova','2025-05-02','currently_airing',''),(61603,'Ao Ashi 2nd Season',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1832/149517.jpg','tv','2026','not_yet_aired','Second season of Ao Ashi.'),(61607,'Shiguang Dailiren III',0,0,24,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1289/149566.webp','ona','2026','not_yet_aired','Third season of Shiguang Dailiren (Link Click).'),(61608,'Jigoku Sensei Nube (2025) Part 2',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1800/149568.jpg','tv','2026-01','not_yet_aired','Second part of Jigoku Sensei Nube (2025).'),(61609,'Ke Jin Wanjia',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1056/150127.jpg','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','In the future world, the virtual game \"Epoch\" developed by Chu Group has attracted worldwide attention for its perfect immersive experience. However, on the eve of the game\'s official launch, the game developers Chu and his wife disappeared mysteriously. In order to find clues about the whereabouts of his parents, the rich young man Chu Yi, under the guidance of the humanoid AI Chaos, spent 30 billion krypton gold to enter the game upgrade adventure. In the process, Chu Yi gathered a group of player partners who fought side by side. After several efforts, he finally found out that his parents\' disappearance was related to the Fantasy World Organization. \n\nIn order to find the whereabouts of his parents, fight against the Fantasy World Organization, and \"save\" the Era World, Chu Yi launched a series of ridiculous and unimaginable krypton gold operations, embarked on a journey of playing the pig and eating the tiger, and a wonderful battle between good and evil began.\n\n(Source: Youku, Google translated)'),(61610,'Yuan Zun (2027)',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1802/149577.jpg','ona','2027','not_yet_aired',''),(61611,'Ye Wujiang',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1815/149950.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired',''),(61612,'Tianyuan',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1426/149972.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired',''),(61613,'Wo You Yi Jian',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1803/149961.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired',''),(61615,'Ta Xing',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1426/149583.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired',''),(61616,'Lupin the IIIrd: Zenigata to 2-nin no Lupin',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1094/149586.webp','ona','2025-06-20','not_yet_aired','Prequel to Lupin the IIIrd the Movie: Fujimi no Ketsuzoku.'),(61617,'Lang Lang Shan Xiao Yaoguai',0,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1540/149587.jpg','movie','2025-08-02','not_yet_aired',''),(61618,'Wo Wei Dao Zong',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1220/149601.jpg','ona','2025','not_yet_aired',''),(61619,'Zeri Feisheng',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1252/149604.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','In chaotic times, evil spirits are rampant and treacherous people are in power. At the same time, the underworld invaded, and the forces of the two worlds poisoned the human world. The snake catcher Xu Ying could not stand and watch the gods working for the underworld oppress the common people, so he rebelled and committed the crime of killing the gods. He also killed the court officials who did nothing. He was hunted down by the forces of the two worlds and began his life of escape...\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61621,'Yun Shen Buzhi Meng',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1897/150259.jpg','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','A beautiful wedding turns into betrayal by a beloved. No longer seeking immortality, a single thought transforms into darkness. The powerful and tragic heroine embarks on a path of vengeance as a killing deity, determined to eradicate all.\n\n(Source: YOUKU English Animation YouTube Channel)'),(61622,'Yujin Xingzhe',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1302/150125.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','On the planet after the disaster, the young boy Ye Yu went to Embers City for an assessment in pursuit of his dream. He faces numerous murderous intentions and mysteries, and the truth behind them is impossible to unravel.\n\n(Source: iQIYI Animation YouTube Channel)'),(61625,'Xian Chong',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1179/149608.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','One hundred years ago, in the battle of Mirage Land, the fairy Tianjuan killed the Lord of Mirage with her own hands. However, Tianjuan\'s soul was incomplete and she lost her memory of the war.\n\nAfter the war, Tianjuan came down to earth and to serve as the landowner in Cangshuo. She adopted the fairy pet Li Xiao, which looked like a little black bird. Then the war goddess and the little black bird teamed up to solve a case. Behind a series of strange murders, they found traces of the mirage monster returning to the land of Cangshuo! As Li Xiao transforms, Tianjuan discovers that there is a possible connection between her dead lover Shao Weili, Li Xiao, and the Lord of Mirage whom she killed...\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61626,'Sou Shen Ji (ONA)',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1810/149956.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','The story takes place in the barbaric era of Yan Emperor and Huang Emperor. Just when many heroes were vying for supremacy in the Central Plains, the world-recognized leader, Emperor Shennong, passed away, and the heroes of the gold, wood, water, fire, and earth tribes were all ready to make a move. \n\nIn the turbulent times, the young boy Tuoba Ye suddenly appeared and by chance obtained the dying inheritance of Emperor Shennong, thus starting a thrilling legendary journey.\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61627,'Tonari Kanojo',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1844/149627.jpg','ova','2025-06-27','not_yet_aired',''),(61628,'Yogoreta Kanojo',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1865/149616.jpg','ova','2025-06-27','not_yet_aired',''),(61634,'Cheng Ye Xiao He',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1640/149636.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','Xiao He leads a successful double life as a medical science student with top grades by day and a professional e-sports gamer by night. However, his life isn\'t all sunshine and rainbows: he keeps bumping into this bothersome girl in-game called Escape Artist Tao, a notorious PKer who\'s declared him to be her archenemy. These two top-ranked players can\'t seem to get away from each other despite their mutual disdain. However, their feelings start to become something more...\n\n(Source: Comikey Media)'),(61635,'Qi Guo Yinhe',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1620/149641.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','Thousands of years after the fall of the Beichen Dynasty, the sons of destiny from four different forces help each other and grow from dealing with crisis after crisis. They work together to stop the war conspiracy of cutting-edge artificial intelligence.\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61637,'29-sai Dokushin Chuuken Boukensha no Nichijou',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1363/149644.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','This story is about Shinonome Hajime, an adventurer of Silver Range. He\'s dedicated to fulfilling missions from the guild. One day when completing a quest for monster meat, he finds a strange girl named Lily in a dungeon who\'s far more trouble than she\'s worth. Saving the girl from certain death, her story reminds him of his similar past and he takes her under his care...\n\n(Source: MU)'),(61639,'Da Tang Chengfeng Lu',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1015/149653.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','The notorious divinely-skilled Mu Tianhou was suddenly ambushed, causing a stir in the martial arts world. Two upright disciples, Zheng Dongting and Zu Beiqiu (the useless brothers), met each other because of this. In order to help their younger brother Zu Beiqiu find his wife whom he had not seen for ten years, and also to find the real murderer who killed their master, a famous constable and a rich second-generation accidentally teamed up to venture into the world and embarked on an adventurous journey of delivering a divorce letter for thousands of miles. \n\nThe two came to the Luo family in Yangzhou, but encountered the Luo family\'s massacre and were mistaken for the murderer. They were called \"the two evildoers of Central Plains.\" Between the two of them, Zheng Dongting has martial arts that he cannot use, while Zu Beiqiu has martial arts that he doesn\'t know how to use. Although the brothers intend to clear their names, the misunderstandings of the various factions in the martial arts world continue to deepen, and the righteous martial arts people rise up to attack them. After experiencing manny dangerous situations, the two discovered that this was a big conspiracy against them...\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61640,'Zi Jin: Yu Miao Fang',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1830/149658.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','In the Forbidden City, which has a long history and profound cultural heritage, there live many cute cats. From the perspective of humans, they live an enviable and leisurely life. Among them, six royal cats are special. They are responsible for protecting the memory of cultural relics of \"Wuhua.\" They entered the world of Wuhua and defeated the destroyer Black Owl time and time again, bringing the world of Wuhua back on the right track and thus protecting the cultural relics. \n\nThe six imperial cats are Luban and Momo from the literary class, and Shuangmei, Aobai, Pingan and Xiaozai from the martial class. Not only are they intelligent and brave, they also have a tacit understanding. They form the Forbidden City Imperial Cat Room, which protects the national treasures of the world.\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61642,'Wan Ren Zhi Shang',0,0,14,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1130/149661.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','Yi Feng traveled to the Xianjiang Continent. Since he was born without spiritual roots, he could only survive by relying on the \"essential life skills\" given by the system. Little did he know that in the eyes of those practitioners, his strength was already at the god level, and his every move affected the entire pattern of the Xianjiang Continent. Yi Feng easily resolved many crises without knowing it, which also brought about many passionate and hilarious scenes, and brought new opportunities and choices to the people living on this continent.\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61643,'Tianzi Chuanqi: Ji Fa Pian',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1942/149665.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','Gifted with supernatural powers, Ji Fa was feared by King Zhou. In order to protect his relatives and friends, Ji Fa went berserk several times—his power got out of control and his life was in danger. The death of his master, the loss of his friends, the death of his mother, and the great mission bestowed upon the young hero, tempering him on the path to martyrdom.\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61644,'Chang An Du Wu Si',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1533/149667.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','Martial artists with strange bones and unique skills are called Qiwu people. Some Qiwu people who pursued prosperity and peace surrendered to the imperial court and formed the \"Duwu Division,\" while other Qiwu people who pursued hegemony in troubled times formed the \"Zhenwu Society.\" \n\nIn the early years of the Tang Dynasty, the Zhenwu Society was in chaos. Yun Xinxiao, a good-for-nothing brother who was invited to the capital of gods, joined the Chang An Duwu Division in the crisis, underwent a strange bone transplant and received unique skills. Yun Xinxiao and his fellow Duwusi companions, including Shi Nan and Themis, go from the streets to the imperial palace and into every corner of Chang An City, gradually uncovering the mysterious cause of death of their brother Yun Xinyao, and finding out the mastermind behind the death, Bu Wenjun, in a bid to crack down on a super terrorist attack against the current Supreme and even the entire prosperous age. The road of revenge and protection is full of unknowns. Yun Xinxiao\'s choice will determine the fate of Chang An...\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61645,'Shi Shen',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1944/149669.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired',''),(61646,'Zi Heian Zhong Zou Lai',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1059/149671.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','Li Hai, a soldier leader who is tired of killing, transforms himself into a valley detective and hides in the city. He wants to live an ordinary life, but unexpectedly opens up a new world of extraordinary people. The darkness follows him like a shadow and there is no escape from it, so he goes back and defeats him!\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61649,'Caishen Dou Zhanlong',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1798/149675.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','Taoist Cui accidentally released the treasure-gathering golden toad in order to read the heavenly book. The golden toad coveted the prosperity of the human world and reincarnated as a human, Dou Zhanlong. In order to avoid the heavenly calamity, the golden toad tore the three souls and seven spirits in Dou Zhanlong\'s spiritual cavity, creating nine clones, which fell into nine places respectively. The nine Dou Zhanlongs were in different parallel time and space, and each death gave rise to a new clone. They experienced \"nine deaths and thirteen disasters\" in total. Our story starts with the first Dou Zhanlong.\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61650,'Yongbing Tianxia',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1234/149696.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','Three unknown mercenaries, with their unyielding spirit, wrote an unparalleled legend that will last through the ages.\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61651,'Jian Ke',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1833/149703.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','In the Sanlin Star Region of the Federation, Xu Le, an orphan from the Donglin area, works as a clerk in the shop of the mechanic Feng Yu. Feng Yu teaches Xu Le mechanic techniques and ancient martial arts moves. But one day, Feng Yu is hunted down by the Federation military, and Xu Le is inexplicably implicated and becomes a wanted criminal of the Federation. \n\nAfter witnessing Feng Yu\'s \"death,\" Xu Le uses the chip left by Feng Yu to replace his own chip (which also confuses him as to who he is?) and changes his identity to study at Xinglihua University in the capital, where he meets Jian Shuier who\'s superstar of the Federation, Tai Zhiyuan who\'s a former royal family member of the Federation, Shi Qinghai who\'s a spy from Qinglong Mountain, and Zhang Xiaomeng who\'s a spy from Qinglong Mountain. He also drives a mecha for the first time and fights...\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61652,'Qixing Lu Wanggong',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1997/149694.webp','ona','','not_yet_aired','Fifty years ago, Wu Laogou, the ancestor of the Wu family, accidentally entered a mysterious place and encountered a bizarre disaster, which almost made him extinct. Fifty years later, Wu Xie, who inherited his ancestral antique shop, obtained a rubbing of a silk book by chance, from which he discovered the ancient text materials he had been studying for a long time. Wu Xie found his third uncle Wu Sanxing, and decided to go to the ruins with his third uncle and several helpers, Menyouping, Pan Zi, and Da Kui. \n\nThe group who fell into the ruins broke through many obstacles in the Seven-Star Lu Palace, and at the same time, they also unraveled the life of King Lu Shang and his ultimate intentions. After escaping danger, Wu Xie decided not to get involved anymore, but he didn\'t know that he had already joined the game, and what was waiting for him would be a bigger conspiracy...\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61653,'Xiang Wang Shi',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1243/149698.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','The whale swallowed the present world, and the human race was in trouble. The boy practiced the \"forgetfulness technique\" at the cost of his memory to prevent the catastrophe! Will they live together in the face of adversity, or will they forget each other in the arena?\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61654,'Yi Na He Qiaqia 2nd Season',200,0,104,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1938/149680.jpg','ona','2025-04-25','currently_airing',''),(61655,'Yi Zhi Baobao',140,0,25,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1009/149681.jpg','ona','2020','finished_airing',''),(61656,'Yi Zhi Baobao 2nd Season',140,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1099/149682.jpg','ona','2025-02','currently_airing',''),(61657,'Shuangsheng Wu Hun',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1548/149683.jpg','ona','2025','not_yet_aired','Lin Fan, who was born in a noble family in Dalin County, was originally a peerless genius who was awarded the Tianjiao Order, but his martial soul was taken away by his fiancée, and he became a waste. When a mysterious demon parasitized Lin Fan and reactivated his abandoned martial soul, making him a rare dual martial soul physique, Lin Fan officially embarked on the road to rise, from a small county town to the heavens and the worlds.\n\n(Source: Tencent, Google translated)'),(61658,'Dang Shen Bu Rang',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1055/149687.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','Yang Jian is the god in heaven who is in charge of eliminating disasters. He will violently and mercilessly destroy any target that brings harm to the three realms. However, the crisis of spiritual energy depletion in the world is imminent, and Yang Jian falls into the human world. Only by learning to influence the monsters in the world with true emotions instead of violence can he complete his mission and return to heaven as a god. Yang Jian, who has no other talent except violence, finds his his former partner Xiaotian Quan (a black dog), reincarnated as a mortal girl by the name of Wang Xiaoxiao, and begins a monster-hunting operation of unprecedented difficulty.\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61659,'Saibo Jian Xian Tie Yu',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1514/149700.jpg','ona','','not_yet_aired','Fang Bailu, a modern terminally ill patient, wakes up after being frozen for a thousand years in a world where prosperous cyber and ancient cultivation are blended. He embarks on a journey to fight against destiny and face the disaster of the resurrection of a mysterious immortal.\n\n(Source: iQIYI, Google translated)'),(61663,'Uruwashi no Yoi no Tsuki',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1653/149714.webp','tv','2026-01','not_yet_aired','Every time Yoi Takiguchi so much as lets out a sigh, her female classmates squeal in admiration and awe. She has been dubbed the school\'s \"prince\" by virtue of her boyishly attractive appearance and casual disposition. However, she chooses to be indifferent toward the attention she receives and spends her days normally—that is, until the school\'s other prince, Kohaku Ichimura, waltzes into her life and calls her beautiful.\n\nKohaku is nothing like a prince—he acts thoughtlessly and does as he pleases. But when he compliments her, Yoi feels flustered, and the way he looks at her gets her all nervous. He is the first boy to acknowledge her as a girl, and her attempts to distance herself prove futile as he seems to have set his sights on her. While Yoi keeps telling herself that it is nothing serious, even she cannot completely ignore the stir Kohaku causes in her heart.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(61667,'Gokusaishoku Nikuhitsu Emaki: Zashikirou',9900,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1737/149721.jpg','movie','2025-05-09','finished_airing',''),(61672,'Shinsei Galverse',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1220/149729.jpg','unknown','2025','not_yet_aired','Long ago, harmony across the galaxy was maintained by a sacred star known as the Mother Planet. But that peace was shattered when the Mother mysteriously exploded and vanished without a trace.\n\nIn the aftermath, the galaxy plunged into chaos and conflict. Yet from the scattered remnants of the Mother Planet, new beings were born—sentient fragments known as the Galverse.\n\nNow, these Galverse girls, each imbued with extraordinary powers and an unstoppable gal spirit, rise to confront the evil organization \"Space End Society.\" As they battle across the stars, they begin to uncover the truth behind the galaxy\'s collapse—and the fate of the Mother Planet itself.\n\n(Source: MAL News)'),(61674,'One Piece: Dr. Chopper no Bouken Karte - Chichi to Musume no Ballad',1415,63.099999999999994,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1584/149734.jpg','tv_special','2025-05-11','finished_airing','The sixth recap special of the Egghead arc.'),(61678,'Wo de Shizun Shi Wukong',320,0,8,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1083/149740.jpg','ona','2025-09-05','not_yet_aired',''),(61679,'Bunka Shutter 70-shuunen Kinen Animation CM',30,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1835/149741.jpg','cm','2025-04-01','finished_airing','A commercial to celebrate Bunka Shutter\'s 70th anniversary.'),(61686,'Heroine? Seijo? Iie, All Works Maid desu (Hokori)!',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1887/149752.jpg','tv','','not_yet_aired','\"I will become the world\'s most wonderful maid!\" With her skirt fluttering in black and white, the girl shouted. Her name is Melody. A reincarnated former Japanese girl, she now pursues her dream in her new life, working as an all-purpose maid for a poor count\'s family in the kingdom of Théolas. When she makes it, even cheap tea turns into a luxury brew, and a dilapidated mansion is quickly restored to new! Cleaning, serving, hunting, DIY—leave it all to her and her powerful magic.\n\nUnbeknownst to Melody, this world is actually an otome game, and she is the most powerful and invincible heroine, the saint! Yet, she remains oblivious to this fact. Romance with handsome men? Attacks by the Demon Lord? Work comes first! A fantasy of misunderstood work that unknowingly shatters destiny!\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)'),(61687,'Jishou Akuyaku Reijou na Konyakusha no Kansatsu Kiroku.',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1602/149753.jpg','tv','2026','not_yet_aired','For a natural genius like Crown Prince Cecil Glow Alfostar, every day is a bore. Knowledge and skills come far too easily for him, to the point that nothing can captivate his interest. However, this changes the day he meets someone who never fails to betray his expectations—his fiancée and self-proclaimed villainess Bertia Evil Nochesse.\n\nBertia claims that this world is that of an \"otome game.\" She has been reborn as the villainess, and it is her duty to impede the relationship between Cecil and the heroine. Never one to shy away from fate, she zealously takes to her evil role... to mixed results. Though she doesn\'t realize it, Bertia\'s supposedly \"evil deeds\" always come off as sincere and kind. Finally relieved of his melancholy, there is never a boring day for Cecil as he observes his unknowingly good-hearted fiancée.\n\n[Written by MAL Rewrite]'),(61688,'Akuru Hi no Aru ka Nai Ashi',137,0,1,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1746/149760.jpg','movie','2024','finished_airing',''),(61694,'Android wa Keiken Ninzuu ni Hairimasu ka??',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1084/149783.webp','tv','2026','not_yet_aired','Office Lady Tsuda Akane, age 28, seems like she\'s got it all together. Beautiful, brainy, and an indispensable office worker for a robotics manufacturer, Akane\'s admired at work...because her colleagues can\'t see her at home. Privately, Akane\'s a hot mess with an apartment that looks more like a landfill than a living space. Good thing she drunkenly ordered a new android named Nadeshiko to help her clean up! Well, maybe not good, because the beautiful lady android that arrives is a horny hottie. Akane\'s about to get more service than she expected!\n\n(Source: Seven Seas Entertainment)'),(61704,'Tun Tian Ji',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1356/149824.jpg','ona','2025-05-19','currently_airing','Tun Tian Ji depicts the legendary transformation of the young Wu Yu from a mortal to an immortal Buddha. \n\n(Source: Tencent, Google translated)'),(61730,'Shixiong A Shixiong 3rd Season',1260,0,52,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1229/149886.jpg','ona','2024-06-06','currently_airing',''),(61731,'Gakkou de wa Oshiete Kurenai Taisetsu na Koto',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1791/149887.jpg','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','Unique and reliable \"experts\" appear before elementary school students who are struggling with issues such as \"I\'m not good at tidying up,\" \"I keep putting off my homework because I\'m so obsessed with games,\" and \"My grades aren\'t improving as much as I\'d like,\" and provide passionate instruction to teach them important things that they should learn but that they won\'t learn at school.\n\n(Source: MANTANWEB, translated)'),(61742,'Dekichau made Kon',0,0,0,'https://cdn.myanimelist.net/images/anime/1453/150262.jpg','tv','2025-07','not_yet_aired','');
